('6ebf1a36-f103-5336-8c52-05842aab700a', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'cross', 'UK: /krɒs/ | US: /krɔs/', 'A2', 'verb', 'băng qua', 'To go or move from one side of an area, road, or line to another.', 'Pedestrians must cross the street at the crosswalk.', 'Người đi bộ phải băng qua đường ở vạch sang đường.', '{\"en\": \"Pedestrians should use the designated walkway when crossing the busy avenue near the office complex.\", \"vi\": \"Người đi bộ nên sử dụng lối đi quy định khi sang đường đại lộ đông đúc gần khu phức hợp văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-ljspeech-ac4280ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-cori-ac4280ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cross-86772cc7.webp', '[\"traverse\", \"pass over\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cross the street\", \"meaning\": \"băng qua đường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cross one\'s arms\", \"meaning\": \"khoanh tay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"across\", \"note_vi\": \"Across là giới từ/phó từ (ở bên kia/băng qua), còn cross là động từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"crossing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-cori-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-aru0-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-aru5-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-aru6-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-aru10-ac4280ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-aru9-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-aru3-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-aru7-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-aru8-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-aru2-ac4280ba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-ljspeech-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-lt408-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-lt138-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-lt624-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-lt396-ac4280ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-lt498-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-lt132-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-lt288-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-lt42-ac4280ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-lt90-ac4280ba.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC Listening Part 1, động từ \'cross\' rất hay gặp ở dạng tiếp diễn \'is/are crossing the street\' (đang sang đường) hoặc \'crossing arms\' (khoanh tay).', 'travel', 1, 1),
('1551bafc-53f8-5b1c-b08c-ffb435c02793', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'hate', '/heɪt/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Cảm thấy ghét bỏ hoặc ác cảm sâu sắc đối với ai/cái gì.', 'to feel a very strong dislike for someone or something.', 'I really hate waking up early on weekends.', 'Tôi thực sự ghét phải dậy sớm vào cuối tuần.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees hate dealing with delayed flights during their business travel trips.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên ghét việc phải xử lý các chuyến bay bị hoãn trong các chuyến công tác của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-ljspeech-c3ace180.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-cori-c3ace180.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hate-095f3a24.webp', '[\"detest\", \"loathe\", \"dislike\"]', '[\"love\", \"like\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hate doing something\", \"meaning\": \"ghét làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hate to interrupt\", \"meaning\": \"ngại phải ngắt lời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dislike\", \"note_vi\": \"Hate thể hiện mức độ ghét mạnh mẽ hơn nhiều so với dislike.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hatred\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hateful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-cori-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-aru0-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-aru5-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-aru6-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-aru10-c3ace180.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-aru9-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-aru3-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-aru7-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-aru8-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-aru2-c3ace180.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-ljspeech-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-lt408-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-lt138-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-lt624-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-lt396-c3ace180.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-lt498-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-lt132-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-lt288-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-lt42-c3ace180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hate-lt90-c3ace180.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ hate có thể đi cùng danh động từ (V-ing) hoặc động từ nguyên thể (to-V).', 'travel', 1, 2),
('1d1b92ba-988c-506f-8d10-8ee5975c381c', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'hear', '/hɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Cảm nhận âm thanh bằng tai.', 'to use your ears to receive sounds or listen to someone speaking.', 'I could hear the birds singing outside my window this morning.', 'Sáng nay tôi có thể nghe tiếng chim hót bên ngoài cửa sổ.', '{\"en\": \"Did you hear the announcement about the change in the office building security policy today?\", \"vi\": \"Bạn có nghe thông báo về việc thay đổi chính sách an ninh tòa nhà văn phòng hôm nay không?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-ljspeech-ca607cf6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-cori-ca607cf6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hear-54986ae4.webp', '[\"listen\", \"perceive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hear about\", \"meaning\": \"nghe về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hear from\", \"meaning\": \"nhận tin từ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"here\", \"note_vi\": \"Here là ở đây, hear là nghe, phát âm giống nhau.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-cori-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-aru0-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-aru5-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-aru6-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-aru10-ca607cf6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-aru9-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-aru3-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-aru7-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-aru8-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-aru2-ca607cf6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-ljspeech-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-lt408-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-lt138-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-lt624-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-lt396-ca607cf6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-lt498-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-lt132-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-lt288-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-lt42-ca607cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hear-lt90-ca607cf6.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm lẫn với \'here\' (ở đây) vì phát âm giống hệt nhau.', 'office', 1, 3),
('f82996c2-fb87-55bc-91ea-a3098367724f', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'tomorrow', '/təˈmɒrəʊ/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Ngày sau ngày hôm nay.', 'on or during the day that comes directly after today.', 'Let\'s meet for lunch tomorrow at noon.', 'Chúng ta hãy gặp nhau ăn trưa vào ngày mai lúc giữa trưa.', '{\"en\": \"The hiring committee will interview the shortlisted candidates tomorrow morning at eight.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng tuyển dụng sẽ phỏng vấn các ứng viên trong danh sách rút gọn vào sáng mai lúc tám giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-ljspeech-2dac81d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-cori-2dac81d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tomorrow-60ee7b1f.webp', NULL, '[\"yesterday\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tomorrow morning\", \"meaning\": \"sáng mai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"by tomorrow\", \"meaning\": \"trước ngày mai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tomorrow\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-cori-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-aru0-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-aru5-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-aru6-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-aru10-2dac81d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-aru9-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-aru3-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-aru7-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-aru8-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-aru2-2dac81d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-ljspeech-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-lt408-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-lt138-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-lt624-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-lt396-2dac81d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-lt498-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-lt132-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-lt288-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-lt42-2dac81d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tomorrow-lt90-2dac81d6.mp3\"]}}', 'Tomorrow chú ý viết chính xác với 2 chữ \'r\' và 1 chữ \'m\'.', 'hr', 1, 4),
('53be6501-c185-5e71-b0c5-d54de61688c5', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'routine', '/ruːˈtiːn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một chuỗi các hành động thường xuyên được thực hiện theo cùng một thứ tự.', 'a set of actions that you do regularly in the same order.', 'Establishing a flexible work routine can significantly enhance employee productivity and focus.', 'Việc thiết lập một quy trình làm việc linh hoạt có thể nâng cao đáng kể năng suất và sự tập trung của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked all staff to follow the daily safety routine carefully.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý yêu cầu tất cả nhân viên tuân thủ quy trình an toàn hàng ngày một cách cẩn thận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-ljspeech-012da8a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-cori-012da8a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/routine-73ef3530.webp', '[\"habit\", \"schedule\", \"procedure\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"daily routine\", \"meaning\": \"thói quen hàng ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"follow a routine\", \"meaning\": \"tuân theo thói quen/quy trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"routine check\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra định kỳ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"habit\", \"note_vi\": \"\'habit\' thiên về hành vi cá nhân; \'routine\' nhấn mạnh trình tự các bước lặp lại.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"routine\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"routinely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-cori-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru0-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru5-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru6-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru10-012da8a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru9-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru3-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru7-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru8-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru2-012da8a9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-ljspeech-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-lt408-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-lt138-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-lt624-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-lt396-012da8a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-lt498-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-lt132-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-lt288-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-lt42-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-lt90-012da8a9.mp3\"]}}', '\'Routine check\' (kiểm tra định kỳ) là cụm từ rất hay gặp trong đề thi TOEIC phần đọc.', 'office', 1, 5),
('a60f3d7a-169f-573d-948b-dd1e4319b4b5', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'full', '/fʊl/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Chứa đựng tối đa, không còn chỗ trống.', 'holding or containing as much or as many as possible with no space left.', 'The basket was full of fresh fruit from the market.', 'Cái giỏ đầy ắp trái cây tươi từ chợ.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel is completely full this weekend due to an international business conference nearby.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã hoàn toàn đầy phòng vào cuối tuần này do một hội nghị kinh doanh quốc tế gần đó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-ljspeech-52e6d8ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-cori-52e6d8ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/full-9003f6ac.webp', '[\"packed\", \"filled\", \"crowded\"]', '[\"empty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"full refund\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn tiền đầy đủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full time\", \"meaning\": \"toàn thời gian\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fill\", \"note_vi\": \"full là tính từ (đầy), fill là động từ (làm đầy)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fullness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-cori-52e6d8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-aru0-52e6d8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-aru5-52e6d8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-aru6-52e6d8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-aru10-52e6d8ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-aru9-52e6d8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-aru3-52e6d8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-aru7-52e6d8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-aru8-52e6d8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-aru2-52e6d8ab.mp3\"]}, \