('179a93e3-7fc4-597c-9451-3f70010d03a4', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'style', '/staɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cách riêng biệt để làm hoặc thể hiện điều gì đó.', 'a particular way of doing, designing, or producing something.', 'Her unique sense of style always makes her stand out in a crowd.', 'Phong cách độc đáo của cô ấy luôn khiến cô ấy nổi bật giữa đám đông.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team wants to change the design style of our brand logo.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị muốn thay đổi phong cách thiết kế của logo thương hiệu chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-ljspeech-26ec8d00.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-cori-26ec8d00.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/style-fe794398.webp', '[\"fashion\", \"manner\", \"way\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"management style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách quản lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lifestyle\", \"meaning\": \"lối sống\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stylish\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stylist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-cori-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-aru0-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-aru5-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-aru6-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-aru10-26ec8d00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-aru9-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-aru3-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-aru7-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-aru8-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-aru2-26ec8d00.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-ljspeech-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-lt408-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-lt138-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-lt624-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-lt396-26ec8d00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-lt498-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-lt132-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-lt288-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-lt42-26ec8d00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/style-lt90-26ec8d00.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'management style\' (phong cách quản lý) là một cụm từ rất phổ biến.', 'marketing', 1, 26),
('417f8270-05cf-5826-997f-ac36d93326b1', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'ride', '/raɪd/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đi bằng xe đạp, xe máy, ngựa hoặc phương tiện khác.', 'to sit on an animal or a vehicle and control it while it moves along.', 'I like to ride my bicycle to work when the weather is nice.', 'Tôi thích đạp xe đi làm khi thời tiết đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees choose to ride their bicycles to the office to save on fuel costs.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên chọn đạp xe đến văn phòng để tiết kiệm chi phí nhiên liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-ljspeech-320ef6a3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-cori-320ef6a3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ride-0a606a35.webp', '[\"travel\", \"drive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ride a bike\", \"meaning\": \"đạp xe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go for a ride\", \"meaning\": \"đi dạo bằng xe/ngựa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"drive\", \"note_vi\": \"Drive dùng cho xe có động cơ, ride dùng cho xe đạp hoặc động vật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rider\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-cori-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru0-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru5-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru6-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru10-320ef6a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru9-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru3-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru7-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru8-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru2-320ef6a3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-ljspeech-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt408-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt138-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt624-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt396-320ef6a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt498-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt132-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt288-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt42-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt90-320ef6a3.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận phân biệt giữa xe đạp (ride) và xe hơi (drive).', 'daily', 1, 27),
('d5ba1a40-009d-59f6-bb1e-8e267bca9803', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'article', '/ˈɑːtɪkl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một bài viết trên báo, tạp chí hoặc trang web.', 'A non-fictional piece of text written for publication within a newspaper, journal, or periodical.', 'Our company recently published a detailed article regarding the new market trends.', 'Công ty chúng tôi vừa mới xuất bản một bài báo chi tiết về các xu hướng thị trường mới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager shared an article about new marketing trends with the team.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã chia sẻ một bài báo về xu hướng tiếp thị mới với nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-ljspeech-565cecd7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-cori-565cecd7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/article-3e9a3b23.webp', '[\"piece\", \"report\", \"feature\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"write an article\", \"meaning\": \"viết một bài báo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"publish an article\", \"meaning\": \"đăng một bài báo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"news article\", \"meaning\": \"bài báo tin tức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"essay\", \"note_vi\": \"essay là bài luận học thuật, article là bài viết trên báo/tạp chí\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-cori-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru0-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru5-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru6-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru10-565cecd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru9-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru3-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru7-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru8-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru2-565cecd7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-ljspeech-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt408-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt138-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt624-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt396-565cecd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt498-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt132-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt288-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt42-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt90-565cecd7.mp3\"]}}', 'Article còn có nghĩa là \'mạo từ\' trong ngữ pháp, đừng nhầm lẫn hai nghĩa.', 'media', 1, 28),
('7e118d72-46b0-59c0-8f03-567b1446d013', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '17194afa-a6f6-5b52-a962-5e4610f49fe2', '0388b523-5c9b-50ec-8b75-79fa6e142bd3', 'menu', '/ˈmenjuː/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Danh sách các món ăn có sẵn tại nhà hàng hoặc quán ăn.', 'a list of the food and drink that you can order in a restaurant.', 'The waiter handed us the menu as soon as we sat down.', 'Người phục vụ đưa thực đơn cho chúng tôi ngay khi chúng tôi ngồi xuống.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant updated its lunch menu to attract more business clients.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng đã cập nhật thực đơn bữa trưa để thu hút thêm nhiều khách hàng doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-ljspeech-252a2566.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-cori-252a2566.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/menu-79cdb941.webp', '[\"bill of fare\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dinner menu\", \"meaning\": \"thực đơn tối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"set menu\", \"meaning\": \"thực đơn cố định theo set\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"venue\", \"note_vi\": \"venue là địa điểm tổ chức sự kiện, dễ nhầm với menu\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-cori-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-aru0-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-aru5-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-aru6-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-aru10-252a2566.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-aru9-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-aru3-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-aru7-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-aru8-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-aru2-252a2566.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-ljspeech-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-lt408-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-lt138-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-lt624-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-lt396-252a2566.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-lt498-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-lt132-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-lt288-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-lt42-252a2566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menu-lt90-252a2566.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công nghệ, menu còn có nghĩa là thanh thực đơn trên màn hình máy tính.', 'dining', 1, 29),
('e9591804-674d-566f-8725-31ce2e62a0b0', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'listen', '/ˈlɪsn/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Chú ý để nghe âm thanh hoặc điều gì đó.', 'to pay attention to sound or speech with your ears.', 'All team members ought to listen to customer feedback before redesigning the product.', 'Tất cả các thành viên trong đội nên lắng nghe phản hồi của khách hàng trước khi thiết kế lại sản phẩm.', '{\"en\": \"Employees should listen carefully to the instructions during the safety orientation session.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên nên lắng nghe kỹ các hướng dẫn trong buổi định hướng an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-ljspeech-2147a9e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-cori-2147a9e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/listen-a2ffe9ef.webp', '[\"hear\", \"attend\"]', '[\"ignore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"listen carefully\", \"meaning\": \"lắng nghe cẩn thận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"listen to a speech\", \"meaning\": \"lắng nghe một bài phát biểu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hear\", \"note_vi\": \"Hear là nghe thụ động, listen là lắng nghe chủ động có chú ý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"listener\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-cori-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru0-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru5-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru6-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru10-2147a9e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru9-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru3-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru7-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru8-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru2-2147a9e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-ljspeech-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt408-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt138-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt624-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt396-2147a9e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt498-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt132-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt288-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt42-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt90-2147a9e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Listen thường đi kèm với giới từ to khi có tân ngữ chỉ người hoặc vật phía sau.', 'office', 1, 0),
('c13b5f1e-0c90-5f5e-86ab-fa34d8984074', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'museum', '/mjuˈziːəm/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nơi trưng bày các hiện vật lịch sử, nghệ thuật.', 'a building where valuable historic, artistic, or scientific objects are kept and shown.', 'The science museum offers interactive exhibits for visitors of all age groups.', 'Bảo tàng khoa học cung cấp các triển lãm tương tác dành cho du khách ở mọi lứa tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"The local museum offers special group discount tickets for visiting corporate tour groups.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo tàng địa phương cung cấp vé giảm giá nhóm đặc biệt cho các đoàn tham quan của doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-ljspeech-5019bac9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-cori-5019bac9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/museum-cd04ef40.webp', '[\"gallery\", \"exhibition hall\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"art museum\", \"meaning\": \"bảo tàng nghệ thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"history museum\", \"meaning\": \"bảo tàng lịch sử\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-cori-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-aru0-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-aru5-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-aru6-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-aru10-5019bac9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-aru9-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-aru3-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-aru7-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-aru8-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-aru2-5019bac9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-ljspeech-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-lt408-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-lt138-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-lt624-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-lt396-5019bac9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-lt498-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-lt132-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-lt288-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-lt42-5019bac9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/museum-lt90-5019bac9.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý trọng âm rơi vào âm tiết thứ hai: /mjuːˈziːəm/.', 'travel', 1, 1),
('2b794319-f5d6-56ac-9eb0-014dc4f04080', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'trip', '/trɪp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'một hành trình đi đến một nơi nào đó và trở về.', 'An act of traveling from one location to another, typically returning after a period.', 'The senior consultant took a business trip to Tokyo to sign the contract.', 'Cố vấn cao cấp đã có một chuyến công tác đến Tokyo để ký hợp đồng.', '{\"en\": \"The sales manager is on a business trip to visit our overseas branch next week.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng kinh doanh đang có chuyến công tác để thăm chi nhánh nước ngoài của chúng ta vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-ljspeech-fdd91fba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-cori-fdd91fba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trip-6c0fdf32.webp', '[\"journey\", \"excursion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business trip\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến công tác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a trip\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện một chuyến đi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"travel\", \"note_vi\": \"travel là danh từ chung, trip là một chuyến đi cụ thể.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-cori-fdd91fba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-aru0-fdd91fba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-aru5-fdd91fba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-aru6-fdd91fba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-aru10-fdd91fba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-aru9-fdd91fba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-aru3-fdd91fba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-aru7-fdd91fba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-aru8-fdd91fba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trip-aru2-fdd91fba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"