('96206310-2c26-5e59-a49d-9722e6f83d37', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'actually', 'UK: /ˈæktʃuəli/ | US: /ˈæktʃuəli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'thực ra, trên thực tế', 'in truth or in fact, used to emphasize real circumstances', 'I thought the meeting was at 10 AM, but actually it\'s at 11.', 'Tôi nghĩ cuộc họp lúc 10 giờ sáng, nhưng thực ra là 11 giờ.', '{\"en\": \"Although we expected delays, the building renovations actually finished ahead of schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù chúng tôi dự đoán sẽ có sự chậm trễ, công việc cải tạo tòa nhà trên thực tế lại hoàn thành trước thời hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-ljspeech-d617b5ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-cori-d617b5ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/actually-9f2e2e79.webp', '[\"in fact\", \"really\", \"truly\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"actually happen\", \"meaning\": \"thực sự xảy ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"what actually matters\", \"meaning\": \"điều thực sự quan trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"currently\", \"note_vi\": \"Currently nghĩa là \'hiện tại/bây giờ\', không phải là \'thực ra/trên thực tế\' như actually.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"actual\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-cori-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru0-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru5-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru6-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru10-d617b5ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru9-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru3-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru7-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru8-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru2-d617b5ef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-ljspeech-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-lt408-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-lt138-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-lt624-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-lt396-d617b5ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-lt498-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-lt132-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-lt288-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-lt42-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-lt90-d617b5ef.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để đính chính hoặc bổ sung sự thật khác với suy đoán ban đầu; mang nghĩa \'trên thực tế\'.', 'office communication', 1, 3),
('3c443a9d-877e-5250-90dd-b30910f76db6', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'man', '/mæn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một người trưởng thành thuộc giới tính nam.', 'an adult male human being.', 'The man in the black suit is the new manager.', 'Người đàn ông mặc vest đen là quản lý mới.', '{\"en\": \"The man in the grey suit is our new regional sales manager.\", \"vi\": \"Người đàn ông mặc vest xám là giám đốc kinh doanh khu vực mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-ljspeech-8175e3c8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-cori-8175e3c8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/man-00c7c208.webp', '[\"gentleman\", \"male\"]', '[\"woman\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"business man\", \"meaning\": \"doanh nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"young man\", \"meaning\": \"chàng trai trẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"man in charge\", \"meaning\": \"người phụ trách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"men\", \"note_vi\": \"men là số nhiều của man, không dùng thay thế nhau\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"manly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mankind\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-cori-8175e3c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-aru0-8175e3c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-aru5-8175e3c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-aru6-8175e3c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-aru10-8175e3c8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-aru9-8175e3c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-aru3-8175e3c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-aru7-8175e3c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-aru8-8175e3c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/man-aru2-8175e3c8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/