('125f1f84-95ab-5986-a833-4c10e7042126', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'between', '/bɪˈtwiːn/', 'A1', 'preposition', 'Ở vị trí giữa hai người, vật hoặc thời điểm.', 'in or into the space that separates two places, people, or objects.', 'The manager scheduled a brief meeting between the two main departments yesterday morning.', 'Quản lý đã lên lịch một cuộc họp ngắn giữa hai bộ phận chính vào sáng qua.', '{\"en\": \"The new office building is located between the train station and the shopping mall.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng mới nằm ở giữa ga tàu và trung tâm mua sắm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-ljspeech-70963405.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-cori-70963405.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/between-f06179e6.webp', '[\"amid\", \"amongst\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"between you and me\", \"meaning\": \"bí mật giữa hai chúng ta\"}, {\"phrase\": \"choose between\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn giữa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"among\", \"note_vi\": \"dùng cho ba đối tượng trở lên, between dùng cho hai\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-cori-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru0-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru5-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru6-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru10-70963405.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru9-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru3-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru7-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru8-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru2-70963405.mp3\"]}, \"us