('189464c9-6fc2-5c45-b772-2b24fe7a9aba', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'director', 'UK: /dɪˈrektər/ | US: /dɪˈrektər/', 'A2', 'noun', 'giám đốc', 'a person who is in charge of an organization, department, or business operation.', 'She was promoted to the position of sales director.', 'Cô ấy được thăng chức lên vị trí giám đốc kinh doanh.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors approved the budget proposal for the new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã phê duyệt đề xuất ngân sách cho chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-ljspeech-235acfdf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-cori-235acfdf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/director-6f0d1e5a.webp', '[\"executive\", \"head\", \"manager\", \"chief\"]', '[\"subordinate\", \"employee\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"board of directors\", \"meaning\": \"hội đồng quản trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"managing director\", \"meaning\": \"giám đốc điều hành\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"directory\", \"note_vi\": \"Danh bạ, thư mục thông tin, không phải người giám đốc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"direct\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"direction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"directly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-cori-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-aru0-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-aru5-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-aru6-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-aru10-235acfdf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-aru9-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-aru3-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-aru7-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-aru8-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-aru2-235acfdf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-ljspeech-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-lt408-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-lt138-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-lt624-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-lt396-235acfdf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-lt498-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-lt132-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-lt288-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-lt42-235acfdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/director-lt90-235acfdf.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong các tiêu đề công sở như \'Board of Directors\' (Hội đồng quản trị) hay \'Managing Director\' (Giám đốc điều hành).', 'management', 1, 18),
('ab1ce59d-9964-5cde-913f-09302ef81589', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'advantage', 'UK: /ədˈvɑːntɪdʒ/ | US: /ədˈvæntɪdʒ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'lợi thế', 'a condition or quality that puts someone in a better position than others.', 'The new system offers several advantages to users.', 'Hệ thống mới mang lại nhiều lợi thế cho người dùng.', '{\"en\": \"Our competitive pricing gives us a clear advantage over local rivals.\", \"vi\": \"Mức giá cạnh tranh của chúng tôi mang lại lợi thế rõ rệt so với các đối thủ địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-ljspeech-5caa3c36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-cori-5caa3c36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/advantage-e6976a36.webp', '[\"benefit\", \"edge\", \"asset\"]', '[\"disadvantage\", \"drawback\", \"handicap\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take advantage of\", \"meaning\": \"tận dụng, khai thác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"competitive advantage\", \"meaning\": \"lợi thế cạnh tranh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"to somebody\'s advantage\", \"meaning\": \"có lợi cho ai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"advantageous\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disadvantage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-cori-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-aru0-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-aru5-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-aru6-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-aru10-5caa3c36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-aru9-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-aru3-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-aru7-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-aru8-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-aru2-5caa3c36.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-ljspeech-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-lt408-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-lt138-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-lt624-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-lt396-5caa3c36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-lt498-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-lt132-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-lt288-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-lt42-5caa3c36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advantage-lt90-5caa3c36.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc hay gặp: \'take advantage of\' (tận dụng cơ hội) hoặc \'have an advantage over\' (có lợi thế so với).', 'business', 1, 19),
('3329c2c1-f31c-5b94-8a4d-dd8b017583f3', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'mistake', '/mɪˈsteɪk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một hành động hoặc suy nghĩ không đúng.', 'an action or decision that is incorrect or produces an unwanted result.', 'Correcting a minor mistake early can prevent serious problems during software development.', 'Việc sửa một lỗi nhỏ từ sớm có thể ngăn ngừa những vấn đề nghiêm trọng trong quá trình phát triển phần mềm.', '{\"en\": \"The accountant corrected the mistake on the financial report before submitting it to management.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán viên đã sửa lỗi trên báo cáo tài chính trước khi trình lên ban quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-ljspeech-c07a45a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-cori-c07a45a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mistake-f5cbe3b9.webp', '[\"error\", \"fault\", \"blunder\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a mistake\", \"meaning\": \"mắc sai lầm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"correct a mistake\", \"meaning\": \"sửa một sai lầm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"error\", \"note_vi\": \"error thường dùng cho lỗi kỹ thuật hoặc trang trọng hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mistake\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mistaken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-cori-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru0-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru5-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru6-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru10-c07a45a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru9-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru3-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru7-c07a45a8.mp3\", \