('940e673c-7d58-5707-a5c8-fb64f0080651', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'another', '/əˈnʌðə(r)/', 'A2', 'determiner', 'Một cái khác, một người khác, hoặc thêm một.', 'one more person or thing of the same type as the one you already have.', 'Could I have another cup of coffee, please?', 'Làm ơn cho tôi thêm một tách cà phê nữa được không?', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to hire another assistant to help with the increasing volume of paperwork.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý quyết định thuê thêm một trợ lý để giúp xử lý khối lượng giấy tờ ngày càng tăng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-ljspeech-b7c8ffb8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-cori-b7c8ffb8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/another-1b3ef650.webp', '[\"additional\", \"extra\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"another one\", \"meaning\": \"một cái khác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"another time\", \"meaning\": \"lần khác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"other\", \"note_vi\": \"dùng cho danh từ số nhiều hoặc không đếm được.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-cori-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-aru0-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-aru5-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-aru6-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-aru10-b7c8ffb8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-aru9-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-aru3-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-aru7-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-aru8-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-aru2-b7c8ffb8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-ljspeech-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-lt408-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-lt138-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-lt624-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-lt396-b7c8ffb8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-lt498-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-lt132-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-lt288-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-lt42-b7c8ffb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/another-lt90-b7c8ffb8.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng \'another\' trước danh từ số ít đếm được.', 'business', 1, 22),
('f822e538-85c7-57c8-9a51-52dd39ce1394', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'anytime', 'UK: /ˈɛnitaɪm/ | US: /ˈɛniˌtaɪm/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'bất cứ lúc nào', 'at any moment or on any occasion, without restriction to a specific period.', 'You can submit your report anytime before the deadline.', 'Bạn có thể nộp báo cáo bất cứ lúc nào trước thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"Clients can view their account statements online anytime by logging into the secure portal.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể xem sao kê tài khoản trực tuyến bất kỳ lúc nào bằng cách đăng nhập vào cổng thông tin bảo mật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-ljspeech-6f2cbfec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-cori-6f2cbfec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anytime-88f73423.webp', '[\"whenever\", \"at any time\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"feel free to contact anytime\", \"meaning\": \"cứ tự nhiên liên hệ bất cứ lúc nào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"available anytime\", \"meaning\": \"sẵn sàng bất kỳ lúc nào\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-cori-6f2cbfec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-aru0-6f2cbfec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-aru5-6f2cbfec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-aru6-6f2cbfec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-aru10-6f2cbfec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-aru9-6f2cbfec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-aru3-6f2cbfec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-aru7-6f2cbfec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-aru8-6f2cbfec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anytime-aru2-6f2cbfec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia