('e2d32276-dd04-58ff-a97e-1fb808e2be9b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'school', '/skuːl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nơi học sinh đến để học tập.', 'a place where children go to be taught and learn new things every day.', 'My younger brother goes to primary school every morning.', 'Em trai tôi đi học tiểu học mỗi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The local business school offers evening courses for professionals who want to improve their management skills.\", \"vi\": \"Trường kinh doanh địa phương cung cấp các khóa học buổi tối cho những chuyên gia muốn cải thiện kỹ năng quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-ljspeech-655f83be.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-cori-655f83be.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/school-41ac7ba3.webp', '[\"academy\", \"institution\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go to school\", \"meaning\": \"đi học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business school\", \"meaning\": \"trường kinh doanh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scholarly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-cori-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-aru0-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-aru5-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-aru6-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-aru10-655f83be.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-aru9-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-aru3-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-aru7-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-aru8-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-aru2-655f83be.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-ljspeech-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-lt408-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-lt138-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-lt624-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-lt396-655f83be.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-lt498-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-lt132-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-lt288-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-lt42-655f83be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/school-lt90-655f83be.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, thường xuất hiện dưới dạng \'business school\' hoặc \'training school\'.', 'education', 1, 24),
('41ab0348-088b-5151-90e3-877056958d74', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'convenient', 'UK: /kənˈviːniənt/ | US: /kənˈviːnɪənt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'thuận tiện', 'suitable for your needs and causing little difficulty or effort to use.', 'The office location is convenient for all employees.', 'Vị trí văn phòng thuận tiện cho tất cả nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The new branch is in a very convenient location close to public transportation.\", \"vi\": \"Chi nhánh mới nằm ở một vị trí rất thuận tiện gần phương tiện giao thông công cộng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-ljspeech-23e0d93b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-cori-23e0d93b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/convenient-6e07335f.webp', '[\"accessible\", \"handy\", \"suitable\"]', '[\"inconvenient\", \"unsuitable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"convenient location\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí thuận tiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"convenient time\", \"meaning\": \"thời gian thích hợp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conventional\", \"note_vi\": \"Theo truyền thống, thông thường (tránh nhầm với convenient là thuận tiện).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"convenience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"conveniently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-cori-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-aru0-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-aru5-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-aru6-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-aru10-23e0d93b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-aru9-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-aru3-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-aru7-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-aru8-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-aru2-23e0d93b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-ljspeech-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-lt408-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-lt138-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-lt624-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-lt396-23e0d93b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-lt498-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-lt132-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-lt288-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-lt42-23e0d93b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convenient-lt90-23e0d93b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng cho sự việc/địa điểm, không dùng miêu tả con người (nói \'It is convenient for me\', không dùng \'I am convenient\').', 'travel', 1, 25),
('1fb5bb6d-7983-590f-8e98-ec036e8bd775', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'interest', '/ˈɪntrəst/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác muốn biết hoặc tìm hiểu về điều gì đó.', 'a feeling of wanting to know about or be involved in something.', 'Her main interest is reading historical novels.', 'Sở thích chính của cô ấy là đọc tiểu thuyết lịch sử.', '{\"en\": \"The manager expressed great interest in the new marketing proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý bày tỏ sự quan tâm lớn đến đề xuất marketing mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-ljspeech-5e8aa8df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-cori-5e8aa8df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interest-710cfc70.webp', '[\"curiosity\", \"enthusiasm\", \"passion\"]', '[\"indifference\", \"boredom\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"show interest in\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự quan tâm đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take an interest in\", \"meaning\": \"quan tâm đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lose interest\", \"meaning\": \"mất hứng thú\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"interest\", \"note_vi\": \"\'interest\' còn nghĩa là tiền lãi trong tài chính, cần phân biệt theo ngữ cảnh. (finance)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"interested\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"interesting\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"interest\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"interestingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-cori-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-aru0-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-aru5-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-aru6-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-aru10-5e8aa8df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-aru9-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-aru3-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-aru7-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-aru8-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-aru2-5e8aa8df.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-ljspeech-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-lt408-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-lt138-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-lt624-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-lt396-5e8aa8df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-lt498-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-lt132-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-lt288-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-lt42-5e8aa8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interest-lt90-5e8aa8df.mp3\"]}}', '\'Interest\' có hai nghĩa phổ biến trong TOEIC: sự quan tâm và tiền lãi ngân hàng.', 'business', 1, 26),
('a8dfecaf-1334-576a-b4c4-42a678e2e508', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'know', '/nəʊ/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Có kiến thức hoặc thông tin về điều gì đó.', 'to have information or facts in your mind about something.', 'Do you know how to get to the nearest bus station?', 'Bạn có biết làm thế nào để đến trạm xe buýt gần nhất không?', '{\"en\": \"Do you know the schedule for the upcoming training session in the conference room?\", \"vi\": \"Bạn có biết lịch trình cho buổi đào tạo sắp tới trong phòng họp không?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-ljspeech-97accafb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-cori-97accafb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/know-92b17ee3.webp', '[\"understand\", \"realize\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"forget\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"know about\", \"meaning\": \"biết về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"know well\", \"meaning\": \"biết rõ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"no\", \"note_vi\": \"no là từ phủ định, phát âm giống know.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"knowledge\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"knowledgeable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-cori-97accafb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-aru0-97accafb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-aru5-97accafb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-aru6-97accafb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-aru10-97accafb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-aru9-97accafb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-aru3-97accafb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-aru7-97accafb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-aru8-97accafb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/know-aru2-97accafb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/p