('ec6fd7f7-19a8-5fa1-a8eb-dcf01687db19', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'carrot', '/ˈkærət/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Loại củ màu cam, thường dùng làm rau ăn.', 'a long orange root vegetable that grows under the ground.', 'She chopped an orange carrot to add color to the fresh vegetable salad.', 'Cô ấy thái nhỏ một củ cà rốt màu cam để thêm màu sắc cho món rau trộn tươi.', '{\"en\": \"The cafeteria served a fresh salad containing sliced cucumber and sweet roasted carrot.\", \"vi\": \"Quán ăn tự phục vụ đã phục vụ món xà lách tươi có dưa chuột thái lát và cà rốt nướng ngọt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-ljspeech-d8bfad4b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-cori-d8bfad4b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carrot-4d9a86d5.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"raw carrot\", \"meaning\": \"cà rốt sống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carrot juice\", \"meaning\": \"nước ép cà rốt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-cori-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-aru0-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-aru5-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-aru6-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-aru10-d8bfad4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-aru9-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-aru3-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-aru7-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-aru8-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-aru2-d8bfad4b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-ljspeech-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-lt408-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-lt138-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-lt624-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-lt396-d8bfad4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-lt498-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-lt132-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-lt288-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-lt42-d8bfad4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carrot-lt90-d8bfad4b.mp3\"]}}', 'Carrot là danh từ đếm được, dạng số nhiều chỉ cần thêm s.', 'dining', 1, 28),
('d16d5220-f057-5961-b014-46e9aac40c99', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1db84f5d-9621-5456-8ec4-af8182e556a3', 'ffb23b23-3a6c-540d-ab64-95a27b2e15b8', 'hello', '/həˈləʊ/', 'A1', 'interjection', 'Lời chào khi gặp ai đó.', 'a word used as a greeting when meeting someone or answering the phone.', 'She waved and said \"hello\" to her neighbor.', 'Cô ấy vẫy tay và nói \"xin chào\" với người hàng xóm của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist said hello to the client as soon as he entered the office.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên lễ tân đã chào vị khách ngay khi anh ấy bước vào văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-ljspeech-aaf4c61d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-cori-aaf4c61d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hello-024081b5.webp', '[\"hi\", \"greetings\"]', '[\"goodbye\", \"bye\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"say hello\", \"meaning\": \"gửi lời chào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"say hello to someone\", \"meaning\": \"chào hỏi ai đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"halo\", \"note_vi\": \"halo nghĩa là vòng hào quang, khác với hello là lời chào\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-cori-aaf4c61d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-aru0-aaf4c61d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-aru5-aaf4c61d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-aru6-aaf4c61d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-aru10-aaf4c61d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-aru9-aaf4c61d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-aru3-aaf4c61d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-aru7-aaf4c61d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-aru8-aaf4c61d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-aru2-aaf4c61d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-ljspeech-aaf4c61d.mp3\", \"/