('04828d71-4f2e-505d-a668-c35ce4756696', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1fff6119-8348-5cea-8b33-1f04e28f418d', 'd9f64193-17b6-51aa-ae34-18a0b684652a', 'interesting', '/ˈɪntrəstɪŋ/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Gây tò mò, hấp dẫn sự chú ý.', 'something that keeps your attention because it is unusual, exciting, or provides new information.', 'The documentary about ancient civilizations was very interesting.', 'Bộ phim tài liệu về các nền văn minh cổ đại rất thú vị.', '{\"en\": \"The speaker gave an interesting presentation about the latest trends in the global technology market.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả đã có một bài thuyết trình thú vị về những xu hướng mới nhất trên thị trường công nghệ toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-ljspeech-68f55551.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-cori-68f55551.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interesting-e9ba0740.webp', '[\"fascinating\", \"engaging\"]', '[\"boring\", \"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"very interesting\", \"meaning\": \"rất thú vị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interesting idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng hay\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"interest\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"interest\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-cori-68f55551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-aru0-68f55551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-aru5-68f55551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-aru6-68f55551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-aru10-68f55551.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-aru9-68f55551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-aru3-68f55551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-aru7-68f55551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interesting-aru8-68