('641685ec-a813-5c4d-8b33-319df80e0f4c', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1fff6119-8348-5cea-8b33-1f04e28f418d', 'd9f64193-17b6-51aa-ae34-18a0b684652a', 'third', '/θɜːd/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Chỉ vị trí số ba trong một dãy hoặc thứ tự.', 'coming after the second and before the fourth in a series.', 'This is my third attempt to pass the driving test.', 'Đây là lần thứ ba tôi cố gắng vượt qua bài thi lái xe.', '{\"en\": \"The company will open its third branch in this city next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ mở chi nhánh thứ ba tại thành phố này vào quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-ljspeech-34fb3300.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-cori-34fb3300.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/third-196a0304.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"third quarter\", \"meaning\": \"quý ba\"}, {\"phrase\": \"third party\", \"meaning\": \"bên thứ ba\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"thirdly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-cori-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-aru0-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-aru5-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-aru6-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-aru10-34fb3300.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-aru9-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-aru3-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-aru7-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-aru8-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-aru2-34fb3300.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-ljspeech-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-lt408-34fb3300.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-lt1