('a0cfb09a-b840-5579-a8be-2134a24df77f', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1fff6119-8348-5cea-8b33-1f04e28f418d', 'd9f64193-17b6-51aa-ae34-18a0b684652a', 'boring', '/ˈbɔːrɪŋ/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Gây cảm giác buồn tẻ, không thú vị.', 'causing feelings of weariness or a lack of interest in people.', 'The lecture was so boring that I almost fell asleep.', 'Bài giảng nhàm chán đến mức tôi suýt ngủ gật.', '{\"en\": \"The training video was boring and made the staff sleepy.\", \"vi\": \"Video đào tạo nhàm chán và làm nhân viên buồn ngủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-ljspeech-2c7fba49.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-cori-2c7fba49.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/boring-dcf91cf5.webp', '[\"dull\", \"tedious\"]', '[\"interesting\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"boring job\", \"meaning\": \"công việc nhàm chán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dead boring\", \"meaning\": \"cực chán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"baring\", \"note_vi\": \"boring là chán, baring là làm trần (của bare)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bore\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"boredom\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-cori-2c7fba49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-aru0-2c7fba49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-aru5-2c7fba49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-aru6-2c7fba49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-aru10-2c7fba49.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-aru9-2c7fba49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-aru3-2c7fba49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-aru7-2c7fba49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-aru8-2c7fba49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boring-aru2-2c7fba49.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bori