('46be1817-feef-5458-a4b5-d5f5266f46b2', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1fff6119-8348-5cea-8b33-1f04e28f418d', 'd9f64193-17b6-51aa-ae34-18a0b684652a', 'hungry', '/ˈhʌŋɡri/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy muốn ăn, cần thức ăn.', 'wanting or needing to eat food because your stomach is empty.', 'After playing all morning, the children were very hungry.', 'Sau khi chơi cả buổi sáng, lũ trẻ rất đói.', '{\"en\": \"The staff members were hungry after working late to complete the urgent project.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên đều thấy đói sau khi làm việc muộn để hoàn thành dự án gấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-ljspeech-eff2146b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-cori-eff2146b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hungry-2ad9a180.webp', '[\"starving\", \"famished\"]', '[\"full\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel hungry\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy đói\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hungry for success\", \"meaning\": \"khao khát thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"angry\", \"note_vi\": \"Hungry là đói bụng, còn angry là tức giận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hunger\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"hungrily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-cori-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru0-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru5-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru6-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru10-eff2146b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru9-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru3-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru7-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru8-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru2-eff2146b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"n