('2fc9128b-405a-5f59-8ab0-ac842a262b88', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1fff6119-8348-5cea-8b33-1f04e28f418d', 'd9f64193-17b6-51aa-ae34-18a0b684652a', 'example', '/ɪɡˈzɑːmpl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một trường hợp cụ thể minh họa cho một điều gì đó.', 'a specific case or item that helps to explain or prove a general idea or point.', 'Can you give me an example of how to use this new software?', 'Bạn có thể cho tôi một ví dụ về cách sử dụng phần mềm mới này không?', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor provided an example of how to handle difficult customer complaints effectively and professionally.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát đã đưa ra một ví dụ về cách xử lý khiếu nại của khách hàng hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-ljspeech-c3499c27.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-cori-c3499c27.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/example-b354e299.webp', '[\"instance\", \"sample\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"give an example\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra ví dụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"for example\", \"meaning\": \"ví dụ như\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exemplify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-cori-c3499c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-aru0-c3499c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-aru5-c3499c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-aru6-c3499c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-aru10-c3499c27.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-aru9-c3499c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-aru3-c3499c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-aru7-c3499c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-aru8-c3499c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/example-aru2-c3499c27.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pub