('89577590-a649-5fe1-9339-840257baceef', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1fff6119-8348-5cea-8b33-1f04e28f418d', 'd9f64193-17b6-51aa-ae34-18a0b684652a', 'summer', '/ˈsʌmə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Mùa nóng nhất trong năm, thường từ tháng 6 đến tháng 8.', 'the period of the year with the highest temperatures, coming between spring and autumn.', 'We usually go to the beach during the summer holidays.', 'Chúng tôi thường đi biển vào kỳ nghỉ hè.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency offers special discounts on flights during the summer season.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch cung cấp các chương trình giảm giá đặc biệt cho các chuyến bay trong mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-ljspeech-6420ed4d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-cori-6420ed4d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/summer-319ef3c2.webp', NULL, '[\"winter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"summer vacation\", \"meaning\": \"kỳ nghỉ hè\"}, {\"phrase\": \"summer camp\", \"meaning\": \"trại hè\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"summery\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-cori-6420ed4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-aru0-6420ed4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-aru5-6420ed4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-aru6-6420ed4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-aru10-6420ed4d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-aru9-6420ed4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-aru3-6420ed4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-aru7-6420ed4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-aru8-6420ed4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-aru2-6420ed4d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/summer-ljspeech-6420ed4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu