('23c3337d-0ea3-5563-87ce-ced9a66970cb', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1fff6119-8348-5cea-8b33-1f04e28f418d', 'd9f64193-17b6-51aa-ae34-18a0b684652a', 'drive', '/draɪv/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Điều khiển phương tiện giao thông.', 'to operate and control the direction of a motor vehicle while it is moving along roads.', 'I learned to drive when I was eighteen years old.', 'Tôi đã học lái xe khi tôi mười tám tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are required to drive carefully when using company vehicles for official business trips.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được yêu cầu lái xe cẩn thận khi sử dụng xe công ty cho các chuyến công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-ljspeech-4979d619.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-cori-4979d619.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drive-6d683c75.webp', '[\"operate\", \"steer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"drive a car\", \"meaning\": \"lái xe hơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"drive safely\", \"meaning\": \"lái xe an toàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"driver\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-cori-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-aru0-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-aru5-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-aru6-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-aru10-4979d619.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-aru9-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-aru3-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-aru7-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-aru8-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-aru2-4979d619.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-ljspeech-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-lt408-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-lt138-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-lt624-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-lt396-4979d619.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-lt498-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-lt132-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-lt288-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-lt42-4979d619.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drive-lt90-4979d619.mp3\"]}}', 'nghĩa gốc là điều khiển phương tiện, nghĩa bóng là thúc đẩy tiến độ.', 'travel', 1, 24),
('d68a1be4-be4e-5e19-a19e-e651b33262fb', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '1fff6119-8348-5cea-8b33-1f04e28f418d', 'd9f64193-17b6-51aa-ae34-18a0b684652a', 'wonderful', '/ˈwʌndəfl/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Rất tuyệt vời, đẹp đẽ hoặc đáng kinh ngạc.', 'extremely good, pleasant, or enjoyable in a way that causes admiration.', 'The consultant gave a wonderful presentation on strategic financial planning during the annual workshop.', 'Vị cố vấn đã đưa ra một bài thuyết trình tuyệt vời về lập kế hoạch tài chính chiến lược trong buổi hội thảo hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team did a wonderful job organizing the annual product launch event.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã làm một công việc tuyệt vời khi tổ chức sự kiện ra mắt sản phẩm thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-ljspeech-51f90c38.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-cori-51f90c38.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wonderful-ac64603b.webp', '[\"excellent\", \"fantastic\", \"marvelous\"]', '[\"terrible\", \"awful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wonderful opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội tuyệt vời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wonderful experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm tuyệt vời\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wonder\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"wonderfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-cori-51f90c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-aru0-51f90c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-aru5-51f90c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-aru6-51f90c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-aru10-51f90c38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-aru9-51f90c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-aru3-51f90c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonderful-aru7-