('a557b4ef-68f0-5aec-8c4d-e7fe4961b805', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '2b83b85f-5b51-5624-a164-1f201372948e', '08711558-a5d6-5ba6-ac0f-c2c619160b0e', 'sugar', '/ˈʃʊɡə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Chất ngọt màu trắng, thường dùng trong thực phẩm.', 'a sweet white substance that is added to food or drinks to make them taste better.', 'The doctor advised him to reduce the amount of sugar in his daily diet.', 'Bác sĩ khuyên anh ấy nên giảm lượng đường trong chế độ ăn hàng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service provided packets of sugar and cream for the coffee station at the conference.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống đã cung cấp các gói đường và kem cho quầy cà phê tại hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-ljspeech-30eef85d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-cori-30eef85d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sugar-183ad817.webp', '[\"sweetener\", \"glucose\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"brown sugar\", \"meaning\": \"đường nâu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"add sugar\", \"meaning\": \"thêm đường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sugary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-cori-30eef85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-aru0-30eef85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-aru5-30eef85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-aru6-30eef85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-aru10-30eef85d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-aru9-30eef85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-aru3-30eef85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-aru7-30eef85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-aru8-30eef85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-aru2-30eef85d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugar-ljspeech-30e