('84c1be3c-4cbb-596e-b641-b0927d007841', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '2b83b85f-5b51-5624-a164-1f201372948e', '08711558-a5d6-5ba6-ac0f-c2c619160b0e', 'lose', '/luːz/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Không còn sở hữu hoặc tìm thấy được.', 'to be unable to find something that you had before or to have it taken away.', 'I always seem to lose my keys when I\'m in a hurry.', 'Tôi dường như luôn làm mất chìa khóa khi tôi đang vội.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure you do not lose your company identification badge during the business conference.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo bạn không làm mất thẻ nhân viên của công ty trong suốt hội nghị kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-ljspeech-4db924a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-cori-4db924a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lose-81304b6f.webp', '[\"misplace\", \"drop\"]', '[\"find\", \"keep\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lose weight\", \"meaning\": \"giảm cân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lose money\", \"meaning\": \"mất tiền\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"loose\", \"note_vi\": \"tính từ, nghĩa là lỏng lẻo, không chặt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"loss\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lost\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-cori-4db924a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-aru0-4db924a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-aru5-4db924a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-aru6-4db924a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-aru10-4db924a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-aru9-4db924a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-aru3-4db924a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-aru7-4db924a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-aru8-4db924a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-aru2-4db924a2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"