('62d566ba-4ee9-5665-a858-4576b6111495', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '2bfdcce5-4c35-5973-aa68-4b27209afc4f', 'c6fafa29-2c29-5b01-8f0c-51d0c84da3f3', 'breakfast', '/ˈbrekfəst/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bữa ăn đầu tiên trong ngày, thường vào buổi sáng.', 'A dish or meal consumed during the early hours of the day to start activities.', 'I usually have a light breakfast, like toast and coffee, before going to work.', 'Tôi thường ăn sáng nhẹ, như bánh mì nướng và cà phê, trước khi đi làm.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a complimentary buffet breakfast for all business guests every morning.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp bữa ăn sáng tự chọn miễn phí cho tất cả khách công tác mỗi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-ljspeech-9e3a8225.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-cori-9e3a8225.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/breakfast-ea09c203.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"eat breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"ăn sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"serve breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"phục vụ bữa sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"buffet breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"bữa sáng tự chọn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"brunch\", \"note_vi\": \"brunch là bữa ăn kết hợp giữa bữa sáng và bữa trưa\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-cori-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru0-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru5-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru6-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru10-9e3a8225.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru9-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru3-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru7-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru8-9e3a8225.mp3\", 