('321c8cd4-d89a-5d53-802f-71c8fd8996f6', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '2bfdcce5-4c35-5973-aa68-4b27209afc4f', 'c6fafa29-2c29-5b01-8f0c-51d0c84da3f3', 'fire', '/ˈfaɪə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng cháy tạo ra nhiệt và ánh sáng.', 'the heat and light produced when something burns.', 'They built a fire to keep warm during the cold night.', 'Họ đã đốt lửa để giữ ấm trong đêm lạnh.', '{\"en\": \"Staff must follow the fire safety procedures posted in the office.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải tuân theo quy trình an toàn phòng cháy được dán trong văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-ljspeech-1da84024.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-cori-1da84024.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fire-3836ed7f.webp', '[\"flame\", \"blaze\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fire alarm\", \"meaning\": \"báo động cháy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"catch fire\", \"meaning\": \"bốc cháy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fire drill\", \"meaning\": \"diễn tập phòng cháy chữa cháy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fire\", \"note_vi\": \"\'fire\' còn nghĩa là sa thải nhân viên, cần chú ý ngữ cảnh. (verb)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fiery\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fire\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-cori-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru0-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru5-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru6-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru10-1da84024.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru9-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru3-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru7-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru8-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru2-1da84024.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-ljspeech-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt408-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt138-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt624-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt396-1da84024.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt498-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt132-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt288-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt42-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt90-1da84024.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'fire\' thường xuất hiện trong chủ đề an toàn văn phòng hoặc sa thải nhân viên.', 'office', 1, 21),
('f910da75-9244-5245-bc10-829b0d2a6cc9', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '2bfdcce5-4c35-5973-aa68-4b27209afc4f', 'c6fafa29-2c29-5b01-8f0c-51d0c84da3f3', 'bridge', 'UK: /brɪdʒ/ | US: /brɪdʒ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'cây cầu', 'A structure constructed over a river, road, or railway to allow people or vehicles to cross.', 'A concrete bridge was built across the river.', 'Một cây cầu bê tông đã được xây dựng bắc qua sông.', '{\"en\": \"Traffic across the suspension bridge was delayed due to scheduled maintenance work.\", \"vi\": \"Giao thông qua cầu treo bị chậm trễ do công tác bảo trì theo kế hoạch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-ljspeech-2fa1981b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-cori-2fa1981b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bridge-f0e8e040.webp', '[\"span\", \"viaduct\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bridge the gap\", \"meaning\": \"thu hẹp khoảng cách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"foot bridge\", \"meaning\": \"cầu đi bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"breeze\", \"note_vi\": \"gió nhẹ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bridge\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-cori-2fa1981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-aru0-2fa1981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-aru5-2fa1981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-aru6-2fa1981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-aru10-2fa1981b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-aru9-2fa1981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-aru3-2fa1981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-aru7-2fa1981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-aru8-2fa1981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-aru2-2fa1981b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridge-ljspeech-2fa1981b.mp3\", \"/s