('7ff3ebfd-eed9-59a2-9178-3167755f53f0', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '2bfdcce5-4c35-5973-aa68-4b27209afc4f', 'c6fafa29-2c29-5b01-8f0c-51d0c84da3f3', 'pink', '/pɪŋk/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có màu sắc pha trộn giữa đỏ và trắng.', 'a pale shade of red that is lighter and less saturated than pure red.', 'She loves wearing pink dresses, especially in the spring.', 'Cô ấy thích mặc những chiếc váy màu hồng, đặc biệt là vào mùa xuân.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier sent pink envelopes to match our brand color this season.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp đã gửi phong bì hồng để hợp với màu thương hiệu mùa này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-ljspeech-b0f7f128.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-cori-b0f7f128.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pink-6f2cef6e.webp', '[\"rosy\", \"rose\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pink slip\", \"meaning\": \"giấy sa thải\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pink collar\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên nữ hành chính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"peak\", \"note_vi\": \"pink là màu hồng, peak là đỉnh núi\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-cori-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru0-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru5-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru6-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru10-b0f7f128.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru9-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru3-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru7-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru8-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru2-b0f7f128.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-ljspeech-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt408-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt138-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt624-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt396-b0f7f128.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt498-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt132-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt288-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt42-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt90-b0f7f128.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt pink (hồng) với peak (đỉnh) và pinch (bóp).', 'marketing', 1, 29),
('8ae36b5a-15c4-5688-85ac-34ccc0865ee2', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'dark', '/dɑːk/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Không có ánh sáng hoặc có ít ánh sáng.', 'Characterized by an absence or small amount of light, making visual perception difficult.', 'It gets dark very early in winter, so we need to turn on the lights.', 'Trời tối rất sớm vào mùa đông, nên chúng ta cần bật đèn.', '{\"en\": \"The office building has dark hallways because the light bulbs need to be replaced immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng có những hành lang tối vì bóng đèn cần được thay thế ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-ljspeech-3d09ba44.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-cori-3d09ba44.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dark-4cf8c797.webp', '[\"dim\", \"gloomy\"]', '[\"bright\", \"light\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dark room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng tối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pitch dark\", \"meaning\": \"tối đen như mực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"darkness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-cori-3d09ba44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-aru0-3d09ba44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-aru5-3d09ba44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-aru6-3d09ba44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-aru10-3d09ba44.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-aru9-3d09ba44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-aru3-3d09ba44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-aru7-3d09ba44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-aru8-3d09ba44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-aru2-3d09ba44.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dark-ljspeech-3d09ba44.mp3\", \"/