('f2fe84e0-7e7e-5cb0-8de7-1677c3f7233d', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'guess', '/ɡes/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đoán, phỏng đoán điều gì đó mà không có đủ thông tin.', 'to give an answer to a particular question when you do not have all the facts.', 'Can you guess how many candies are in this jar?', 'Bạn có đoán được có bao nhiêu viên kẹo trong hũ này không?', '{\"en\": \"The project manager can only guess how long the software installation will take today.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý dự án chỉ có thể phỏng đoán việc cài đặt phần mềm hôm nay sẽ mất bao lâu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-ljspeech-77361fca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-cori-77361fca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/guess-5a01b789.webp', '[\"estimate\", \"predict\", \"speculate\"]', '[\"know\", \"prove\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"guess correctly\", \"meaning\": \"đoán đúng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"guess wildly\", \"meaning\": \"đoán mò\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hard to guess\", \"meaning\": \"khó đoán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"estimate\", \"note_vi\": \"ước tính dựa trên số liệu, guess thường dựa trên cảm tính\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"guess\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"guesswork\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-cori-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-aru0-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-aru5-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-aru6-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-aru10-77361fca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-aru9-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-aru3-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-aru7-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-aru8-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-aru2-77361fca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-ljspeech-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-lt408-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-lt138-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-lt624-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-lt396-77361fca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-lt498-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-lt132-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-lt288-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-lt42-77361fca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guess-lt90-77361fca.mp3\"]}}', 'Guess thường mang tính chủ quan, thiếu căn cứ hơn so với estimate (ước tính có cơ sở).', 'business', 1, 1),
('fe0e12e2-8b63-5d58-8ab1-96bbab3cb66b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'herself', 'UK: /həˈsɛlf/ | US: /hərˈsɛlf/', 'A2', 'pronoun', 'chính cô ấy, tự cô ấy', 'Used to emphasize a female person previously mentioned as the subject of an action.', 'She managed to complete the project all by herself.', 'Cô ấy đã tự mình hoàn thành dự án.', '{\"en\": \"Ms. Lawson prepared the entire quarterly financial report by herself.\", \"vi\": \"Bà Lawson đã tự tay chuẩn bị toàn bộ báo cáo tài chính quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-ljspeech-03558a3d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-cori-03558a3d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/herself-2e43f5fc.webp', '[\"personally\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"by herself\", \"meaning\": \"một mình, tự cô ấy làm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"express herself\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ suy nghĩ/ý kiến của chính mình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"her\", \"note_vi\": \"\'her\' là tính từ sở hữu hoặc tân ngữ thường, còn \'herself\' nhấn mạnh chính cô ấy tự làm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"pronoun\", \"word\": \"she\"}, {\"pos\": \"pronoun\", \"word\": \"her\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-cori-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru0-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru5-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru6-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru10-03558a3d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru9-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru3-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru7-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru8-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun