('45765542-e09e-5d52-b35b-86953e8d0358', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'world', '/wɜːld/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Toàn bộ hành tinh Trái Đất và mọi thứ trên đó.', 'the earth together with all its countries, people, and natural features.', 'Traveling around the world is my biggest dream.', 'Du lịch vòng quanh thế giới là ước mơ lớn nhất của tôi.', '{\"en\": \"Our company strives to become a leading supplier of green technology around the world.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi nỗ lực trở thành nhà cung cấp công nghệ xanh hàng đầu trên khắp thế giới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-ljspeech-7c211433.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-cori-7c211433.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/world-e1ff0c21.webp', '[\"globe\", \"earth\", \"planet\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"around the world\", \"meaning\": \"trên khắp thế giới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business world\", \"meaning\": \"giới kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"word\", \"note_vi\": \"world có chữ \'l\', phát âm khác word (từ ngữ)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"worldwide\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"worldwide\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-cori-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-aru0-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-aru5-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-aru6-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-aru10-7c211433.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-aru9-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-aru3-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-aru7-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-aru8-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-aru2-7c211433.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-ljspeech-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-lt408-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-lt138-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-lt624-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-lt396-7c211433.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-lt498-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-lt132-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-lt288-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-lt42-7c211433.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/world-lt90-7c211433.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm lẫn chính tả giữa world (thế giới) và word (từ ngữ).', 'business', 1, 4),
('e77ff692-a88e-5c8e-b9a1-d9cb0796ab15', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'website', '/ˈwebsaɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tập hợp các trang thông tin trên Internet.', 'a set of pages on the internet where information about a company or person is found.', 'You can find more details on our company website.', 'Bạn có thể tìm thêm chi tiết trên trang web của công ty chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"Our company website provides detailed information about all the services we offer to our clients.\", \"vi\": \"Trang web công ty chúng tôi cung cấp thông tin chi tiết về tất cả các dịch vụ chúng tôi cung cấp cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-ljspeech-3ab3e0b0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-cori-3ab3e0b0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/website-fb40fc24.webp', '[\"site\", \"webpage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"visit a website\", \"meaning\": \"truy cập trang web\"}, {\"phrase\": \"update a website\", \"meaning\": \"cập nhật trang web\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-cori-3ab3e0b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-aru0-3ab3e0b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-aru5-3ab3e0b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-aru6-3ab3e0b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-aru10-3ab3e0b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-aru9-3ab3e0b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-aru3-3ab3e0b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-aru7-3ab3e0b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-aru8-3ab3e0b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-aru2-3ab3e0b0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/website-l