('68f16016-af4c-5b1f-a2c5-525bd06707e2', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'reason', '/ˈriːzn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nguyên nhân hoặc lời giải thích cho một sự việc, hành động.', 'a rationale or cause offered to explain a particular event, action, or belief.', 'The project manager explained the main reason for delaying the product launch.', 'Quản lý dự án đã giải thích lý do chính cho việc trì hoãn ra mắt sản phẩm.', '{\"en\": \"The main reason for the project delay was a shortage of raw materials.\", \"vi\": \"Lý do chính cho sự chậm trễ của dự án là do thiếu nguyên liệu thô.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-ljspeech-7947e92e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-cori-7947e92e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reason-a7a32ad7.webp', '[\"cause\", \"explanation\", \"motive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"main reason\", \"meaning\": \"lý do chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reason for\", \"meaning\": \"lý do cho việc gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"result\", \"note_vi\": \"reason là nguyên nhân/lý do, result là kết quả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reasonable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"reasonably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-cori-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru0-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru5-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru6-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru10-7947e92e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru9-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru3-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru7-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru8-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/