('29f077c9-829c-5df4-a23e-755733e5d29b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'cool', '/kuːl/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiệt độ thấp dễ chịu.', 'slightly cold in a pleasant way, especially after hot weather.', 'The evening breeze felt wonderfully cool after the hot day.', 'Làn gió chiều thật mát mẻ dễ chịu sau một ngày nóng bức.', '{\"en\": \"The office air conditioner keeps the conference room cool during long afternoon meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Máy điều hòa văn phòng giữ cho phòng hội nghị mát mẻ trong suốt các cuộc họp dài vào buổi chiều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-ljspeech-85d8d76b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-cori-85d8d76b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cool-a6c7e015.webp', '[\"chilly\", \"fresh\"]', '[\"warm\", \"hot\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cool breeze\", \"meaning\": \"làn gió mát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cool weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết mát mẻ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cold\", \"note_vi\": \"cold là lạnh (gây khó chịu), cool là mát mẻ (dễ chịu)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cool\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coolness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"coolly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-cori-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru0-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru5-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru6-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru10-85d8d76b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru9-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru3-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru7-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru8-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru2-85d8d76b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-ljspeech-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-lt408-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-lt138-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-lt624-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-lt396-85d8d76b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-lt498-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-lt132-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-lt288-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-lt42-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-lt90-85d8d76b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cool ngoài nghĩa mát mẻ còn có nghĩa lóng là \'ngầu\' hoặc \'tuyệt vời\'.', 'office', 1, 26),
('0390d368-2b3e-5fde-b296-c8305fb3fe95', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'theatre', '/ˈθɪətə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nơi biểu diễn kịch, ca nhạc hoặc chiếu phim.', 'a building where people go to watch plays or musical performances.', 'We\'re going to the theatre tonight to see a new play.', 'Tối nay chúng tôi sẽ đi nhà hát để xem một vở kịch mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company booked the local theatre for the annual awards ceremony next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đặt nhà hát địa phương cho buổi lễ trao giải thường niên vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-ljspeech-dcbed361.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-cori-dcbed361.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/theatre-f9bdcaa2.webp', '[\"playhouse\", \"auditorium\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go to the theatre\", \"meaning\": \"đi xem hát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"theatre performance\", \"meaning\": \"buổi biểu diễn tại nhà hát\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"theatrical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-cori-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-aru0-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-aru5-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-aru6-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-aru10-dcbed361.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-aru9-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-aru3-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-aru7-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-aru8-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-aru2-dcbed361.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-ljspeech-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-lt408-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-lt138-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-lt624-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-lt396-dcbed361.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-lt498-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-lt132-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-lt288-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-lt42-dcbed361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theatre-lt90-dcbed361.mp3\"]}}', 'cách viết \'theatre\' là kiểu Anh, \'theater\' là kiểu Mỹ.', 'travel', 1, 27),
('eb2b941d-c23c-5dd8-a39a-c2fc0598f290', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'fourteen', '/ˌfɔːˈtiːn/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Số tự nhiên sau mười ba và trước mười lăm.', 'the number that is equal to ten plus four.', 'The project team completed fourteen tasks during the first phase.', 'Nhóm dự án đã hoàn thành mười bốn nhiệm vụ trong giai đoạn đầu tiên.', '{\"en\": \"We have received fourteen applications for the marketing assistant position this week.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã nhận được mười bốn đơn ứng tuyển cho vị trí trợ lý marketing tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-ljspeech-8a13a01d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-cori-8a13a01d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fourteen-96275279.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fourteen days\", \"meaning\": \"mười bốn ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fourteen people\", \"meaning\": \"mười bốn người\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"forty\", \"note_vi\": \"forty không có chữ u, fourteen có chữ u.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"four\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"forty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-cori-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru0-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru5-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru6-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru10-8a13a01d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru9-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru3-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru7-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru8-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru2-8a13a01d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-ljspeech-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-lt408-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-lt138-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-lt624-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-lt396-8a13a01d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-lt498-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-lt132-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-lt288-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-lt42-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-lt90-8a13a01d.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý cách viết \'fourteen\' có chữ \'u\', khác với \'forty\'.', 'hr', 1, 28),
('03538327-de26-532d-9871-acc64525a8bb', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '36fc5e7d-829b-5ff9-86a9-7e9a4ec911b0', 'ee4b8772-dd17-5419-ba72-5c964a700eb1', 'yourself', '/jɔːˈself/', 'A1', 'pronoun', 'Đại từ phản thân, chỉ chính bản thân người nghe.', 'used as the object of a verb or preposition when the subject is \'you\'.', 'Please introduce yourself to the rest of the team during this morning\'s orientation.', 'Vui lòng tự giới thiệu bản thân với phần còn lại của nhóm trong buổi định hướng sáng nay.', '{\"en\": \"Please help yourself to the coffee and snacks in the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Xin vui lòng tự nhiên dùng cà phê và đồ ăn nhẹ trong phòng hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-ljspeech-20770554.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-cori-20770554.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/yourself-af939e0c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"by yourself\", \"meaning\": \"một mình tự làm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"do it yourself\", \"meaning\": \"tự tay làm lấy\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-cori-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-aru0-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-aru5-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-aru6-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-aru10-20770554.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-aru9-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-aru3-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-aru7-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-aru8-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-aru2-20770554.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-ljspeech-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-lt408-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-lt138-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-lt624-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-lt396-20770554.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-lt498-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-lt132-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-lt288-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-lt42-20770554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yourself-lt90-20770554.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ \'help yourself to...\' nghĩa là tự nhiên dùng (đồ ăn, thức uống).', 'office', 1, 29),
('b7dbb9e2-e04c-5dde-a7b6-af5ffff53558', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '3a76814d-1042-5fb0-b38f-a47360630957', 'f92bce4e-103f-524f-b65e-2b1ac435dcba', 'copy', 'UK: /ˈkɒpi/ | US: /ˈkɑpi/', 'A2', 'noun', 'bản sao, cuốn', 'a single printed example of a book, newspaper, document, or other written work', 'Please make a copy of this document.', 'Vui lòng sao chép tài liệu này.', '{\"en\": \"Please print ten copies of the meeting agenda for the board members.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng in mười bản sao chương trình cuộc họp cho các thành viên hội đồng quản trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-ljspeech-f84e2e2d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-cori-f84e2e2d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/copy-1331a798.webp', '[\"duplicate\", \"replica\", \"reproduction\"]', '[\"original\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hard copy\", \"meaning\": \"bản in giấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"soft copy\", \"meaning\": \"bản lưu điện tử\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"copy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"copier\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-cori-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-aru0-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-aru5-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-aru6-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-aru10-f84e2e2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-aru9-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-aru3-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-aru7-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-aru8-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-aru2-f84e2e2d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-ljspeech-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-lt408-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-lt138-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-lt624-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-lt396-f84e2e2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-lt498-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-lt132-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-lt288-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-lt42-f84e2e2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copy-lt90-f84e2e2d.mp3\"]}}', 'Đếm được khi chỉ bản in/cuốn sách (\'a copy of the report\'); không đếm được khi chỉ nội dung văn bản quảng cáo (\'ad copy\').', 'office', 1, 0),
('136e09b8-0995-5c04-b6c3-023a5abde4aa', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '3a76814d-1042-5fb0-b38f-a47360630957', 'f92bce4e-103f-524f-b65e-2b1ac435dcba', 'second', '/ˈsekənd/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Đứng ở vị trí số hai trong một dãy hoặc thứ tự.', 'coming immediately after the first in order, position, time, or importance.', 'Our sales manager will give a second presentation after the lunch break.', 'Quản lý kinh doanh của chúng tôi sẽ có bài trình bày thứ hai sau giờ nghỉ trưa.', '{\"en\": \"Our company will launch its second branch in downtown Chicago next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi sẽ khai trương chi nhánh thứ hai tại trung tâm thành phố Chicago vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-ljspeech-352f7829.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-cori-352f7829.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/second-209b38a6.webp', NULL, '[\"first\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"second chance\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội thứ hai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"second half\", \"meaning\": \"nửa sau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"secondary\", \"note_vi\": \"secondary là tính từ mang nghĩa \'thứ yếu\' hoặc \'trung học\'\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"secondly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-cori-352f7829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-aru0-352f7829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-aru5-352f7829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-aru6-352f7829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-aru10-352f7829.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-aru9-352f7829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-aru3-352f7829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-aru7-352f7829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/second-aru8-352f7829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/s