('c198a045-a0c2-5337-bf04-525057c0cbeb', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '3edbe970-dcad-536f-b4d5-f75fb28cab57', 'f3f4d34f-c03a-5dfc-b6b2-5cfc839a9dbe', 'father', '/ˈfɑːðə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Người đàn ông có con; người cha.', 'a male parent who has a child or children, often used to refer to a male guardian.', 'My father taught me how to ride a bicycle when I was five.', 'Bố tôi đã dạy tôi cách đi xe đạp khi tôi năm tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"My father attended the company anniversary party to support my recent promotion to senior manager.\", \"vi\": \"Cha tôi đã tham dự bữa tiệc kỷ niệm của công ty để ủng hộ việc tôi mới được thăng chức quản lý cấp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-ljspeech-32c8bbff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-cori-32c8bbff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/father-9114991f.webp', '[\"dad\", \"parent\"]', '[\"mother\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"father figure\", \"meaning\": \"người như cha\"}, {\"phrase\": \"proud father\", \"meaning\": \"người cha tự hào\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fatherly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-cori-32c8bbff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-aru0-32c8bbff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-aru5-32c8bbff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-aru6-32c8bbff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-aru10-32c8bbff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-aru9-32c8bbff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-aru3-32c8bbff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-aru7-32c8bbff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-aru8-32c8bbff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-aru2-32c8bbff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father