('310c6444-6378-55e3-a36a-1ed406be7d71', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '3edbe970-dcad-536f-b4d5-f75fb28cab57', 'f3f4d34f-c03a-5dfc-b6b2-5cfc839a9dbe', 'half', '/hɑːf/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một trong hai phần bằng nhau của một vật.', 'one of two equal parts that something is divided into during a process or event.', 'I\'ll take half of the pizza, and you can have the other half.', 'Tôi sẽ lấy nửa cái pizza, còn bạn có thể lấy nửa kia.', '{\"en\": \"We have already completed half of the project before the deadline set by the client.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã hoàn thành một nửa dự án trước thời hạn do khách hàng đặt ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-ljspeech-6dbdd59a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-cori-6dbdd59a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/half-024299d9.webp', '[\"fifty percent\", \"part\"]', '[\"whole\", \"entire\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"half an hour\", \"meaning\": \"nửa giờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in half\", \"meaning\": \"làm đôi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"halve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-cori-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru0-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru5-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru6-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru10-6dbdd59a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru9-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru3-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru7-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru8-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru2-6dbdd59a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-ljspeech-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-lt408-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-lt138-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-lt624-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-lt396-6dbdd59a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-lt498-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-lt132-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-lt288-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-lt42-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-lt90-6dbdd59a.mp3\"]}}', '\"Half\" có thể là tính từ, danh từ hoặc trạng từ.', 'business', 1, 21),
('cccbdf52-263e-5f38-85a5-87dba7d0c83f', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '3edbe970-dcad-536f-b4d5-f75fb28cab57', 'f3f4d34f-c03a-5dfc-b6b2-5cfc839a9dbe', 'both', '/bəʊθ/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Cả hai người hoặc vật.', 'used for referring to two people or things together as a single unit.', 'The candidate is fluent in both English and French, making her ideal for the role.', 'Ứng viên này thành thạo cả tiếng Anh lẫn tiếng Pháp, khiến cô ấy trở nên lý tưởng cho vị trí này.', '{\"en\": \"Both candidates have excellent qualifications, making it difficult for the manager to choose one.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai ứng viên đều có trình độ chuyên môn xuất sắc, khiến quản lý khó chọn lựa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-ljspeech-fc39b18f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-cori-fc39b18f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/both-71c001db.webp', NULL, '[\"neither\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"both sides\", \"meaning\": \"cả hai bên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"both of them\", \"meaning\": \"cả hai bọn họ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"both A and B\", \"meaning\": \"cả A và B\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-cori-fc39b18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-aru0-fc39b18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-aru5-fc39b18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-aru6-fc39b18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-aru10-fc39b18f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-aru9-fc39b18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-aru3-fc39b18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-aru7-fc39b18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-aru8-fc39b18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-aru2-fc39b18f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/both-ljspeech-fc39b18f.m