('3339629a-a698-5cd5-8199-545626c6d6d2', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '4692bd0d-b8e2-5d67-9d63-ab9b7bb34662', '234caf36-1c1b-5083-bf3a-7015ac88d571', 'stay', '/steɪ/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Ở lại một nơi nào đó.', 'to remain in a particular place and not move away from it.', 'We decided to stay home because of the heavy rain.', 'Chúng tôi quyết định ở nhà vì trời mưa to.', '{\"en\": \"Delegates will stay at a luxury hotel during the three-day business conference.\", \"vi\": \"Các đại biểu sẽ ở tại một khách sạn sang trọng trong suốt hội nghị thương mại kéo dài ba ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-ljspeech-396f9974.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-cori-396f9974.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stay-0306b08e.webp', '[\"remain\", \"reside\", \"lodge\"]', '[\"leave\", \"depart\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stay overnight\", \"meaning\": \"ở lại qua đêm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stay focused\", \"meaning\": \"giữ sự tập trung\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stay\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-cori-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru0-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru5-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru6-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru10-396f9974.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru9-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru3-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru7-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru8-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru2-396f9974.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-ljspeech-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt408-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt138-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt624-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt396-396f9974.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt498-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt132-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt288-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt42-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt90-396f9974.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm giới từ at (stay at a hotel) hoặc with (stay with someone).', 'travel', 1, 1),
('7cfaa4a5-2bf2-5723-945a-9cc76f9d227c', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '4692bd0d-b8e2-5d67-9d63-ab9b7bb34662', '234caf36-1c1b-5083-bf3a-7015ac88d571', 'very', '/ˈveri/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Dùng để nhấn mạnh mức độ cao của tính chất hoặc hành động.', 'used to add emphasis to an adjective or another adverb.', 'She was very happy with the results of her exam.', 'Cô ấy rất vui với kết quả bài kiểm tra của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing strategy proved to be very successful in attracting young clients.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến lược tiếp thị mới đã chứng minh là rất thành công trong việc thu hút khách hàng trẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-ljspeech-e74295bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-cori-e74295bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/very-19bc62eb.webp', '[\"extremely\", \"highly\", \"greatly\"]', '[\"slightly\", \"barely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"very much\", \"meaning\": \"rất nhiều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"very well\", \"meaning\": \"rất tốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vary\", \"note_vi\": \"vary là động từ nghĩa là thay đổi, khác phát âm.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-cori-e74295bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-aru0-e74295bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-aru5-e74295bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-aru6-e74295bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-aru10-e74295bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-aru9-e74295bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-aru3-e74295bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-aru7-e74295bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-aru8-e74295bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-aru2-e74295bf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/very-ljspeech-e74295bf.m