('4fd39aaf-797b-55e2-b2e5-00b60b5575c1', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '4692bd0d-b8e2-5d67-9d63-ab9b7bb34662', '234caf36-1c1b-5083-bf3a-7015ac88d571', 'appearance', 'UK: /əˈpɪərəns/ | US: /əˈpɪrəns/', 'A2', 'noun', 'vẻ bề ngoài', 'The outward physical look or aspect of a person, place, or thing.', 'Her appearance changed after the makeover.', 'Vẻ ngoài của cô ấy đã thay đổi sau khi được trang điểm.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are requested to maintain a neat and professional appearance at all times.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được yêu cầu luôn giữ diện mạo gọn gàng và chuyên nghiệp mọi lúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-ljspeech-85a7b4e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-cori-85a7b4e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appearance-52bca567.webp', '[\"look\", \"aspect\", \"image\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"professional appearance\", \"meaning\": \"diện mạo chuyên nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make an appearance\", \"meaning\": \"hội ngộ / xuất hiện ngắn hạn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"appear\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-cori-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-aru0-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-aru5-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-aru6-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-aru10-85a7b4e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-aru9-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-aru3-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-aru7-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-aru8-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-aru2-85a7b4e8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-ljspeech-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-lt408-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-lt138-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-lt624-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-lt396-85a7b4e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-lt498-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-lt132-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-lt288-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-lt42-85a7b4e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appearance-lt90-85a7b4e8.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở, cụm \'professional appearance\' (diện mạo chuyên nghiệp) rất hay gặp trong các bài thi TOEIC.', 'office', 1, 3),
('e04b2ac0-f2e8-55b7-827c-af03b91d4ef6', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '4692bd0d-b8e2-5d67-9d63-ab9b7bb34662', '234caf36-1c1b-5083-bf3a-7015ac88d571', 'spell', '/spel/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Đọc hoặc viết từng chữ cái của một từ.', 'to write or say the letters of a word in the correct order.', 'The receptionist asked the client to spell his full address clearly.', 'Nhân viên lễ tân đã yêu cầu khách hàng đánh vần rõ ràng địa chỉ đầy đủ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Could you please spell your last name so I can type it correctly?\", \"vi\": \"Bạn có thể vui lòng đánh vần họ của bạn để tôi nhập chính xác không?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-ljspeech-9e8fbda8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-cori-9e8fbda8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spell-bb19c21b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"spell out\", \"meaning\": \"giải thích rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"correctly spelled\", \"meaning\": \"được đánh vần đúng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spill\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là làm tràn, đổ chất lỏng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spelling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-cori-9e8fbda8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-aru0-9e8fbda8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-aru5-9e8fbda8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-aru6-9e8fbda8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-aru10-9e8fbda8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-aru9-9e8fbda8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-aru3-9e8fbda8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-aru7-9e8fbda8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-aru8-9e8fbda8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-aru2-9e8fbda8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spell-ljspeech-9e8fbda8.