('8762956a-31c4-5505-86e3-c966359f56bd', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '4692bd0d-b8e2-5d67-9d63-ab9b7bb34662', '234caf36-1c1b-5083-bf3a-7015ac88d571', 'video', '/ˈvɪdiəʊ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hình ảnh và âm thanh được ghi lại hoặc phát sóng.', 'a recording of moving pictures and sound that can be watched on a screen.', 'We watched a funny video of puppies playing in the park.', 'Chúng tôi đã xem một đoạn video vui nhộn về những chú chó con chơi đùa trong công viên.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team created a short video to promote our new software product.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị đã tạo một video ngắn để quảng bá sản phẩm phần mềm mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-ljspeech-ffbaf58f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-cori-ffbaf58f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/video-c62e6875.webp', '[\"clip\", \"recording\", \"film\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"video conference\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc họp qua video\"}, {\"phrase\": \"watch a video\", \"meaning\": \"xem video\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"audio\", \"note_vi\": \"video là hình ảnh động, audio là âm thanh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"videotape\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-cori-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-aru0-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-aru5-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-aru6-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-aru10-ffbaf58f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-aru9-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-aru3-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-aru7-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-aru8-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-aru2-ffbaf58f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-ljspeech-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-lt408-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-lt138-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-lt624-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-lt396-ffbaf58f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-lt498-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-lt132-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-lt288-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-lt42-ffbaf58f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/video-lt90-ffbaf58f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'video conference\' (họp trực tuyến qua video) xuất hiện rất nhiều.', 'marketing', 1, 20),
('8536c585-0f56-5f27-96c0-7acaa22bef5b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '4692bd0d-b8e2-5d67-9d63-ab9b7bb34662', '234caf36-1c1b-5083-bf3a-7015ac88d571', 'centre', '/ˈsentə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Điểm ở giữa một vật hoặc khu vực.', 'the middle point or part of something or a place for specific activities.', 'The new shopping mall is located right in the city centre.', 'Trung tâm mua sắm mới nằm ngay giữa trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The new convention centre is located conveniently near the main international airport.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm hội nghị mới nằm ở vị trí thuận tiện gần sân bay quốc tế chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-ljspeech-2bd5fb5d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-cori-2bd5fb5d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/centre-fae11838.webp', '[\"middle\", \"core\", \"hub\"]', '[\"edge\", \"periphery\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"city centre\", \"meaning\": \"trung tâm thành phố\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shopping centre\", \"meaning\": \"trung tâm mua sắm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"call centre\", \"meaning\": \"trung tâm giải đáp khách hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"center\", \"note_vi\": \"là cách viết kiểu Anh-Mỹ, centre là Anh-Anh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"central\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"centralize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-cori-2bd5fb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-aru0-2bd5fb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-aru5-2bd5fb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-aru6-2bd5fb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-aru10-2bd5fb5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-aru9-2bd5fb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-aru3-2bd5fb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/centre-aru7-2bd5fb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/