('6679800d-1140-5d10-9f27-eb7769639f1e', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '4692bd0d-b8e2-5d67-9d63-ab9b7bb34662', '234caf36-1c1b-5083-bf3a-7015ac88d571', 'sleep', '/sliːp/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Nghỉ ngơi trong trạng thái vô thức.', 'to rest your mind and body by closing your eyes in a state of unconsciousness.', 'I usually try to sleep for at least seven hours every night.', 'Tôi thường cố gắng ngủ ít nhất bảy tiếng mỗi đêm.', '{\"en\": \"Passengers can sleep comfortably in the private cabins of the overnight train service.\", \"vi\": \"Hành khách có thể ngủ một cách thoải mái trong các cabin riêng của dịch vụ tàu đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-ljspeech-c3ca5f78.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-cori-c3ca5f78.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sleep-ea729e73.webp', '[\"slumber\", \"doze\"]', '[\"wake\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sleep well\", \"meaning\": \"ngủ ngon\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sleep deeply\", \"meaning\": \"ngủ sâu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fall asleep\", \"meaning\": \"thiếp đi, ngủ gật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"asleep\", \"note_vi\": \"sleep là động từ; asleep là tính từ (đang trong trạng thái ngủ).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sleepy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sleepless\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"asleep\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-cori-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-aru0-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-aru5-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-aru6-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-aru10-c3ca5f78.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-aru9-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-aru3-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-aru7-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-aru8-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-aru2-c3ca5f78.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-ljspeech-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-lt408-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-lt138-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-lt624-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-lt396-c3ca5f78.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-lt498-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-lt132-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-lt288-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-lt42-c3ca5f78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleep-lt90-c3ca5f78.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt động từ \'sleep\' và tính từ \'asleep\' (thường dùng: fall asleep, be asleep).', 'travel', 1, 26),
('7b306049-121f-5ec6-951a-274d46280b7b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '4692bd0d-b8e2-5d67-9d63-ab9b7bb34662', '234caf36-1c1b-5083-bf3a-7015ac88d571', 'fantastic', '/fænˈtæstɪk/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất tốt, tuyệt diệu hoặc phi thường.', 'extremely good, excellent, or very impressive in quality or performance.', 'We had a fantastic time at the concert last night.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một khoảng thời gian tuyệt vời tại buổi hòa nhạc tối qua.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave a fantastic presentation about the new marketing strategy during the morning meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã có một bài thuyết trình tuyệt vời về chiến lược tiếp thị mới trong cuộc họp sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-ljspeech-3be18d81.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-cori-3be18d81.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fantastic-24b44091.webp', '[\"excellent\", \"wonderful\"]', '[\"terrible\", \"poor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fantastic job\", \"meaning\": \"công việc tuyệt vời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fantastic opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội tuyệt vời\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fantasy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-cori-3be18d81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-aru0-3be18d81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-aru5-3be18d81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-aru6-3be18d81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-aru10-3be18d81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-aru9-3be18d81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-aru3-3be18d81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-aru7-3be18d81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-aru8-3be18d81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fantastic-ar