('f1203545-417d-5823-9e51-7086345b03cd', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '4692bd0d-b8e2-5d67-9d63-ab9b7bb34662', '234caf36-1c1b-5083-bf3a-7015ac88d571', 'difficult', '/ˈdɪfɪkəlt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Khó làm, khó hiểu hoặc đòi hỏi nhiều nỗ lực.', 'requiring a lot of effort or skill to do or understand.', 'Learning a new language can be difficult, but it\'s very rewarding.', 'Học một ngôn ngữ mới có thể khó khăn, nhưng rất bổ ích.', '{\"en\": \"It is difficult to meet the deadline because of the unexpected technical issues.\", \"vi\": \"Rất khó để kịp thời hạn vì các vấn đề kỹ thuật không mong đợi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-ljspeech-d2a26f03.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-cori-d2a26f03.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/difficult-42ded813.webp', '[\"hard\", \"challenging\"]', '[\"easy\", \"simple\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"difficult task\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ khó khăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find it difficult\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy khó khăn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"difficulty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-cori-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru0-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru5-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru6-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru10-d2a26f03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru9-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru3-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru7-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru8-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru2-d2a26f03.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio