('def4a7dd-b5ba-5cf1-adf9-f08a8178a8d9', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5be9de34-e420-531e-8ced-fad76d931d2f', '3e7de1f0-bbb7-57fb-83cb-f21098efd47b', 'sandwich', '/ˈsænwɪtʃ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Món ăn gồm hai lát bánh mì kẹp nhân ở giữa.', 'two pieces of bread with meat, cheese, or vegetables placed between them.', 'For lunch, I usually have a simple cheese and ham sandwich.', 'Bữa trưa tôi thường ăn một chiếc bánh mì kẹp phô mai và giăm bông đơn giản.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a club sandwich as part of its express lunch menu.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp bánh mì kẹp club như một phần trong thực đơn ăn trưa nhanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-ljspeech-579db7d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-cori-579db7d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sandwich-ef884085.webp', '[\"sub\", \"wrap\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a sandwich\", \"meaning\": \"làm bánh mì kẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"club sandwich\", \"meaning\": \"bánh mì kẹp nhiều tầng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sandwich shop\", \"meaning\": \"tiệm bánh mì kẹp\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-cori-579db7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-aru0-579db7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-aru5-579db7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-aru6-579db7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-aru10-579db7d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-aru9-579db7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-aru3-579db7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-aru7-579db7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-aru8-579db7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandwich-aru2-579db7d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu