('6db9ccae-7bf0-57a3-8fe1-271119793f42', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5be9de34-e420-531e-8ced-fad76d931d2f', '3e7de1f0-bbb7-57fb-83cb-f21098efd47b', 'quarter', '/ˈkwɔːtə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một trong bốn phần bằng nhau của một cái gì đó.', 'one of four equal parts of a whole thing.', 'The financial department reported a dramatic increase in sales during the last quarter.', 'Bộ phận tài chính đã báo cáo sự gia tăng mạnh mẽ về doanh số trong quý cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported a quarter of growth in its overseas sales.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty báo cáo một phần tư tăng trưởng trong doanh số nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-ljspeech-7fa1f943.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-cori-7fa1f943.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quarter-dbdbcb4a.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"first quarter\", \"meaning\": \"quý đầu tiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quarter of an hour\", \"meaning\": \"một phần tư giờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"quart\", \"note_vi\": \"quart là đơn vị thể tích, phát âm gần\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"quarterly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-cori-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru0-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru5-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru6-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru10-7fa1f943.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru9-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru3-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru7-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru8-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru2-7fa1f943.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/