('e6c5cf7d-2a59-558c-a820-c56a4b27452e', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5be9de34-e420-531e-8ced-fad76d931d2f', '3e7de1f0-bbb7-57fb-83cb-f21098efd47b', 'brother', '/ˈbrʌðə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Người con trai có cùng cha mẹ với bạn.', 'a male sibling who shares one or both parents with you.', 'My older brother taught me how to ride a bike.', 'Anh trai tôi đã dạy tôi cách đi xe đạp.', '{\"en\": \"My brother works as a receptionist at the new hotel.\", \"vi\": \"Anh trai tôi làm lễ tân tại khách sạn mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-ljspeech-d67cca5a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-cori-d67cca5a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brother-3002f0ee.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"older brother\", \"meaning\": \"anh trai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"younger brother\", \"meaning\": \"em trai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brother company\", \"meaning\": \"công ty chị em\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bother\", \"note_vi\": \"bother là làm phiền, không phải anh em\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"brotherly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"brotherhood\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-cori-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-aru0-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-aru5-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-aru6-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-aru10-d67cca5a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-aru9-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-aru3-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-aru7-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-aru8-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-aru2-d67cca5a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-ljspeech-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-lt408-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-lt138-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-lt624-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-lt396-d67cca5a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-lt498-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-lt132-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-lt288-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-lt42-d67cca5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brother-lt90-d67cca5a.mp3\"]}}', 'Brother là anh/em trai, không nhầm với bother (làm phiền).', 'daily', 1, 25),
('7f0c3f13-f923-5975-806b-84606e5e3f25', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5be9de34-e420-531e-8ced-fad76d931d2f', '3e7de1f0-bbb7-57fb-83cb-f21098efd47b', 'catch', 'UK: /kætʃ/ | US: /kætʃ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'bắt, tóm', 'to intercept and hold something that has been thrown or is moving through air', 'He managed to catch the ball with one hand.', 'Anh ấy đã cố gắng bắt được quả bóng bằng một tay.', '{\"en\": \"Mr. Miller left the meeting early so he could catch the last train back to Boston.\", \"vi\": \"Ông Miller đã rời cuộc họp sớm để kịp bắt chuyến tàu cuối cùng trở về Boston.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-ljspeech-9ebad64e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-cori-9ebad64e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/catch-f423d9d3.webp', '[\"grab\", \"capture\", \"seize\"]', '[\"miss\", \"drop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"catch a flight\", \"meaning\": \"kịp chuyến bay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"catch someone\'s attention\", \"meaning\": \"thu hút sự chú ý của ai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"catch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-cori-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru0-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru5-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru6-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru10-9ebad64e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru9-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru3-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru7-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru8-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru2-9ebad64e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-ljspeech-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-lt408-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-lt138-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-lt624-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-lt396-9ebad64e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-lt498-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-lt132-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-lt288-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-lt42-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-lt90-9ebad64e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong chủ đề đi lại/du lịch của TOEIC, \'catch a train/flight\' nghĩa là kịp bắt/đón chuyến tàu hoặc chuyến bay.', 'travel', 1, 26),
('803512a5-60c7-527b-a458-ad099df0e3a1', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5be9de34-e420-531e-8ced-fad76d931d2f', '3e7de1f0-bbb7-57fb-83cb-f21098efd47b', 'quite', '/kwaɪt/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Ở một mức độ nào đó, nhưng không hoàn toàn.', 'to a certain degree, but not extremely or completely.', 'The movie was quite good, although not the best I\'ve ever seen.', 'Bộ phim khá hay, mặc dù không phải là bộ hay nhất tôi từng xem.', '{\"en\": \"The project deadline is quite tight, so we need to work efficiently this week.\", \"vi\": \"Hạn chót của dự án khá gấp rút, vì vậy chúng ta cần làm việc hiệu quả trong tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-ljspeech-58981027.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-cori-58981027.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quite-82e0906b.webp', '[\"fairly\", \"rather\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"quite good\", \"meaning\": \"khá tốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quite a few\", \"meaning\": \"khá nhiều\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"quiet\", \"note_vi\": \"yên tĩnh (khác vị trí chữ \'e\' và \'t\')\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-cori-58981027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-aru0-58981027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-aru5-58981027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-aru6-58981027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-aru10-58981027.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-aru9-58981027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-aru3-58981027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-aru7-58981027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-aru8-58981027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-aru2-58981027.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quite-ljspeech-58981027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec