('2001d081-842c-5953-8c60-2186a79ce461', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5d999aed-6764-5c00-b8d7-21c09f4ea2d7', 'ec65e89e-2e4d-5f41-af79-7c54c63229ff', 'fourth', '/fɔːθ/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Đứng ở vị trí số bốn trong một dãy.', 'coming next after the third position in a sequence or order.', 'This is the fourth time I\'ve tried to call him today.', 'Đây là lần thứ tư tôi cố gọi cho anh ấy hôm nay.', '{\"en\": \"The company will present its financial results in the fourth quarter of this year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ trình bày kết quả tài chính của mình vào quý tư năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-ljspeech-2db18e1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-cori-2db18e1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fourth-f92b287d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fourth quarter\", \"meaning\": \"quý bốn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fourth floor\", \"meaning\": \"tầng bốn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"forth\", \"note_vi\": \"forth là phó từ nghĩa là về phía trước, đi ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"four\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fourthly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-cori-2db18e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-aru0-2db18e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-aru5-2db18e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-aru6-2db18e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-aru10-2db18e1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-aru9-2db18e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-aru3-2db18e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-aru7-2db18e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-aru8-2db18e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourth-aru2-2db18e1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/