('58e14a9e-6d0e-5dd7-a7f7-e83ead780dbf', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5d999aed-6764-5c00-b8d7-21c09f4ea2d7', 'ec65e89e-2e4d-5f41-af79-7c54c63229ff', 'keep', '/kiːp/', 'A2', 'verb', 'duy trì ở một trạng thái hoặc vị trí nhất định.', 'to continue to have or hold something, or not to give it away.', 'You should keep your promises if you want people to trust you.', 'Bạn nên giữ lời hứa nếu muốn mọi người tin tưởng mình.', '{\"en\": \"Please keep all receipts from your business trip to get a full refund.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng giữ lại tất cả các hóa đơn từ chuyến công tác của bạn để được hoàn tiền đầy đủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-ljspeech-1264bdfe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-cori-1264bdfe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/keep-1e7b63e8.webp', '[\"retain\", \"hold\", \"preserve\"]', '[\"lose\", \"give\", \"discard\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keep in touch\", \"meaning\": \"giữ liên lạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep track of\", \"meaning\": \"theo dõi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"kick\", \"note_vi\": \"đá, phát âm khác nhưng dễ nhầm khi đọc nhanh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"keeper\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-cori-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru0-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru5-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru6-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru10-1264bdfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru9-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru3-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru7-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru8-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru2-1264bdfe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-ljspeech-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt408-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt138-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt624-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt396-1264bdfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt498-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt132-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt288-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt42-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt90-1264bdfe.mp3\"]}}', 'Keep thường đi với V-ing (keep doing something) mang nghĩa tiếp tục làm gì.', 'office', 1, 5),
('1c5f1ab1-d96d-5b75-8629-cdeb32158db4', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5d999aed-6764-5c00-b8d7-21c09f4ea2d7', 'ec65e89e-2e4d-5f41-af79-7c54c63229ff', 'passport', '/ˈpɑːspɔːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Giấy tờ tùy thân chính thức cho phép bạn đi lại giữa các quốc gia.', 'an official document proving identity for travel abroad.', 'You must present a valid passport when checking in for an overseas flight.', 'Bạn phải xuất trình hộ chiếu hợp lệ khi làm thủ tục cho chuyến bay nước ngoài.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel asked for her passport during the check-in process.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã yêu cầu xem hộ chiếu của cô ấy trong lúc làm thủ tục.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-ljspeech-a3404013.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-cori-a3404013.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/passport-aeb2fafb.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"passport control\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm soát hộ chiếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"valid passport\", \"meaning\": \"hộ chiếu còn hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"passport photo\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hộ chiếu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"password\", \"note_vi\": \"mật khẩu, phát âm và viết gần giống\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-cori-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-aru0-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-aru5-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-aru6-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-aru10-a3404013.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-aru9-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-aru3-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-aru7-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-aru8-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-aru2-a3404013.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-ljspeech-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-lt408-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-lt138-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-lt624-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-lt396-a3404013.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-lt498-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-lt132-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-lt288-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-lt42-a3404013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passport-lt90-a3404013.mp3\"]}}', 'Passport (hộ chiếu) dễ nhầm với password (mật khẩu).', 'travel', 1, 6),
('a163ba99-43d6-5589-81d4-7ba93d0740e6', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5d999aed-6764-5c00-b8d7-21c09f4ea2d7', 'ec65e89e-2e4d-5f41-af79-7c54c63229ff', 'moment', '/ˈməʊmənt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một khoảng thời gian rất ngắn.', 'a very short period of time or a particular point in time.', 'Can you wait for a moment? I\'ll be right with you.', 'Bạn có thể đợi một lát không? Tôi sẽ đến ngay với bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will be ready to meet you in a moment after completing her phone call.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý sẽ sẵn sàng gặp bạn trong chốc lát sau khi hoàn thành cuộc gọi điện thoại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-ljspeech-b56def36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-cori-b56def36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/moment-eec8dba7.webp', '[\"instant\", \"minute\", \"second\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"at the moment\", \"meaning\": \"hiện tại, ngay lúc này\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in a moment\", \"meaning\": \"trong chốc lát\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"momentary\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"momentarily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-cori-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-aru0-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-aru5-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-aru6-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-aru10-b56def36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-aru9-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-aru3-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-aru7-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-aru8-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-aru2-b56def36.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-ljspeech-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-lt408-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-lt138-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-lt624-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-lt396-b56def36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-lt498-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-lt132-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-lt288-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-lt42-b56def36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moment-lt90-b56def36.mp3\"]}}', '\'At the moment\' tương đương \'currently\' hoặc \'now\', thường dùng ở thì hiện tại tiếp diễn.', 'office', 1, 7),
('21f780b7-ab56-5659-9c89-3e541998f19b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5d999aed-6764-5c00-b8d7-21c09f4ea2d7', 'ec65e89e-2e4d-5f41-af79-7c54c63229ff', 'band', '/bænd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm nhạc sĩ biểu diễn cùng nhau.', 'an organized group of musical performers performing instrumental or vocal pieces together.', 'The corporate event hired a live band to entertain guests throughout the evening.', 'Sự kiện của công ty đã thuê một ban nhạc sống để giải trí cho các quan khách suốt buổi tối.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel hired a live band to entertain corporate guests during the annual dinner.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã thuê một ban nhạc sống để phục vụ khách doanh nghiệp trong bữa tối thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-ljspeech-2502deb4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-cori-2502deb4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/band-62226f88.webp', '[\"group\", \"ensemble\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"live band\", \"meaning\": \"ban nhạc diễn sống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rock band\", \"meaning\": \"ban nhạc rock\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"brand\", \"note_vi\": \"brand là thương hiệu, khác với ban nhạc\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-cori-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-aru0-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-aru5-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-aru6-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-aru10-2502deb4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-aru9-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-aru3-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-aru7-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-aru8-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-aru2-2502deb4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-ljspeech-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-lt408-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-lt138-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-lt624-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-lt396-2502deb4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-lt498-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-lt132-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-lt288-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-lt42-2502deb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/band-lt90-2502deb4.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt band (ban nhạc) và brand (thương hiệu).', 'media', 1, 8),
('625abb5a-7108-5ff5-bac4-9d401c285bfa', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '5d999aed-6764-5c00-b8d7-21c09f4ea2d7', 'ec65e89e-2e4d-5f41-af79-7c54c63229ff', 'hobby', '/ˈhɒbi/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một hoạt động bạn làm thường xuyên để giải trí.', 'an activity that you do for pleasure when you are not working.', 'Reading is her favorite hobby, and she spends hours in the library.', 'Đọc sách là sở thích yêu thích của cô ấy, và cô ấy dành hàng giờ trong thư viện.', '{\"en\": \"The manager encourages employees to have a hobby to reduce stress after work.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý khuyến khích nhân viên có một sở thích để giảm bớt căng thẳng sau giờ làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-ljspeech-54b7e849.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-cori-54b7e849.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hobby-d07cdbcc.webp', '[\"pastime\", \"interest\", \"leisure activity\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"favorite hobby\", \"meaning\": \"sở thích yêu thích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pursue a hobby\", \"meaning\": \"theo đuổi một sở thích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"habit\", \"note_vi\": \"thói quen (thường làm vô thức), khác với hobby là sở thích giải trí\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-cori-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru0-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru5-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru6-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru10-54b7e849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru9-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru3-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru7-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru8-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru2-54b7e849.mp3\"]},