('f1c32867-65f7-58b5-b6f6-6a81764aa21a', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '657d1539-d819-5036-9629-00f95c45f83a', '77a83f4d-0615-53f2-9d23-a0a049f77671', 'direction', 'UK: /daɪˈrɛkʃən/ | US: /dɪˈrɛkʃən/', 'A2', 'noun', 'sự chỉ đạo, sự hướng dẫn', 'management, guidance, or supervision of a person, group, or ongoing activity.', 'We are working under the direction of the CEO.', 'Chúng tôi đang làm việc dưới sự chỉ đạo của CEO.', '{\"en\": \"Under the new management\'s direction, the company increased its sales by twenty percent.\", \"vi\": \"Dưới sự chỉ đạo của ban quản lý mới, công ty đã tăng doanh số bán hàng thêm 20 phần trăm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-ljspeech-57077e98.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-cori-57077e98.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/direction-88903019.webp', '[\"guidance\", \"supervision\", \"leadership\", \"management\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"under the direction of\", \"meaning\": \"dưới sự chỉ đạo của\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strategic direction\", \"meaning\": \"định hướng chiến lược\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dimension\", \"note_vi\": \"Dimension nghĩa là kích thước, khác với direction là sự chỉ đạo/hướng đi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"direct\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"director\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"directly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-cori-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru0-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru5-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru6-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru10-57077e98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru9-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru3-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru7-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru8-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru2-57077e98.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-ljspeech-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-lt408-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-lt138-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-lt624-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-lt396-57077e98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-lt498-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-lt132-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-lt288-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-lt42-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-lt90-57077e98.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đi trong cấu trúc \'under the direction of...\' (dưới sự chỉ đạo của...). Khi dùng ở số nhiều \'directions\' mang nghĩa chỉ đường.', 'management', 1, 3),
('c21db0d5-4de4-53d5-9a67-8bcfbd1ef6ac', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '657d1539-d819-5036-9629-00f95c45f83a', '77a83f4d-0615-53f2-9d23-a0a049f77671', 'greenhouse', 'UK: /ˈɡriːnˌhaʊs/ | US: /ˈɡriːnˌhaʊs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'nhà kính', 'a glass building used for growing delicate plants that require protection from cold weather', 'The company grows organic vegetables in its greenhouse.', 'Công ty trồng rau hữu cơ trong nhà kính của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The agricultural firm constructed a modern greenhouse to cultivate organic vegetables year-round.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty nông nghiệp đã xây dựng một nhà kính hiện đại để trồng rau hữu cơ quanh năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-ljspeech-ffedc28b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-cori-ffedc28b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/greenhouse-b3d4a356.webp', '[\"hothouse\", \"glasshouse\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"greenhouse gas\", \"meaning\": \"khí nhà kính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"greenhouse effect\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu ứng nhà kính\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-cori-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-aru0-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-aru5-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-aru6-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-aru10-ffedc28b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-aru9-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-aru3-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-aru7-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-aru8-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-aru2-ffedc28b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-ljspeech-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-lt408-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-lt138-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-lt624-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-lt396-ffedc28b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-lt498-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-lt132-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-lt288-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-lt42-ffedc28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greenhouse-lt90-ffedc28b.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'greenhouse\' (nhà kính trồng cây) với thuật ngữ \'greenhouse effect\' (hiệu ứng nhà kính) / \'greenhouse gas\' (khí nhà kính) trong bài đọc môi trường.', 'environment', 1, 4),
('28fe1efa-beee-5a35-a850-383a43090aa5', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '657d1539-d819-5036-9629-00f95c45f83a', '77a83f4d-0615-53f2-9d23-a0a049f77671', 'upstairs', '/ˌʌpˈsteəz/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Khu vực hoặc các phòng ở tầng cao hơn trong một tòa nhà.', 'the part of a building that is above the ground floor.', 'My bedroom is upstairs, so I\'ll go there to rest.', 'Phòng ngủ của tôi ở trên lầu, nên tôi sẽ lên đó nghỉ ngơi.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel guests rented the entire upstairs for a private meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn khách thuê toàn bộ tầng trên cho một cuộc họp riêng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-ljspeech-193c47c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-cori-193c47c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/upstairs-008391d6.webp', '[\"upper floor\", \"top floor\"]', '[\"downstairs\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"upstairs floor\", \"meaning\": \"tầng trên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upstairs apartment\", \"meaning\": \"căn hộ tầng trên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upstairs area\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực tầng trên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"downstairs\", \"note_vi\": \"downstairs là tầng dưới, trái nghĩa với upstairs\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"upstairs\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-cori-193c47c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-aru0-193c47c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-aru5-193c47c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-aru6-193c47c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-aru10-193c47c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-aru9-193c47c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-aru3-193c47c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-aru7-193c47c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upstairs-aru8-193c47c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje