('600c0919-cfb8-57cd-bdef-03eb470b5bb0', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '657d1539-d819-5036-9629-00f95c45f83a', '77a83f4d-0615-53f2-9d23-a0a049f77671', 'interview', '/ˈɪntəvjuː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Buổi gặp mặt để hỏi và trả lời câu hỏi, thường là để tuyển dụng hoặc thu thập thông tin.', 'a formal meeting where someone is asked questions to see if they are suitable for a job.', 'I have a job interview next week for a marketing position.', 'Tôi có một buổi phỏng vấn xin việc vào tuần tới cho vị trí tiếp thị.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department scheduled an interview with the top three candidates for the position.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự đã lên lịch phỏng vấn với ba ứng viên hàng đầu cho vị trí này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-ljspeech-af537eeb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-cori-af537eeb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interview-579e8e26.webp', '[\"screening\", \"meeting\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"job interview\", \"meaning\": \"phỏng vấn xin việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conduct an interview\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành phỏng vấn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"interviewer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"interviewee\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-cori-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-aru0-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-aru5-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-aru6-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-aru10-af537eeb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-aru9-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-aru3-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-aru7-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-aru8-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-aru2-af537eeb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-ljspeech-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-lt408-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-lt138-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-lt624-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-lt396-af537eeb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-lt498-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-lt132-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-lt288-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-lt42-af537eeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interview-lt90-af537eeb.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ phân biệt \'interviewer\' (người phỏng vấn) và \'interviewee\' (người được phỏng vấn).', 'hr', 1, 11),
('bcda7175-e338-540a-aba9-ee61396c38c4', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '657d1539-d819-5036-9629-00f95c45f83a', '77a83f4d-0615-53f2-9d23-a0a049f77671', 'purple', '/ˈpɜːpl/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có màu pha trộn giữa đỏ và xanh lam.', 'of a color between red and blue in the spectrum.', 'She wore a beautiful purple dress to the party.', 'Cô ấy mặc một chiếc váy màu tím rất đẹp đến bữa tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel provided purple badges for the VIP guests at the conference.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã cung cấp huy hiệu tím cho các khách VIP tại hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-ljspeech-afaed754.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-cori-afaed754.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/purple-9e7a15bd.webp', '[\"violet\", \"lilac\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"purple dress\", \"meaning\": \"váy màu tím\"}, {\"phrase\": \"purple color\", \"meaning\": \"màu tím\"}, {\"phrase\": \"light purple\", \"meaning\": \"tím nhạt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"purple\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-cori-afaed754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-aru0-afaed754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-aru5-afaed754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-aru6-afaed754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-aru10-afaed754.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-aru9-afaed754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-aru3-afaed754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-aru7-afaed754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-aru8-afaed754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-aru2-afaed754.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purple-ljspeech-afaed754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v