('488c4620-0d45-5baf-9a0b-25d93a7560d6', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7a763254-f2e0-5194-bcaf-e43e2f6512af', 'c3bbfe43-af02-59e8-abec-61dac54466ce', 'love', '/lʌv/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Cảm xúc yêu thương, quý mến sâu sắc.', 'a strong feeling of deep affection or liking for someone or something.', 'True love is about caring for someone deeply and unconditionally.', 'Tình yêu đích thực là quan tâm sâu sắc và vô điều kiện đến một ai đó.', '{\"en\": \"The company has a deep love for innovation and creates new products every year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có niềm đam mê sâu sắc với sự đổi mới và tạo ra các sản phẩm mới mỗi năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-ljspeech-9f2feb0f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-cori-9f2feb0f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/love-45392e91.webp', '[\"affection\", \"passion\"]', '[\"hatred\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in love\", \"meaning\": \"đang yêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"show love\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện tình cảm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lovely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lover\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-cori-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru0-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru5-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru6-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru10-9f2feb0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru9-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru3-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru7-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru8-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru2-9f2feb0f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-ljspeech-9f2feb0f.mp3\",