('3b286917-7541-5abb-b8b0-6eef53e72045', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7a763254-f2e0-5194-bcaf-e43e2f6512af', 'c3bbfe43-af02-59e8-abec-61dac54466ce', 'elephant', '/ˈelɪfənt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Loài động vật có vú lớn, có vòi dài và tai to.', 'a very large grey animal with a long nose, big ears, and thick legs.', 'We saw a huge elephant at the zoo yesterday.', 'Chúng tôi đã nhìn thấy một con voi khổng lồ ở sở thú ngày hôm qua.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency offers tours to observe elephants in their natural habitat.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch cung cấp các tour quan sát voi trong môi trường tự nhiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-ljspeech-0ae9e4de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-cori-0ae9e4de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elephant-ec4506f7.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"elephant sanctuary\", \"meaning\": \"khu bảo tồn voi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"baby elephant\", \"meaning\": \"voi con\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wild elephant\", \"meaning\": \"voi hoang dã\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-cori-0ae9e4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-aru0-0ae9e4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-aru5-0ae9e4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-aru6-0ae9e4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-aru10-0ae9e4de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-aru9-0ae9e4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-aru3-0ae9e4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-aru7-0ae9e4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-aru8-0ae9e4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-aru2-0ae9e4de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elephant-ljspeech-0ae9e4de.mp3\", \"/stora