('f656f49c-67ad-5bd1-b028-9fc90019cfee', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7a763254-f2e0-5194-bcaf-e43e2f6512af', 'c3bbfe43-af02-59e8-abec-61dac54466ce', 'advertisement', 'UK: /ədˈvɜːtɪsmənt/ | US: /ˌædvərˈtaɪzmənt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'quảng cáo', 'a notice or picture designed to encourage people to buy a product.', 'The job advertisement attracted many qualified candidates.', 'Quảng cáo việc làm đã thu hút nhiều ứng viên chất lượng.', '{\"en\": \"The company placed an advertisement in the national newspaper to recruit senior engineers.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đăng một quảng cáo trên tờ báo quốc gia để tuyển dụng các kỹ sư cao cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-ljspeech-f264e6fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-cori-f264e6fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/advertisement-4793de67.webp', '[\"ad\", \"commercial\", \"commercial notice\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"place an advertisement\", \"meaning\": \"đăng quảng cáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"print advertisement\", \"meaning\": \"quảng cáo in ấn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"job advertisement\", \"meaning\": \"tin tuyển dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commercial\", \"note_vi\": \"Commercial là quảng cáo trên truyền hình/đài phát thanh; Advertisement bao gồm cả bài đăng, biển hiệu, báo in.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"advertise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"advertising\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"advertiser\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-cori-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru0-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru5-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru6-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru10-f264e6fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru9-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru3-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru7-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru8-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru2-f264e6fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-ljspeech-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-lt408-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-lt138-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-lt624-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-lt396-f264e6fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-lt498-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-lt132-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-lt288-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-lt42-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-lt90-f264e6fd.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường được viết tắt là \'ad\' hoặc \'advert\'. Trong TOEIC thường gặp \'place an advertisement\' (đặt/đăng quảng cáo).', 'marketing', 1, 12),
('be211ca4-661e-5c2f-94c9-31a678630188', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7a763254-f2e0-5194-bcaf-e43e2f6512af', 'c3bbfe43-af02-59e8-abec-61dac54466ce', 'chart', '/tʃɑːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Biểu đồ hoặc đồ thị thể hiện thông tin, số liệu.', 'a drawing that shows information in a simple way, often using lines or bars.', 'The presenter displayed an organizational chart to explain the company\'s management structure.', 'Người thuyết trình đã hiển thị một sơ đồ tổ chức để giải thích cơ cấu quản lý của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"Please look at the sales chart to see our progress over the last quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nhìn vào biểu đồ doanh số để thấy tiến trình của chúng ta trong quý qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-ljspeech-b82b40b8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-cori-b82b40b8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chart-6b972df1.webp', '[\"graph\", \"diagram\", \"table\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pie chart\", \"meaning\": \"biểu đồ tròn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bar chart\", \"meaning\": \"biểu đồ cột\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flow chart\", \"meaning\": \"sơ đồ quy trình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"map\", \"note_vi\": \"bản đồ chỉ đường, còn chart là biểu đồ số liệu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"chart\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-cori-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-aru0-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-aru5-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-aru6-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-aru10-b82b40b8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-aru9-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-aru3-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-aru7-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-aru8-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-aru2-b82b40b8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-ljspeech-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-lt408-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-lt138-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-lt624-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-lt396-b82b40b8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-lt498-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-lt132-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-lt288-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-lt42-b82b40b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chart-lt90-b82b40b8.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \"chart\" thường xuất hiện ở phần mô tả biểu đồ của bài nghe và đọc.', 'business', 1, 13),
('b9f50c50-d60c-514b-a39d-8e59f2937b61', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7a763254-f2e0-5194-bcaf-e43e2f6512af', 'c3bbfe43-af02-59e8-abec-61dac54466ce', 'forget', '/fəˈɡet/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Không nhớ hoặc không nghĩ đến điều gì đó.', 'to be unable to remember a fact, something that occurred, or how to do something.', 'Please do not forget to turn off the office projector after finishing your presentation.', 'Vui lòng đừng quên tắt máy chiếu văn phòng sau khi hoàn thành bài thuyết trình của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Do not forget to submit your monthly expense report before the Friday deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Đừng quên nộp báo cáo chi phí hàng tháng của bạn trước hạn chót vào thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-ljspeech-b96cfac5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-cori-b96cfac5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forget-e8547b0b.webp', NULL, '[\"remember\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"forget completely\", \"meaning\": \"quên hoàn toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"never forget\", \"meaning\": \"không bao giờ quên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"leave\", \"note_vi\": \"forget là quên thông tin/nhiệm vụ, leave là để quên đồ vật ở đâu đó\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"forgetful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unforgettable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-cori-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru0-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru5-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru6-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru10-b96cfac5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru9-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru3-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru7-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru8-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru2-b96cfac5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-ljspeech-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt408-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt138-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt624-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt396-b96cfac5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt498-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt132-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt288-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt42-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt90-b96cfac5.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt forget to do (quên phải làm gì) và forget doing (quên đã làm gì).', 'office', 1, 14),
('f83f8cc7-838c-5ada-91a2-cbb4e33dc9c5', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7a763254-f2e0-5194-bcaf-e43e2f6512af', 'c3bbfe43-af02-59e8-abec-61dac54466ce', 'should', '/ʃəd/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Diễn tả lời khuyên, nghĩa vụ hoặc sự mong đợi.', 'used to express duty, advice, or what is expected or likely to happen.', 'You should study hard if you want to pass the exam.', 'Bạn nên học hành chăm chỉ nếu muốn đỗ kỳ thi.', '{\"en\": \"Employees should review the safety guidelines before operating the new factory machinery.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên nên xem lại các hướng dẫn an toàn trước khi vận hành máy móc nhà máy mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-ljspeech-c6dc9bc9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-cori-c6dc9bc9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/should-98fe562e.webp', '[\"ought to\", \"had better\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"should have done\", \"meaning\": \"lẽ ra nên làm (trong quá khứ)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"should not\", \"meaning\": \"không nên\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-cori-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-aru0-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-aru5-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-aru6-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-aru10-c6dc9bc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-aru9-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-aru3-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-aru7-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-aru8-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-aru2-c6dc9bc9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-ljspeech-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-lt408-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-lt138-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-lt624-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-lt396-c6dc9bc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-lt498-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-lt132-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-lt288-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-lt42-c6dc9bc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/should-lt90-c6dc9bc9.mp3\"]}}', 'Sau \'should\' luôn là động từ nguyên mẫu không \'to\'.', 'office', 1, 15),
('27426fc7-09e5-51db-bedd-cf58f84b5e62', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7a763254-f2e0-5194-bcaf-e43e2f6512af', 'c3bbfe43-af02-59e8-abec-61dac54466ce', 'pig', '/pɪɡ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'một loài động vật có vú được nuôi để lấy thịt.', 'a pink or black animal with a flat nose that is kept on farms.', 'The farmer feeds his pigs twice a day.', 'Người nông dân cho lợn của mình ăn hai lần một ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The agricultural company imports high-quality feed for the pigs on their large organic farm.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty nông nghiệp nhập khẩu thức ăn chất lượng cao cho đàn lợn tại trang trại hữu cơ lớn của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-ljspeech-2cd4ba93.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-cori-2cd4ba93.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pig-0e334d41.webp', '[\"swine\", \"hog\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pig farm\", \"meaning\": \"trang trại nuôi lợn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pig iron\", \"meaning\": \"gang thỏi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-cori-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-aru0-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-aru5-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-aru6-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-aru10-2cd4ba93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-aru9-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-aru3-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-aru7-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-aru8-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-aru2-2cd4ba93.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-ljspeech-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-lt408-2cd4ba93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pig-lt138-2cd