('04fdbf91-6e4a-5301-9778-47b729bfc733', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7a763254-f2e0-5194-bcaf-e43e2f6512af', 'c3bbfe43-af02-59e8-abec-61dac54466ce', 'certain', 'UK: /ˈsɜːtn/ | US: /ˈsɜːrtn/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'chắc chắn, tin chắc', 'Feeling completely sure about something and having no doubts about its truth or outcome.', 'I am certain that the report will be finished on time.', 'Tôi tin chắc rằng báo cáo sẽ được hoàn thành đúng thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"The hiring manager is certain that Ms. Davis has the necessary qualifications for the position.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng tuyển dụng chắc chắn rằng cô Davis có đủ năng lực cho vị trí này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-ljspeech-eb27a323.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-cori-eb27a323.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/certain-c4098f46.webp', '[\"sure\", \"confident\", \"convinced\", \"positive\"]', '[\"uncertain\", \"doubtful\", \"unsure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be certain of\", \"meaning\": \"chắc chắn về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make certain\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo, kiểm tra cho chắc chắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"certainly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"certainty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-cori-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-aru0-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-aru5-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-aru6-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-aru10-eb27a323.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-aru9-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-aru3-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-aru7-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-aru8-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-aru2-eb27a323.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-ljspeech-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-lt408-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-lt138-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-lt624-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-lt396-eb27a323.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-lt498-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-lt132-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-lt288-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-lt42-eb27a323.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certain-lt90-eb27a323.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cấu trúc \'be certain of/about sth\' hoặc \'be certain that...\'. Khi đứng trước danh từ (\'a certain factor\'), mang nghĩa là \'nhất định/nào đó\'.', 'office', 1, 24),
('9a4de1c1-9358-5091-8e8e-8c0ac5dd54ae', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7a763254-f2e0-5194-bcaf-e43e2f6512af', 'c3bbfe43-af02-59e8-abec-61dac54466ce', 'finally', 'UK: /ˈfaɪnəli/ | US: /ˈfaɪnəli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'cuối cùng', 'after a long period of waiting, difficulty, or delay; as the ultimate outcome.', 'After many delays, the project was finally approved.', 'Sau nhiều trì hoãn, dự án cuối cùng đã được duyệt.', '{\"en\": \"After months of negotiations, the two corporations finally signed the merger contract.\", \"vi\": \"Sau nhiều tháng đàm phán, hai tập đoàn cuối cùng đã ký hợp đồng sáp nhập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-ljspeech-8f4e3e3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-cori-8f4e3e3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/finally-e36b5741.webp', '[\"eventually\", \"at last\", \"ultimately\"]', '[\"initially\", \"firstly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"finally reach an agreement\", \"meaning\": \"cuối cùng cũng đạt được thỏa thuận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"finally decide\", \"meaning\": \"cuối cùng đưa ra quyết định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"financially\", \"note_vi\": \"Financially (về mặt tài chính) có chính tả gần giống nhưng nghĩa khác với finally (cuối cùng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"final\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"finalize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-cori-8f4e3e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-aru0-8f4e3e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-aru5-8f4e3e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-aru6-8f4e3e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-aru10-8f4e3e3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-aru9-8f4e3e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-aru3-8f4e3e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finally-aru7-8f4e3