('4cea960e-986e-599e-a88f-b6e032ea2b38', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7b5a43e9-1d14-5ef1-beac-9881cf0d4f70', '14ac4612-4477-5151-bd24-410b1bca5021', 'special', '/ˈspeʃl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Khác thường, nổi bật hoặc quan trọng.', 'not ordinary or usual, but different in a good or important way.', 'The company offered a special discount to customers who registered for the seminar early.', 'Công ty đã đưa ra mức giảm giá đặc biệt cho những khách hàng đăng ký tham gia buổi thảo luận sớm.', '{\"en\": \"We are offering a special discount for customers who purchase items during this week.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đang cung cấp một khoản giảm giá đặc biệt cho khách hàng mua hàng trong tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-ljspeech-ba36b97a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-cori-ba36b97a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/special-cdb30b69.webp', '[\"unique\", \"exceptional\"]', '[\"ordinary\", \"common\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"special offer\", \"meaning\": \"ưu đãi đặc biệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"special event\", \"meaning\": \"sự kiện đặc biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"specific\", \"note_vi\": \"Specific là cụ thể, special là đặc biệt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"specialize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"specialist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-cori-ba36b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-aru0-ba36b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-aru5-ba36b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-aru6-ba36b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-aru10-ba36b97a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-aru9-ba36b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-aru3-ba36b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/special-aru7-ba36b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/