('964b27c2-8b45-56e5-8899-a8de02463443', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7b5a43e9-1d14-5ef1-beac-9881cf0d4f70', '14ac4612-4477-5151-bd24-410b1bca5021', 'see', '/siː/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Nhận thức bằng mắt; nhìn thấy.', 'to notice or become aware of someone or something by using your eyes.', 'I can see a beautiful rainbow after the rain.', 'Tôi có thể nhìn thấy một cầu vồng tuyệt đẹp sau cơn mưa.', '{\"en\": \"Did you see the updated schedule posted on the bulletin board this morning, Mr. Smith?\", \"vi\": \"Ông có thấy lịch trình cập nhật được dán trên bảng thông báo sáng nay không, ông Smith?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-ljspeech-3d637fc6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-cori-3d637fc6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/see-1d00dc8e.webp', '[\"notice\", \"observe\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"see clearly\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn rõ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"see the point\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu vấn đề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"look\", \"note_vi\": \"look là chủ động nhìn, see là khả năng thị giác tự nhiên.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sight\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-cori-3d637fc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-aru0-3d637fc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-aru5-3d637fc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-aru6-3d637fc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-aru10-3d637fc6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-aru9-3d637fc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-aru3-3d637fc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-aru7-3d637fc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-aru8-3d637fc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-aru2-3d637fc6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-ljspeech-3d637fc6.mp3\", \"/st