('3a28999c-c0d7-5d76-bdf4-07b6ec9b1c77', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7b5a43e9-1d14-5ef1-beac-9881cf0d4f70', '14ac4612-4477-5151-bd24-410b1bca5021', 'time', '/taɪm/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Khái niệm đo lường sự kiện diễn ra, từ quá khứ đến tương lai.', 'the continuous measure of duration in which events occur from past to future.', 'We don\'t have much time left before the train departs.', 'Chúng ta không còn nhiều thời gian trước khi tàu khởi hành.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure that you submit the quarterly invoice on time to avoid penalties.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo gửi hóa đơn hàng quý đúng hạn để tránh bị phạt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-ljspeech-714eea0f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-cori-714eea0f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/time-fa386cfb.webp', '[\"duration\", \"period\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on time\", \"meaning\": \"đúng giờ, đúng hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full-time\", \"meaning\": \"toàn thời gian\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"timely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"timer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-cori-714eea0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-aru0-714eea0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-aru5-714eea0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-aru6-714eea0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-aru10-714eea0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-aru9-714eea0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-aru3-714eea0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-aru7-714eea0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-aru8-714eea0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-aru2-714eea0f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-ljspeech-714eea0f.mp3\", \"/stora