('772be27a-1470-58b9-ad06-7dcdfedd4973', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7b5a43e9-1d14-5ef1-beac-9881cf0d4f70', '14ac4612-4477-5151-bd24-410b1bca5021', 'future', '/ˈfjuːtʃə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thời gian sẽ đến sau hiện tại.', 'The period of time following the present or upcoming events that have not occurred yet.', 'We need to think about our future plans carefully.', 'Chúng ta cần suy nghĩ cẩn thận về các kế hoạch tương lai của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors discussed strategy plans for the future of the new project.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã thảo luận về các kế hoạch chiến lược cho tương lai của dự án mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-ljspeech-d848c971.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-cori-d848c971.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/future-8f1b7340.webp', NULL, '[\"past\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"near future\", \"meaning\": \"tương lai gần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"future plans\", \"meaning\": \"kế hoạch tương lai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"futuristic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-cori-d848c971.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-aru0-d848c971.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-aru5-d848c971.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-aru6-d848c971.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-aru10-d848c971.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-aru9-d848c971.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-aru3-d848c971.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-aru7-d848c971.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-aru8-d848c971.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-aru2-d848c971.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/future-ljspeech-d848c971.mp3\", \"/storage/v1