('c064bd12-2594-5ba5-a351-ddb07d278f69', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7b5a43e9-1d14-5ef1-beac-9881cf0d4f70', '14ac4612-4477-5151-bd24-410b1bca5021', 'again', '/əˈɡen/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Một lần nữa; thêm một lần.', 'one more time; returning to a previous state or action.', 'Could you please repeat that instruction again? I didn\'t quite catch it.', 'Bạn có thể vui lòng lặp lại hướng dẫn đó một lần nữa được không? Tôi chưa nghe rõ lắm.', '{\"en\": \"The client called again to confirm the delivery schedule for next week.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng đã gọi lại để xác nhận lịch giao hàng tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-ljspeech-aaa4d5f8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-cori-aaa4d5f8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/again-87a12c99.webp', '[\"once more\", \"anew\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"once again\", \"meaning\": \"một lần nữa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"try again\", \"meaning\": \"thử lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"never again\", \"meaning\": \"không bao giờ nữa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-cori-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-aru0-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-aru5-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-aru6-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-aru10-aaa4d5f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-aru9-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-aru3-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-aru7-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-aru8-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-aru2-aaa4d5f8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-ljspeech-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-lt408-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-lt138-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-lt624-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-lt396-aaa4d5f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-lt498-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-lt132-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-lt288-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-lt42-aaa4d5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/again-lt90-aaa4d5f8.mp3\"]}}', '', 'daily', 1, 22),
('fe579a14-6af2-5dd2-a240-d18b2eb8f90a', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7b5a43e9-1d14-5ef1-beac-9881cf0d4f70', '14ac4612-4477-5151-bd24-410b1bca5021', 'rice', '/raɪs/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hạt ngũ cốc chính, là lương thực cơ bản ở nhiều nước.', 'short, thin white or brown grains from a plant, used as food.', 'Many Asian cultures eat rice as a staple food every day.', 'Nhiều nền văn hóa châu Á ăn cơm như một món ăn chủ yếu hàng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service offers fried rice as an option for the lunch buffet.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống cung cấp cơm chiên như một lựa chọn cho tiệc buffet trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-ljspeech-6939278d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-cori-6939278d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rice-a66a16ab.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"brown rice\", \"meaning\": \"gạo lứt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fried rice\", \"meaning\": \"cơm chiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rice cooker\", \"meaning\": \"nồi cơm điện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rise\", \"note_vi\": \"động từ tăng lên, phát âm có âm /z/ ở cuối.\"}, {\"word\": \"lice\", \"note_vi\": \"chấy rận, phát âm bắt đầu bằng âm /l/.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-cori-6939278d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-aru0-6939278d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-aru5-6939278d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-aru6-6939278d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-aru10-6939278d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-aru9-6939278d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-aru3-6939278d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-aru7-6939278d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-aru8-6939278d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rice-aru2-6939278d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\":