('abc4fd34-7f46-5455-9f56-26bdf5dfe8c0', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7e434e36-4922-57b9-8dc6-ffe3cf11b514', '07499b71-4662-527d-8f7a-e0b02bce38dd', 'hand', '/hænd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bàn tay của con người.', 'the part of the body at the end of the arm that is used for holding things.', 'She waved her hand to say goodbye as the bus pulled away.', 'Cô ấy vẫy tay chào tạm biệt khi xe buýt lăn bánh.', '{\"en\": \"Please make sure to wash your hands before returning to the production line.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo rửa tay trước khi quay trở lại dây chuyền sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-ljspeech-9621a244.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-cori-9621a244.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hand-eda99268.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shake hands\", \"meaning\": \"bắt tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hold hands\", \"meaning\": \"nắm tay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"arm\", \"note_vi\": \"arm là toàn bộ cánh tay, còn hand chỉ là bàn tay.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hand\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"handful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-cori-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru0-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru5-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru6-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru10-9621a244.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru9-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru3-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru7-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru8-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru2-9621a244.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-ljspeech-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/