('2c690e2a-2f37-528d-96d4-8cc1a8d3d487', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '7e434e36-4922-57b9-8dc6-ffe3cf11b514', '07499b71-4662-527d-8f7a-e0b02bce38dd', 'dollar', '/ˈdɒlə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Đơn vị tiền tệ chính của một số quốc gia như Hoa Kỳ, Canada, Úc.', 'a unit of money used in the US, Canada, Australia, and several other countries.', 'This book costs ten dollars, which is a reasonable price.', 'Cuốn sách này giá mười đô la, một mức giá hợp lý.', '{\"en\": \"The total cost of the office supplies came to five hundred dollars.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng chi phí cho dụng cụ văn phòng là năm trăm đô-la.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-ljspeech-6c36ab33.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-cori-6c36ab33.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dollar-b2569020.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"US dollar\", \"meaning\": \"đô-la Mỹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"million dollars\", \"meaning\": \"triệu đô-la\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-cori-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-aru0-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-aru5-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-aru6-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-aru10-6c36ab33.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-aru9-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-aru3-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-aru7-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-aru8-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-aru2-6c36ab33.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-ljspeech-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dollar-lt408-6c36ab33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v