('54bab695-c82a-52dc-bbd6-2487831c5b76', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', '97d7e3f9-0dd3-5715-a3db-a25520433aa8', '535a0704-8f28-5af8-8fab-a6e101a9139e', 'everything', '/ˈevriθɪŋ/', 'A2', 'pronoun', 'Tất cả mọi vật, mọi điều.', 'all the things that exist or all the things in a specific group.', 'She packed everything she needed for the trip into one small suitcase.', 'Cô ấy đã gói ghém mọi thứ cần thiết cho chuyến đi vào một chiếc vali nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"The new software system handles everything from inventory tracking to customer billing processes efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống phần mềm mới xử lý mọi thứ từ theo dõi hàng tồn kho đến quy trình thanh toán khách hàng một cách hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-ljspeech-d5a63c95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-cori-d5a63c95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/everything-5ae2eac9.webp', '[\"all\", \"the whole\"]', '[\"nothing\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-cori-d5a63c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-aru0-d5a63c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-aru5-d5a63c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-aru6-d5a63c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-aru10-d5a63c95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-aru9-d5a63c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-aru3-d5a63c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-aru7-d5a63c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-aru8-d5a63c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-aru2-d5a63c95.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everything-ljspeech-d5a63c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/everythi