('5f11a8b9-c872-5183-9984-370eab32aacc', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'acfb38b3-a0e7-5fc3-8577-972a51437749', 'de9d4bc7-bc3f-5b2b-a11f-993f65424c8a', 'seventeen', '/ˌsɛvənˈtiːn/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Số đếm sau mười sáu và trước mười tám.', 'the number after sixteen and before eighteen in counting.', 'My cousin just turned seventeen last month.', 'Anh họ tôi vừa tròn mười bảy tuổi vào tháng trước.', '{\"en\": \"We ordered seventeen boxes of supplies for the new branch office.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã đặt mười bảy hộp vật tư cho chi nhánh văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-ljspeech-c1777d8e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-cori-c1777d8e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seventeen-cc3ce618.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"seventeen percent\", \"meaning\": \"mười bảy phần trăm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seventeen items\", \"meaning\": \"mười bảy món\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"seventy\", \"note_vi\": \"seventy là bảy mươi, thêm chữ t\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"seventeenth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-cori-c1777d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-aru0-c1777d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-aru5-c1777d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-aru6-c1777d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-aru10-c1777d8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-aru9-c1777d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-aru3-c1777d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-aru7-c1777d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-aru8-c1777d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seventeen-aru2-c1777d8e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sevent