('1faa72b7-cda8-53d2-8b7f-e33c38a1d9d3', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'acfb38b3-a0e7-5fc3-8577-972a51437749', 'de9d4bc7-bc3f-5b2b-a11f-993f65424c8a', 'party', '/ˈpɑːti/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một buổi tụ tập xã hội để ăn mừng hoặc vui chơi.', 'a festive gathering of people invited to socialize, converse, and celebrate a particular occasion.', 'The department hosted a farewell party to honor the retiring senior manager.', 'Phòng ban đã tổ chức một bữa tiệc chia tay để vinh danh quản lý cấp cao sắp nghỉ hưu.', '{\"en\": \"The company is hosting a retirement party for our manager in the main hall.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang tổ chức một bữa tiệc chia tay cho quản lý của chúng ta tại sảnh chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-ljspeech-84beb188.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-cori-84beb188.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/party-05dc1b89.webp', '[\"celebration\", \"gathering\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"throw a party\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức tiệc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dinner party\", \"meaning\": \"tiệc tối\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-cori-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-aru0-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-aru5-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-aru6-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-aru10-84beb188.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-aru9-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-aru3-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-aru7-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-aru8-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-aru2-84beb188.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-ljspeech-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-lt408-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-lt138-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-lt624-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-lt396-84beb188.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-lt498-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-lt132-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-lt288-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-lt42-84beb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/party-lt90-84beb188.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý, \'party\' còn có nghĩa là \'bên\' (trong hợp đồng).', 'office', 1, 17),
('1bccb961-7b8a-54e5-866d-6d950385959e', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'acfb38b3-a0e7-5fc3-8577-972a51437749', 'de9d4bc7-bc3f-5b2b-a11f-993f65424c8a', 'discuss', '/dɪˈskʌs/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nói chuyện về một chủ đề cụ thể để trao đổi ý kiến.', 'to talk about a subject with other people to reach a decision or share ideas.', 'We need to discuss the new project proposal in detail tomorrow.', 'Chúng ta cần thảo luận chi tiết về đề xuất dự án mới vào ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"The management team will discuss the new budget proposal during the meeting on Friday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý sẽ thảo luận về đề xuất ngân sách mới trong cuộc họp vào sáng thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-ljspeech-1b7949a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-cori-1b7949a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/discuss-37b3c286.webp', '[\"debate\", \"deliberate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"discuss a matter\", \"meaning\": \"thảo luận một vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"discuss in detail\", \"meaning\": \"thảo luận chi tiết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"argue\", \"note_vi\": \"argue mang nghĩa tranh cãi gay gắt, discuss mang tính xây dựng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"discussion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-cori-1b7949a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-aru0-1b7949a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-aru5-1b7949a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-aru6-1b7949a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-aru10-1b7949a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-aru9-1b7949a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-aru3-1b7949a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-aru7-1b7949a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discuss-aru8-1b7949a7.mp3\", \"/storag