('eb63c800-a00e-571d-a20e-cf816be5f87a', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'acfb38b3-a0e7-5fc3-8577-972a51437749', 'de9d4bc7-bc3f-5b2b-a11f-993f65424c8a', 'message', '/ˈmesɪdʒ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một thông tin được gửi đi.', 'a piece of written or spoken information that you send to someone else.', 'I received a message from my friend saying he would be late.', 'Tôi nhận được một tin nhắn từ bạn tôi nói rằng anh ấy sẽ đến muộn.', '{\"en\": \"Please leave a message if the customer service representative is not available to answer.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng để lại tin nhắn nếu nhân viên chăm sóc khách hàng không thể trả lời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-ljspeech-6f9b9af3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-cori-6f9b9af3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/message-da7f1a95.webp', '[\"note\", \"communication\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"leave a message\", \"meaning\": \"để lại lời nhắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"send a message\", \"meaning\": \"gửi tin nhắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"messenger\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-cori-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru0-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru5-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru6-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru10-6f9b9af3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru9-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru3-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru7-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru8-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru2-6f9b9af3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-ljspeech-6f9b9af3.mp3\",