('84293644-082c-53a3-bf25-eeaaa5b718d5', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b1480db3-22df-58eb-aff0-9113b4cce761', '27301452-0f9d-5a6f-8805-3b9e4c72b139', 'important', '/ɪmˈpɔːtnt/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có ý nghĩa lớn, cần thiết hoặc có giá trị cao.', 'having high value or great effect on people or future events.', 'It\'s important to eat a healthy breakfast every day.', 'Việc ăn bữa sáng lành mạnh mỗi ngày là rất quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Please read all details carefully because this document contains important safety instructions.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đọc kỹ mọi chi tiết vì tài liệu này chứa các hướng dẫn an toàn quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-ljspeech-5b400951.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-cori-5b400951.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/important-9bc28ec3.webp', '[\"crucial\", \"vital\", \"essential\"]', '[\"unimportant\", \"trivial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"play an important role\", \"meaning\": \"đóng vai trò quan trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"important factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố quan trọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"importance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"importantly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-cori-5b400951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-aru0-5b400951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-aru5-5b400951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-aru6-5b400951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-aru10-5b400951.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-aru9-5b400951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-aru3-5b400951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-aru7-5b400951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/important-aru8-5b400951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub