('0a61f2e8-9040-54f9-9c54-06beb3d28c05', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b1480db3-22df-58eb-aff0-9113b4cce761', '27301452-0f9d-5a6f-8805-3b9e4c72b139', 'onion', '/ˈʌnjən/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Loại củ có nhiều lớp, mùi hăng, dùng làm gia vị.', 'a round vegetable with many layers that has a strong taste and smell.', 'The chef added fried onion slices to give the dish a rich aroma.', 'Đầu bếp đã thêm những lát hành tây chiên để món ăn có mùi thơm đậm đà.', '{\"en\": \"The chef added chopped onion to the soup before serving it to the clients.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp đã thêm hành tây thái nhỏ vào món súp trước khi phục vụ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-ljspeech-6ac8c09b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-cori-6ac8c09b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/onion-9dac4d49.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"raw onion\", \"meaning\": \"hành tây sống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chopped onion\", \"meaning\": \"hành tây thái nhỏ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"garlic\", \"note_vi\": \"tỏi (củ nhỏ hơn, gồm nhiều tép nhỏ)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-cori-6ac8c09b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-aru0-6ac8c09b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-aru5-6ac8c09b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-aru6-6ac8c09b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-aru10-6ac8c09b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-aru9-6ac8c09b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-aru3-6ac8c09b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-aru7-6ac8c09b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-aru8-6ac8c09b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-aru2-6ac8c09b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onion-ljspeech-6ac8c09b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje