('37fff74c-6d70-58ce-80d9-3b606383fc28', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b1480db3-22df-58eb-aff0-9113b4cce761', '27301452-0f9d-5a6f-8805-3b9e4c72b139', 'ability', 'UK: /əˈbɪləti/ | US: /əˈbɪləti/', 'A2', 'noun', 'khả năng', 'the mental or physical capacity and skill required to perform a specific task successfully.', 'Her ability to adapt to new situations is impressive.', 'Khả năng thích ứng với các tình huống mới của cô ấy thật ấn tượng.', '{\"en\": \"Her ability to handle complex negotiations makes her an invaluable asset to the team.\", \"vi\": \"Khả năng xử lý các cuộc đàm phán phức tạp của cô ấy khiến cô trở thành tài sản vô giá đối với nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-ljspeech-083dbabe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-cori-083dbabe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ability-e268772d.webp', '[\"capability\", \"capacity\", \"competence\", \"skill\"]', '[\"inability\", \"incompetence\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"demonstrate ability\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện năng lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ability to multitask\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng làm nhiều việc cùng lúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"capacity\", \"note_vi\": \"sức chứa tối đa hoặc công suất làm việc, trong khi ability thiên về kỹ năng cá nhân\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"able\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"enable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-cori-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru0-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru5-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru6-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru10-083dbabe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru9-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru3-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru7-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru8-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru2-083dbabe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-ljspeech-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt408-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt138-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt624-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt396-083dbabe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt498-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt132-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt288-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt42-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt90-083dbabe.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc hay gặp: \'ability to do something\' (khả năng làm gì). Khác với capacity (sức chứa/khả năng tối đa).', 'human resources', 1, 29),
('32e43209-afb1-5d46-8dde-1a1e8d95b5e9', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'dear', '/dɪə(r)/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Được yêu mến hoặc quý trọng.', 'loved or cherished by someone, often used as a polite form of address.', 'My dear friend, it\'s been too long since we last met.', 'Bạn thân mến của tôi, đã quá lâu rồi kể từ lần cuối chúng ta gặp nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The director opened the official speech by welcoming all dear colleagues and business partners.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc mở đầu bài phát biểu chính thức bằng việc chào đón tất cả đồng nghiệp thân mến và đối tác kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-ljspeech-dd6bd66e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-cori-dd6bd66e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dear-46fb46d1.webp', '[\"precious\", \"cherished\", \"beloved\"]', '[\"hated\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dear customer\", \"meaning\": \"quý khách thân mến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dear colleague\", \"meaning\": \"đồng nghiệp thân mến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deer\", \"note_vi\": \"deer là con hươu hoặc nai, đồng âm với dear\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"dearly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-cori-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru0-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru5-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru6-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru10-dd6bd66e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru9-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru3-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru7-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru8-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru2-d