('4405cfc8-ab94-5c29-b666-71a931e18a25', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'hotel', '/həʊˈtel/', 'A1', 'noun', 'tòa nhà cung cấp chỗ ở và dịch vụ cho khách du lịch.', 'a building where people pay to stay in rooms for a short period of time.', 'We booked a nice hotel room with a view of the city.', 'Chúng tôi đã đặt một phòng khách sạn đẹp có view nhìn ra thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"We have reserved a room at the downtown hotel for the international conference participants.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã đặt một phòng tại khách sạn trung tâm cho các đại biểu tham dự hội nghị quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-ljspeech-14e83355.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-cori-14e83355.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hotel-971317e2.webp', '[\"inn\", \"lodge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"book a hotel\", \"meaning\": \"đặt khách sạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"luxury hotel\", \"meaning\": \"khách sạn sang trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hostel\", \"note_vi\": \"hostel là nhà nghỉ giá rẻ, thường dùng chung phòng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-cori-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-aru0-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-aru5-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-aru6-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-aru10-14e83355.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-aru9-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-aru3-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-aru7-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-aru8-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-aru2-14e83355.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-ljspeech-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-lt408-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-lt138-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-lt624-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-lt396-14e83355.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-lt498-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-lt132-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-lt288-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-lt42-14e83355.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hotel-lt90-14e83355.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn âm tiết thứ hai: ho-TEL.', 'travel', 1, 17),
('f774cac8-efa4-508f-8e3b-8fbdbef5864c', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'bird', '/bɜːd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Động vật có lông vũ, cánh và mỏ.', 'a creature with feathers and wings, usually able to fly and lay eggs.', 'The bright yellow bird built a small nest on the tree branch.', 'Chú chim màu vàng tươi đã làm một chiếc tổ nhỏ trên cành cây.', '{\"en\": \"The resort offers bird watching tours to attract nature lovers during the summer.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng cung cấp các tour ngắm chim để thu hút những người yêu thiên nhiên vào mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-ljspeech-cd92815b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-cori-cd92815b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bird-27da85da.webp', '[\"fowl\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"early bird\", \"meaning\": \"người đến sớm/dậy sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wild bird\", \"meaning\": \"chim hoang dã\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-cori-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru0-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru5-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru6-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru10-cd92815b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru9-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru3-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru7-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru8-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru2-cd92815b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-ljspeech-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt408-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt138-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt624-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt396-cd92815b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt498-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt132-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt288-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt42-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt90-cd92815b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'early bird\' thường dùng trong TOEIC để chỉ vé hoặc ưu đãi đặt sớm.', 'nature', 1, 18),
('7f6774f0-715c-5c32-b74a-1368a6afa851', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'live', '/lɪv/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Tồn tại hoặc trải qua cuộc sống.', 'to have your home in a particular place or to stay alive.', 'Many international employees choose to live near the downtown corporate headquarters.', 'Nhiều nhân viên quốc tế chọn sống gần trụ sở chính của công ty ở trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Many people live near the business district to reduce their daily commuting time.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều người sống gần khu thương mại để giảm thời gian đi làm hàng ngày của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-ljspeech-98aadb37.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-cori-98aadb37.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/live-1f222c26.webp', '[\"reside\", \"dwell\"]', '[\"die\", \"depart\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"live in\", \"meaning\": \"sống tại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"live alone\", \"meaning\": \"sống một mình\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"life\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"living\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-cori-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru0-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru5-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru6-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru10-98aadb37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru9-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru3-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru7-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru8-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru2-98aadb37.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-ljspeech-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-lt408-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-lt138-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-lt624-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-lt396-98aadb37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-lt498-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-lt132-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-lt288-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-lt42-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-lt90-98aadb37.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'live\' (động từ) và \'life\' (danh từ).', 'daily', 1, 19),
('1729a39e-f50a-5a6d-a70a-251f5890a2ee', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'ball', '/bɔːl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Vật tròn dùng để chơi thể thao hoặc giải trí.', 'a round object used in games and sports for kicking, hitting, or throwing.', 'The referee threw the ball to the players to start the game.', 'Trọng tài đã ném quả bóng cho các cầu thủ để bắt đầu trận đấu.', '{\"en\": \"The sports store ordered a large shipment of leather ball products for summer.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng dụng cụ thể thao đã đặt một lô hàng quả bóng bằng da lớn cho mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-ljspeech-8bec0406.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-cori-8bec0406.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ball-131a2e20.webp', '[\"sphere\", \"orb\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"golf ball\", \"meaning\": \"bóng golf\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tennis ball\", \"meaning\": \"bóng quần vợt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bowl\", \"note_vi\": \"Bowl là cái bát/tô, ball là quả bóng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-cori-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-aru0-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-aru5-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-aru6-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-aru10-8bec0406.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-aru9-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-aru3-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-aru7-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-aru8-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-aru2-8bec0406.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-ljspeech-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-lt408-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-lt138-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-lt624-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-lt396-8bec0406.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-lt498-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-lt132-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-lt288-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-lt42-8bec0406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-lt90-8bec0406.mp3\"]}}', 'Ball còn có nghĩa là buổi dạ vũ trang trọng.', 'daily', 1, 20),
('c7f6ef68-a2b0-53b4-892d-a16949a8f2f6', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'dislike', 'UK: /dɪsˈlaɪk/ | US: /dɪsˈlaɪk/', 'A2', 'verb', 'không thích', 'to feel aversion, disapproval, or a lack of affection toward something or someone.', 'Many people dislike long meetings that lack clear objectives.', 'Nhiều người không thích những cuộc họp dài thiếu mục tiêu rõ ràng.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees dislike working overtime without receiving prior notification.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên không thích làm việc tăng ca mà không được thông báo trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-ljspeech-aedf6156.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-cori-aedf6156.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dislike-4d2b0713.webp', '[\"disapprove of\", \"disfavor\", \"detest\"]', '[\"like\", \"enjoy\", \"prefer\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strongly dislike\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ không thích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dislike working late\", \"meaning\": \"không thích làm việc muộn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unlike\", \"note_vi\": \"giới từ: không giống như, trái ngược với\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dislike\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-cori-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-aru0-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-aru5-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-aru6-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-aru10-aedf6156.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-aru9-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-aru3-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-aru7-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-aru8-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-aru2-aedf6156.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-ljspeech-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-lt408-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-lt138-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-lt624-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-lt396-aedf6156.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-lt498-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-lt132-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-lt288-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-lt42-aedf6156.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dislike-lt90-aedf6156.mp3\"]}}', 'Sau \'dislike\' thường đi với danh từ hoặc động từ dạng V-ing (\'dislike doing something\').', 'office', 1, 21),
('70fde894-f111-5d6a-9c28-a026e522e1a7', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'juice', '/dʒuːs/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nước chiết xuất từ trái cây hoặc rau củ.', 'the liquid that comes from fruit or vegetables when you squeeze them.', 'Fresh orange juice is a healthy way to start the day.', 'Nước cam tươi là một cách lành mạnh để bắt đầu ngày mới.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel restaurant serves fresh orange juice to all guests during breakfast hours.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng khách sạn phục vụ nước cam tươi cho tất cả khách trong giờ ăn sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-ljspeech-07ef8791.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-cori-07ef8791.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/juice-b3f7d688.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fruit juice\", \"meaning\": \"nước ép trái cây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fresh juice\", \"meaning\": \"nước ép tươi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sauce\", \"note_vi\": \"sauce là nước xốt dùng kèm thức ăn, không phải nước ép\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"juicy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-cori-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-aru0-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-aru5-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-aru6-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-aru10-07ef8791.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-aru9-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-aru3-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-aru7-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-aru8-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-aru2-07ef8791.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-ljspeech-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-lt408-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-lt138-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-lt624-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-lt396-07ef8791.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-lt498-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-lt132-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-lt288-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-lt42-07ef8791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juice-lt90-07ef8791.mp3\"]}}', '', 'dining', 1, 22),
('066e0009-036c-569a-bf6f-719589e364c2', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'cheap', '/tʃiːp/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Rẻ, giá thấp.', 'costing little money or less than is usual or expected.', 'This restaurant serves delicious food at a very cheap price.', 'Nhà hàng này phục vụ đồ ăn ngon với giá rất rẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The company chose a cheap supplier to reduce the production costs of their new products.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã chọn một nhà cung cấp giá rẻ để giảm chi phí sản xuất cho các sản phẩm mới của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-ljspeech-fb8df41a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-cori-fb8df41a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cheap-b681fc52.webp', '[\"inexpensive\", \"low-cost\", \"affordable\"]', '[\"expensive\", \"costly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cheap price\", \"meaning\": \"giá rẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cheap labor\", \"meaning\": \"nhân công giá rẻ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chip\", \"note_vi\": \"mảnh vỡ, khoai tây chiên, phát âm ngắn hơn cheap\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"cheaply\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cheapness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-cori-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-aru0-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-aru5-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-aru6-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-aru10-fb8df41a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-aru9-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-aru3-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-aru7-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-aru8-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-aru2-fb8df41a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-ljspeech-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-lt408-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-lt138-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-lt624-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-lt396-fb8df41a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-lt498-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-lt132-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-lt288-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-lt42-fb8df41a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheap-lt90-fb8df41a.mp3\"]}}', 'Cheap đôi khi mang nghĩa tiêu cực là chất lượng kém, nên dùng inexpensive để lịch sự hơn.', 'business', 1, 23),
('fd92feab-3616-5a4b-8cd1-77ff9c777c8d', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'basket', 'UK: /ˈbɑːskɪt/ | US: /ˈbæskət/', 'A2', 'noun', 'rổ', 'a container made of woven materials used for carrying or holding items.', 'She carried a basket of fresh fruit from the garden.', 'Cô ấy mang một giỏ trái cây tươi từ vườn.', '{\"en\": \"Online shoppers can review the items in their shopping basket before proceeding to checkout.\", \"vi\": \"Người mua sắm trực tuyến có thể xem lại các mặt hàng trong giỏ hàng trước khi tiến hành thanh toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-ljspeech-c9be014f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-cori-c9be014f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/basket-cb9e3131.webp', '[\"hamper\", \"crate\", \"container\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shopping basket\", \"meaning\": \"giỏ mua hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gift basket\", \"meaning\": \"giỏ quà tặng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bucket\", \"note_vi\": \"xô, thùng múc nước\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-cori-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-aru0-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-aru5-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-aru6-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-aru10-c9be014f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-aru9-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-aru3-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-aru7-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-aru8-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-aru2-c9be014f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-ljspeech-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-lt408-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-lt138-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-lt624-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-lt396-c9be014f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-lt498-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-lt132-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-lt288-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-lt42-c9be014f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basket-lt90-c9be014f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh mua sắm trực tuyến (e-commerce), \'shopping basket\' có nghĩa là giỏ hàng trực tuyến.', 'e-commerce', 1, 24),
('1b545680-f457-5701-9aae-ab443ad13aaa', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'holiday', '/ˈhɒlədeɪ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một ngày hoặc khoảng thời gian nghỉ làm hoặc nghỉ học.', 'a period of time when you do not work and can relax or travel.', 'The company office will remain closed during the upcoming public holiday next week.', 'Văn phòng công ty sẽ đóng cửa trong kỳ nghỉ lễ công cộng sắp tới vào tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must submit their request for a summer holiday at least two weeks early.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải nộp yêu cầu nghỉ lễ mùa hè trước ít nhất hai tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-ljspeech-1b602c45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-cori-1b602c45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/holiday-ea95dbd5.webp', '[\"vacation\", \"break\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a holiday\", \"meaning\": \"đi nghỉ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public holiday\", \"meaning\": \"ngày lễ quốc gia\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-cori-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-aru0-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-aru5-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-aru6-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-aru10-1b602c45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-aru9-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-aru3-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-aru7-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-aru8-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-aru2-1b602c45.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-ljspeech-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-lt408-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-lt138-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-lt624-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-lt396-1b602c45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-lt498-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-lt132-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-lt288-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-lt42-1b602c45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holiday-lt90-1b602c45.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở Mỹ thường dùng \'vacation\', còn \'holiday\' phổ biến ở Anh.', 'travel', 1, 25)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('d7e3ab66-a7e7-50c1-b579-58e83ec8cfe8', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'excited', '/ɪkˈsaɪtɪd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy rất vui và mong đợi điều gì đó.', 'Stirred by strong emotions of enthusiasm, eager anticipation, or lively delight regarding an event.', 'Our team was extremely excited to receive positive feedback from the new corporate client.', 'Đội ngũ của chúng tôi rất hào hứng khi nhận được phản hồi tích cực từ khách hàng doanh nghiệp mới.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team is excited about the new product launch scheduled for early next month.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị rất hào hứng về việc ra mắt sản phẩm mới dự kiến vào đầu tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-ljspeech-f529c0de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-cori-f529c0de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excited-2c8c6568.webp', '[\"enthusiastic\", \"thrilled\"]', '[\"bored\", \"uninterested\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"excited about\", \"meaning\": \"hào hứng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"very excited\", \"meaning\": \"rất hào hứng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exciting\", \"note_vi\": \"Excited là cảm xúc của người, exciting là tính chất của sự vật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"excite\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"excitement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-cori-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru0-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru5-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru6-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru10-f529c0de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru9-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru3-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru7-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru8-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru2-f529c0de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-ljspeech-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt408-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt138-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt624-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt396-f529c0de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt498-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt132-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt288-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt42-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt90-f529c0de.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ quy tắc: người \'excited\', sự việc \'exciting\'.', 'hr', 1, 26),
('d5b90e48-1cbe-59ae-9cd1-d0519876d2b3', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b4f56eac-34c8-5406-9ef0-8e2ed2a5b531', '99ad8e3b-8520-573b-aa26-98236f5cac2e', 'pay', '/peɪ/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Đưa tiền để mua gì đó hoặc trả nợ.', 'to give money to someone for goods or services that you have received.', 'Don\'t forget to pay the electricity bill by the end of the week.', 'Đừng quên thanh toán hóa đơn điện trước cuối tuần nhé.', '{\"en\": \"Please pay the invoice within thirty days to avoid any late fees on your account.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng thanh toán hóa đơn trong vòng ba mươi ngày để tránh phí trễ hạn trên tài khoản của bạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-ljspeech-bfc95e50.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-cori-bfc95e50.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pay-cb219195.webp', '[\"settle\", \"remit\"]', '[\"charge\", \"earn\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pay the bill\", \"meaning\": \"thanh toán hóa đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pay in cash\", \"meaning\": \"trả bằng tiền mặt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"payment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-cori-bfc95e50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-aru0-bfc95e50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-aru5-bfc95e50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-aru6-bfc95e50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-aru10-bfc95e50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-aru9-bfc95e50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-aru3-bfc95e50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-aru7-bfc95e50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-aru8-bfc95e50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-aru2-bfc95e50.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pay-ljspeech-bfc95e50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat