('04760d86-5893-5e2d-a614-9dd9d32f9674', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b5b27dd4-78f0-5fab-8e1d-71ecf7d627a0', '9b8a25e1-ceee-58e8-acac-915350802ae8', 'black', '/blæk/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có màu tối nhất, không có ánh sáng.', 'having the darkest color, like coal or the sky at night.', 'She wore a beautiful black dress to the party last night.', 'Tối qua cô ấy mặc một chiếc váy đen rất đẹp đi dự tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"The manager wore a formal black suit for the annual board of directors meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã mặc một bộ vest đen trang trọng cho cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-ljspeech-466bc8ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-cori-466bc8ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/black-ceb0a211.webp', '[\"dark\", \"ebony\"]', '[\"white\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"black ink\", \"meaning\": \"mực đen\"}, {\"phrase\": \"black market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường đen\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"blacken\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"blackness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-cori-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru0-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru5-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru6-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru10-466bc8ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru9-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru3-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru7-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru8-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru2-466bc8ce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-ljspeech-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object