('24a346fe-c590-548a-9ba2-f88c612ee894', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b5b27dd4-78f0-5fab-8e1d-71ecf7d627a0', '9b8a25e1-ceee-58e8-acac-915350802ae8', 'little', '/ˈlɪtl̩/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có kích thước nhỏ, không lớn.', 'small in size, amount, degree, or importance compared to others.', 'She has a cute little puppy that loves to play.', 'Cô ấy có một chú cún con dễ thương rất thích chơi đùa.', '{\"en\": \"The manager noticed a little error in the financial report before signing.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã nhận ra một lỗi nhỏ trong báo cáo tài chính trước khi ký.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-ljspeech-45022297.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-cori-45022297.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/little-c89237fa.webp', '[\"small\", \"tiny\", \"slight\"]', '[\"big\", \"large\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a little bit\", \"meaning\": \"một chút\"}, {\"phrase\": \"little effort\", \"meaning\": \"ít nỗ lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"few\", \"note_vi\": \"little dùng cho danh từ không đếm được, few dùng cho danh từ đếm được\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-cori-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru0-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru5-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru6-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru10-45022297.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru9-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru3-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru7-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru8-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru2-45022297.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-ljspeech-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt408-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt138-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt624-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt396-45022297.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt498-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt132-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt288-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt42-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt90-45022297.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng a little với danh từ không đếm được (a little time), phân biệt với a few.', 'office', 1, 7),
('0ace770d-b112-519e-97d0-add3c3ad3987', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b5b27dd4-78f0-5fab-8e1d-71ecf7d627a0', '9b8a25e1-ceee-58e8-acac-915350802ae8', 'thousand', '/ˈθaʊznd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Số bằng mười lần một trăm (1.000).', 'the number equal to ten times one hundred, written as 1,000.', 'The population of this small town is about five thousand people.', 'Dân số của thị trấn nhỏ này khoảng năm nghìn người.', '{\"en\": \"The company sold over a thousand units of the new product during the first month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã bán được hơn một nghìn đơn vị sản phẩm mới trong tháng đầu tiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-ljspeech-201621d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-cori-201621d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thousand-ee092f7c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"thousands of\", \"meaning\": \"hàng nghìn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a thousand\", \"meaning\": \"một nghìn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-cori-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-aru0-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-aru5-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-aru6-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-aru10-201621d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-aru9-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-aru3-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-aru7-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-aru8-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-aru2-201621d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-ljspeech-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thousand-lt408-201621d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje