('b8b283e5-561e-583b-b1ca-db42b32e6a03', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b5b27dd4-78f0-5fab-8e1d-71ecf7d627a0', '9b8a25e1-ceee-58e8-acac-915350802ae8', 'maybe', '/ˈmeɪbi/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Có khả năng điều gì đó sẽ xảy ra, nhưng không chắc chắn.', 'used to express that something is possible or might happen in the future.', 'Maybe it will rain tomorrow, so don\'t forget your umbrella.', 'Có lẽ ngày mai trời sẽ mưa, nên đừng quên ô của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Maybe we should reschedule the staff meeting until the regional director arrives tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Có lẽ chúng ta nên dời lại cuộc họp nhân viên cho đến khi giám đốc khu vực đến vào sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-ljspeech-f1b58e1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-cori-f1b58e1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/maybe-12b121fa.webp', '[\"perhaps\", \"possibly\"]', '[\"definitely\", \"certainly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"maybe later\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ để sau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maybe next time\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ lần tới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"may be\", \"note_vi\": \"may be là cụm động từ, còn maybe là trạng từ viết liền.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-cori-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru0-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru5-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru6-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru10-f1b58e1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru9-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru3-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru7-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru8-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru2-f1b58e1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\"