('ab3d4d9a-615e-5e31-a9b9-035967674671', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b5b27dd4-78f0-5fab-8e1d-71ecf7d627a0', '9b8a25e1-ceee-58e8-acac-915350802ae8', 'expensive', '/ɪkˈspensɪv/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có giá cao, tốn nhiều tiền.', 'Requiring a large amount of money to purchase or obtain due to high pricing.', 'Dining at high-end restaurants in the financial district is usually quite expensive.', 'Ăn uống tại các nhà hàng sang trọng trong khu tài chính thường khá đắt đỏ.', '{\"en\": \"The firm decided not to purchase the expensive software because it exceeded the annual budget.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty quyết định không mua phần mềm đắt tiền vì nó vượt quá ngân sách hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-ljspeech-e0d587ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-cori-e0d587ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expensive-5f43d5bf.webp', '[\"costly\", \"pricey\"]', '[\"cheap\", \"affordable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"too expensive\", \"meaning\": \"quá đắt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"expensive equipment\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị đắt tiền\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"expense\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"expend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-cori-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru0-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru5-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru6-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru10-e0d587ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru9-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru3-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru7-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru8-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p