('4c96fbe5-1702-5025-a762-98ce677bb990', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b5b27dd4-78f0-5fab-8e1d-71ecf7d627a0', '9b8a25e1-ceee-58e8-acac-915350802ae8', 'answer', '/ˈɑːnsə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Lời đáp lại một câu hỏi hoặc vấn đề.', 'a spoken or written reaction to a question, letter, or phone call.', 'I\'m waiting for an answer to my email.', 'Tôi đang chờ câu trả lời cho email của mình.', '{\"en\": \"We are still waiting for an official answer from the human resources department.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi vẫn đang chờ câu trả lời chính thức từ phòng nhân sự.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-ljspeech-25dc282b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-cori-25dc282b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/answer-a633fe34.webp', '[\"reply\", \"response\"]', '[\"question\", \"inquiry\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"give an answer\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra câu trả lời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"written answer\", \"meaning\": \"câu trả lời bằng văn bản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reply\", \"note_vi\": \"reply thường dùng như động từ hoặc danh từ trang trọng hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"answer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-cori-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-aru0-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-aru5-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-aru6-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-aru10-25dc282b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-aru9-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-aru3-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-aru7-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-aru8-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-aru2-25dc282b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-ljspeech-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-lt408-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-lt138-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-lt624-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-lt396-25dc282b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-lt498-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-lt132-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-lt288-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-lt42-25dc282b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-lt90-25dc282b.mp3\"]}}', 'Answer có thể làm cả danh từ và động từ mà không đổi dạng.', 'hr', 1, 22),
('8ddd20ad-03d6-547f-b333-019e379f4228', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b5b27dd4-78f0-5fab-8e1d-71ecf7d627a0', '9b8a25e1-ceee-58e8-acac-915350802ae8', 'goodbye', '/ˌɡʊdˈbaɪ/', 'A1', 'interjection', 'Lời chào khi chia tay ai đó.', 'used to express good wishes when parting or at the end of a conversation.', 'She waved goodbye to her friends before getting on the bus.', 'Cô ấy vẫy tay chào tạm biệt bạn bè trước khi lên xe buýt.', '{\"en\": \"The manager said goodbye to the retiring employee at the farewell party.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã chào tạm biệt nhân viên sắp nghỉ hưu tại buổi tiệc chia tay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-ljspeech-3c8ec487.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-cori-3c8ec487.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/goodbye-75f133a7.webp', '[\"farewell\", \"bye\"]', '[\"hello\", \"hi\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"say goodbye\", \"meaning\": \"nói lời tạm biệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wave goodbye\", \"meaning\": \"vẫy tay chào tạm biệt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-cori-3c8ec487.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-aru0-3c8ec487.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-aru5-3c8ec487.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-aru6-3c8ec487.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-aru10-3c8ec487.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-aru9-3c8ec487.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-aru3-3c8ec487.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-aru7-3c8ec487.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-aru8-3c8ec487.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-aru2-3c8ec487.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodbye-ljspeech-3c8ec487.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v