('7094eed7-21af-5b71-b914-edd2d1e73b50', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b799d41b-eb2b-5956-94ed-cb0ab627579d', '7f434212-b887-57a4-b454-ef9927b1fb4d', 'paper', '/ˈpeɪpə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Vật liệu mỏng dùng để viết, in hoặc gói.', 'A substance manufactured in thin sheets from tree pulp used primarily to write or print upon.', 'The secretary loaded a new stack of white paper into the office printer.', 'Thư ký đã nạp một xấp giấy trắng mới vào máy in văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"Please load more paper into the printer before starting the large copying job.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nạp thêm giấy vào máy in trước khi bắt đầu công việc sao chép lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-ljspeech-950593b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-cori-950593b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/paper-3c76684e.webp', '[\"document\", \"sheet\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sheet of paper\", \"meaning\": \"tờ giấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"paper document\", \"meaning\": \"tài liệu giấy\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"paperwork\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-cori-950593b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-aru0-950593b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-aru5-950593b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-aru6-950593b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-aru10-950593b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-aru9-950593b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-aru3-950593b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-aru7-950593b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-aru8-950593b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-aru2-950593b1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-ljspeech-950593b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v