('9785c351-9865-54dd-a8de-18b3517f0abd', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b799d41b-eb2b-5956-94ed-cb0ab627579d', '7f434212-b887-57a4-b454-ef9927b1fb4d', 'police', '/pəˈliːs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tổ chức nhà nước có nhiệm vụ duy trì trật tự và thực thi pháp luật.', 'the official organization that is responsible for protecting people and preventing crime in society.', 'Local police directed traffic around the busy downtown intersection during rush hour.', 'Cảnh sát địa phương đã điều tiết giao thông quanh ngã tư đông đúc ở trung tâm thành phố vào giờ cao điểm.', '{\"en\": \"The police were called to the warehouse to investigate the report of a security breach.\", \"vi\": \"Cảnh sát đã được gọi đến nhà kho để điều tra báo cáo về một vụ vi phạm an ninh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-ljspeech-ee848a3b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-cori-ee848a3b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/police-6042b70e.webp', '[\"law enforcement\", \"authorities\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"call the police\", \"meaning\": \"gọi cảnh sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"police officer\", \"meaning\": \"sĩ quan cảnh sát\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-cori-ee848a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-aru0-ee848a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-aru5-ee848a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-aru6-ee848a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-aru10-ee848a3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-aru9-ee848a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-aru3-ee848a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-aru7-ee848a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-aru8-ee848a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-aru2-ee848a3b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {