('232d452c-6226-5e35-9405-e3943c5abaed', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b799d41b-eb2b-5956-94ed-cb0ab627579d', '7f434212-b887-57a4-b454-ef9927b1fb4d', 'according to', 'UK: /əˈkɔːdɪŋ tuː/ | US: /əˈkɔːrdɪŋ tuː/', 'A2', 'preposition', 'theo, dựa theo', 'as stated or indicated by a particular source, system, or set of rules.', 'The tasks are assigned according to priority.', 'Các nhiệm vụ được giao theo mức độ ưu tiên.', '{\"en\": \"According to the latest quarterly report, our international sales figures have increased by 15 percent.\", \"vi\": \"Theo báo cáo quý mới nhất, số liệu doanh số bán hàng quốc tế của chúng ta đã tăng 15%.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-ljspeech-3afbcfb4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-cori-3afbcfb4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/according-to-6f62939c.webp', '[\"as stated by\", \"in line with\", \"per\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"according to schedule\", \"meaning\": \"theo đúng tiến độ/kế hoạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"according to regulations\", \"meaning\": \"theo đúng quy định\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"accordingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-cori-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru0-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru5-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru6-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru10-3afbcfb4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru9-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru3-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru7-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru8-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru2-3afbcfb4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-ljspeech-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt408-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt138-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt624-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt396-3afbcfb4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt498-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt132-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt288-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt42-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt90-3afbcfb4.mp3\"]}}', 'Không dùng \'according to me\' khi thể hiện ý kiến cá nhân (dùng \'in my opinion\' thay thế). \'According to\' dùng trích dẫn nguồn tin/quy định.', 'business', 1, 24),
('468c9b46-8be4-5181-acc7-1e61fbfa3ee3', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'b799d41b-eb2b-5956-94ed-cb0ab627579d', '7f434212-b887-57a4-b454-ef9927b1fb4d', 'bookstore', 'UK: /ˈbʊkˌstɔː/ | US: /ˈbʊkˌstɔː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'hiệu sách', 'a commercial establishment where customers can buy printed publications and reading materials', 'The bookstore environment is quiet and cozy.', 'Môi trường hiệu sách yên tĩnh và ấm cúng.', '{\"en\": \"The local bookstore is hosting an autograph session with the best-selling author this Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Hiệu sách địa phương sẽ tổ chức một buổi ký tặng với tác giả bán chạy nhất vào thứ Sáu này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-ljspeech-ee710b91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-cori-ee710b91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bookstore-5a704a25.webp', '[\"bookshop\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"online bookstore\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu sách trực tuyến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local bookstore\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu sách địa phương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"library\", \"note_vi\": \"Library là thư viện (mượn sách), bookstore là cửa hàng bán sách.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-cori-ee710b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-aru0-ee710b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-aru5-ee710b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-aru6-ee710b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-aru10-ee710b91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-aru9-ee710b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-aru3-ee710b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-aru7-ee710b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-aru8-ee710b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bookstore-aru2-ee710b91.mp3\"]},