('5037f8b7-2e5e-5369-91b9-8f95cb0b5eb2', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'bc2e3fb9-e705-5a56-b8ef-ca7f6a07137c', '3392f953-154b-5604-92d6-ae09947beefa', 'salt', '/sɔːlt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Gia vị phổ biến có vị mặn, dùng để nêm nếm thức ăn.', 'a white substance from the sea or earth used to flavor and preserve food.', 'Please pass me the salt; this soup needs a little more flavor.', 'Làm ơn đưa cho tôi lọ muối; món súp này cần thêm chút hương vị.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant manager asked the kitchen staff to add less salt to the soup.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý nhà hàng đã yêu cầu nhân viên bếp cho ít muối hơn vào súp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-ljspeech-b295d117.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-cori-b295d117.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/salt-b9f4ba42.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pinch of salt\", \"meaning\": \"một nhúm muối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sea salt\", \"meaning\": \"muối biển\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"salty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-cori-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru0-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru5-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru6-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru10-b295d117.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru9-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru3-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru7-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru8-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru2-b295d117.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-ljspeech-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt408-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/