('4ab90766-b9c8-56b5-a03b-21b0f259c3b2', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'bc2e3fb9-e705-5a56-b8ef-ca7f6a07137c', '3392f953-154b-5604-92d6-ae09947beefa', 'metre', '/ˈmiːtə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Đơn vị đo chiều dài trong hệ mét, bằng 100 centimet.', 'a unit of length equal to one hundred centimeters.', 'The swimming pool is 25 metres long.', 'Bể bơi dài 25 mét.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping box must be at least one metre wide to fit the equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Thùng vận chuyển phải rộng ít nhất một mét để vừa với thiết bị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-ljspeech-c38e0b97.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-cori-c38e0b97.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/metre-80a7349c.webp', '[\"m\", \"unit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"square metre\", \"meaning\": \"mét vuông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cubic metre\", \"meaning\": \"mét khối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"meter\", \"note_vi\": \"meter là đồng hồ đo (Mỹ), metre là đơn vị đo (Anh).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"metric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-cori-c38e0b97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-aru0-c38e0b97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-aru5-c38e0b97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-aru6-c38e0b97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-aru10-c38e0b97.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-aru9-c38e0b97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-aru3-c38e0b97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-aru7-c38e0b97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-aru8-c38e0b97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-aru2-c38e0b97.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-ljspeech-c38e0b97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metre-lt408-c38e0