('7a33eeb9-8ddc-542d-b394-93030c0af3ab', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'bc2e3fb9-e705-5a56-b8ef-ca7f6a07137c', '3392f953-154b-5604-92d6-ae09947beefa', 'orange', '/ˈɒrɪndʒ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một loại trái cây có múi, màu vàng cam.', 'a round sweet fruit with a thick skin that is divided into parts inside.', 'She squeezed an orange to make fresh juice for breakfast.', 'Cô ấy vắt một quả cam để làm nước ép tươi cho bữa sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel breakfast buffet offers fresh orange juice and organic fruits every morning.\", \"vi\": \"Bữa sáng tự chọn của khách sạn cung cấp nước cam tươi và trái cây hữu cơ mỗi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-ljspeech-ef0ebbb7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-cori-ef0ebbb7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/orange-310e6b67.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"orange juice\", \"meaning\": \"nước cam\"}, {\"phrase\": \"peel an orange\", \"meaning\": \"lột vỏ cam\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-cori-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru0-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru5-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru6-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru10-ef0ebbb7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru9-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru3-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru7-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru8-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru2-ef0ebbb7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-ljspeech-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-lt408-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/