('252457cb-6d30-500b-870d-2d46ab42cc69', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'night', '/naɪt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Khoảng thời gian từ hoàng hôn đến bình minh.', 'The time of complete darkness occurring each day from evening until the following morning.', 'We enjoyed a quiet night under the stars.', 'Chúng tôi đã tận hưởng một đêm yên tĩnh dưới những vì sao.', '{\"en\": \"The security team monitors the office building throughout the night for safety.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo vệ giám sát tòa nhà văn phòng suốt đêm để đảm bảo an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-ljspeech-1be2a44c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-cori-1be2a44c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/night-64b716fb.webp', NULL, '[\"day\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"overnight stay\", \"meaning\": \"việc ở lại qua đêm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"late at night\", \"meaning\": \"muộn vào ban đêm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"knight\", \"note_vi\": \"knight là hiệp sĩ, đồng âm với night (đêm) nhưng viết khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"nightly\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"nightly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-cori-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-aru0-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-aru5-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-aru6-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-aru10-1be2a44c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-aru9-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-aru3-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-aru7-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-aru8-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-aru2-1be2a44c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-ljspeech-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-lt408-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-lt138-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-lt624-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-lt396-1be2a44c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-lt498-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-lt132-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-lt288-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-lt42-1be2a44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/night-lt90-1be2a44c.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với knight (hiệp sĩ) có cùng cách phát âm.', 'daily', 1, 2),
('fdc9abba-e40d-5ab1-8e19-f00f4c10fe4e', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'writing', '/ˈraɪtɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hành động ghi lại chữ cái, từ hoặc số.', 'the activity or skill of marking letters or words on paper or a screen.', 'Her writing style is very clear and easy to understand.', 'Phong cách viết của cô ấy rất rõ ràng và dễ hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The job description requires excellent business writing skills for drafting professional emails and reports.\", \"vi\": \"Mô tả công việc yêu cầu kỹ năng viết thương mại xuất sắc để soạn thảo email và báo cáo chuyên nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-ljspeech-1935d7b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-cori-1935d7b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/writing-02cbf5a1.webp', '[\"composition\", \"script\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"writing skills\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ năng viết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"creative writing\", \"meaning\": \"viết sáng tạo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"write\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"writer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-cori-1935d7b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-aru0-1935d7b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-aru5-1935d7b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-aru6-1935d7b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-aru10-1935d7b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-aru9-1935d7b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-aru3-1935d7b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-aru7-1935d7b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-aru8-1935d7b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/writing-aru2-1935d7b6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/sto