('55351e9b-fa81-5579-b5e5-a50f98a9d73e', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'learn', '/lɜːn/', 'A1', 'verb', 'tiếp thu kiến thức hoặc kỹ năng mới.', 'to acquire information, understanding, or expertise by studying or receiving instruction.', 'Children learn a lot by observing and imitating adults.', 'Trẻ em học được rất nhiều bằng cách quan sát và bắt chước người lớn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must learn how to use the new accounting software before the end of month.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải học cách sử dụng phần mềm kế toán mới trước cuối tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-ljspeech-7dca5d4c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-cori-7dca5d4c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/learn-18c64125.webp', '[\"acquire\", \"master\"]', '[\"forget\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"learn a skill\", \"meaning\": \"học một kỹ năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"learn from experience\", \"meaning\": \"học từ kinh nghiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"study\", \"note_vi\": \"study là quá trình nghiên cứu, learn là kết quả thu được.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"learner\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"learning\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-cori-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-aru0-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-aru5-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-aru6-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-aru10-7dca5d4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-aru9-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-aru3-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-aru7-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-aru8-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-aru2-7dca5d4c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-ljspeech-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-lt408-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-lt138-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-lt624-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-lt396-7dca5d4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-lt498-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-lt132-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-lt288-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-lt42-7dca5d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learn-lt90-7dca5d4c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng \'learn to do something\' để chỉ việc học một kỹ năng mới.', 'education', 1, 4),
('d281e34e-4ba0-51dd-a8cd-381e7487ecc9', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'bill', '/bɪl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Giấy tờ ghi số tiền phải trả cho hàng hóa hoặc dịch vụ.', 'a piece of paper that shows how much money you must pay for goods or services.', 'Could you please bring us the bill when you have a moment?', 'Bạn có thể mang hóa đơn cho chúng tôi khi nào rảnh không?', '{\"en\": \"Please make sure to pay the electricity bill before the end of this month.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo thanh toán hóa đơn tiền điện trước cuối tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-ljspeech-c692d6a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-cori-c692d6a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bill-d034d6fa.webp', '[\"invoice\", \"receipt\", \"statement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pay a bill\", \"meaning\": \"thanh toán hóa đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"utility bill\", \"meaning\": \"hóa đơn tiện ích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"receipt\", \"note_vi\": \"bill là hóa đơn yêu cầu thanh toán, receipt là biên lai đã trả tiền.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bill\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"billing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-cori-c692d6a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-aru0-c692d6a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-aru5-c692d6a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-aru6-c692d6a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-aru10-c692d6a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-aru9-c692d6a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-aru3-c692d6a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-aru7-c692d6a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-aru8-c692d6a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bill-aru