('3ac4df8d-95be-58fb-ae4c-502641374669', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'health', '/helθ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng thể chất và tinh thần tốt, không bệnh tật.', 'the condition of a person\'s body and mind, especially being free from illness or injury.', 'Getting adequate sleep every night plays a vital role in improving overall physical health.', 'Ngủ đủ giấc mỗi đêm đóng vai trò quan trọng trong việc cải thiện sức khỏe thể chất toàn diện.', '{\"en\": \"The company provides comprehensive health insurance for all full-time staff members and their families.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp bảo hiểm sức khỏe toàn diện cho tất cả nhân viên chính thức và gia đình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-ljspeech-834b34f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-cori-834b34f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/health-d611bab5.webp', '[\"well-being\", \"fitness\"]', '[\"illness\", \"sickness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"health insurance\", \"meaning\": \"bảo hiểm sức khỏe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"good health\", \"meaning\": \"sức khỏe tốt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"healthy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"healthily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-cori-834b34f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-aru0-834b34f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-aru5-834b34f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-aru6-834b34f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-aru10-834b34f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-aru9-834b34f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-aru3-834b34f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-aru7-834b34f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-aru