('976402db-4d51-5362-a7bd-b199dca35963', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'attend', 'UK: /əˈtend/ | US: /əˈtend/', 'A2', 'verb', 'tham dự', 'to be present at an event, meeting, class, or gathering of people.', 'Employees must attend the mandatory training session.', 'Nhân viên phải tham dự buổi đào tạo bắt buộc.', '{\"en\": \"All department heads are required to attend the annual strategic planning seminar next Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các trưởng bộ phận đều được yêu cầu tham dự buổi thảo luận kế hoạch chiến lược hàng năm vào thứ Hai tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-ljspeech-600f311c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-cori-600f311c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attend-bcb2547f.webp', '[\"be present at\", \"participate in\", \"join\"]', '[\"miss\", \"absent oneself from\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"attend a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"tham dự cuộc họp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attend a workshop\", \"meaning\": \"tham dự buổi hội thảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attend to\", \"note_vi\": \"Attend to (phrasal verb) nghĩa là xử lý, giải quyết hoặc chăm sóc công việc/khách hàng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attendance\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attendee\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attendant\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"attentive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-cori-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-aru0-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-aru5-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-aru6-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-aru10-600f311c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-aru9-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-aru3-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-aru7-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-aru8-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-aru2-600f311c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-ljspeech-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-lt408-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-lt138-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-lt624-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-lt396-600f311c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-lt498-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-lt132-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-lt288-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-lt42-600f311c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attend-lt90-600f311c.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi mang nghĩa \'tham dự sự kiện\', attend đi trực tiếp với tân ngữ (attend the meeting, KHÔNG dùng attend to/at the meeting).', 'events', 1, 20),
('5a3bed89-79fa-510a-8ccf-8da9081b454a', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'clerk', 'UK: /klɑːk/ | US: /klɜːrk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'nhân viên văn phòng', 'an employee who performs routine administrative, clerical, or customer service duties in an office.', 'The clerk filed all the documents efficiently.', 'Nhân viên văn phòng đã sắp xếp tất cả tài liệu một cách hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The front desk clerk was very efficient in handling the guest\'s check-in process.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên lễ tân rất nhanh nhẹn trong việc xử lý quy trình nhận phòng của khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-ljspeech-f38de235.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-cori-f38de235.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clerk-3a7c7ad4.webp', '[\"assistant\", \"receptionist\", \"administrator\", \"agent\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"front desk clerk\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên lễ tân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sales clerk\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên bán hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cloak\", \"note_vi\": \"Áo choàng hoặc hành động che giấu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"clerical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-cori-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru0-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru5-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru6-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru10-f38de235.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru9-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru3-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru7-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru8-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru2-f38de2