('6b8e8018-a2fa-5bb5-a8ca-4a463b1c741b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'beach', '/biːtʃ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Khu vực đất cát hoặc sỏi dọc theo bờ biển.', 'an area of sand or small stones beside the sea or a lake.', 'We spent the whole afternoon relaxing on the beach.', 'Chúng tôi đã dành cả buổi chiều thư giãn trên bãi biển.', '{\"en\": \"The new resort hotel is located right on the beach, attracting many summer tourists.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn nghỉ dưỡng mới nằm ngay trên bãi biển, thu hút nhiều du khách mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-ljspeech-48617412.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-cori-48617412.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beach-bead9b31.webp', '[\"coast\", \"shore\", \"seaside\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sandy beach\", \"meaning\": \"bãi biển cát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go to the beach\", \"meaning\": \"đi biển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bitch\", \"note_vi\": \"cẩn thận phát âm âm /i:/ dài để không nhầm\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-cori-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-aru0-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-aru5-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-aru6-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-aru10-48617412.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-aru9-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-aru3-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-aru7-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-aru8-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-aru2-48617412.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-ljspeech-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-lt408-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-lt138-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-lt624-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-lt396-48617412.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-lt498-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-lt132-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-lt288-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-lt42-48617412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beach-lt90-48617412.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm âm /i:/ dài, kéo dài miệng để tránh nhầm với từ nhạy cảm.', 'travel', 1, 22),
('b739b60c-6e8c-5f5e-9391-625d191f75dd', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'station', '/ˈsteɪʃn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nơi tàu hỏa, xe buýt dừng đón/trả khách.', 'a place where trains or buses stop so that passengers can get on or off.', 'We arrived at the train station an hour before our departure time.', 'Chúng tôi đến nhà ga xe lửa một giờ trước giờ khởi hành.', '{\"en\": \"The new office building is located just a short walk from the subway station.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng mới nằm cách ga tàu điện ngầm chỉ một quãng đi bộ ngắn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-ljspeech-2da36ff3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-cori-2da36ff3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/station-b61c0bcb.webp', '[\"terminal\", \"stop\", \"depot\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"train station\", \"meaning\": \"nhà ga xe lửa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bus station\", \"meaning\": \"bến xe buýt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stationery\", \"note_vi\": \"stationery (đuôi -ery) nghĩa là văn phòng phẩm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"station\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-cori-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-aru0-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-aru5-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-aru6-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-aru10-2da36ff3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-aru9-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-aru3-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-aru7-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-aru8-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-aru2-2da36ff3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-ljspeech-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-lt408-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-lt138-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-lt624-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-lt396-2da36ff3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-lt498-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-lt132-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-lt288-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-lt42-2da36ff3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/station-lt90-2da36ff3.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'station\' (nhà ga) và \'stationery\' (văn phòng phẩm - viết bằng chữ e).', 'travel', 1, 23),
('3aebae35-782f-5de2-85b0-d8c489bc2d12', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'camera', '/ˈkæmrə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị dùng để chụp ảnh hoặc quay video.', 'a device used for taking photographs or recording moving images.', 'Don\'t forget to bring your camera to capture all the beautiful scenery.', 'Đừng quên mang theo máy ảnh để ghi lại tất cả phong cảnh đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The security camera in the lobby recorded the visitor entering the building after office hours.\", \"vi\": \"Camera an ninh ở sảnh đã ghi lại cảnh khách vào tòa nhà sau giờ làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-ljspeech-251e382f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-cori-251e382f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/camera-3e341921.webp', '[\"camcorder\", \"device\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"security camera\", \"meaning\": \"camera an ninh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"digital camera\", \"meaning\": \"máy ảnh kỹ thuật số\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-cori-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-aru0-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-aru5-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-aru6-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-aru10-251e382f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-aru9-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-aru3-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-aru7-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-aru8-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-aru2-251e382f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-ljspeech-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-lt408-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-lt138-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-lt624-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-lt396-251e382f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-lt498-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-lt132-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-lt288-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-lt42-251e382f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/camera-lt90-251e382f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở thường gặp \'security camera\' (camera giám sát).', 'technology', 1, 24),
('608b8018-60bc-5809-b052-63d4e35f6d9e', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'evening', '/ˈiːvnɪŋ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Khoảng thời gian từ chiều muộn đến đêm.', 'the part of the day between the afternoon and the time you go to bed.', 'We usually have dinner together every evening at seven o\'clock.', 'Chúng tôi thường ăn tối cùng nhau mỗi buổi tối vào lúc bảy giờ.', '{\"en\": \"The networking event will take place this evening at the grand hotel ballroom.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện kết nối mạng lưới sẽ diễn ra vào tối nay tại phòng tiệc lớn của khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-ljspeech-d57fd916.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-cori-d57fd916.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/evening-98185767.webp', '[\"night\", \"dusk\"]', '[\"morning\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tomorrow evening\", \"meaning\": \"tối mai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in the evening\", \"meaning\": \"vào buổi tối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"night\", \"note_vi\": \"evening là từ chiều tối đến lúc ngủ, night là đêm muộn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-cori-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-aru0-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-aru5-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-aru6-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-aru10-d57fd916.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-aru9-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-aru3-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-aru7-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-aru8-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-aru2-d57fd916.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-ljspeech-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-lt408-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-lt138-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-lt624-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-lt396-d57fd916.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-lt498-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-lt132-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-lt288-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-lt42-d57fd916.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evening-lt90-d57fd916.mp3\"]}}', 'Giới từ đi kèm thường là \'in the evening\' nhưng \'on Friday evening\'.', 'business', 1, 25),
('4ad75367-c414-5fc8-a34c-61d6843dc2e1', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'almost', 'UK: /ˈɔːlməʊst/ | US: /ˈɔlˌmoʊst/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'hầu như, gần như', 'very nearly but not completely or entirely in degree or extent.', 'The project is almost finished and ready for presentation.', 'Dự án gần như đã hoàn thành và sẵn sàng để trình bày.', '{\"en\": \"We have almost reached our annual sales target two months ahead of schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi hầu như đã đạt được mục tiêu doanh số hàng năm trước kế hoạch hai tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-ljspeech-f9e2ef61.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-cori-f9e2ef61.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/almost-1dd4387a.webp', '[\"nearly\", \"practically\", \"virtually\"]', '[\"definitely\", \"completely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"almost all\", \"meaning\": \"hầu như tất cả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"almost entirely\", \"meaning\": \"gần như toàn bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"almost finished\", \"meaning\": \"gần hoàn thành\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"most\", \"note_vi\": \"most + danh từ (hầu hết...), còn almost + all/every + danh từ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-cori-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-aru0-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-aru5-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-aru6-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-aru10-f9e2ef61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-aru9-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-aru3-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-aru7-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-aru8-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-aru2-f9e2ef61.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-ljspeech-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-lt408-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-lt138-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-lt624-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-lt396-f9e2ef61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-lt498-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-lt132-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-lt288-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-lt42-f9e2ef61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/almost-lt90-f9e2ef61.mp3\"]}}', '\'Almost\' thường đứng trước tính từ, động từ hoặc các từ chỉ lượng như \'all\', \'every\', \'finished\'.', 'office', 1, 26),
('e3429d25-72f4-5c53-a0cf-87cc8f770142', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'cb426380-0534-5de5-a1fe-3b273636ac96', '11d2c29a-b472-5f94-97fc-76fd40659831', 'idea', '/aɪˈdɪə/', 'A1', 'noun', 'một suy nghĩ, kế hoạch, hoặc đề xuất.', 'a plan, thought, or suggestion about what to do in a situation.', 'The marketing team proposed an innovative idea to boost product sales this quarter.', 'Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã đề xuất một ý tưởng sáng tạo nhằm đẩy mạnh doanh số sản phẩm trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"She presented an innovative idea to increase product sales during the strategy session.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy đã trình bày một ý tưởng sáng tạo nhằm tăng doanh số bán hàng trong buổi họp chiến lược.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-ljspeech-76625061.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-cori-76625061.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/idea-a1d0fedb.webp', '[\"concept\", \"thought\", \"notion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"good idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng hay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"come up with an idea\", \"meaning\": \"nảy ra ý tưởng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ideal\", \"note_vi\": \"Idea là ý tưởng (danh từ), ideal là lý tưởng (tính từ/danh từ).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ideal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-cori-76625061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-aru0-76625061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-aru5-76625061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-aru6-76625061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-aru10-76625061.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-aru9-76625061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-aru3-76625061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idea-aru7-76625061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro