('6b098cf1-6aa9-5334-b9f3-f1a032b76e0c', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd67259fd-0afa-5236-8747-d66f25af3c92', 'f4bc4c58-7869-52e6-90ee-787d365da3a2', 'warm', '/wɔːm/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có nhiệt độ dễ chịu, không lạnh.', 'having a pleasant temperature that is not cold.', 'The sun felt warm on my skin after a cold morning.', 'Mặt trời cảm thấy ấm áp trên da tôi sau một buổi sáng lạnh giá.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave a warm welcome to all the new employees at the orientation.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã dành sự chào đón nồng nhiệt cho tất cả nhân viên mới tại buổi định hướng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-ljspeech-d83fc386.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-cori-d83fc386.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/warm-57d28637.webp', '[\"mild\", \"tepid\"]', '[\"cold\", \"cool\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"warm welcome\", \"meaning\": \"sự chào đón nồng nhiệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"warm up\", \"meaning\": \"làm nóng lên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"warmth\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"warmly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-cori-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru0-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru5-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru6-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru10-d83fc386.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru9-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru3-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru7-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru8-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru2-d83fc386.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-ljspeech-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub