('82eece4a-a41b-59b6-b1ad-0bb6e9c38497', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd67259fd-0afa-5236-8747-d66f25af3c92', 'f4bc4c58-7869-52e6-90ee-787d365da3a2', 'remember', '/rɪˈmembə(r)/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Giữ trong trí nhớ, không quên.', 'to bring back to your mind a fact, piece of information, or event.', 'I can\'t remember where I put my keys.', 'Tôi không thể nhớ mình đã để chìa khóa ở đâu.', '{\"en\": \"Please remember to submit your weekly timesheet to the human resources department today.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nhớ nộp bảng chấm công hàng tuần của bạn cho bộ phận nhân sự hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-ljspeech-0759f56c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-cori-0759f56c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/remember-c30f287c.webp', '[\"recall\", \"recollect\"]', '[\"forget\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"remember to do\", \"meaning\": \"nhớ phải làm gì (chưa làm)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remember doing\", \"meaning\": \"nhớ đã làm gì (trong quá khứ)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"remind\", \"note_vi\": \"remind là nhắc nhở ai đó, remember là tự mình nhớ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"remembrance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-cori-0759f56c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-aru0-0759f56c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-aru5-0759f56c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-aru6-0759f56c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-aru10-0759f56c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-aru9-0759f56c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-aru3-0759f56c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-aru7-0759f56c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-aru8-0759f56c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remember-aru2-0759f56c.mp