('232fd2a5-827c-5d42-9428-08598458d471', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd67259fd-0afa-5236-8747-d66f25af3c92', 'f4bc4c58-7869-52e6-90ee-787d365da3a2', 'just', '/dʒʌst/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'chỉ đơn thuần, không hơn không kém', 'only; simply; no more than what is mentioned.', 'I just want a small piece of cake, not the whole thing.', 'Tôi chỉ muốn một miếng bánh nhỏ thôi, không phải cả cái.', '{\"en\": \"The manager just wanted to confirm the time of the upcoming board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý chỉ muốn xác nhận thời gian của cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-ljspeech-d95b79cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-cori-d95b79cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/just-cc2023ec.webp', '[\"only\", \"merely\", \"simply\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"just a moment\", \"meaning\": \"chờ một chút\"}, {\"phrase\": \"just in time\", \"meaning\": \"vừa kịp lúc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-cori-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru0-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru5-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru6-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru10-d95b79cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru9-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru3-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru7-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru8-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru2-d95b79cf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-ljspeech-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-lt408-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-lt138-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-lt624-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-lt396-d95b79cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-lt498-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-lt132-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-lt288-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-lt42-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-lt90-d95b79cf.mp3\"]}}', '\'Just\' có nhiều nghĩa: \'vừa mới\' (thì HTHT) hoặc \'chỉ\' (như \'only\').', 'office', 1, 12),
('5e37ea17-b680-56f9-aeaf-d9b3ca98860d', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd67259fd-0afa-5236-8747-d66f25af3c92', 'f4bc4c58-7869-52e6-90ee-787d365da3a2', 'lunch', '/lʌntʃ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bữa ăn giữa buổi sáng và buổi tối, thường vào giữa ngày.', 'An informal or formal food intake served typically around noon or early afternoon.', 'I usually have a light lunch at noon, like a sandwich or a salad.', 'Tôi thường ăn trưa nhẹ vào buổi trưa, như một chiếc bánh mì kẹp hoặc một món salad.', '{\"en\": \"The team went to a nearby restaurant for lunch after the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ đi đến một nhà hàng gần đó ăn trưa sau cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-ljspeech-09453054.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-cori-09453054.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lunch-366628c3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have lunch\", \"meaning\": \"ăn trưa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business lunch\", \"meaning\": \"tiệc trưa công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lunch break\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ trưa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"launch\", \"note_vi\": \"launch nghĩa là ra mắt, phát âm gần lunch\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lunchtime\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lunchbox\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-cori-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru0-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru5-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru6-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru10-09453054.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru9-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru3-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru7-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru8-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/