('729134ad-62b6-54c5-8ed2-3d3c5c532145', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd67259fd-0afa-5236-8747-d66f25af3c92', 'f4bc4c58-7869-52e6-90ee-787d365da3a2', 'leave', '/liːv/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Rời khỏi một nơi hoặc một người.', 'to go away from a person, place, or position permanently or temporarily.', 'We decided to leave the party early because we were tired.', 'Chúng tôi quyết định rời bữa tiệc sớm vì chúng tôi mệt.', '{\"en\": \"Please remember to turn off the lights before you leave the office tonight.\", \"vi\": \"Xin vui lòng nhớ tắt đèn trước khi bạn rời văn phòng tối nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-ljspeech-31aed9e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-cori-31aed9e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leave-32672dd8.webp', '[\"depart\", \"exit\", \"quit\"]', '[\"arrive\", \"stay\", \"enter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"leave a message\", \"meaning\": \"để lại tin nhắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leave the room\", \"meaning\": \"rời khỏi phòng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"live\", \"note_vi\": \"live phát âm âm i ngắn, leave phát âm âm i dài\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"leave\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-cori-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-aru0-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-aru5-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-aru6-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-aru10-31aed9e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-aru9-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-aru3-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-aru7-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-aru8-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-aru2-31aed9e3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-ljspeech-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-lt408-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-lt138-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-lt624-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-lt396-31aed9e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-lt498-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-lt132-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-lt288-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-lt42-31aed9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-lt90-31aed9e3.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn cách phát âm giữa leave /liːv/ và live /lɪv/.', 'office', 1, 16),
('6d831757-5b84-5124-aaf5-fcb437f4a39a', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd67259fd-0afa-5236-8747-d66f25af3c92', 'f4bc4c58-7869-52e6-90ee-787d365da3a2', 'want', '/wɒnt/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Có mong muốn hoặc khao khát điều gì đó.', 'to have a desire or a wish for something to happen.', 'I really want to learn how to play the guitar.', 'Tôi thực sự muốn học cách chơi đàn guitar.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing director will want to review the advertising budget before Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tiếp thị sẽ muốn xem xét ngân sách quảng cáo trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-ljspeech-b5f23bca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-cori-b5f23bca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/want-3532c91c.webp', '[\"desire\", \"wish\"]', '[\"refuse\", \"reject\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"want to do something\", \"meaning\": \"muốn làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"really want\", \"meaning\": \"thực sự muốn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"need\", \"note_vi\": \"need là cần thiết, want chỉ là mong muốn cá nhân\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"wanted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-cori-b5f23bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-aru0-b5f23bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-aru5-b5f23bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-aru6-b5f23bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-aru10-b5f23bca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-aru9-b5f23bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-aru3-b5f23bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-aru7-b5f23bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-aru8-b5f23bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-aru2-b5f23bca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/want-ljspeech-b5f23bca.mp3\", \"/stora