('7dd2337c-d215-5a20-a7ea-2a8fa174967b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd67259fd-0afa-5236-8747-d66f25af3c92', 'f4bc4c58-7869-52e6-90ee-787d365da3a2', 'useful', '/ˈjuːsfl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Mang lại lợi ích, có thể dùng được.', 'helpful for doing something or achieving a specific goal.', 'This dictionary is a very useful tool for learning English.', 'Cuốn từ điển này là một công cụ rất hữu ích để học tiếng Anh.', '{\"en\": \"The training session provided many useful tips for managing time more effectively at work.\", \"vi\": \"Buổi đào tạo đã cung cấp nhiều mẹo hữu ích để quản lý thời gian hiệu quả hơn tại nơi làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-ljspeech-c4ba45eb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-cori-c4ba45eb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/useful-9ac38e99.webp', '[\"helpful\", \"practical\"]', '[\"useless\", \"unhelpful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"useful information\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin hữu ích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"very useful\", \"meaning\": \"rất hữu ích\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"use\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"usefulness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-cori-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-aru0-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-aru5-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-aru6-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-aru10-c4ba45eb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-aru9-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-aru3-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-aru7-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-aru8-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-aru2-c4ba45eb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-ljspeech-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-lt408-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-lt138-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-lt624-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-lt396-c4ba45eb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-lt498-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-lt132-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-lt288-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-lt42-c4ba45eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useful-lt90-c4ba45eb.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này rất hay xuất hiện trong các đoạn hội thoại về lời khuyên hoặc hướng dẫn.', 'office', 1, 22),
('fd3e23f2-293d-5e76-9e87-54f656738aef', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd67259fd-0afa-5236-8747-d66f25af3c92', 'f4bc4c58-7869-52e6-90ee-787d365da3a2', 'fun', '/fʌn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Sự thích thú, niềm vui hoặc giải trí.', 'enjoyment, amusement, or lighthearted pleasure that people experience during an activity.', 'Organizing the company picnic was a lot of fun for the entire planning committee.', 'Việc tổ chức buổi dã ngoại của công ty mang lại nhiều niềm vui cho toàn bộ ban kế hoạch.', '{\"en\": \"The team building event was full of fun and helped improve communication among staff.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện xây dựng đội ngũ rất vui vẻ và giúp cải thiện giao tiếp giữa các nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-ljspeech-c84c50d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-cori-c84c50d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fun-5c1a07b4.webp', '[\"enjoyment\", \"pleasure\"]', '[\"boredom\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have fun\", \"meaning\": \"vui vẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"for fun\", \"meaning\": \"để giải trí\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"funny\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-cori-c84c50d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-aru0-c84c50d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-aru5-c84c50d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-aru6-c84c50d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-aru10-c84c50d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-aru9-c84c50d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-aru3-c84c50d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-aru7-c84c50d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-aru8-c84c50d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-aru2-c84c50d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fun-ljspeech-c84c50d5.mp3\", \