('5376435c-3391-5825-929b-0b64ad150c26', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd67259fd-0afa-5236-8747-d66f25af3c92', 'f4bc4c58-7869-52e6-90ee-787d365da3a2', 'part', '/pɑːt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một phần của một tổng thể; một bộ phận.', 'some but not all of a thing, or a piece of a machine.', 'Replacing the damaged part restored the factory machinery to full operational capacity.', 'Việc thay thế bộ phận bị hỏng đã khôi phục máy móc nhà máy về công suất hoạt động tối đa.', '{\"en\": \"The technician ordered a replacement part for the broken printer in the office.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã đặt một bộ phận thay thế cho máy in bị hỏng trong văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-ljspeech-3fc88b83.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-cori-3fc88b83.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/part-24c264a7.webp', '[\"portion\", \"section\", \"component\"]', '[\"whole\", \"entirety\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spare part\", \"meaning\": \"phụ tùng thay thế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take part in\", \"meaning\": \"tham gia vào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"party\", \"note_vi\": \"party là bữa tiệc hoặc đảng phái, khác với part\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"partial\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"partially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-cori-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-aru0-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-aru5-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-aru6-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-aru10-3fc88b83.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-aru9-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-aru3-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-aru7-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-aru8-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-aru2-3fc88b83.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-ljspeech-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-lt408-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-lt138-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-lt624-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-lt396-3fc88b83.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-lt498-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-lt132-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-lt288-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-lt42-3fc88b83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-lt90-3fc88b83.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ \'take part in\' rất phổ biến trong đề thi TOEIC.', 'office', 1, 25)
