('df77be06-5d6c-5d61-812a-90f71d32da9f', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'back', '/bæk/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Trở về vị trí cũ hoặc trạng thái trước đó.', 'in, into, or towards a previous place or condition, or an earlier time.', 'The manager had to head back to the office right after finishing his client appointment.', 'Quản lý đã phải quay trở lại văn phòng ngay sau khi kết thúc cuộc hẹn với khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will be back in the office after his business trip to Japan.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý sẽ trở lại văn phòng sau chuyến công tác tới Nhật Bản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-ljspeech-61bb8d29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-cori-61bb8d29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/back-68adbc2d.webp', '[\"backward\", \"rearward\"]', '[\"forward\", \"ahead\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"go back\", \"meaning\": \"quay lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"call back\", \"meaning\": \"gọi lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pay back\", \"meaning\": \"trả lại tiền\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"again\", \"note_vi\": \"lại (làm lại hành động), back là trở về trạng thái/vị trí cũ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"back\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"backward\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-cori-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-aru0-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-aru5-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-aru6-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-aru10-61bb8d29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-aru9-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-aru3-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-aru7-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-aru8-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-aru2-61bb8d29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-ljspeech-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-lt408-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-lt138-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-lt624-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-lt396-61bb8d29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-lt498-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-lt132-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-lt288-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-lt42-61bb8d29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-lt90-61bb8d29.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi dùng với động từ di chuyển (go, come), back mang nghĩa quay về vị trí ban đầu.', 'office', 1, 11),
('87cec410-4598-5910-b91d-f6fc8aa25711', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'put', '/pʊt/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Đặt cái gì đó vào một vị trí cụ thể.', 'to move something into a particular position or place.', 'Please put the books back on the shelf when you\'re finished reading them.', 'Làm ơn hãy đặt những cuốn sách trở lại kệ khi bạn đọc xong.', '{\"en\": \"Please put the new marketing brochures on the reception desk for visitors.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đặt các tài liệu quảng cáo tiếp thị mới lên bàn tiếp tân cho khách truy cập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-ljspeech-132aeadf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-cori-132aeadf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/put-b7699fcf.webp', '[\"place\", \"set\", \"lay\"]', '[\"remove\", \"take\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"put pressure on\", \"meaning\": \"gây áp lực lên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"put an end to\", \"meaning\": \"chấm dứt cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lay\", \"note_vi\": \"lay cần tân ngữ trực tiếp và thường mang nghĩa đặt nằm ngang.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-cori-132aeadf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-aru0-132aeadf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-aru5-132aeadf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-aru6-132aeadf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-aru10-132aeadf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-aru9-132aeadf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-aru3-132aeadf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-aru7-132aeadf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-aru8-132aeadf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-aru2-132aeadf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-ljspeech-132aeadf.m