('ec745170-a238-5caa-a32c-2b70c4ba1cbc', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'device', 'UK: /dɪˈvaɪs/ | US: /dɪˈvaɪs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'thiết bị, dụng cụ', 'An object or machine made for a specific purpose or particular practical work.', 'This new device can connect to the internet wirelessly.', 'Thiết bị mới này có thể kết nối internet không dây.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must disconnect all electronic devices from the power outlets before leaving the office.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải ngắt kết nối tất cả các thiết bị điện tử khỏi ổ cắm điện trước khi rời văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-ljspeech-f3a929b3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-cori-f3a929b3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/device-3430a178.webp', '[\"gadget\", \"appliance\", \"equipment\", \"instrument\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"electronic device\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị điện tử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mobile device\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị di động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"devise\", \"note_vi\": \"động từ: sáng chế, nghĩ ra kế hoạch\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"devise\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-cori-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-aru0-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-aru5-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-aru6-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-aru10-f3a929b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-aru9-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-aru3-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-aru7-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-aru8-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-aru2-f3a929b3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-ljspeech-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-lt408-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-lt138-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-lt624-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-lt396-f3a929b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-lt498-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-lt132-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-lt288-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-lt42-f3a929b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/device-lt90-f3a929b3.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt danh từ \'device\' (thiết bị - đuôi \'ce\') và động từ \'devise\' (phát minh, nghĩ ra - đuôi \'se\').', 'technology', 1, 14),
('599259b7-30ba-5fd4-a984-f19bb20a8e5e', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'guitar', '/ɡɪˈtɑː(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một loại nhạc cụ có dây, thường dùng để đệm hát.', 'a musical instrument with six strings sounded by plucking or strumming with fingers.', 'She learned to play the guitar when she was just ten years old.', 'Cô ấy đã học chơi đàn ghi-ta khi mới mười tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"The store manager offered a ten percent discount on the classical acoustic guitar.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cửa hàng đã giảm giá mười phần trăm cho chiếc đàn ghi-ta cổ điển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-ljspeech-22942b7c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-cori-22942b7c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/guitar-ba592704.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play the guitar\", \"meaning\": \"chơi đàn ghi-ta\"}, {\"phrase\": \"acoustic guitar\", \"meaning\": \"đàn ghi-ta mộc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"electric guitar\", \"meaning\": \"đàn ghi-ta điện\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"guitarist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-cori-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-aru0-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-aru5-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-aru6-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-aru10-22942b7c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-aru9-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-aru3-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-aru7-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-aru8-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-aru2-22942b7c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-ljspeech-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-lt408-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-lt138-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-lt624-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-lt396-22942b7c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-lt498-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-lt132-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-lt288-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-lt42-22942b7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guitar-lt90-22942b7c.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi nói đến việc chơi nhạc cụ, luôn dùng mạo từ \'the\' trước guitar (play the guitar).', 'shopping', 1, 15),
('c51123fe-91fa-5e16-97b2-77fe218e6a61', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'farm', '/fɑːm/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Khu đất dùng để trồng trọt hoặc chăn nuôi.', 'an area of land used for growing crops and raising animals for food.', 'My grandparents live on a large farm where they grow vegetables and raise cattle.', 'Ông bà tôi sống ở một trang trại lớn nơi họ trồng rau và nuôi gia súc.', '{\"en\": \"The organic farm supplies fresh vegetables directly to top restaurants in the downtown area.\", \"vi\": \"Trang trại hữu cơ cung cấp rau tươi trực tiếp cho các nhà hàng hàng đầu ở khu vực trung tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-ljspeech-36a3bbe0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-cori-36a3bbe0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/farm-0f82d05e.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dairy farm\", \"meaning\": \"trang trại bò sữa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"organic farm\", \"meaning\": \"trang trại hữu cơ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"farmer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"farming\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-cori-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-aru0-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-aru5-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-aru6-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-aru10-36a3bbe0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-aru9-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-aru3-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-aru7-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-aru8-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-aru2-36a3bbe0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-ljspeech-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-lt408-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-lt138-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-lt624-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-lt396-36a3bbe0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-lt498-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-lt132-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-lt288-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-lt42-36a3bbe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farm-lt90-36a3bbe0.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với giới từ \'on\' (on a farm), không dùng \'in a farm\'.', 'nature', 1, 16),
('8fc3d564-3cbe-581b-b58b-21b96ea75532', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'shoe', '/ʃuː/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Vật dùng để đi vào chân, thường làm bằng da hoặc vải.', 'a strong covering for the foot, usually made of leather, worn with socks inside.', 'She bought a new pair of running shoes for her morning jogs.', 'Cô ấy đã mua một đôi giày chạy bộ mới cho những buổi chạy bộ buổi sáng của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The safety shoe is required for all employees working in the factory production area daily.\", \"vi\": \"Giày bảo hộ là bắt buộc đối với tất cả nhân viên làm việc tại khu vực sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-ljspeech-4488ae65.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-cori-4488ae65.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shoe-bc8d647c.webp', '[\"footwear\", \"boot\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"leather shoe\", \"meaning\": \"giày da\"}, {\"phrase\": \"safety shoe\", \"meaning\": \"giày bảo hộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"show\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm khác nhau, shoe có âm \'sh\' dài, show có âm \'o\' dài.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-cori-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-aru0-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-aru5-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-aru6-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-aru10-4488ae65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-aru9-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-aru3-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-aru7-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-aru8-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-aru2-4488ae65.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-ljspeech-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-lt408-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-lt138-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-lt624-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-lt396-4488ae65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-lt498-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-lt132-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-lt288-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-lt42-4488ae65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoe-lt90-4488ae65.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công nghiệp, thường dùng \'safety shoes\' (số nhiều).', 'manufacturing', 1, 17),
('4f745968-044f-5b56-acf6-0968459d2386', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'poor', '/pɔː(r)/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Không có đủ tiền hoặc tài sản để sống thoải mái.', 'having little money and few possessions to live well.', 'Many people in developing countries live in very poor conditions.', 'Nhiều người ở các nước đang phát triển sống trong điều kiện rất nghèo nàn.', '{\"en\": \"The poor employee requested an advance on his monthly salary.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên nghèo đã yêu cầu ứng trước tiền lương hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-ljspeech-2156e40a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-cori-2156e40a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/poor-4f6bca15.webp', '[\"needy\", \"impoverished\", \"broke\"]', '[\"rich\", \"wealthy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"poor people\", \"meaning\": \"người nghèo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"poor country\", \"meaning\": \"đất nước nghèo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pour\", \"note_vi\": \"viết là poor nhưng pour nghĩa là đổ, phát âm khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"poverty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-cori-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru0-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru5-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru6-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru10-2156e40a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru9-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru3-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru7-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru8-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru2-2156e40a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun