('45edd450-9d21-5b6e-9b5e-0ba268585dc0', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'cap', 'UK: /kæp/ | US: /kæp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'mũ (một loại mũ có lưỡi)', 'a soft flat head covering with a curved visor at the front', 'He wore a baseball cap to the shade his eyes.', 'Anh ấy đội mũ lưỡi trai để che mắt.', '{\"en\": \"The financial director set a strict cap on travel expenses for the upcoming quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tài chính đã đặt một mức trần nghiêm ngặt cho các khoản chi phí đi lại trong quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-ljspeech-ac4be5ac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-cori-ac4be5ac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cap-06ff0f8e.webp', '[\"limit\", \"ceiling\", \"cover\", \"lid\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"spending cap\", \"meaning\": \"mức trần chi tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"put a cap on\", \"meaning\": \"đặt giới hạn cho cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cape\", \"note_vi\": \"Áo khoác không tay hoặc mũi đất, khác với cap (mũ, nắp, mức trần).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cap\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-cori-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-aru0-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-aru5-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-aru6-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-aru10-ac4be5ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-aru9-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-aru3-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-aru7-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-aru8-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-aru2-ac4be5ac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-ljspeech-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-lt408-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-lt138-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-lt624-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-lt396-ac4be5ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-lt498-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-lt132-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-lt288-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-lt42-ac4be5ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cap-lt90-ac4be5ac.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa mũ lưỡi trai hay nắp đậy, trong bối cảnh tài chính TOEIC, \'cap\' còn có nghĩa là mức trần/giới hạn chi tiêu.', 'finance', 1, 23),
('644bd48c-2e0f-5ed2-88ea-bd69ad9cda6e', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'decide', '/dɪˈsaɪd/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đưa ra lựa chọn hoặc kết luận sau khi suy nghĩ.', 'to choose something after thinking about the different possibilities.', 'The board members will decide on the new marketing strategy tomorrow.', 'Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị sẽ quyết định về chiến lược tiếp thị mới vào ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors will decide on the new budget proposal tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc sẽ quyết định về đề xuất ngân sách mới vào sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-ljspeech-d14809f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-cori-d14809f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decide-9457bc01.webp', '[\"determine\", \"resolve\", \"choose\"]', '[\"hesitate\", \"waver\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"decide to do something\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"decide on\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định chọn cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"divide\", \"note_vi\": \"chia ra, phân chia, viết gần giống decide\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"decision\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"decisive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-cori-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru0-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru5-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru6-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru10-d14809f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru9-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru3-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru7-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru8-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru2-d14809f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-ljspeech-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt408-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt138-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt624-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt396-d14809f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt498-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt132-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt288-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt42-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt90-d14809f0.mp3\"]}}', 'Decide đi với động từ to-infinitive (decide to do), không đi với V-ing.', 'business', 1, 24),
('bab969ba-8796-5e79-9199-0951e19a51c5', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'carefully', 'UK: /ˈkeə.fə.li/ | US: /ˈkɛr.fə.li/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'một cách cẩn thận', 'in a manner that avoids danger, mistakes, or damage through thorough attention', 'The manager carefully reviewed all project proposals.', 'Quản lý đã xem xét cẩn thận tất cả các đề xuất dự án.', '{\"en\": \"Applicants are advised to review the job requirements carefully before submitting their resumes.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên được khuyên nên xem xét kỹ các yêu cầu công việc trước khi nộp hồ sơ xin việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-ljspeech-00f74c9d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-cori-00f74c9d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carefully-32236c67.webp', '[\"cautiously\", \"thoroughly\", \"meticulously\", \"attentively\"]', '[\"carelessly\", \"hastily\", \"recklessly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"read carefully\", \"meaning\": \"đọc kỹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"review carefully\", \"meaning\": \"xem xét cẩn thận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handle carefully\", \"meaning\": \"cầm nắm/xử lý cẩn thận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"carelessly\", \"note_vi\": \"Carelessly là một cách bất cẩn/cẩu thả, nghĩa trái ngược với carefully.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"care\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"care\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"careful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-cori-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru0-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru5-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru6-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru10-00f74c9d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru9-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru3-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru7-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru8-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru2-00f74c9d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-ljspeech-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-lt408-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-lt138-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-lt624-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-lt396-00f74c9d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-lt498-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-lt132-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-lt288-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-lt42-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-lt90-00f74c9d.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ này thường đi cùng các động từ chỉ thao tác kiểm tra, đọc hoặc xử lý như: read carefully, review carefully, handle carefully.', 'office', 1, 25),
