('07988666-7a90-527d-842d-32fc69269897', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'd80c9a37-1dda-54c6-9b20-8391519ef8d9', 'cd51e151-9c2d-5cc1-8558-c452e63013c1', 'designer', 'UK: /dɪˈzaɪnər/ | US: /dɪˈzaɪnər/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nhà thiết kế', 'A person who plans the form, look, or working of something before it is made.', 'Our lead designer presented the new product concept.', 'Nhà thiết kế chính của chúng tôi đã trình bày ý tưởng sản phẩm mới.', '{\"en\": \"The lead designer presented several conceptual layouts for the client\'s new website.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế chính đã trình bày một số bố cục ý tưởng cho trang web mới của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-ljspeech-1ec1e366.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-cori-1ec1e366.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/designer-0493d0ac.webp', '[\"creator\", \"architect\", \"planner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"graphic designer\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thiết kế đồ họa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"web designer\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thiết kế website\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"design\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"design\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-cori-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru0-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru5-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru6-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru10-1ec1e366.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru9-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru3-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru7-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru8-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru2-1ec1e366.mp3\"]}, \"u