('179b16ef-94ab-53e3-8a91-d28d90f04064', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'de8bb4d7-9e2e-57dc-8785-701817e43a49', '4cc5a6ed-5e5c-56a5-883c-96d2bc3355e7', 'understand', '/ˌʌndəˈstænd/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Nắm được ý nghĩa hoặc bản chất của điều gì đó.', 'to know the meaning of what someone is saying or how something works.', 'I didn\'t understand the instructions, so I asked for clarification.', 'Tôi không hiểu các hướng dẫn, vì vậy tôi đã hỏi lại cho rõ.', '{\"en\": \"We need to understand the customer\'s needs before designing the new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi cần hiểu nhu cầu của khách hàng trước khi thiết kế chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-ljspeech-8e73840b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-cori-8e73840b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/understand-48165b96.webp', '[\"comprehend\", \"grasp\", \"realize\"]', '[\"misunderstand\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fully understand\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu đầy đủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"difficult to understand\", \"meaning\": \"khó hiểu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"misunderstand\", \"note_vi\": \"hiểu lầm, ngược nghĩa với understand\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"understanding\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"understandable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-cori-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru0-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru5-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru6-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru10-8e73840b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru9-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru3-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru7-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/st