('9aeafe16-b408-53fb-b088-4d8fef06aad0', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'de8bb4d7-9e2e-57dc-8785-701817e43a49', '4cc5a6ed-5e5c-56a5-883c-96d2bc3355e7', 'positive', '/ˈpɒzɪtɪv/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Tốt, lạc quan, hoặc mang lại kết quả mong muốn.', 'showing confidence, hope, and focusing on the good aspects of a situation.', 'Despite the challenges, he maintained a positive attitude throughout the project.', 'Mặc dù gặp nhiều thử thách, anh ấy vẫn giữ thái độ tích cực trong suốt dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The company received positive feedback from customers about the new service.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã nhận được phản hồi tích cực từ khách hàng về dịch vụ mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-ljspeech-c4c6c572.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-cori-c4c6c572.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/positive-1ddff9d8.webp', '[\"optimistic\", \"favorable\", \"encouraging\"]', '[\"negative\", \"pessimistic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"positive feedback\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi tích cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"positive attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ tích cực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"positively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"positivity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-cori-c4c6c572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-aru0-c4c6c572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-aru5-c4c6c572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-aru6-c4c6c572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-aru10-c4c6c572.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-aru9-c4c6c572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-aru3-c4c6c572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-aru7-c4c6c572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/positive-aru8-c4c6c572.mp3\", \"/storag