('4569b3bf-9af5-57ff-9a7b-bd09876c1d82', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'de8bb4d7-9e2e-57dc-8785-701817e43a49', '4cc5a6ed-5e5c-56a5-883c-96d2bc3355e7', 'easiest', 'UK: /ˈiːziɪst/ | US: /ˈiːziɪst/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'dễ nhất', 'Requiring the least amount of effort, skill, or difficulty to understand or accomplish.', 'This is the easiest way to finish the report.', 'Đây là cách dễ nhất để hoàn thành báo cáo.', '{\"en\": \"Using the online client portal is the easiest way to track your shipment status.\", \"vi\": \"Sử dụng cổng thông tin khách hàng trực tuyến là cách dễ nhất để theo dõi trạng thái đơn hàng của bạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-ljspeech-c36a612e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-cori-c36a612e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/easiest-e229017a.webp', '[\"simplest\", \"most effortless\"]', '[\"hardest\", \"most difficult\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"the easiest way\", \"meaning\": \"cách dễ nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"easiest to use\", \"meaning\": \"dễ sử dụng nhất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"easy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"easily\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ease\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-cori-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-aru0-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-aru5-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-aru6-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-aru10-c36a612e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-aru9-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-aru3-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-aru7-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-aru8-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-aru2-c36a612e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-ljspeech-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-lt408-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-lt138-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-lt624-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-lt396-c36a612e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-lt498-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-lt132-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-lt288-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-lt42-c36a612e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/easiest-lt90-c36a612e.mp3\"]}}', '\'Easiest\' là dạng so sánh nhất của \'easy\' (đổi \'y\' thành \'i\' rồi thêm \'-est\'). Thường đi sau mạo từ \'the\'.', 'technology', 1, 24),
('e01f38bd-859c-5046-8b02-84eddde613f2', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'de8bb4d7-9e2e-57dc-8785-701817e43a49', '4cc5a6ed-5e5c-56a5-883c-96d2bc3355e7', 'mouse', '/maʊs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Động vật gặm nhấm nhỏ hoặc thiết bị điều khiển máy tính.', 'a small device that you move with your hand to control the cursor on a screen.', 'My cat loves to chase the little mouse in the garden.', 'Con mèo của tôi thích đuổi theo con chuột nhỏ trong vườn.', '{\"en\": \"The computer mouse is not responding, so please contact the IT department for a replacement.\", \"vi\": \"Chuột máy tính không phản hồi, vì vậy vui lòng liên hệ bộ phận IT để được thay thế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-ljspeech-9e05e683.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-cori-9e05e683.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mouse-3d44fa53.webp', '[\"pointing device\", \"controller\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"click the mouse\", \"meaning\": \"nhấp chuột\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wireless mouse\", \"meaning\": \"chuột không dây\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-cori-9e05e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-aru0-9e05e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-aru5-9e05e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-aru6-9e05e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-aru10-9e05e683.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-aru9-9e05e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-aru3-9e05e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-aru7-9e05e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-aru8-9e05e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-aru2-9e05e683.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouse-ljspeech-9e05e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio