('ab13eefe-c444-502d-801e-0b1cc2cb92a5', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'ea3f0102-3dab-5154-8f93-f8ffc8d40af3', 'd6eeef1a-59cd-5208-91c3-0997b617ab0d', 'coat', '/kəʊt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một loại quần áo ấm mặc bên ngoài.', 'an outer piece of clothing with long sleeves that you wear over other clothes in cold weather.', 'Don\'t forget your coat; it\'s cold outside.', 'Đừng quên áo khoác của bạn; bên ngoài trời lạnh đó.', '{\"en\": \"The manager left his heavy winter coat in the closet before entering the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã để chiếc áo khoác mùa đông dày của mình trong tủ trước khi vào phòng họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-ljspeech-09d5f620.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-cori-09d5f620.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coat-66d5926c.webp', '[\"jacket\", \"overcoat\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wear a coat\", \"meaning\": \"mặc áo khoác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"winter coat\", \"meaning\": \"áo khoác mùa đông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"jacket\", \"note_vi\": \"Jacket thường ngắn và nhẹ hơn coat.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coat\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-cori-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-aru0-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-aru5-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-aru6-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-aru10-09d5f620.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-aru9-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-aru3-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-aru7-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-aru8-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-aru2-09d5f620.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-ljspeech-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-lt408-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-lt138-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-lt624-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-lt396-09d5f620.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-lt498-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-lt132-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-lt288-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-lt42-09d5f620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coat-lt90-09d5f620.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý \'coat\' thường dài hơn \'jacket\'.', 'daily', 1, 1),
('7e57bc46-6902-5b0a-9f68-e98717e04868', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'ea3f0102-3dab-5154-8f93-f8ffc8d40af3', 'd6eeef1a-59cd-5208-91c3-0997b617ab0d', 'address', '/əˈdres/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thông tin chi tiết về nơi ở hoặc vị trí của một người/vật.', 'the details of where a building is, including the number and street name.', 'The job applicant forgot to include her email address on the resume.', 'Người nộp đơn xin việc đã quên ghi địa chỉ email của cô ấy vào sơ yếu lý lịch.', '{\"en\": \"Please confirm your shipping address before finalizing the online order on our website.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xác nhận địa chỉ giao hàng của bạn trước khi hoàn tất đơn hàng trực tuyến trên trang web của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-ljspeech-c6621802.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-cori-c6621802.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/address-ac7693c9.webp', '[\"location\", \"residence\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"email address\", \"meaning\": \"địa chỉ email\"}, {\"phrase\": \"forwarding address\", \"meaning\": \"địa chỉ chuyển tiếp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"address\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-cori-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru0-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru5-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru6-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru10-c6621802.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru9-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru3-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru7-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru8-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru2-c6621802.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-ljspeech-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt408-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt138-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt624-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt396-c6621802.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt498-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt132-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt288-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt42-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt90-c6621802.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ nhấn âm 1 hoặc âm 2, động từ (giải quyết) nhấn âm 2.', 'shopping', 1, 2),
('04816016-b2bd-59a8-8136-c2a6c5ee3586', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'ea3f0102-3dab-5154-8f93-f8ffc8d40af3', 'd6eeef1a-59cd-5208-91c3-0997b617ab0d', 'enough', '/ɪˈnʌf/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Lượng cần thiết hoặc đủ.', 'as much or as many as is needed or wanted for a purpose.', 'The company did not allocate enough budget to cover all proposed project expenses.', 'Công ty đã không phân bổ đủ ngân sách để chi trả cho tất cả các chi phí dự án được đề xuất.', '{\"en\": \"We do not have enough office supplies to complete the project by this Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi không có đủ văn phòng phẩm để hoàn thành dự án vào thứ Sáu này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-ljspeech-8ce77cc3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-cori-8ce77cc3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enough-0a765cf6.webp', '[\"sufficient\", \"adequate\"]', '[\"insufficient\", \"inadequate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enough time\", \"meaning\": \"đủ thời gian\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fair enough\", \"meaning\": \"cũng hợp lý thôi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-cori-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-aru0-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-aru5-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-aru6-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-aru10-8ce77cc3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-aru9-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-aru3-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-aru7-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-aru8-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-aru2-8ce77cc3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-ljspeech-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-lt408-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-lt138-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-lt624-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-lt396-8ce77cc3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-lt498-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-lt132-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-lt288-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-lt42-8ce77cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enough-lt90-8ce77cc3.mp3\"]}}', 'Vị trí: Enough đứng trước danh từ nhưng đứng sau tính từ và trạng từ.', 'office', 1, 3),
('6e0865ea-e910-53a9-8fef-a9f5fe65419b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'ea3f0102-3dab-5154-8f93-f8ffc8d40af3', 'd6eeef1a-59cd-5208-91c3-0997b617ab0d', 'skill', '/skɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khả năng làm một việc gì đó thành thạo.', 'the ability to do something well because you have learned and practiced it.', 'Learning a new language requires dedication and practice to develop the necessary skills.', 'Học một ngôn ngữ mới đòi hỏi sự cống hiến và luyện tập để phát triển các kỹ năng cần thiết.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources manager evaluated the applicant\'s communication skill during the job interview.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý nhân sự đã đánh giá kỹ năng giao tiếp của ứng viên trong buổi phỏng vấn xin việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skill-ljspeech-34b33e00.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skill-cori-34b33e00.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/skill-3d8fa59b.webp', '[\"ability\", \"expertise\", \"competence\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"communication skill\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ năng giao tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"management skill\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ năng quản lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"develop a skill\", \"meaning\": \"phát triển kỹ năng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"talent\", \"note_vi\": \"talent là năng khiếu bẩm sinh, skill là kỹ năng nhờ học hỏi rèn luyện\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"skilled\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"skillful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skill-cori-34b33e00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skill-aru0-34b33e00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skill-aru5-34b33e00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skill-aru6-34b33e00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skill-aru10-34b33e00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skill-aru9-34b33e00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skill-aru3-34b33