('2948b9d3-8bed-5612-8c3a-cba7e693d536', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'ea3f0102-3dab-5154-8f93-f8ffc8d40af3', 'd6eeef1a-59cd-5208-91c3-0997b617ab0d', 'pepper', '/ˈpepə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Gia vị cay được dùng để nêm thức ăn.', 'a hot tasting powder made from dried berries, used to season food.', 'He sprinkled freshly ground black pepper over his pasta dish.', 'Anh ấy rắc tiêu đen xay tươi lên đĩa mì Ý của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant manager ordered extra black pepper to prepare for the dinner service.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý nhà hàng đã đặt thêm tiêu đen để chuẩn bị cho dịch vụ bữa tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-ljspeech-64356bcf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-cori-64356bcf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pepper-69a29364.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"black pepper\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu đen\"}, {\"phrase\": \"salt and pepper\", \"meaning\": \"muối và tiêu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"paper\", \"note_vi\": \"Paper là giấy, pepper là hạt tiêu hoặc ớt chuông.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-cori-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru0-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru5-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru6-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru10-64356bcf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru9-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru3-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru7-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru8-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru2-64356bcf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-ljspeech-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-lt408-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-lt138-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-lt624-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-lt396-64356bcf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-lt498-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-lt132-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-lt288-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-lt42-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-lt90-64356bcf.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi chỉ gia vị tiêu thì không đếm được, chỉ quả ớt chuông (bell pepper) thì đếm được.', 'dining', 1, 11),
('f9937ff8-2e86-56fc-887a-24c17ff4977d', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'ea3f0102-3dab-5154-8f93-f8ffc8d40af3', 'd6eeef1a-59cd-5208-91c3-0997b617ab0d', 'follow', '/ˈfɒləʊ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đi hoặc di chuyển đằng sau ai đó hoặc vật gì đó.', 'to move behind someone or something in the same direction.', 'All visitors must follow the company safety guidelines while inside the factory.', 'Tất cả khách tham quan phải tuân thủ các quy định an toàn của công ty khi ở trong nhà máy.', '{\"en\": \"The assistant will follow the manager to the conference room for the presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Trợ lý sẽ đi theo sau người quản lý đến phòng hội nghị để thuyết trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-ljspeech-f7ac253b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-cori-f7ac253b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/follow-e78af2e8.webp', '[\"pursue\", \"shadow\", \"trail\"]', '[\"lead\", \"guide\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"follow instructions\", \"meaning\": \"làm theo hướng dẫn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"follow a trend\", \"meaning\": \"theo một xu hướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fellow\", \"note_vi\": \"đồng nghiệp, bạn đồng hành, không phải động từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"follower\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"following\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-cori-f7ac253b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-aru0-f7ac253b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-aru5-f7ac253b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-aru6-f7ac253b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-aru10-f7ac253b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-aru9-f7ac253b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-aru3-f7ac253b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-aru7-f7ac253b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2