('1b882518-aec0-53cb-87c0-e5305b3c23e0', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'edfb269b-8652-5d1b-b2a0-0de3a2e0c9c9', 'adb327c7-8037-514d-9d07-2d4f77933800', 'fruit', '/fruːt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Phần quả ngọt của cây, có thể ăn được.', 'the sweet and fleshy product of a tree or other plant that contains seeds.', 'Eating fresh fruit every day is good for your health.', 'Ăn trái cây tươi mỗi ngày rất tốt cho sức khỏe của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel lobby always provides fresh fruit for guests during their check-in.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn luôn cung cấp trái cây tươi cho khách trong suốt quá trình nhận phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-ljspeech-f053b8b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-cori-f053b8b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fruit-a5e1096c.webp', '[\"produce\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh fruit\", \"meaning\": \"trái cây tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fruit juice\", \"meaning\": \"nước ép trái cây\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fruitful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-cori-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-aru0-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-aru5-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-aru6-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-aru10-f053b8b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-aru9-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-aru3-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-aru7-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-aru8-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-aru2-f053b8b6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-ljspeech-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-lt408-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-lt138-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-lt624-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-lt396-f053b8b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-lt498-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-lt132-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-lt288-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-lt42-f053b8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruit-lt90-f053b8b6.mp3\"]}}', 'Fruit thường là danh từ không đếm được khi nói chung, nhưng dùng fruits khi chỉ nhiều loại quả khác nhau.', 'dining', 1, 7),
('2d2683c2-1d09-575b-9074-fe0acc93059c', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'edfb269b-8652-5d1b-b2a0-0de3a2e0c9c9', 'adb327c7-8037-514d-9d07-2d4f77933800', 'kind', '/kaɪnd/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có lòng tốt, tử tế và quan tâm đến người khác.', 'having a friendly, generous, and helpful nature towards other people in your daily life.', 'Our supervisor is always kind and willing to support new employees.', 'Người giám sát của chúng tôi luôn tử tế và sẵn sàng hỗ trợ nhân viên mới.', '{\"en\": \"It was very kind of the client to offer us a ride to the airport.\", \"vi\": \"Thật tử tế khi khách hàng đề nghị cho chúng tôi đi nhờ xe đến sân bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-ljspeech-0ef25ae0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-cori-0ef25ae0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/kind-c37c2d51.webp', '[\"nice\", \"considerate\"]', '[\"unkind\", \"mean\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"kind of\", \"meaning\": \"loại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be kind to\", \"meaning\": \"tử tế với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"kin\", \"note_vi\": \"họ hàng, người thân\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"kindness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"kindly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-cori-0ef25ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-aru0-0ef25ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-aru5-0ef25ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-aru6-0ef25ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-aru10-0ef25ae0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-aru9-0ef25ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-aru3-0ef25ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-aru7-0ef25ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-aru8-0ef25ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kind-aru2-0ef25ae0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/