('a7704f8d-6571-5624-bb69-c529b8ea319b', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'edfb269b-8652-5d1b-b2a0-0de3a2e0c9c9', 'adb327c7-8037-514d-9d07-2d4f77933800', 'mountain', '/ˈmaʊntən/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một khối đất đá nhô cao tự nhiên trên bề mặt Trái Đất, lớn hơn đồi.', 'a very high hill, often with steep sides and a pointed top.', 'We hiked up the mountain to enjoy the panoramic view.', 'Chúng tôi đã leo lên núi để ngắm nhìn toàn cảnh.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency offers guided tours to the famous mountain resort this summer.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch cung cấp các tour du lịch có hướng dẫn đến khu nghỉ dưỡng núi nổi tiếng vào mùa hè này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-ljspeech-d79ac4a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-cori-d79ac4a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mountain-fbd1dadc.webp', '[\"peak\", \"mount\"]', '[\"valley\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mountain range\", \"meaning\": \"dãy núi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"climb a mountain\", \"meaning\": \"leo núi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fountain\", \"note_vi\": \"mountain là núi, fountain là vòi phun nước\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mountainous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-cori-d79ac4a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-aru0-d79ac4a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-aru5-d79ac4a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-aru6-d79ac4a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-aru10-d79ac4a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-aru9-d79ac4a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-aru3-d79ac4a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-aru7-d79ac4a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-aru8-d79ac4a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountain-a