('97e64670-b75c-5499-b160-19df4b9a1725', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'edfb269b-8652-5d1b-b2a0-0de3a2e0c9c9', 'adb327c7-8037-514d-9d07-2d4f77933800', 'cost', '/kɒst/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Số tiền cần thiết để mua hoặc làm điều gì đó.', 'the financial price required to acquire, produce, or maintain a particular item or service.', 'The total cost of the trip was much higher than we expected.', 'Tổng chi phí chuyến đi cao hơn nhiều so với chúng tôi dự kiến.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to reduce the production cost to increase their annual profit margin significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã quyết định giảm chi phí sản xuất để tăng đáng kể biên lợi nhuận hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-ljspeech-885dc4a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cori-885dc4a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cost-6ca7a838.webp', '[\"price\", \"expense\", \"charge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cut costs\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high cost\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"price\", \"note_vi\": \"Price là giá bán, cost là chi phí bỏ ra để sản xuất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"costly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cori-885dc4a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-aru0-885dc4a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-aru5-885dc4a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-aru6-885dc4a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-aru10-885dc4a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-aru9-885dc4a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-aru3-885dc4a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-aru7-885dc4a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-aru8-885dc4a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-aru2-885dc4a9.mp3