('8102622b-23df-5e10-83f9-44eeff2424cc', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'edfb269b-8652-5d1b-b2a0-0de3a2e0c9c9', 'adb327c7-8037-514d-9d07-2d4f77933800', 'salad', '/ˈsæləd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Món ăn gồm rau sống, trái cây hoặc các nguyên liệu khác trộn với nước sốt.', 'a mixture of raw vegetables, usually eaten with a special sauce or dressing.', 'The restaurant serves a delicious green salad mixed with olive oil.', 'Nhà hàng phục vụ món salad rau xanh thơm ngon trộn với dầu ô liu.', '{\"en\": \"The catering company will serve a fresh green salad before the main course.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty phục vụ ăn uống sẽ phục vụ món salad xanh tươi trước món chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-ljspeech-f41c041b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-cori-f41c041b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/salad-db6a33c7.webp', '[\"greens\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mixed salad\", \"meaning\": \"salad trộn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fruit salad\", \"meaning\": \"salad hoa quả\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-cori-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru0-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru5-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru6-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru10-f41c041b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru9-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru3-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru7-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru8-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru2-f41c041b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-ljspeech-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt408-f41c04