('49bf06c3-cff0-505e-909c-66c176fe9570', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'edfb269b-8652-5d1b-b2a0-0de3a2e0c9c9', 'adb327c7-8037-514d-9d07-2d4f77933800', 'computer', '/kəmˈpjuːtə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thiết bị điện tử dùng để xử lý thông tin.', 'an electronic machine that can store and process large amounts of information very quickly.', 'My new computer is much faster than my old one.', 'Máy tính mới của tôi nhanh hơn nhiều so với cái cũ.', '{\"en\": \"Our IT department will upgrade every computer in the building to improve overall work efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng IT của chúng ta sẽ nâng cấp mọi máy tính trong tòa nhà để cải thiện hiệu quả công việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-ljspeech-c60266a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-cori-c60266a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/computer-a151c22a.webp', '[\"PC\", \"workstation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"laptop computer\", \"meaning\": \"máy tính xách tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"computer system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống máy tính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compute\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"computation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-cori-c60266a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aru0-c60266a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aru5-c60266a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aru6-c60266a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aru10-c60266a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aru9-c60266a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aru3-c60266a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aru7-c60266a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aru8-c60266a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aru2-c60266a8.mp3