('b598186a-61a3-5eff-a9ab-458d087888de', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'edfb269b-8652-5d1b-b2a0-0de3a2e0c9c9', 'adb327c7-8037-514d-9d07-2d4f77933800', 'help', '/help/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Hỗ trợ ai đó làm gì hoặc thoát khỏi khó khăn.', 'to give assistance to someone so that they can do something more easily.', 'Our team leader agreed to help us prepare the sales report.', 'Trưởng nhóm của chúng tôi đã đồng ý giúp chúng tôi chuẩn bị báo cáo doanh số.', '{\"en\": \"The new assistant will help the manager organize the upcoming international conference next week.\", \"vi\": \"Trợ lý mới sẽ giúp quản lý tổ chức hội nghị quốc tế sắp tới vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-ljspeech-92005ecf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-cori-92005ecf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/help-5c929571.webp', '[\"assist\", \"support\", \"aid\"]', '[\"hinder\", \"impede\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"help with something\", \"meaning\": \"giúp đỡ công việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"help to do something\", \"meaning\": \"giúp làm điều gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"help\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"helpful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"helpfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-cori-92005ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-aru0-92005ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-aru5-92005ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-aru6-92005ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-aru10-92005ecf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-aru9-92005ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-aru3-92005ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-aru7-92005ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/help-aru8-92005ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation