('2f20ad7e-76ff-5481-bc71-19f032484f48', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'eedfe70e-a960-5150-98b9-2eda94263a8f', 'baf1cef9-72a9-5710-b280-652b1bbbc960', 'bored', '/bɔːd/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy buồn tẻ, không có hứng thú.', 'feeling unhappy or tired because something is not interesting or you have nothing to do.', 'The children were bored with nothing to do during the long car ride.', 'Bọn trẻ cảm thấy buồn chán vì không có gì để làm trong chuyến đi xe dài.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees felt bored during the long presentation about the new office rules.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên cảm thấy nhàm chán trong buổi thuyết trình dài về quy định mới của văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-ljspeech-aa6897a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-cori-aa6897a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bored-e08d15ec.webp', '[\"uninterested\", \"weary\"]', '[\"interested\", \"excited\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bored with something\", \"meaning\": \"chán nản với cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get bored\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên chán nản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"boring\", \"note_vi\": \"Boring tả tính chất sự việc, bored tả cảm xúc con người.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bore\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"boredom\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"boring\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-cori-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru0-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru5-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru6-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru10-aa6897a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru9-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru3-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru7-aa6897a9.mp3\"