('f7e898c9-b1da-5cb0-88e6-3ebf2b6ed0be', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'eedfe70e-a960-5150-98b9-2eda94263a8f', 'baf1cef9-72a9-5710-b280-652b1bbbc960', 'newspaper', '/ˈnjuːzpeɪpə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Ấn phẩm định kỳ in tin tức và bài viết.', 'a printed publication containing news, articles, and advertisements, usually published daily or weekly.', 'Our company was recently featured on the front page of a national newspaper.', 'Công ty chúng tôi gần đây đã được đưa tin trên trang nhất của một tờ báo quốc gia.', '{\"en\": \"The manager read the daily newspaper to check for updates on the local market.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đọc báo hàng ngày để kiểm tra các cập nhật về thị trường địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-ljspeech-29cf0a63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-cori-29cf0a63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/newspaper-d66278f4.webp', '[\"paper\", \"journal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"daily newspaper\", \"meaning\": \"báo hàng ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"read the newspaper\", \"meaning\": \"đọc báo\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-cori-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-aru0-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-aru5-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-aru6-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-aru10-29cf0a63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-aru9-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-aru3-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-aru7-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-aru8-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-aru2-29cf0a63.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-ljspeech-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-lt408-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-lt138-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-lt624-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-lt396-29cf0a63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-lt498-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-lt132-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-lt288-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-lt42-29cf0a63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/newspaper-lt90-29cf0a63.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng kèm với mạo từ \'the\'.', 'media', 1, 2),
('cec5fa21-dd6f-5d50-a5de-81d34a78779c', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'eedfe70e-a960-5150-98b9-2eda94263a8f', 'baf1cef9-72a9-5710-b280-652b1bbbc960', 'park', '/pɑːk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Khu đất rộng có cây xanh và tiện ích công cộng để thư giãn.', 'a large open area with grass and trees, especially in a town, where people can relax.', 'We often go to the park on weekends to play sports.', 'Chúng tôi thường đến công viên vào cuối tuần để chơi thể thao.', '{\"en\": \"The company is planning to build a new office complex near the city park.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang lên kế hoạch xây dựng một khu phức hợp văn phòng mới gần công viên thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-ljspeech-ce4151ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-cori-ce4151ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/park-d18dc649.webp', '[\"garden\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"national park\", \"meaning\": \"vườn quốc gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amusement park\", \"meaning\": \"công viên giải trí\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"park\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"parking\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-cori-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-aru0-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-aru5-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-aru6-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-aru10-ce4151ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-aru9-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-aru3-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-aru7-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-aru8-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-aru2-ce4151ff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-ljspeech-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-lt408-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-lt138-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-lt624-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-lt396-ce4151ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-lt498-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-lt132-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-lt288-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-lt42-ce4151ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/park-lt90-ce4151ff.mp3\"]}}', '', 'nature', 1, 3),
('c97cf6e8-7bfb-5a27-ba14-a6526f17f80c', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'eedfe70e-a960-5150-98b9-2eda94263a8f', 'baf1cef9-72a9-5710-b280-652b1bbbc960', 'ever', '/ˈevə(r)/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Vào bất kỳ thời điểm nào; đã từng.', 'at any time in the past, present, or future, often used in questions.', 'This is the most efficient software solution our IT team has ever developed.', 'Đây là giải pháp phần mềm hiệu quả nhất mà đội ngũ IT của chúng tôi từng phát triển.', '{\"en\": \"Have you ever worked with this specific accounting software in your previous jobs?\", \"vi\": \"Bạn đã bao giờ làm việc với phần mềm kế toán cụ thể này ở các công việc trước chưa?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-ljspeech-55472e53.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-cori-55472e53.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ever-d1ab94e5.webp', '[\"always\"]', '[\"never\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hardly ever\", \"meaning\": \"hầu như không bao giờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ever since\", \"meaning\": \"kể từ đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"never\", \"note_vi\": \"ever mang nghĩa đã từng/bao giờ, never là chưa từng/không bao giờ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-cori-55472e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-aru0-55472e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-aru5-55472e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-aru6-55472e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-aru10-55472e53.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-aru9-55472e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-aru3-55472e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-aru7-55472e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-aru8-55472e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ever-aru2-55472e53.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pr