('9ac0e62e-fd56-5074-932e-fd6463ec2d6a', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'eedfe70e-a960-5150-98b9-2eda94263a8f', 'baf1cef9-72a9-5710-b280-652b1bbbc960', 'doctor', '/ˈdɒktə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Người làm nghề y để chữa bệnh.', 'a trained practitioner who gives medical treatment to people who are sick.', 'I have an appointment with the doctor next Tuesday.', 'Tôi có hẹn với bác sĩ vào thứ Ba tới.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a qualified doctor to provide annual health checkups for staff.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một bác sĩ có chuyên môn để kiểm tra sức khỏe hàng năm cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-ljspeech-1f016007.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-cori-1f016007.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/doctor-83c31124.webp', '[\"physician\", \"medical practitioner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"see a doctor\", \"meaning\": \"đi khám bác sĩ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"family doctor\", \"meaning\": \"bác sĩ gia đình\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"doctorate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"doctoral\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-cori-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru0-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru5-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru6-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru10-1f016007.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru9-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru3-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru7-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru8-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru2-1f016007.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-ljspeech-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-lt408-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-lt138-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-lt624-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-lt396-1f016007.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-lt498-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-lt132-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-lt288-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-lt42-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-lt90-1f016007.mp3\"]}}', 'Doctor vừa chỉ bác sĩ y khoa vừa chỉ tiến sĩ khoa học.', 'health', 1, 6),
('4e42b2db-29ac-5d28-a79b-3f71fcecdd12', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'eedfe70e-a960-5150-98b9-2eda94263a8f', 'baf1cef9-72a9-5710-b280-652b1bbbc960', 'detail', '/ˈdiːteɪl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một phần nhỏ hoặc thông tin cụ thể về một cái gì đó.', 'a small individual piece of information or fact about something.', 'The project manager reviewed every detail of the proposal before submitting it.', 'Quản lý dự án đã xem xét từng chi tiết của bản đề xuất trước khi nộp.', '{\"en\": \"Please send the client all the details of the contract before Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng gửi cho khách hàng tất cả chi tiết của hợp đồng trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detail-ljspeech-b7f90d4c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detail-cori-b7f90d4c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/detail-ce7954c5.webp', '[\"particular\", \"specifics\", \"information\"]', '[\"overview\", \"summary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in detail\", \"meaning\": \"một cách chi tiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"further details\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin chi tiết hơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"detail-oriented\", \"meaning\": \"chú trọng chi tiết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"detailed\", \"note_vi\": \"detailed là tính từ nghĩa \'chi tiết\', còn detail là danh từ hoặc động từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"detailed\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"detail\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detail-cori-b7f90d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detail-aru0-b7f90d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detail-aru5-b7f90d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detail-aru6-b7f90d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detail-aru10-b7f90d4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detail-aru9-b7f90d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detail-aru3-b7f90d4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public