('7da9c18d-ebf6-5ced-a437-73f6d8e727e0', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'eedfe70e-a960-5150-98b9-2eda94263a8f', 'baf1cef9-72a9-5710-b280-652b1bbbc960', 'continue', 'UK: /kənˈtɪnjuː/ | US: /kənˈtɪnjuː/', 'A1', 'verb', 'tiếp tục (hành động, trạng thái)', 'to keep doing an activity or remain in a particular state without stopping.', 'We will continue to offer excellent customer service throughout the holiday season.', 'Chúng tôi sẽ tiếp tục cung cấp dịch vụ khách hàng xuất sắc trong suốt mùa lễ hội.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors decided to continue investing in renewable energy projects.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị quyết định tiếp tục đầu tư vào các dự án năng lượng tái tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-ljspeech-eee0bbba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-cori-eee0bbba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/continue-fd9c75d5.webp', '[\"proceed\", \"resume\", \"carry on\", \"persist\"]', '[\"stop\", \"discontinue\", \"cease\", \"halt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"continue to grow\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tục tăng trưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"continue operations\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tục các hoạt động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"discontinue\", \"note_vi\": \"Discontinue nghĩa là ngừng hẳn, ngưng cung cấp dịch vụ hoặc ngừng sản xuất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"continual\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"continuous\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"continuation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-cori-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru0-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru5-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru6-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru10-eee0bbba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru9-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru3-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru7-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru8-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru2-eee0bbba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-ljspeech-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt408-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt138-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt624-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt396-eee0bbba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt498-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt132-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt288-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt42-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt90-eee0bbba.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể đi với cả động từ nguyên mẫu có \'to\' (continue to do) hoặc V-ing (continue doing) với nghĩa tương đương.', 'management', 1, 25)
