('124da010-ee50-5194-b84d-5b48588ba327', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'ef9a1bf4-045a-5f2d-9597-b60b36ba944a', 'd169e348-440f-5b71-8b7a-61be8024e61e', 'snake', '/sneɪk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loài bò sát không chân, thân dài, có vảy, một số loài có nọc độc.', 'a long, thin animal without legs that moves by sliding on the ground.', 'Be careful when hiking in the mountains; you might encounter a snake.', 'Hãy cẩn thận khi đi bộ đường dài trên núi; bạn có thể gặp một con rắn.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team found a snake near the warehouse during the morning inspection.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã tìm thấy một con rắn gần kho hàng trong lúc kiểm tra buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-ljspeech-14862708.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-cori-14862708.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/snake-af9d2443.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-cori-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru0-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru5-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru6-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru10-14862708.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru9-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru3-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru7-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru8-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru2-14862708.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-ljspeech-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt408-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt138-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/