('6b08fdaf-a8a4-5256-81d0-0a27b7a9ced5', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'handbag', 'UK: /ˈhænd.bæɡ/ | US: /ˈhænd.bæɡ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'túi xách (tay)', 'a small container used by women to carry personal items like money.', 'She placed her phone in her handbag.', 'Cô ấy đặt điện thoại vào túi xách của mình.', '{\"en\": \"She left her leather handbag on the chair in the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy đã để quên chiếc túi xách da trên ghế trong phòng họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-ljspeech-7e1898c3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-cori-7e1898c3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/handbag-f7c938ce.webp', '[\"purse\", \"bag\", \"pouch\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"leather handbag\", \"meaning\": \"túi xách bằng da\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carry a handbag\", \"meaning\": \"mang theo túi xách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"backpack\", \"note_vi\": \"Balo đeo trên lưng thay vì túi xách tay.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-cori-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-aru0-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-aru5-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-aru6-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-aru10-7e1898c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-aru9-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-aru3-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-aru7-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-aru8-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-aru2-7e1898c3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-ljspeech-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-lt408-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-lt138-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-lt624-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-lt396-7e1898c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-lt498-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-lt132-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-lt288-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-lt42-7e1898c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handbag-lt90-7e1898c3.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong Tiếng Anh-Anh (UK), còn Tiếng Anh-Mỹ (US) thường gọi là \'purse\'.', 'retail', 1, 2),
('e9fec74a-5ba1-5b3e-8794-e737e486f21a', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'restaurant', '/ˈrestrɒnt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nơi bán và phục vụ đồ ăn thức uống.', 'a place where people pay to sit and eat meals that are cooked there.', 'We decided to try that new Italian restaurant downtown for dinner.', 'Chúng tôi quyết định thử nhà hàng Ý mới ở trung tâm thành phố để ăn tối.', '{\"en\": \"The manager booked a table at a local restaurant for the business dinner.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đặt một bàn tại một nhà hàng địa phương cho bữa tối kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-ljspeech-32ac991d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-cori-32ac991d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/restaurant-c321bf12.webp', '[\"eatery\", \"bistro\", \"diner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fancy restaurant\", \"meaning\": \"nhà hàng sang trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"restaurant chain\", \"meaning\": \"chuỗi nhà hàng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-cori-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-aru0-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-aru5-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-aru6-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-aru10-32ac991d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-aru9-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-aru3-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-aru7-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-aru8-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-aru2-32ac991d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-ljspeech-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-lt408-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-lt138-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-lt624-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-lt396-32ac991d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-lt498-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-lt132-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-lt288-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-lt42-32ac991d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restaurant-lt90-32ac991d.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý cách viết chính tả của từ này, rất dễ viết sai chữ \'au\'.', 'dining', 1, 3),
('cfeb2a92-b794-5f03-9bd1-68257ca538a0', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'afternoon', '/ˌɑːftəˈnuːn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'khoảng thời gian từ trưa đến tối.', 'the part of the day between twelve o\'clock in the middle and evening.', 'We usually have a coffee break in the late afternoon.', 'Chúng tôi thường có một buổi giải lao uống cà phê vào cuối buổi chiều.', '{\"en\": \"The board meeting will take place tomorrow afternoon in the main conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị sẽ diễn ra vào chiều mai tại phòng hội nghị chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-ljspeech-7a10f399.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-cori-7a10f399.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/afternoon-9ac49d99.webp', NULL, '[\"morning\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"this afternoon\", \"meaning\": \"chiều nay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in the afternoon\", \"meaning\": \"vào buổi chiều\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-cori-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-aru0-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-aru5-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-aru6-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-aru10-7a10f399.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-aru9-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-aru3-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-aru7-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-aru8-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-aru2-7a10f399.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-ljspeech-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-lt408-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-lt138-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-lt624-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-lt396-7a10f399.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-lt498-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-lt132-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-lt288-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-lt42-7a10f399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afternoon-lt90-7a10f399.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng \'in the afternoon\', nhưng không dùng giới từ trước \'this afternoon\' hay \'tomorrow afternoon\'.', 'office', 1, 4),
('eabdb4c7-65eb-5ee0-be65-3e068e15d19a', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'other', '/ˈʌðə(r)/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Không phải cái này, cái đó; còn lại.', 'being different from the one already mentioned or known to the speaker.', 'Do you have any other questions for me?', 'Bạn có câu hỏi nào khác dành cho tôi không?', '{\"en\": \"The other candidate has more experience in managing large teams for this project.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên khác có nhiều kinh nghiệm hơn trong việc quản lý các nhóm lớn cho dự án này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-ljspeech-d0941e68.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-cori-d0941e68.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/other-5d727583.webp', '[\"alternative\", \"additional\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"the other day\", \"meaning\": \"hôm nọ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on the other hand\", \"meaning\": \"mặt khác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"another\", \"note_vi\": \"another dùng cho số ít không xác định, other dùng cho số nhiều hoặc xác định.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-cori-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-aru0-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-aru5-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-aru6-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-aru10-d0941e68.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-aru9-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-aru3-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-aru7-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-aru8-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-aru2-d0941e68.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-ljspeech-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-lt408-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-lt138-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-lt624-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-lt396-d0941e68.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-lt498-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-lt132-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-lt288-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-lt42-d0941e68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/other-lt90-d0941e68.mp3\"]}}', 'dùng \'the other\' khi chỉ còn một lựa chọn cuối cùng.', 'business', 1, 5),
('d22179bb-c37e-58b4-a470-21a31f9fd5cc', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'practice', '/ˈpræktɪs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động lặp đi lặp lại để cải thiện kỹ năng.', 'the act of doing something regularly to improve your ability or skill in it.', 'Regular practice is essential if you want to master a musical instrument.', 'Luyện tập thường xuyên là điều cần thiết nếu bạn muốn thành thạo một nhạc cụ.', '{\"en\": \"Regular practice of presentation skills will help you feel more confident during client meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Việc luyện tập kỹ năng thuyết trình thường xuyên sẽ giúp bạn tự tin hơn trong các cuộc họp khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-ljspeech-e17674f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-cori-e17674f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/practice-cc83c623.webp', '[\"training\", \"exercise\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"put into practice\", \"meaning\": \"đưa vào thực tiễn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"daily practice\", \"meaning\": \"luyện tập hàng ngày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"practise\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Practise\' là động từ, \'practice\' là danh từ (Anh-Anh).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"practise\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-cori-e17674f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-aru0-e17674f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-aru5-e17674f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-aru6-e17674f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-aru10-e17674f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-aru9-e17674f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-aru3-e17674f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practice-aru7-e17674f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati