('716d0fa1-1ea4-53f2-b9b7-8a3e51324b15', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'buy', 'UK: /baɪ/ | US: /baɪ/', 'A1', 'verb', 'mua', 'to obtain goods, property, or services by paying money for them', 'We plan to buy new office furniture next month.', 'Chúng tôi dự định mua đồ nội thất văn phòng mới vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The purchasing department decided to buy office supplies in bulk to secure a volume discount.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận thu mua đã quyết định mua văn phòng phẩm số lượng lớn để có được chiết khấu theo số lượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-ljspeech-a066f070.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-cori-a066f070.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/buy-aafe1bfc.webp', '[\"purchase\", \"acquire\", \"procure\"]', '[\"sell\", \"vend\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"buy in bulk\", \"meaning\": \"mua số lượng lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"buy online\", \"meaning\": \"mua hàng trực tuyến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"by\", \"note_vi\": \"bởi / cạnh bên\"}, {\"word\": \"bye\", \"note_vi\": \"tạm biệt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"buyer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"buy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-cori-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-aru0-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-aru5-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-aru6-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-aru10-a066f070.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-aru9-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-aru3-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-aru7-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-aru8-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-aru2-a066f070.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-ljspeech-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-lt408-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-lt138-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-lt624-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-lt396-a066f070.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-lt498-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-lt132-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-lt288-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-lt42-a066f070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buy-lt90-a066f070.mp3\"]}}', 'Cột V2/V3 của \'buy\' là \'bought\'. Đi với \'in bulk\' nghĩa là mua sỉ số lượng lớn.', 'shopping', 1, 7),
('678daeae-f982-50f7-a8c5-21892d2ea801', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'final', '/ˈfaɪnl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Là cái cuối cùng trong một chuỗi, không còn cái nào nữa.', 'happening at the end of a process or series of events.', 'This is the final warning before we take further action.', 'Đây là lời cảnh báo cuối cùng trước khi chúng tôi thực hiện hành động tiếp theo.', '{\"en\": \"The final report must be submitted to the manager before the end of the day.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo cuối cùng phải được nộp cho quản lý trước khi kết thúc ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-ljspeech-d594c2cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-cori-d594c2cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/final-03d7c039.webp', '[\"last\", \"ultimate\"]', '[\"initial\", \"first\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"final decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định cuối cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"final result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả cuối cùng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fine\", \"note_vi\": \"fine nghĩa là tốt hoặc tiền phạt, khác hẳn final.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"finally\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"finalize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-cori-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru0-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru5-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru6-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru10-d594c2cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru9-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru3-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru7-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru8-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc