('98ce4545-cb92-5231-8f28-f0743d8b7e27', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'arm', '/ɑːm/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bộ phận cơ thể từ vai đến bàn tay.', 'either of the two long parts of the upper body between the shoulder and the hand.', 'She carried her baby in her arms.', 'Cô ấy bế con mình trong vòng tay.', '{\"en\": \"The factory worker injured his arm while operating the heavy machinery yesterday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân nhà máy đã bị thương ở cánh tay khi vận hành máy móc hạng nặng sáng qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-ljspeech-ed945d6b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-cori-ed945d6b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arm-ba389beb.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"arm in arm\", \"meaning\": \"khoác tay nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upper arm\", \"meaning\": \"cánh tay trên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hand\", \"note_vi\": \"hand là bàn tay, arm là cả cánh tay từ vai đến cổ tay\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"arm\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-cori-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru0-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru5-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru6-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru10-ed945d6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru9-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru3-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru7-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru8-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru2-ed945d6b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-ljspeech-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt