('a2431572-eb11-5980-bd23-9bf4b087bcb5', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'difference', '/ˈdɪfrəns/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Sự không giống nhau giữa hai hoặc nhiều thứ.', 'the way in which two or more people or things are not the same.', 'There is a big difference between knowing and understanding.', 'Có một sự khác biệt lớn giữa việc biết và việc hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"There is a significant difference in price between the two software packages.\", \"vi\": \"Có một sự khác biệt lớn về giá giữa hai gói phần mềm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difference-ljspeech-48d53c6e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difference-cori-48d53c6e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/difference-be517532.webp', '[\"distinction\", \"dissimilarity\", \"variation\"]', '[\"similarity\", \"likeness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make a difference\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra sự khác biệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tell the difference\", \"meaning\": \"phân biệt sự khác nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"discrepancy\", \"note_vi\": \"discrepancy là sự khác biệt, không nhất quán giữa các số liệu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"different\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"differ\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"differently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difference-cori-48d53c6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difference-aru0-48d53c6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difference-aru5-48d53c6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difference-aru6-48d53c6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difference-aru10-48d53c6e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difference-aru9-48d53c6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difference-aru3-48d53c6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dif