('c2038990-a9e1-5305-bf0f-ce9ad1830547', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'heat', 'UK: /ˈhiːtɪŋ/ | US: /ˈhiːtɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'hệ thống sưởi, việc sưởi ấm', 'Warmth provided by a system designed to make an indoor space warm and comfortable.', 'The building\'s heating system needs repair.', 'Hệ thống sưởi của tòa nhà cần được sửa chữa.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team was called to turn on the heat in the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã được gọi đến để bật hệ thống sưởi trong phòng hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-ljspeech-853911dc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-cori-853911dc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heat-42a1a8e0.webp', '[\"warmth\", \"heating\"]', '[\"cold\", \"chill\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"turn up the heat\", \"meaning\": \"tăng nhiệt độ sưởi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heat source\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn nhiệt / nguồn sưởi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heater\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Heat\' là hơi nóng/hệ thống sưởi nói chung, còn \'heater\' là thiết bị máy sưởi cụ thể.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"heat\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"heated\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"heater\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-cori-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru0-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru5-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru6-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru10-853911dc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru9-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru3-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru7-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru8-853911dc.