('8332b0b3-54e7-52f3-80e3-2103b66f82ed', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'lion', '/ˈlaɪən/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Loài mèo lớn, ăn thịt, sống ở châu Phi và Ấn Độ, nổi tiếng với bờm.', 'a large wild animal of the cat family that lives in Africa.', 'We saw a majestic lion resting under a tree during our safari trip.', 'Chúng tôi đã nhìn thấy một con sư tử hùng vĩ đang nghỉ dưới gốc cây trong chuyến đi săn.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency organized a safari trip where tourists could see a wild lion.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã tổ chức một chuyến đi dã ngoại nơi du khách có thể nhìn thấy sư tử hoang dã.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-ljspeech-eaf14a01.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-cori-eaf14a01.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lion-96cc3af3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pride of lions\", \"meaning\": \"đàn sư tử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lion cub\", \"meaning\": \"sư tử con\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-cori-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-aru0-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-aru5-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-aru6-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-aru10-eaf14a01.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-aru9-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-aru3-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-aru7-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-aru8-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-aru2-eaf14a01.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-ljspeech-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-lt408-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-lt138-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-lt624-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-lt396-eaf14a01.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-lt498-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-lt132-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-lt288-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-lt42-eaf14a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lion-lt90-eaf14a01.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ \'the lion\'s share\' (phần lớn nhất) thỉnh thoảng xuất hiện trong bài thi đọc.', 'travel', 1, 17),
('7df746bc-fc2b-5692-ba83-f38c437effc7', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'tell', '/tɛl/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Kể, nói cho ai đó biết điều gì.', 'to give information or express thoughts to someone by using spoken or written words.', 'Can you tell me the way to the nearest bus station?', 'Bạn có thể chỉ cho tôi đường đến trạm xe buýt gần nhất được không?', '{\"en\": \"Please tell the manager about the delay in the shipment of our new supplies.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng thông báo cho quản lý về sự chậm trễ trong lô hàng cung ứng mới của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-ljspeech-47b8015d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-cori-47b8015d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tell-b1a35e2e.webp', '[\"inform\", \"state\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tell the truth\", \"meaning\": \"nói sự thật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tell a story\", \"meaning\": \"kể một câu chuyện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"say\", \"note_vi\": \"Tell cần tân ngữ chỉ người (tell me), say thì không cần.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"telling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-cori-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-aru0-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-aru5-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-aru6-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-aru10-47b8015d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-aru9-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-aru3-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-aru7-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-aru8-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-aru2-47b8015d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-ljspeech-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-lt408-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-lt138-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-lt624-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-lt396-47b8015d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-lt498-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-lt132-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-lt288-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-lt42-47b8015d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-lt90-47b8015d.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: tell + someone + (that) + clause.', 'office', 1, 18),
('4d198d8c-bd6a-5936-8467-f7410aba7eda', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'son', '/sʌn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'người con giới tính nam của một cặp cha mẹ', 'a male child in relation to his parents.', 'My son is learning to play the piano.', 'Con trai tôi đang học chơi đàn piano.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO\'s son joined the company as a junior marketing assistant last week.\", \"vi\": \"Con trai của giám đốc điều hành đã gia nhập công ty với tư cách trợ lý marketing cấp dưới tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-ljspeech-f0cbc0ee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-cori-f0cbc0ee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/son-7f599a97.webp', '[\"boy\", \"male child\"]', '[\"daughter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eldest son\", \"meaning\": \"con trai cả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"only son\", \"meaning\": \"con trai một\"}, {\"phrase\": \"son-in-law\", \"meaning\": \"con rể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sun\", \"note_vi\": \"sun là mặt trời, phát âm giống son nhưng nghĩa hoàn toàn khác\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-cori-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-aru0-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-aru5-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-aru6-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-aru10-f0cbc0ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-aru9-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-aru3-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-aru7-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-aru8-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-aru2-f0cbc0ee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-ljspeech-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-lt408-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-lt138-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-lt624-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-lt396-f0cbc0ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-lt498-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-lt132-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-lt288-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-lt42-f0cbc0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/son-lt90-f0cbc0ee.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận phát âm: son /sʌn/ và sun /sʌn/ giống nhau, phân biệt qua ngữ cảnh.', 'daily', 1, 19),
('f9c8374b-5ce9-5989-86d1-c847fbd269dc', '9adb6452-11a5-5b18-bb10-e71549f348f5', 'fa1e82d7-e931-58b9-917e-a49164daf792', 'e8e21ead-01f7-5474-949b-bf61ef5c77aa', 'town', '/taʊn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khu vực dân cư lớn hơn làng nhưng nhỏ hơn thành phố.', 'a place where people live and work that is larger than a village but smaller than a city.', 'Our small town has a beautiful park in the center.', 'Thị trấn nhỏ của chúng tôi có một công viên đẹp ở trung tâm.', '{\"en\": \"Our company plans to open a new branch in a small town near the airport.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi dự định mở một chi nhánh mới tại một thị trấn nhỏ gần sân bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-ljspeech-0cd0b192.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-cori-0cd0b192.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/town-3b639c31.webp', '[\"community\", \"municipality\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"small town\", \"meaning\": \"thị trấn nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in town\", \"meaning\": \"trong thị trấn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-cori-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-aru0-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-aru5-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-aru6-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-aru10-0cd0b192.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-aru9-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-aru3-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-aru7-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-aru8-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-aru2-0cd0b192.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-ljspeech-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/town-lt408-0cd0b192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/