('fcd8b675-e288-53d4-a30b-4dcab9cd86f2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '0d8fd286-2cd1-5ba5-b581-bd8dc0c36794', '07429b81-3344-5b7d-808e-ba48c3e7c3e4', 'bone', '/bəʊn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một trong những phần cứng tạo nên bộ xương của cơ thể.', 'any of the hard parts that form the frame inside the body of a human or animal.', 'The x-ray showed that the patient had broken a bone in his leg.', 'Hình chụp X-quang cho thấy bệnh nhân đã bị gãy một xương ở chân.', '{\"en\": \"The medical clinic purchased a new scanner to check bone density in elderly patients.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng khám y tế đã mua một máy quét mới để kiểm tra mật độ xương ở bệnh nhân lớn tuổi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-ljspeech-ffdf4ccb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-cori-ffdf4ccb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bone-671412f1.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"broken bone\", \"meaning\": \"xương bị gãy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bone density\", \"meaning\": \"mật độ xương\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bony\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-cori-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru0-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru5-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru6-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru10-ffdf4ccb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru9-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru3-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru7-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru8-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru2-ffdf4ccb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-ljspeech-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation