('6ecfb50f-01c8-56f9-b400-70c52dae2543', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '0d8fd286-2cd1-5ba5-b581-bd8dc0c36794', '07429b81-3344-5b7d-808e-ba48c3e7c3e4', 'continue', '/kənˈtɪnjuː/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Tiếp diễn một hành động hoặc trạng thái mà không dừng lại.', 'To maintain an action or state without interruption, or resume after a brief delay.', 'We will continue our discussion after a short break.', 'Chúng ta sẽ tiếp tục cuộc thảo luận sau một thời gian nghỉ ngắn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked the team to continue the project after the lunch break.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý yêu cầu nhóm tiếp tục dự án sau giờ nghỉ trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-ljspeech-eee0bbba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-cori-eee0bbba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/continue-fd9c75d5.webp', '[\"proceed\", \"carry on\", \"persist\"]', '[\"stop\", \"cease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"continue working\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tục làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"continue a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tục cuộc họp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"continue to improve\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tục cải thiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"continual\", \"note_vi\": \"continual: lặp đi lặp lại; continuous: không gián đoạn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"continuation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"continuous\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"continuously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-cori-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru0-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru5-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru6-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru10-eee0bbba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru9-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru3-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru7-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru8-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-aru2-eee0bbba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-ljspeech-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt408-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt138-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt624-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt396-eee0bbba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt498-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt132-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt288-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt42-eee0bbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continue-lt90-eee0bbba.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ: continue + V-ing hoặc continue + to V đều đúng ngữ pháp.', 'office', 2, 17),
('4b2fe7e6-f672-5a52-95d7-f913294be2e8', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '0d8fd286-2cd1-5ba5-b581-bd8dc0c36794', '07429b81-3344-5b7d-808e-ba48c3e7c3e4', 'public', '/ˈpʌblɪk/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về hoặc dành cho tất cả mọi người, không riêng ai.', 'provided for or available to all people in a community.', 'The library is a public space where everyone can read and study.', 'Thư viện là một không gian công cộng nơi mọi người đều có thể đọc và học.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are encouraged to use public transportation to reduce office parking congestion.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được khuyến khích sử dụng phương tiện giao thông công cộng để giảm ùn tắc bãi đỗ xe văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-ljspeech-61c9b2b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-cori-61c9b2b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/public-48524a12.webp', '[\"communal\", \"civic\"]', '[\"private\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"public transport\", \"meaning\": \"giao thông công cộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public sector\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ công\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"public\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"publicly\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"publicize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-cori-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-aru0-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-aru5-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-aru6-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-aru10-61c9b2b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-aru9-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-aru3-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-aru7-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-aru8-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-aru2-61c9b2b1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-ljspeech-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-lt408-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-lt138-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-lt624-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-lt396-61c9b2b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-lt498-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-lt132-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-lt288-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-lt42-61c9b2b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-lt90-61c9b2b1.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa hoàn toàn với private (tư nhân, riêng tư).', 'travel', 2, 18),
('ac5e1339-d0fe-5718-9f5a-7cfa48fd8773', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '0d8fd286-2cd1-5ba5-b581-bd8dc0c36794', '07429b81-3344-5b7d-808e-ba48c3e7c3e4', 'rise', '/raɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Di chuyển lên cao hoặc tăng lên.', 'to increase in amount, number, or level, especially in prices or temperatures.', 'The sun began to rise above the horizon, painting the sky with colors.', 'Mặt trời bắt đầu mọc trên đường chân trời, tô điểm bầu trời bằng những sắc màu.', '{\"en\": \"The price of raw materials will rise significantly due to the high demand in the market.\", \"vi\": \"Giá nguyên vật liệu sẽ tăng đáng kể do nhu cầu cao trên thị trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-ljspeech-e5edb94e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-cori-e5edb94e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rise-d3cf6e83.webp', '[\"increase\", \"grow\"]', '[\"fall\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"price rise\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rise in demand\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng nhu cầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"raise\", \"note_vi\": \"Thường dùng để nói về giá cả hoặc mức độ tăng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rising\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-cori-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru0-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru5-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru6-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru10-e5edb94e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru9-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru3-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru7-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru8-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru2-e5edb94e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v