('c139bb42-8885-529f-8ed1-19b0fdf4521b', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '0d8fd286-2cd1-5ba5-b581-bd8dc0c36794', '07429b81-3344-5b7d-808e-ba48c3e7c3e4', 'atmosphere', 'UK: /ˈætməsfɪə/ | US: /ˈætməsfɪr/', 'B1', 'noun', 'bầu không khí', 'the mood or general feeling present in a particular environment or social place.', 'The office has a very positive and supportive atmosphere.', 'Văn phòng có một bầu không khí rất tích cực và hỗ trợ.', '{\"en\": \"The new office design aims to create a more collaborative and relaxed working atmosphere.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế văn phòng mới nhằm tạo ra một bầu không khí làm việc hợp tác và thoải mái hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-ljspeech-ffa2fbc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-cori-ffa2fbc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/atmosphere-61b92450.webp', '[\"ambiance\", \"environment\", \"mood\", \"climate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"friendly atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí thân thiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"working atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường/không khí làm việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"atmospheric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-cori-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru0-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru5-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru6-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru10-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru9-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru3-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru7-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru8-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru2-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-ljspeech-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt408-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt138-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt624-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt396-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt498-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt132-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt288-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt42-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt90-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, từ này ít khi chỉ bầu khí quyển Trái Đất mà thường chỉ bầu không khí hoặc môi trường làm việc (\'work atmosphere\').', 'office', 1, 25),
('3db67f04-1aa2-579f-8c70-b6e170347169', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '0d8fd286-2cd1-5ba5-b581-bd8dc0c36794', '07429b81-3344-5b7d-808e-ba48c3e7c3e4', 'fashion', '/ˈfæʃn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Phong cách ăn mặc, làm đẹp thịnh hành tại một thời điểm.', 'a prevailing mode or trend in dress, appearance, or personal habits.', 'The new clothing line was inspired by classic European fashion of the 1920s.', 'Dòng quần áo mới được lấy cảm hứng từ thời trang châu Âu cổ điển những năm 1920.', '{\"en\": \"The retailer launched a new fashion line to attract younger consumers this season.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà bán lẻ đã ra mắt một dòng thời trang mới nhằm thu hút người tiêu dùng trẻ hơn trong mùa này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-ljspeech-ed421c35.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-cori-ed421c35.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fashion-0d46408a.webp', '[\"style\", \"trend\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"in fashion\", \"meaning\": \"đang hợp thời trang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"out of fashion\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi mốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fashion industry\", \"meaning\": \"ngành thời trang\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fashionable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fashionably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-cori-ed421c35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-aru0-ed421c35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-aru5-ed421c35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-aru6-ed421c35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-aru10-ed421c35.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-aru9-ed421c35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-aru3-ed421c35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-aru7-ed421c35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fashion-aru8-ed421