('0ee3d4eb-5f85-51db-a928-6124c891be4d', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '10a9dedd-23fd-5131-a49d-e7cbb7941c18', 'edee1df6-4c9c-5f6c-8591-da15d8ff32cf', 'moon', '/muːn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiên thể tự nhiên quay quanh Trái Đất, phát sáng vào ban đêm.', 'the large round object that shines in the night sky above the earth.', 'Astronauts collected rock samples during their historic mission to the moon.', 'Các nhà phi hành gia đã thu thập các mẫu đá trong chuyến sứ mệnh lịch sử tới mặt trăng.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a beautiful terrace where guests can view the moon at night.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp một sân thượng tuyệt đẹp nơi khách có thể ngắm mặt trăng vào ban đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-ljspeech-46dcd4dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-cori-46dcd4dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/moon-1d494c77.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"full moon\", \"meaning\": \"trăng tròn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"moonlight\", \"meaning\": \"ánh trăng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-cori-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru0-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru5-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru6-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru10-46dcd4dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru9-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru3-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru7-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru8-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru2-46dcd4dd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-ljspeech-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-lt408-46dcd4dd.mp3