('21005e27-2236-502b-a111-99be16a62787', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '10a9dedd-23fd-5131-a49d-e7cbb7941c18', 'edee1df6-4c9c-5f6c-8591-da15d8ff32cf', 'source', '/sɔːs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nơi bắt đầu, xuất phát của một cái gì đó.', 'An origin or starting point from which information, water, or energy is provided.', 'The journalist refused to reveal the source of her information.', 'Nhà báo từ chối tiết lộ nguồn thông tin của cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"We need to identify the primary source of the error in our monthly financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần xác định nguồn gốc chính gây ra lỗi trong báo cáo tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-ljspeech-828d338a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-cori-828d338a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/source-ec1eb090.webp', '[\"origin\", \"root\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"source of income\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn thu nhập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reliable source\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn tin cậy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sauce\", \"note_vi\": \"sauce là nước sốt, source là nguồn. Phát âm khác nhau.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"source\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-cori-828d338a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-aru0-828d338a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-aru5-828d338a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-aru6-828d338a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-aru10-828d338a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-aru9-828d338a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-aru3-828d338a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-aru7-828d338a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-aru8-828d338a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/source-aru2-828d338a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st