('31c4d70f-470c-57cc-9050-b7dee8b6a760', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '10a9dedd-23fd-5131-a49d-e7cbb7941c18', 'edee1df6-4c9c-5f6c-8591-da15d8ff32cf', 'notice', '/ˈnəʊtɪs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một thông điệp hoặc bảng hiệu công khai cung cấp thông tin.', 'a written or printed statement that gives information to people about a future event.', 'There was a notice on the bulletin board about the upcoming meeting.', 'Có một thông báo trên bảng tin về cuộc họp sắp tới.', '{\"en\": \"Please read the notice regarding the new office hours posted on the main entrance door.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đọc thông báo về giờ làm việc mới được dán trên cửa lối vào chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-ljspeech-a81b09d9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-cori-a81b09d9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/notice-a9eee487.webp', '[\"announcement\", \"warning\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"give notice\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra thông báo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"short notice\", \"meaning\": \"thông báo gấp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"notify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-cori-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-aru0-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-aru5-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-aru6-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-aru10-a81b09d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-aru9-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-aru3-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-aru7-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-aru8-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-aru2-a81b09d9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-ljspeech-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-lt408-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-lt138-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-lt624-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-lt396-a81b09d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-lt498-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-lt132-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-lt288-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-lt42-a81b09d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notice-lt90-a81b09d9.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công sở, \'give notice\' thường có nghĩa là nộp đơn xin nghỉ việc.', 'office', 2, 8),
