('6419646a-9121-5ae6-9b0b-30c145aebcef', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'shoulder', '/ˈʃəʊldə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Phần cơ thể nối cánh tay với thân mình.', 'the part of the body between the neck and the top of the arm.', 'The athlete felt a sharp pain in her right shoulder while playing tennis.', 'Vận động viên cảm thấy đau nhói ở vai phải khi đang chơi quần vợt.', '{\"en\": \"The heavy box was too much for him to carry on his shoulder alone.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc hộp nặng quá sức để anh ấy có thể mang trên vai một mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-ljspeech-a460abdc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-cori-a460abdc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shoulder-f87c3746.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shoulder the responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"gánh vác trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cold shoulder\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ lạnh nhạt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-cori-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru0-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru5-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru6-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru10-a460abdc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru9-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru3-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru7-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru8-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru2-a460abdc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-ljspeech-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-lt408-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-lt138-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-lt624-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-lt396-a460abdc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-lt498-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-lt132-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-lt288-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-lt42-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-lt90-a460abdc.mp3\"]}}', 'nghĩa bóng thường dùng trong kinh doanh là gánh vác trách nhiệm.', 'daily', 2, 2),
('0c1a2bd4-8dbf-5d1b-93a5-3bffcba2d3a4', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'analysis', 'UK: /əˈnæləsɪs/ | US: /əˈnæləsɪs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự phân tích', 'the detailed examination of the elements or structure of something to understand it better.', 'The financial analysis revealed some unexpected results.', 'Bản phân tích tài chính đã tiết lộ một số kết quả bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team conducted a thorough market analysis before launching the product.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi đã tiến hành phân tích thị trường kỹ lưỡng trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-ljspeech-36847a29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-cori-36847a29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/analysis-5c551158.webp', '[\"examination\", \"investigation\", \"scrutiny\", \"evaluation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conduct an analysis\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành phân tích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"market analysis\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích thị trường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"analyze\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analyst\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"analytical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-cori-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru0-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru5-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru6-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru10-36847a29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru9-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru3-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru7-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ana