('0c3c366a-27c9-5bc4-85f6-b388c68422e6', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'introduction', '/ˌɪntrəˈdʌkʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động giới thiệu ai đó hoặc một cái gì đó.', 'the act of telling someone the name of another person or explaining a new subject.', 'The book begins with an introduction to the main characters and setting.', 'Cuốn sách bắt đầu bằng phần giới thiệu về các nhân vật chính và bối cảnh.', '{\"en\": \"The training session began with a brief introduction of the new software tools for employees.\", \"vi\": \"Buổi đào tạo bắt đầu với phần giới thiệu ngắn gọn về các công cụ phần mềm mới cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-ljspeech-26aca794.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-cori-26aca794.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/introduction-08ab4c28.webp', '[\"presentation\", \"preface\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make an introduction\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện giới thiệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide an introduction\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp phần giới thiệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"introduce\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-cori-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-aru0-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-aru5-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-aru6-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-aru10-26aca794.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-aru9-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-aru3-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-aru7-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-aru8-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-aru2-26aca794.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-ljspeech-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-lt408-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-lt138-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-lt624-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-lt396-26aca794.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-lt498-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-lt132-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-lt288-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-lt42-26aca794.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduction-lt90-26aca794.mp3\"]}}', 'dùng để chỉ phần mở đầu hoặc hành động làm quen.', 'office', 2, 6),
('a62717f6-5de8-56b6-89d4-dc41ddd91777', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'discussion', '/dɪˈskʌʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cuộc nói chuyện hoặc tranh luận về một chủ đề.', 'a conversation or written exchange about a specific topic to reach a decision.', 'The board members held a detailed discussion regarding next year\'s expansion plans.', 'Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã có một cuộc thảo luận chi tiết liên quan đến kế hoạch mở rộng cho năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"The team had a productive discussion regarding the budget allocation for the next fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm đã có một cuộc thảo luận hiệu quả về việc phân bổ ngân sách cho năm tài chính tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-ljspeech-c255751d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-cori-c255751d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/discussion-b55476ad.webp', '[\"debate\", \"talk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have a discussion\", \"meaning\": \"có một cuộc thảo luận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"group discussion\", \"meaning\": \"thảo luận nhóm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"discuss\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-cori-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru0-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru5-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru6-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru10-c255751d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru9-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru3-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru7-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru8-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru2-c255751d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-ljspeech-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt408-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt138-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt624-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt396-c255751d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt498-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt132-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt288-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt42-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt90-c255751d.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý không dùng \'discuss about\', chỉ dùng \'discuss something\'.', 'office', 2, 7),
('f6e88987-bacc-5a3a-ac62-0365dbb99e88', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'along', '/əˈlɒŋ/', 'A1', 'preposition', 'Dọc theo một đường hoặc bề mặt.', 'in a line next to the length of something such as a road or river.', 'We walked along the riverbank, enjoying the fresh air.', 'Chúng tôi đi bộ dọc bờ sông, tận hưởng không khí trong lành.', '{\"en\": \"We installed the cables along the corridor of the office building yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã lắp đặt các dây cáp dọc theo hành lang của tòa nhà văn phòng vào hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-ljspeech-0956be0d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-cori-0956be0d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/along-9b30db92.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"along the road\", \"meaning\": \"dọc theo con đường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"along with\", \"meaning\": \"cùng với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"come along\", \"meaning\": \"đi cùng/ tiến triển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"alone\", \"note_vi\": \"alone nghĩa là một mình, không có cùng nghĩa dọc theo.\"}, {\"word\": \"long\", \"note_vi\": \"long là tính từ nghĩa dài, khác giới từ along.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-cori-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-aru0-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-aru5-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-aru6-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-aru10-0956be0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-aru9-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-aru3-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-aru7-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-aru8-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-aru2-0956be0d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-ljspeech-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-lt408-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-lt138-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-lt624-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-lt396-0956be0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-lt498-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-lt132-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-lt288-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-lt42-0956be0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/along-lt90-0956be0d.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ phân biệt along (dọc theo) với alone (một mình) và long (dài).', 'office', 2, 8),
('089d8085-9ff3-50fc-b7ad-8537271fa574', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'row', 'UK: /rəʊ/ | US: /roʊ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'hàng, dãy (ghế, cây)', 'A line of people or things arranged next to each other in order.', 'Please sit in the front row for a better view.', 'Vui lòng ngồi hàng ghế đầu để có tầm nhìn tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The chairs in the main auditorium were arranged in neat rows before the seminar started.\", \"vi\": \"Các ghế trong hội trường chính được xếp thành từng hàng gọn gàng trước khi buổi thảo luận bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-ljspeech-e8cdc05b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-cori-e8cdc05b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/row-cd0762e0.webp', '[\"line\", \"tier\", \"file\", \"column\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"front row\", \"meaning\": \"hàng ghế đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in a row\", \"meaning\": \"liên tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"row of seats\", \"meaning\": \"dãy ghế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"raw\", \"note_vi\": \"Row (/roʊ/) nghĩa là hàng/dãy, còn raw (/rɔː/) nghĩa là sống, thô (chưa qua chế biến).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-cori-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru0-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru5-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru6-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru10-e8cdc05b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru9-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru3-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru7-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru8-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru2-e8cdc05b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-ljspeech-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt408-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt138-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt624-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt396-e8cdc05b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt498-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt132-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt288-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt42-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt90-e8cdc05b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt \'in a row\' (liên tiếp nhau) và \'in rows\' (được xếp thành từng hàng).', 'office', 1, 9),
('7d5a5bbd-4f40-52d3-be49-4d12e43b9f04', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'leader', '/ˈliːdə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người dẫn dắt hoặc chỉ huy một nhóm, tổ chức.', 'a person who manages or controls a group of people, an organization, or a country.', 'The new leader promised to bring positive changes to the community.', 'Vị lãnh đạo mới hứa sẽ mang lại những thay đổi tích cực cho cộng đồng.', '{\"en\": \"The project leader will present the final budget report to the board of directors tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng dự án sẽ trình bày báo cáo ngân sách cuối cùng cho ban giám đốc vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-ljspeech-b25f5987.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-cori-b25f5987.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leader-5529900a.webp', '[\"manager\", \"director\", \"head\"]', '[\"follower\", \"subordinate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strong leader\", \"meaning\": \"nhà lãnh đạo mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"political leader\", \"meaning\": \"lãnh đạo chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"team leader\", \"meaning\": \"trưởng nhóm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"manager\", \"note_vi\": \"\'manager\' thiên về quản lý vận hành, \'leader\' thiên về dẫn dắt tinh thần.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"lead\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"leadership\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-cori-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-aru0-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-aru5-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-aru6-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-aru10-b25f5987.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-aru9-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-aru3-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-aru7-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-aru8-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-aru2-b25f5987.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-ljspeech-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-lt408-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-lt138-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-lt624-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-lt396-b25f5987.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-lt498-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-lt132-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-lt288-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-lt42-b25f5987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leader-lt90-b25f5987.mp3\"]}}', '', 'office', 2, 10),
