('7f784ffb-11e5-5516-a715-4e2358edb5dd', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'admit', 'UK: /ədˈmɪt/ | US: /ədˈmɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'thừa nhận', 'to acknowledge or agree that something is true, often reluctantly or unwillingly.', 'She had to admit her mistake.', 'Cô ấy phải thừa nhận sai lầm của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager admitted that the project deadline had been calculated unrealistically.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý thừa nhận rằng thời hạn dự án đã được tính toán thiếu thực tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-ljspeech-4a4f47d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-cori-4a4f47d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/admit-8919f5df.webp', '[\"acknowledge\", \"concede\", \"grant\"]', '[\"deny\", \"reject\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"admit a mistake\", \"meaning\": \"thừa nhận sai lầm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"admit doing something\", \"meaning\": \"thừa nhận đã làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"admittance\", \"note_vi\": \"Admit là động từ thừa nhận/cho vào, còn admittance là danh từ chỉ sự cho phép đi vào một nơi cụ thể.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"admission\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"admissible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-cori-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru0-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru5-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru6-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru10-4a4f47d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru9-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru3-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru7-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru8-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru2-4a4f47d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-ljspeech-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt408-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt138-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt624-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt396-4a4f47d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt498-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt132-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt288-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt42-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt90-4a4f47d5.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: \'admit to doing something\' hoặc \'admit that + clause\'. Đừng quên \'admit\' đi với V-ing chứ không dùng to-V.', 'office', 1, 21),
('a8e3a0cf-01f1-5010-a9e4-71f62137138f', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'gas', '/ɡæs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một chất không có hình dạng hay thể tích cố định.', 'a substance that is not solid or liquid, used for heating or cooking in homes.', 'The car runs on natural gas, which is a cleaner fuel.', 'Chiếc xe chạy bằng khí tự nhiên, một loại nhiên liệu sạch hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant manager decided to switch to electric stoves instead of using natural gas.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý nhà hàng quyết định chuyển sang dùng bếp điện thay vì sử dụng khí đốt tự nhiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-ljspeech-facafa74.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-cori-facafa74.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gas-6f6e4bb0.webp', '[\"fuel\", \"vapor\"]', '[\"solid\", \"liquid\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"natural gas\", \"meaning\": \"khí tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gas station\", \"meaning\": \"trạm xăng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"glass\", \"note_vi\": \"glass là thủy tinh, gas là khí đốt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"gaseous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-cori-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-aru0-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-aru5-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-aru6-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-aru10-facafa74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-aru9-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-aru3-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-aru7-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-aru8-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-aru2-facafa74.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-ljspeech-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-lt408-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-lt138-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-lt624-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-lt396-facafa74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-lt498-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-lt132-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-lt288-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-lt42-facafa74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gas-lt90-facafa74.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở Mỹ, \"gas\" còn có nghĩa là xăng (gasoline).', 'daily', 2, 22),
('368c1a29-e7f8-5231-94dc-f4ed902d576b', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'mine', '/maɪn/', 'A1', 'pronoun', 'Thuộc về tôi, của riêng tôi.', 'the thing or things that belong to the speaker or writer.', 'This is my book, not yours; it\'s mine.', 'Đây là sách của tôi, không phải của bạn; nó là của tôi.', '{\"en\": \"If you cannot find your employee badge, you can borrow mine for today.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu bạn không tìm thấy thẻ nhân viên của mình, bạn có thể mượn cái của tôi hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-ljspeech-8034c43d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-cori-8034c43d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mine-664ce998.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a friend of mine\", \"meaning\": \"một người bạn của tôi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"my\", \"note_vi\": \"My đứng trước danh từ, còn mine đứng một mình làm đại từ sở hữu.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-cori-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-aru0-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-aru5-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-aru6-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-aru10-8034c43d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-aru9-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-aru3-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-aru7-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-aru8-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-aru2-8034c43d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-ljspeech-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-lt408-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-lt138-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-lt624-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-lt396-8034c43d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-lt498-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-lt132-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-lt288-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-lt42-8034c43d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mine-lt90-8034c43d.mp3\"]}}', 'Mine thay thế cho \'my + danh từ\' nên phía sau KHÔNG đi kèm danh từ.', 'office', 2, 23),
('be479b5c-15fc-5387-8b66-6acdf0d0b587', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'grass', '/ɡrɑːs/', 'A1', 'noun', 'cỏ, bãi cỏ', 'a common wild green plant with narrow leaves that covers fields and lawns.', 'The children were playing happily on the soft green grass.', 'Bọn trẻ đang chơi đùa vui vẻ trên bãi cỏ xanh mềm mại.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew is cutting the grass around the corporate headquarters this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đang cắt cỏ xung quanh trụ sở chính của công ty vào sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-ljspeech-bbc29b76.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-cori-bbc29b76.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grass-32a5db56.webp', '[\"lawn\", \"turf\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cut the grass\", \"meaning\": \"cắt cỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"green grass\", \"meaning\": \"cỏ xanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"glass\", \"note_vi\": \"glass là thủy tinh hoặc cái ly, phát âm khác âm r/l\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"grassy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-cori-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-aru0-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-aru5-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-aru6-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-aru10-bbc29b76.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-aru9-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-aru3-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-aru7-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-aru8-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-aru2-bbc29b76.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-ljspeech-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-lt408-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-lt138-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-lt624-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-lt396-bbc29b76.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-lt498-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-lt132-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-lt288-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-lt42-bbc29b76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grass-lt90-bbc29b76.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt phát âm giữa \'grass\' /ɡrɑːs/ và \'glass\' /ɡlɑːs/.', 'housing', 2, 24),
('88ae6fec-a6c8-5d26-9fd3-4aee1b472890', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'oil', '/ɔɪl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Chất lỏng đặc, trơn, không hòa tan trong nước, dùng làm nhiên liệu hoặc bôi trơn.', 'a thick liquid that comes from petroleum or plants, used for fuel or cooking.', 'We use cooking oil to fry eggs in the morning.', 'Chúng tôi dùng dầu ăn để chiên trứng vào buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden rise in global oil prices affected our shipping costs significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Sự gia tăng đột ngột của giá dầu toàn cầu đã ảnh hưởng đáng kể đến chi phí vận chuyển của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-ljspeech-a5f58c39.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-cori-a5f58c39.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oil-e899d6c3.webp', '[\"petroleum\", \"fuel\", \"lubricant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"crude oil\", \"meaning\": \"dầu thô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"oil refinery\", \"meaning\": \"nhà máy lọc dầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"soil\", \"note_vi\": \"soil là đất trồng, oil là dầu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"oily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-cori-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru0-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru5-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru6-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru10-a5f58c39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru9-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru3-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru7-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru8-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru2-a5f58c39.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-ljspeech-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-lt408-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-lt138-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-lt624-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-lt396-a5f58c39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-lt498-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-lt132-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-lt288-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-lt42-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-lt90-a5f58c39.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, oil thường xuất hiện trong bối cảnh giá dầu mỏ hoặc năng lượng.', 'business', 2, 25)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('e5df0be1-dea1-5e97-a2e5-6ce4057748a2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'reaction', 'UK: /riˈæk.ʃən/ | US: /riˈæk.ʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'phản ứng', 'an action, feeling, or behavior produced in response to a particular event or situation.', 'Her reaction to the news was quite surprising.', 'Phản ứng của cô ấy trước tin tức khá bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager\'s initial reaction to the proposal was very positive.\", \"vi\": \"Phản ứng ban đầu của người quản lý đối với đề xuất rất tích cực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-ljspeech-a9043ffe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-cori-a9043ffe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reaction-3086f68c.webp', '[\"response\", \"feedback\", \"reply\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"adverse reaction\", \"meaning\": \"phản ứng bất lợi/tiêu cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chain reaction\", \"meaning\": \"phản ứng dây chuyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in reaction to\", \"meaning\": \"để phản ứng lại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"action\", \"note_vi\": \"\'action\' là hành động chủ động, còn \'reaction\' là phản ứng đáp lại một sự việc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"react\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reactive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-cori-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru0-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru5-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru6-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru10-a9043ffe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru9-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru3-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru7-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru8-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru2-a9043ffe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-ljspeech-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt408-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt138-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt624-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt396-a9043ffe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt498-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt132-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt288-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt42-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt90-a9043ffe.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với giới từ \'to\' (reaction to something), không dùng \'with\' hay \'for\'.', 'management', 1, 26),
('dd5e86f0-7eaa-5e0f-9a3f-2e01b52b1b32', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'product', 'UK: /ˈprɒdʌkt/ | US: /ˈprɑdʌkt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'sản phẩm', 'an item or substance that is manufactured or refined to be sold in market', 'The company launched a new product last week.', 'Công ty đã ra mắt sản phẩm mới vào tuần trước.', '{\"en\": \"Our new product line will be introduced at the upcoming annual trade show.\", \"vi\": \"Dòng sản phẩm mới của chúng tôi sẽ được giới thiệu tại triển lãm thương mại hàng năm sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-ljspeech-38a00715.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-cori-38a00715.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/product-3e6d844c.webp', '[\"item\", \"goods\", \"merchandise\", \"commodity\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"product launch\", \"meaning\": \"buổi ra mắt sản phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"product development\", \"meaning\": \"phát triển sản phẩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"production\", \"note_vi\": \"product là mặt hàng/sản phẩm cụ thể, production là sự/quá trình sản xuất\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"produce\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"production\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"productive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-cori-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-aru0-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-aru5-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-aru6-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-aru10-38a00715.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-aru9-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-aru3-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-aru7-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-aru8-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-aru2-38a00715.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-ljspeech-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-lt408-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-lt138-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-lt624-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-lt396-38a00715.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-lt498-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-lt132-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-lt288-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-lt42-38a00715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/product-lt90-38a00715.mp3\"]}}', '\'product\' chỉ vật phẩm cụ thể được tạo ra để bán, phân biệt với \'production\' (quá trình sản xuất).', 'marketing', 1, 27),
('e955c59e-868b-50ff-a547-2259daea72e7', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'already', '/ɔːlˈredi/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'đã xảy ra hoặc hoàn thành rồi', 'Prior to a specified time or sooner than anticipated by someone.', 'Don\'t worry about dinner; I\'ve already cooked it.', 'Đừng lo lắng về bữa tối; tôi đã nấu xong rồi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager has already approved the budget proposal for the upcoming marketing campaign next month.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã phê duyệt đề xuất ngân sách cho chiến dịch tiếp thị sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-ljspeech-e9bc90ed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-cori-e9bc90ed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/already-b379351d.webp', '[\"previously\", \"beforehand\"]', '[\"not yet\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"already done\", \"meaning\": \"đã làm xong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"already know\", \"meaning\": \"đã biết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"all ready\", \"note_vi\": \"all ready là hoàn toàn sẵn sàng, already là đã rồi.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-cori-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-aru0-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-aru5-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-aru6-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-aru10-e9bc90ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-aru9-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-aru3-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-aru7-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-aru8-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-aru2-e9bc90ed.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-ljspeech-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-lt408-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-lt138-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-lt624-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-lt396-e9bc90ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-lt498-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-lt132-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-lt288-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-lt42-e9bc90ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/already-lt90-e9bc90ed.mp3\"]}}', 'Already dùng trong câu khẳng định, yet dùng trong câu phủ định/nghi vấn.', 'business', 2, 28),
('45f109eb-f952-58fb-8b4a-f4b04ccbab52', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '129b9d6f-0527-54c5-8897-205a72ee467b', '120f3273-2bd5-59e1-b6da-ee88f79b8fb4', 'receive', '/rɪˈsiːv/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Lấy hoặc được đưa cho một cái gì đó.', 'to get or be given something that somebody sends or offers to you.', 'I was happy to receive a letter from my old friend yesterday.', 'Hôm qua tôi rất vui khi nhận được thư từ người bạn cũ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Clients will receive a confirmation email after their online payment is processed successfully.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng sẽ nhận được email xác nhận sau khi thanh toán trực tuyến được xử lý thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-ljspeech-f1655af9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-cori-f1655af9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/receive-5aeaf0bb.webp', '[\"get\", \"obtain\", \"accept\"]', '[\"send\", \"give\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"receive confirmation\", \"meaning\": \"nhận sự xác nhận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"receive payment\", \"meaning\": \"nhận thanh toán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deceive\", \"note_vi\": \"Deceive nghĩa là lừa dối, chỉ khác chữ cái đầu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"receipt\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reception\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"receiver\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-cori-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-aru0-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-aru5-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-aru6-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-aru10-f1655af9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-aru9-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-aru3-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-aru7-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-aru8-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-aru2-f1655af9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-ljspeech-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-lt408-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-lt138-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-lt624-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-lt396-f1655af9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-lt498-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-lt132-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-lt288-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-lt42-f1655af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receive-lt90-f1655af9.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý quy tắc i đứng trước e ngoại trừ sau chữ c (r-e-c-e-i-v-e).', 'business', 2, 29),
('6e9afbd7-aa58-5d99-a56c-811c42df92e5', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '1595c6da-f4ce-5cee-bf3c-ab876acbe5f8', 'b0ca48af-661e-5402-87e0-3897339e0bd9', 'independent', '/ˌɪndɪˈpendənt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không phụ thuộc vào người khác hoặc không bị kiểm soát.', 'not controlled or influenced by other people, organizations, or governments.', 'After graduating, she became financially independent from her parents.', 'Sau khi tốt nghiệp, cô ấy đã tự chủ tài chính, không phụ thuộc vào cha mẹ.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired an independent auditor to review its financial statements carefully.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một kiểm toán viên độc lập để rà soát kỹ các báo cáo tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-ljspeech-7601834e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-cori-7601834e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/independent-02b365d9.webp', '[\"autonomous\", \"self-reliant\"]', '[\"dependent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"independent auditor\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm toán viên độc lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"independent contractor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thầu độc lập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dependable\", \"note_vi\": \"dependable có nghĩa là đáng tin cậy, trái ngược ý nghĩa độc lập.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"independence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"independently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-cori-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-aru0-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-aru5-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-aru6-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-aru10-7601834e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-aru9-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-aru3-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-aru7-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-aru8-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-aru2-7601834e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-ljspeech-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-lt408-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-lt138-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-lt624-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-lt396-7601834e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-lt498-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-lt132-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-lt288-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-lt42-7601834e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-lt90-7601834e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC hay gặp cụm \'independent contractor\' (nhà thầu độc lập) hoặc \'independent audit\'.', 'finance', 2, 0),
('8942448b-0b59-51d2-a92b-ba4b399545d2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '1595c6da-f4ce-5cee-bf3c-ab876acbe5f8', 'b0ca48af-661e-5402-87e0-3897339e0bd9', 'dear', '/dɪə(r)/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Được yêu mến, quý trọng; hoặc dùng để gọi thân mật.', 'loved or cherished very much by someone, or used as a polite greeting.', 'My dear friend, it\'s been too long since we last met.', 'Người bạn thân mến của tôi, đã quá lâu rồi chúng ta chưa gặp nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO sent a letter to all dear clients thanking them for their continuous support.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng giám đốc đã gửi thư đến tất cả khách hàng thân mến cảm ơn sự ủng hộ liên tục của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-ljspeech-dd6bd66e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-cori-dd6bd66e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dear-46fb46d1.webp', '[\"precious\", \"beloved\", \"cherished\"]', '[\"hated\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dear customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng thân mến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hold dear\", \"meaning\": \"trân trọng, yêu quý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deer\", \"note_vi\": \"deer (con hươu/nai) đồng âm nhưng khác nghĩa và cách viết với dear.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"dearly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-cori-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru0-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru5-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru6-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru10-dd6bd66e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru9-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru3-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru7-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru8-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-aru2-dd6bd66e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-ljspeech-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-lt408-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-lt138-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-lt624-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-lt396-dd6bd66e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-lt498-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-lt132-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-lt288-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-lt42-dd6bd66e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dear-lt90-dd6bd66e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong thư từ thương mại, \'Dear Sir/Madam\' hoặc \'Dear [Name]\' là lời chào mở đầu chuẩn mực.', 'media', 2, 1),
('cb6970e8-cfd2-5f2a-b4ce-1829ecbff641', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '1595c6da-f4ce-5cee-bf3c-ab876acbe5f8', 'b0ca48af-661e-5402-87e0-3897339e0bd9', 'gap', '/ɡæp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'khoảng cách, chỗ trống giữa hai vật hoặc người', 'an empty space or opening in the middle of something solid.', 'There\'s a small gap between the two shelves where dust collects.', 'Có một khoảng trống nhỏ giữa hai cái kệ nơi bụi bám vào.', '{\"en\": \"We need to bridge the gap between our current marketing strategy and customer expectations.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần thu hẹp khoảng cách giữa chiến lược tiếp thị hiện tại và kỳ vọng của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-ljspeech-81bf0145.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-cori-81bf0145.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gap-7caebd39.webp', '[\"opening\", \"space\"]', '[\"connection\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bridge the gap\", \"meaning\": \"thu hẹp khoảng cách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pay gap\", \"meaning\": \"chênh lệch lương\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-cori-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-aru0-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-aru5-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-aru6-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-aru10-81bf0145.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-aru9-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-aru3-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-aru7-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-aru8-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-aru2-81bf0145.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-ljspeech-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gap-lt408-81bf0145.mp3\", \"/sto