('c0aa26d7-0537-550a-84b8-a877a6e9970e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '1595c6da-f4ce-5cee-bf3c-ab876acbe5f8', 'b0ca48af-661e-5402-87e0-3897339e0bd9', 'reach', '/riːtʃ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đến một địa điểm hoặc đạt được một mục tiêu.', 'to arrive at a place or to achieve a specific goal or level.', 'We finally reached the summit after a long hike.', 'Cuối cùng chúng tôi cũng đã đến đỉnh núi sau một chặng đi bộ dài.', '{\"en\": \"We hope to reach our sales target by the end of the current quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi hy vọng sẽ đạt được mục tiêu doanh số vào cuối quý hiện tại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-ljspeech-baff1506.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-cori-baff1506.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reach-af0c2b70.webp', '[\"achieve\", \"attain\"]', '[\"miss\", \"fail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reach a goal\", \"meaning\": \"đạt mục tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reach an agreement\", \"meaning\": \"đạt thỏa thuận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reachable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-cori-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru0-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru5-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru6-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru10-baff1506.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru9-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru3-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru7-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru8-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru2-baff1506.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-ljspeech-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt408-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt138-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt624-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt396-baff1506.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt498-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt132-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt288-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt42-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt90-baff1506.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh đạt được con số hoặc thỏa thuận.', 'business', 2, 14),
('ba81e24a-4991-573a-9563-d442f0e8e9d5', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '1595c6da-f4ce-5cee-bf3c-ab876acbe5f8', 'b0ca48af-661e-5402-87e0-3897339e0bd9', 'ourselves', '/ɑːˈselvz/', 'B1', 'pronoun', 'Đại từ phản thân, nhấn mạnh hành động do chính chúng ta thực hiện.', 'used by a group of people to refer to themselves as the object of a verb.', 'We built the treehouse ourselves without any professional help.', 'Chúng tôi tự xây nhà trên cây mà không cần bất kỳ sự giúp đỡ chuyên nghiệp nào.', '{\"en\": \"We decided to organize the annual charity event by ourselves to save on extra costs.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi quyết định tự tổ chức sự kiện từ thiện hàng năm để tiết kiệm chi phí phát sinh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-ljspeech-980677ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-cori-980677ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ourselves-7ff1fb4d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"do by ourselves\", \"meaning\": \"tự làm lấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"for ourselves\", \"meaning\": \"cho chính chúng ta\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-cori-980677ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-aru0-980677ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-aru5-980677ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-aru6-980677ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-aru10-980677ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-aru9-980677ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-aru3-980677ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-aru7-980677ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-aru8-980677ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ourselves-aru2-980677ba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oursel