('134c5268-4c3e-5ea9-8ea1-4fd9093d236e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '1595c6da-f4ce-5cee-bf3c-ab876acbe5f8', 'b0ca48af-661e-5402-87e0-3897339e0bd9', 'report', '/rɪˈpɔːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'bản báo cáo, tường trình', 'a written or spoken description of a situation, event, or official investigation findings.', 'The manager asked for a detailed report on the project\'s progress.', 'Người quản lý yêu cầu một báo cáo chi tiết về tiến độ dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked the sales team to complete the monthly financial report before Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý yêu cầu đội ngũ bán hàng hoàn thành báo cáo tài chính hàng tháng trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-ljspeech-a27297bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-cori-a27297bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/report-6fb22477.webp', '[\"statement\", \"summary\", \"document\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"annual report\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo thường niên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"financial report\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"submit a report\", \"meaning\": \"nộp báo cáo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"report\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reporter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-cori-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru0-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru5-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru6-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru10-a27297bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru9-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru3-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru7-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru8-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru2-a27297bd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-ljspeech-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt408-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt138-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt624-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt396-a27297bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt498-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt132-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt288-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt42-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt90-a27297bd.mp3\"]}}', 'Dạng danh từ vừa chỉ bản báo cáo, dạng động từ chỉ hành động báo cáo hoặc trình diện.', 'office', 2, 28),
('dd46c5b3-79e4-5a91-91a9-178c8eedb3a2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '1595c6da-f4ce-5cee-bf3c-ab876acbe5f8', 'b0ca48af-661e-5402-87e0-3897339e0bd9', 'mind', '/maɪnd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khả năng suy nghĩ, cảm nhận và ý thức của con người.', 'The element of an individual that controls consciousness, thought, memory, and decision making.', 'She has a brilliant mind and can solve complex problems easily.', 'Cô ấy có một trí óc xuất chúng và có thể giải quyết các vấn đề phức tạp một cách dễ dàng.', '{\"en\": \"Keeping the client\'s preferences in mind will help us create a better proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Việc ghi nhớ sở thích của khách hàng trong tâm trí sẽ giúp chúng ta tạo ra đề xuất tốt hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-ljspeech-d42c0112.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-cori-d42c0112.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mind-d884bc26.webp', '[\"brain\", \"intellect\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"keep in mind\", \"meaning\": \"ghi nhớ trong đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"change one\'s mind\", \"meaning\": \"thay đổi ý định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"peace of mind\", \"meaning\": \"sự bình yên trong tâm trí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"brain\", \"note_vi\": \"Brain là cơ quan bộ não vật lý, còn mind là tâm trí / trí óc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mind\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mindful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mindless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-cori-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru0-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru5-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru6-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru10-d42c0112.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru9-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru3-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru7-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru8-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru2-d42c0112.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-ljspeech-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt408-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt138-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt624-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt396-d42c0112.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt498-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt132-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt288-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt42-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt90-d42c0112.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt mind (tâm trí/tinh thần) với brain (bộ não sinh học).', 'daily', 2, 29),
('e6811dd3-14a6-5cb8-9f0d-84f36f4436cb', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '27ef85aa-45c7-58f7-9a43-8a9165a9d43b', 'e81f6ed0-9874-5413-821d-60e2defb18cd', 'talk', '/tɔːk/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Giao tiếp bằng lời nói với ai đó.', 'to communicate with someone using spoken words; to have a conversation.', 'Let\'s talk about your ideas for the new project during the meeting.', 'Chúng ta hãy nói về những ý tưởng của bạn cho dự án mới trong cuộc họp nhé.', '{\"en\": \"The HR manager will talk to the new employees about company policies tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nhân sự sẽ nói chuyện với nhân viên mới về chính sách công ty vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-ljspeech-e55e91b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-cori-e55e91b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/talk-9f2cf5e0.webp', '[\"speak\", \"chat\", \"converse\"]', '[\"listen\", \"stay silent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"talk about\", \"meaning\": \"nói về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"talk to someone\", \"meaning\": \"nói chuyện với ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"talk over\", \"meaning\": \"thảo luận kỹ về điều gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"say\", \"note_vi\": \"say nhấn mạnh nội dung lời nói, talk nhấn mạnh hành động giao tiếp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"talk\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"talkative\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"talker\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-cori-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-aru0-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-aru5-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-aru6-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-aru10-e55e91b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-aru9-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-aru3-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-aru7-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-aru8-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-aru2-e55e91b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-ljspeech-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-lt408-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-lt138-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-lt624-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-lt396-e55e91b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-lt498-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-lt132-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-lt288-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-lt42-e55e91b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-lt90-e55e91b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Talk to (nói chuyện với) và talk about (nói về); đừng nhầm với speak, vốn trang trọng hơn.', 'office', 2, 0),
('ba5eb54d-1a60-57d1-83a0-e01935ccf302', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '27ef85aa-45c7-58f7-9a43-8a9165a9d43b', 'e81f6ed0-9874-5413-821d-60e2defb18cd', 'fortunately', '/ˈfɔːtʃənətli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'thật may mắn, thật hên là', 'it is good that a particular thing happened or is the case.', 'Fortunately, the technical team restored all corrupted files before the deadline.', 'May mắn thay, đội ngũ kỹ thuật đã khôi phục tất cả các tệp bị lỗi trước thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"Fortunately, the client agreed to extend the deadline for our project proposal submission.\", \"vi\": \"May mắn thay, khách hàng đã đồng ý gia hạn thời hạn nộp đề xuất dự án của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-ljspeech-7ef172de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-cori-7ef172de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fortunately-d073df1f.webp', '[\"luckily\", \"happily\"]', '[\"unfortunately\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fortunately for\", \"meaning\": \"thật may mắn cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quite fortunately\", \"meaning\": \"khá may mắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fortune\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fortunate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-cori-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru0-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru5-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru6-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru10-7ef172de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru9-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru3-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru7-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru8-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o