('42c54a5c-9399-5fa9-a2c5-878706d4949c', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '27ef85aa-45c7-58f7-9a43-8a9165a9d43b', 'e81f6ed0-9874-5413-821d-60e2defb18cd', 'arrival', 'UK: /əˈraɪvəl/ | US: /əˈraɪvl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự đến nơi', 'the act or fact of reaching a destination after traveling or moving towards a place', 'We are expecting the arrival of our new products next week.', 'Chúng tôi dự kiến hàng mới của mình sẽ về vào tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"Please present your booking confirmation at the front desk upon arrival.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xuất trình xác nhận đặt phòng của bạn tại quầy lễ tân ngay khi đến nơi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-ljspeech-7933e585.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-cori-7933e585.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arrival-500aa5e3.webp', '[\"entry\", \"appearance\", \"presence\"]', '[\"departure\", \"leaving\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"upon arrival\", \"meaning\": \"khi đến nơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arrival time\", \"meaning\": \"giờ đến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"arrive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-cori-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-aru0-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-aru5-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-aru6-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-aru10-7933e585.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-aru9-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-aru3-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-aru7-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-aru8-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-aru2-7933e585.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-ljspeech-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-lt408-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-lt138-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-lt624-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-lt396-7933e585.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-lt498-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-lt132-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-lt288-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-lt42-7933e585.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrival-lt90-7933e585.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm các cụm từ như \'upon arrival\' (khi vừa đến nơi), \'arrival time\' (giờ đến).', 'travel', 1, 23),
('f3392b3c-6dfe-591d-aac4-fd65feb7eb1b', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '27ef85aa-45c7-58f7-9a43-8a9165a9d43b', 'e81f6ed0-9874-5413-821d-60e2defb18cd', 'worse', '/wɜːs/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'tệ hơn, tồi tệ hơn (so sánh hơn của \'bad\')', 'more unpleasant, difficult, or of lower quality than before.', 'His financial situation became significantly worse after losing his main investment.', 'Tình hình tài chính của anh ấy trở nên tệ hơn đáng kể sau khi mất khoản đầu tư chính.', '{\"en\": \"The financial results for this quarter were worse than we had originally projected.\", \"vi\": \"Kết quả tài chính quý này tệ hơn so với dự kiến ban đầu của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-ljspeech-4f818023.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-cori-4f818023.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/worse-d1bc04f6.webp', '[\"inferior\", \"poorer\"]', '[\"better\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get worse\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên tệ hơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"worse off\", \"meaning\": \"khó khăn hơn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bad\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-cori-4f818023.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-aru0-4f818023.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-aru5-4f818023.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-aru6-4f818023.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-aru10-4f818023.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-aru9-4f818023.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-aru3-4f818023.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-aru7-4f818023.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-aru8-4f818023.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-aru2-4f818023.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worse-ljspeech-4f818023.mp3\