('ee8842e9-4ed0-5ef0-bc58-162568abc10a', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '27ef85aa-45c7-58f7-9a43-8a9165a9d43b', 'e81f6ed0-9874-5413-821d-60e2defb18cd', 'bend', 'UK: /bɛnd/ | US: /bɛnd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'cúi xuống', 'to lean the body forward and downward from an upright position.', 'He had to bend to pass under the low archway.', 'Anh ấy phải cúi người để đi qua vòm cửa thấp.', '{\"en\": \"Warehouse employees are taught how to bend their knees properly when lifting heavy crates.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên kho hàng được hướng dẫn cách gập đầu gối đúng cách khi nâng các kiện hàng nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-ljspeech-abf1da7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-cori-abf1da7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bend-8fbc9a1b.webp', '[\"lean\", \"incline\", \"bow\"]', '[\"straighten\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bend down\", \"meaning\": \"cúi người xuống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bend the rules\", \"meaning\": \"nới lỏng/lách quy định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bind\", \"note_vi\": \"Bind nghĩa là buộc, ràng buộc hoặc đóng (sách), khác với bend (cúi/uốn)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-cori-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru0-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru5-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru6-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru10-abf1da7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru9-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru3-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru7-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru8-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru2-abf1da7e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-ljspeech-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt408-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt138-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt624-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt396-abf1da7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt498-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt132-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt288-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt42-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt90-abf1da7e.mp3\"]}}', '\'Bend down\' hoặc \'bend over\' mô tả hành động cúi gập người xuống (ví dụ khi nâng đồ nặng trong kho).', 'logistics', 1, 25),
('91fa1b8b-6bed-527f-98c2-cf2ac3b20a80', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '27ef85aa-45c7-58f7-9a43-8a9165a9d43b', 'e81f6ed0-9874-5413-821d-60e2defb18cd', 'start', '/stɑːt/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Khởi động một hoạt động hoặc quá trình.', 'to begin doing something or to cause something to begin happening.', 'The project manager decided to start the presentation after all team members arrived.', 'Quản lý dự án đã quyết định bắt đầu buổi thuyết trình sau khi tất cả thành viên trong đội đến đông đủ.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager decided to start the team meeting twenty minutes earlier.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý dự án đã quyết định bắt đầu cuộc họp nhóm sớm hơn hai mươi phút.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/start-ljspeech-2b020927.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/start-cori-2b020927.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/start-7d7a587e.webp', '[\"begin\", \"commence\", \"initiate\"]', '[\"finish\", \"end\", \"stop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"start a business\", \"meaning\": \"bắt đầu kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"start work\", \"meaning\": \"bắt đầu làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"start early\", \"meaning\": \"bắt đầu sớm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"begin\", \"note_vi\": \"start thường dùng cho máy móc/doanh nghiệp, begin trang trọng hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"starter\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"start\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/start-cori-2b020927.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/start-aru0-2b020927.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/start-aru5-2b020927.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/start-aru6-2b020927.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/start-aru10-2b020927.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/start-aru9-2b020927.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/start-aru3-2b020927.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/