('bc5688df-711a-50c3-a4fa-db68de357077', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2d826c76-8fc0-5a1e-9c99-9fc7dee214dc', 'e0545300-07e8-5ea7-89b0-040a363250e2', 'variety', '/vəˈraɪəti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự đa dạng, nhiều loại khác nhau.', 'a lot of different things of the same general type.', 'The cafeteria serves a great variety of healthy dishes every lunch break.', 'Quán ăn tự phục vụ cung cấp nhiều món ăn lành mạnh vào mỗi giờ nghỉ trưa.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier offers a wide variety of office furniture to suit different budgets.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp cung cấp nhiều loại nội thất văn phòng đa dạng để phù hợp với các ngân sách khác nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-ljspeech-21e7a8ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-cori-21e7a8ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/variety-0b0349db.webp', '[\"diversity\", \"assortment\", \"range\"]', '[\"sameness\", \"uniformity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a wide variety of\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều loại đa dạng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"variety of products\", \"meaning\": \"sự đa dạng của sản phẩm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vary\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"various\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-cori-21e7a8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-aru0-21e7a8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-aru5-21e7a8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-aru6-21e7a8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-aru10-21e7a8ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-aru9-21e7a8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-aru3-21e7a8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-aru7-21e7a8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variety-aru8-21e7a8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/