('5575b81d-9b9e-56df-8a9e-8db0a89ff4b8', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2d826c76-8fc0-5a1e-9c99-9fc7dee214dc', 'e0545300-07e8-5ea7-89b0-040a363250e2', 'track', '/træk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Con đường nhỏ hoặc lối đi hẹp, thường do người hoặc động vật tạo ra.', 'a path or a set of metal rails for trains to travel along.', 'We followed the narrow track through the forest to reach the old cabin.', 'Chúng tôi đi theo con đường mòn nhỏ xuyên rừng để đến căn nhà gỗ cũ.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew is repairing the railway track to ensure safe transport of goods.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đang sửa chữa đường ray để đảm bảo việc vận chuyển hàng hóa an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-ljspeech-42aef171.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-cori-42aef171.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/track-a998ae51.webp', '[\"path\", \"rail\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"railway track\", \"meaning\": \"đường ray xe lửa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep track of\", \"meaning\": \"theo dõi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-cori-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-aru0-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-aru5-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-aru6-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-aru10-42aef171.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-aru9-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-aru3-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-aru7-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-aru8-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-aru2-42aef171.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-ljspeech-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-lt408-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-lt138-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-lt624-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-lt396-42aef171.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-lt498-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-lt132-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-lt288-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-lt42-42aef171.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/track-lt90-42aef171.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'keep track of\' rất hay gặp trong TOEIC.', 'manufacturing', 2, 8),
('af5fda82-62cc-5900-a778-dc2088904606', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2d826c76-8fc0-5a1e-9c99-9fc7dee214dc', 'e0545300-07e8-5ea7-89b0-040a363250e2', 'spider', '/ˈspaɪdə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loài động vật chân đốt có tám chân, thường giăng tơ.', 'a small creature with eight legs that makes silk webs.', 'She spotted a tiny spider crawling across the garden table.', 'Cô phát hiện một con nhện nhỏ đang bò qua chiếc bàn trong vườn.', '{\"en\": \"The cleaner found a spider in the office bathroom yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Người lao công tìm thấy một con nhện trong phòng vệ sinh văn phòng hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-ljspeech-640fb061.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-cori-640fb061.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spider-ec24cc4e.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"spider web\", \"meaning\": \"mạng nhện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spider bite\", \"meaning\": \"vết cắn của nhện\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-cori-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-aru0-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-aru5-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-aru6-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-aru10-640fb061.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-aru9-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-aru3-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-aru7-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-aru8-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-aru2-640fb061.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-ljspeech-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-lt408-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-lt138-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-lt624-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-lt396-640fb061.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-lt498-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-lt132-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-lt288-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-lt42-640fb061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spider-lt90-640fb061.mp3\"]}}', 'Spider là động vật 8 chân, không phải côn trùng.', 'office', 2, 9),
('38224763-aa90-5796-bbaa-cd13c55512c3', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2d826c76-8fc0-5a1e-9c99-9fc7dee214dc', 'e0545300-07e8-5ea7-89b0-040a363250e2', 'knock', '/nɒk/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Dùng tay đập nhẹ vào cửa hoặc bề mặt.', 'to hit a surface forcefully to attract attention or produce a noise.', 'Someone is knocking at the door, can you please answer it?', 'Có ai đó đang gõ cửa, bạn có thể ra mở được không?', '{\"en\": \"Please knock on the door before entering the executive conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng gõ cửa trước khi vào phòng họp cấp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-ljspeech-03c065ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-cori-03c065ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/knock-33b0a554.webp', '[\"tap\", \"rap\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"knock on the door\", \"meaning\": \"gõ cửa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"knock down\", \"meaning\": \"xô ngã, đánh gục\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"knock\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-cori-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-aru0-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-aru5-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-aru6-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-aru10-03c065ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-aru9-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-aru3-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-aru7-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-aru8-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-aru2-03c065ba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-ljspeech-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knock-lt408-03c065ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati