('0ef6e1f4-00c5-55fb-82c0-bf516d98a2a9', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2d826c76-8fc0-5a1e-9c99-9fc7dee214dc', 'e0545300-07e8-5ea7-89b0-040a363250e2', 'between', '/bɪˈtwiːn/', 'A1', 'preposition', 'Ở vị trí không gian hoặc thời gian giữa hai vật, người, hoặc điểm.', 'in the space that separates two different objects, places, or points in time.', 'The small village is located between two mountains.', 'Ngôi làng nhỏ nằm giữa hai ngọn núi.', '{\"en\": \"The meeting is scheduled between two and four o\'clock this afternoon in room B.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp được lên lịch vào khoảng giữa hai và bốn giờ chiều nay tại phòng B.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-ljspeech-70963405.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-cori-70963405.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/between-f06179e6.webp', '[\"among\", \"amid\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"between A and B\", \"meaning\": \"giữa A và B\"}, {\"phrase\": \"choose between\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn giữa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"among\", \"note_vi\": \"Between dùng cho hai đối tượng, among dùng cho nhiều hơn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-cori-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru0-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru5-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru6-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru10-70963405.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru9-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru3-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru7-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru8-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-aru2-70963405.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-ljspeech-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-lt408-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-lt138-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-lt624-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-lt396-70963405.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-lt498-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-lt132-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-lt288-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-lt42-70963405.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/between-lt90-70963405.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn đi với \'and\' khi liệt kê hai đối tượng.', 'office', 2, 11),
('ac535bd9-f7ef-5407-8451-5ac56b75b7f5', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2d826c76-8fc0-5a1e-9c99-9fc7dee214dc', 'e0545300-07e8-5ea7-89b0-040a363250e2', 'provide', '/prəˈvaɪd/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Cho ai đó thứ họ cần hoặc muốn.', 'to give or make something available to someone who needs or wants it.', 'The school aims to provide quality education for all students.', 'Trường học đặt mục tiêu cung cấp giáo dục chất lượng cho tất cả học sinh.', '{\"en\": \"The company will provide all necessary training materials to new employees during their orientation week.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ cung cấp tất cả tài liệu đào tạo cần thiết cho nhân viên mới trong tuần định hướng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-ljspeech-4ab69d1f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-cori-4ab69d1f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/provide-65046048.webp', '[\"supply\", \"offer\"]', '[\"withhold\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"provide with\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp cho ai cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide for\", \"meaning\": \"chu cấp cho\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"provision\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-cori-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-aru0-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-aru5-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-aru6-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-aru10-4ab69d1f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-aru9-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-aru3-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-aru7-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-aru8-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-aru2-4ab69d1f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-ljspeech-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-lt408-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-lt138-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-lt624-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-lt396-4ab69d1f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-lt498-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-lt132-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-lt288-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-lt42-4ab69d1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/provide-lt90-4ab69d1f.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: provide someone with something hoặc provide something for someone.', 'hr', 2, 12),
('b8a4a86a-3450-5e1d-9bb4-88d31e545394', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2d826c76-8fc0-5a1e-9c99-9fc7dee214dc', 'e0545300-07e8-5ea7-89b0-040a363250e2', 'sale', '/seɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự kiện bán hàng với giá thấp hơn bình thường.', 'a period when a store sells goods at lower prices than usual.', 'I bought this dress during the summer sale and got a great discount.', 'Tôi đã mua chiếc váy này trong đợt giảm giá mùa hè và được giảm giá rất nhiều.', '{\"en\": \"Our store is having a clearance sale on all office furniture until the end of the month.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng chúng tôi đang có đợt giảm giá thanh lý tất cả nội thất văn phòng cho đến cuối tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-ljspeech-5b8a763b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-cori-5b8a763b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sale-a7716eb8.webp', '[\"discount\", \"bargain\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on sale\", \"meaning\": \"đang giảm giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clearance sale\", \"meaning\": \"bán hàng thanh lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sell\", \"note_vi\": \"Sale là danh từ (sự giảm giá), sell là động từ (bán).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sell\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-cori-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru0-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru5-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru6-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru10-5b8a763b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru9-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru3-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru7-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru8-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru2-5b8a763b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\