('b4c762bb-45d9-59a7-8999-f9b211aa263d', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2d826c76-8fc0-5a1e-9c99-9fc7dee214dc', 'e0545300-07e8-5ea7-89b0-040a363250e2', 'suddenly', '/ˈsʌdənli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Một cách bất ngờ, không báo trước.', 'happening very quickly and unexpectedly, without any warning or preparation before it takes place.', 'The rain started suddenly, so we had to run for shelter.', 'Mưa bắt đầu đột nhiên, vì vậy chúng tôi phải chạy tìm chỗ trú.', '{\"en\": \"The power suddenly went out during the presentation, causing a brief pause in the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Điện đột ngột mất trong buổi thuyết trình, gây ra sự gián đoạn ngắn trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-ljspeech-fac40e01.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-cori-fac40e01.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suddenly-0b5c7ee9.webp', '[\"unexpectedly\", \"abruptly\"]', '[\"gradually\", \"slowly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"suddenly stopped\", \"meaning\": \"đột ngột dừng lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"suddenly changed\", \"meaning\": \"đột ngột thay đổi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sudden\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-cori-fac40e01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-aru0-fac40e01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-aru5-fac40e01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-aru6-fac40e01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-aru10-fac40e01.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-aru9-fac40e01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-aru3-fac40e01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-aru7-fac40e01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-aru8-fac40e01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suddenly-aru2-fac40e01.mp3\"]}, \"us