('3cabb2ef-83b2-5b2c-b353-8206c124e5c1', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2f137875-d3f8-570d-92e1-93876794d02a', 'ec29ea46-bdce-59be-ac99-2de7f41ff72b', 'past', '/pɑːst/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'đã qua, thuộc về thời gian trước đây', 'having happened or existed before the present time.', 'In the past, people used to write letters more often.', 'Trong quá khứ, mọi người thường viết thư nhiều hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The company reviewed its past performance to plan the budget for next year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã xem xét hiệu suất trong quá khứ của mình để lập kế hoạch ngân sách cho năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-ljspeech-dc52f279.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-cori-dc52f279.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/past-a5413f7a.webp', '[\"former\", \"previous\", \"prior\"]', '[\"future\", \"present\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in the past year\", \"meaning\": \"trong năm qua\"}, {\"phrase\": \"past experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm trong quá khứ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"passed\", \"note_vi\": \"passed là động từ quá khứ của pass, past là tính/danh/giới từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"past\"}, {\"pos\": \"preposition\", \"word\": \"past\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-cori-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru0-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru5-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru6-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru10-dc52f279.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru9-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru3-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru7-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru8-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru2-dc52f279.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-ljspeech-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt408-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt138-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt624-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt396-dc52f279.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt498-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt132-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt288-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt42-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt90-dc52f279.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn giữa \'past\' (tính từ/danh từ) và \'passed\' (dạng quá khứ của động từ pass).', 'business', 2, 5),
