('904e48d0-cf15-5c05-9565-d525fb39071e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '2f137875-d3f8-570d-92e1-93876794d02a', 'ec29ea46-bdce-59be-ac99-2de7f41ff72b', 'fish', '/fɪʃ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Loài động vật sống dưới nước, có vây và mang.', 'an animal that lives in water, breathes through gills, and uses fins to swim.', 'We caught a big fish during our fishing trip yesterday.', 'Chúng tôi đã bắt được một con cá lớn trong chuyến đi câu cá hôm qua.', '{\"en\": \"The new seafood restaurant in the business district serves excellent fresh fish and chips.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng hải sản mới trong khu thương mại phục vụ món cá và khoai tây chiên tươi ngon tuyệt vời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-ljspeech-64875fcc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-cori-64875fcc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fish-a84e182b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh fish\", \"meaning\": \"cá tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"catch a fish\", \"meaning\": \"bắt cá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fish\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fishing\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fisherman\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-cori-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru0-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru5-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru6-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru10-64875fcc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru9-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru3-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru7-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru8-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru2-64875fcc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2