('a7cf8f2d-b406-5642-8b9f-fff430a5433d', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'actually', '/ˈæktʃuəli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Thật ra, trên thực tế.', 'used to emphasize a fact or to say what is real or true.', 'I thought the movie would be boring, but it was actually quite good.', 'Tôi nghĩ bộ phim sẽ chán, nhưng thật ra nó khá hay.', '{\"en\": \"The total cost of the office renovation project was actually lower than estimated.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng chi phí của dự án cải tạo văn phòng thực sự thấp hơn ước tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-ljspeech-d617b5ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-cori-d617b5ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/actually-9f2e2e79.webp', '[\"really\", \"truly\", \"indeed\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"actually happen\", \"meaning\": \"thực sự xảy ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"actually do\", \"meaning\": \"thực sự làm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"currently\", \"note_vi\": \"currently là hiện tại, không phải thực sự\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"actual\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-cori-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru0-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru5-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru6-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru10-d617b5ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru9-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru3-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru7-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru8-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru2-d617b5ef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/