('de32c134-efd9-56d1-8465-ab8a85eca356', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'wash', '/wɒʃ/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Làm sạch bằng nước và xà phòng.', 'to clean something using water and usually soap or detergent.', 'Employees must wash their hands thoroughly before returning to the food service area.', 'Nhân viên phải rửa tay thật sạch trước khi quay trở lại khu vực phục vụ đồ ăn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must wash their hands thoroughly before returning to the food preparation area.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải rửa tay thật sạch trước khi quay lại khu vực chuẩn bị thức ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-ljspeech-6814a21e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-cori-6814a21e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wash-42dfab31.webp', '[\"clean\", \"rinse\"]', '[\"dirty\", \"soil\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wash the dishes\", \"meaning\": \"rửa chén bát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wash hands\", \"meaning\": \"rửa tay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"watch\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm gần giống nhưng nghĩa là xem hoặc đồng hồ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"washable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"washing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-cori-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-aru0-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-aru5-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-aru6-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-aru10-6814a21e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-aru9-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-aru3-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-aru7-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-aru8-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-aru2-6814a21e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-ljspeech-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-lt408-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-lt138-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-lt624-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-lt396-6814a21e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-lt498-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-lt132-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-lt288-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-lt42-6814a21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wash-lt90-6814a21e.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm đuôi /ʃ/ rõ ràng để tránh nhầm với watch /tʃ/.', 'dining', 2, 7),
('e313b93b-ca93-5ad1-b6eb-b44477b9200f', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'break', 'UK: /breɪk/ | US: /breɪk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'nghỉ giải lao', 'A brief period of rest from work, study, or other regular activities.', 'Let\'s take a short break after this meeting.', 'Chúng ta hãy nghỉ giải lao một chút sau cuộc họp này.', '{\"en\": \"The seminar schedule includes a fifteen-minute coffee break at 10:30 AM.\", \"vi\": \"Lịch trình hội thảo bao gồm 15 phút nghỉ giải lao uống cà phê lúc 10:30 sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-ljspeech-4f9cac8d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-cori-4f9cac8d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/break-ee4c7ae7.webp', '[\"pause\", \"rest\", \"recess\"]', '[\"continuation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take a break\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ giải lao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lunch break\", \"meaning\": \"giờ nghỉ trưa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"coffee break\", \"meaning\": \"giờ nghỉ uống cà phê\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"brake\", \"note_vi\": \"brake là phanh xe, phát âm giống break.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"break\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"breakable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-cori-4f9cac8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-aru0-4f9cac8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-aru5-4f9cac8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-aru6-4f9cac8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-aru10-4f9cac8d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-aru9-4f9cac8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-aru3-4f9cac8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-aru7-4f9cac8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-aru8-4f9cac8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro