('066e8d0a-182d-55a8-b3b1-64b62fcec7e7', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'light', '/laɪt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Năng lượng bức xạ giúp chúng ta nhìn thấy; nguồn sáng.', 'the energy from the sun, a lamp, or a fire that makes it possible to see things.', 'The room was filled with natural light from the large window.', 'Căn phòng tràn ngập ánh sáng tự nhiên từ ô cửa sổ lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The natural light in this office helps reduce our monthly electricity bill significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Ánh sáng tự nhiên trong văn phòng này giúp giảm đáng kể hóa đơn tiền điện hàng tháng của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-ljspeech-dfccc06f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-cori-dfccc06f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/light-73a28bc4.webp', '[\"illumination\", \"brightness\"]', '[\"darkness\", \"shade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"natural light\", \"meaning\": \"ánh sáng tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bright light\", \"meaning\": \"ánh sáng chói\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"light\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"light\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"lighten\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-cori-dfccc06f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-aru0-dfccc06f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-aru5-dfccc06f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-aru6-dfccc06f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-aru10-dfccc06f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-aru9-dfccc06f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-aru3-dfccc06f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-aru7-dfccc06f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-aru8-dfccc06f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati