('90c93ba6-df44-522f-a92d-ba6a25c8d3dc', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'peace', '/piːs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng không có chiến tranh hoặc xung đột; sự yên tĩnh.', 'a situation in which there is no war or fighting between countries or groups of people.', 'After years of war, the country finally found peace.', 'Sau nhiều năm chiến tranh, đất nước cuối cùng đã tìm thấy hòa bình.', '{\"en\": \"The company is trying to maintain peace between the two departments after the recent conflict.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang cố gắng duy trì hòa bình giữa hai phòng ban sau cuộc xung đột gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-ljspeech-d7c50a08.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-cori-d7c50a08.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/peace-7abd40a4.webp', '[\"harmony\", \"tranquility\"]', '[\"war\", \"conflict\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"world peace\", \"meaning\": \"hòa bình thế giới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"peace treaty\", \"meaning\": \"hiệp ước hòa bình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"piece\", \"note_vi\": \"piece là mảnh/miếng, peace là hòa bình.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"peaceful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"peacefully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-cori-d7c50a08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-aru0-d7c50a08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-aru5-d7c50a08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-aru6-d7c50a08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-aru10-d7c50a08.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-aru9-d7c50a08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-aru3-d7c50a08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-aru7-d7c50a08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peace-aru8-d7c50a08