('e31f5cf8-4b6d-5b84-ad18-82259996dfce', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'regularly', 'UK: /ˈrɛɡjələli/ | US: /ˈrɛɡjələrli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'thường xuyên', 'at steady or consistent time intervals with equal space between events.', 'She regularly attends industry conferences.', 'Cô ấy thường xuyên tham dự các hội nghị ngành.', '{\"en\": \"Equipment should be inspected regularly to maintain high safety standards.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết bị nên được kiểm tra định kỳ để duy trì các tiêu chuẩn an toàn cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-ljspeech-8cd0f11a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-cori-8cd0f11a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/regularly-78fed8ba.webp', '[\"frequently\", \"consistently\", \"routinely\", \"periodically\"]', '[\"rarely\", \"seldom\", \"irregularly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"check regularly\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra thường xuyên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"update regularly\", \"meaning\": \"cập nhật định kỳ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"regular\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"regularity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-cori-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-aru0-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-aru5-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-aru6-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-aru10-8cd0f11a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-aru9-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-aru3-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-aru7-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-aru8-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-aru2-8cd0f11a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-ljspeech-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-lt408-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-lt138-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-lt624-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-lt396-8cd0f11a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-lt498-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-lt132-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-lt288-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-lt42-8cd0f11a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regularly-lt90-8cd0f11a.mp3\"]}}', 'Bằng nghĩa với cụm \'on a regular basis\'. Thường đứng sau động từ hoặc cuối câu.', 'maintenance', 1, 17),
('37c6aa0a-cb7c-571a-9910-41d08f87c287', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'himself', '/hɪmˈself/', 'A2', 'pronoun', 'Chính anh ấy (dùng để nhấn mạnh hoặc làm tân ngữ phản thân).', 'used when the person who does an action is the same as the one affected by it.', 'He built the entire treehouse by himself, without any help.', 'Anh ấy tự mình xây toàn bộ ngôi nhà trên cây mà không cần giúp đỡ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to handle the difficult client complaint by himself to avoid further confusion.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý quyết định tự mình xử lý khiếu nại của khách hàng khó tính để tránh nhầm lẫn thêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-ljspeech-fbd47981.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-cori-fbd47981.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/himself-adcf9423.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"by himself\", \"meaning\": \"một mình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"for himself\", \"meaning\": \"cho riêng mình\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-cori-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-aru0-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-aru5-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-aru6-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-aru10-fbd47981.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-aru9-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-aru3-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-aru7-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-aru8-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-aru2-fbd47981.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-ljspeech-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-lt408-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-lt138-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-lt624-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-lt396-fbd47981.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-lt498-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-lt132-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-lt288-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-lt42-fbd47981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/himself-lt90-fbd47981.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để nhấn mạnh chủ ngữ tự thực hiện hành động.', 'office', 2, 18),
('9d63946c-e796-528d-bbea-dd53c2b22ce8', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'personally', 'UK: /ˈpɜː.sə.nə.li/ | US: /ˈpɝː.sə.nə.li/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'một cách riêng tư, với tư cách cá nhân', 'In a direct manner involving oneself directly rather than through an agent.', 'The CEO will personally sign all the employment contracts.', 'CEO sẽ tự mình ký tất cả các hợp đồng lao động.', '{\"en\": \"The regional director attended the opening ceremony personally to greet key corporate partners.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc khu vực đã đích thân tham dự lễ khai trương để chào đón các đối tác doanh nghiệp chủ chốt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-ljspeech-396be4c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-cori-396be4c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/personally-2d6a7355.webp', '[\"in person\", \"directly\", \"individually\"]', '[\"indirectly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"speak personally\", \"meaning\": \"nói chuyện trực tiếp/riêng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take it personally\", \"meaning\": \"để bụng / coi đó là sự công kích cá nhân\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"personal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"person\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-cori-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru0-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru5-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru6-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru10-396be4c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru9-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru3-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru7-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru8-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru2-396be4c7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-ljspeech-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt408-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt138-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt624-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt396-396be4c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt498-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt132-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt288-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt42-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt90-396be4c7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng đầu câu thể hiện quan điểm cá nhân (\'Personally, I believe...\') hoặc đứng sau động từ chỉ việc tự mình làm trực tiếp (\'attend personally\').', 'office', 1, 19),
('9325ae38-51fe-5a20-bfa6-92bb0ed8f932', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'server', 'UK: /ˈsɜːvə/ | US: /ˈsɜːrvər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'người phục vụ', 'A restaurant worker whose job is to take orders and bring food to customers.', 'The server took our orders promptly.', 'Người phục vụ đã lấy order của chúng tôi nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"The server promptly brought the daily specials menu to our table.\", \"vi\": \"Người phục vụ đã nhanh chóng mang thực đơn món đặc biệt trong ngày đến bàn của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-ljspeech-3de4f901.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-cori-3de4f901.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/server-cbcf1e95.webp', '[\"waiter\", \"waitress\", \"attendant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"experienced server\", \"meaning\": \"người phục vụ có kinh nghiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ask the server\", \"meaning\": \"hỏi người phục vụ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"serve\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"service\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-cori-3de4f901.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-aru0-3de4f901.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-aru5-3de4f901.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-aru6-3de4f901.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-aru10-3de4f901.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-aru9-3de4f901.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-aru3-3de4f901.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-aru7-3de4f901.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-aru8-3de4f901.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-aru2-3de4f901.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/server-ljs