('4c548396-c6b4-53af-94a0-b0647d035ccb', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'pain', '/peɪn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác khó chịu về thể chất hoặc tinh thần.', 'a strong feeling of physical discomfort caused by an injury or an illness in the body.', 'The doctor prescribed medication to help reduce severe back pain.', 'Bác sĩ đã kê đơn thuốc để giúp giảm đau lưng dữ dội.', '{\"en\": \"The employee reported severe back pain after sitting in an uncomfortable chair for many hours.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên báo cáo bị đau lưng dữ dội sau khi ngồi trên chiếc ghế không thoải mái nhiều giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-ljspeech-4582cd02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-cori-4582cd02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pain-1b0536e6.webp', '[\"ache\", \"suffering\"]', '[\"comfort\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"severe pain\", \"meaning\": \"đau dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chronic pain\", \"meaning\": \"đau mãn tính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"painful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-cori-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru0-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru5-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru6-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru10-4582cd02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru9-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru3-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru7-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru8-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru2-4582cd02.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-ljspeech-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/s