('6ef15b06-d298-5bc0-bce2-73c9e5634f5d', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'foreign', '/ˈfɒrən/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về một quốc gia hoặc nền văn hóa khác.', 'relating to or coming from a country that is not your own.', 'Learning a foreign language can open up many new opportunities.', 'Học một ngôn ngữ nước ngoài có thể mở ra nhiều cơ hội mới.', '{\"en\": \"Our company is expanding into foreign markets to increase our global brand awareness and revenue.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đang mở rộng sang các thị trường nước ngoài để tăng nhận diện thương hiệu toàn cầu và doanh thu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-ljspeech-44d16146.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-cori-44d16146.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/foreign-89bfb756.webp', '[\"international\", \"external\"]', '[\"domestic\", \"local\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"foreign market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường nước ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"foreign language\", \"meaning\": \"ngoại ngữ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"foreigner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-cori-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-aru0-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-aru5-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-aru6-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-aru10-44d16146.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-aru9-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-aru3-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-aru7-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-aru8-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-aru2-44d16146.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-ljspeech-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-lt408-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-lt138-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-lt624-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-lt396-44d16146.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-lt498-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-lt132-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-lt288-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-lt42-44d16146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreign-lt90-44d16146.mp3\"]}}', 'Đối lập với \'domestic\' (trong nước).', 'business', 2, 22),
('31b89b51-b7e3-596d-beef-efe75a8000ae', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'exist', '/ɪɡˈzɪst/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Có thật, hiện hữu.', 'to be real, present, or living in a particular place or condition.', 'Many small companies struggle to exist during a severe economic crisis.', 'Nhiều công ty nhỏ phải vật lộn để tồn tại trong thời kỳ khủng hoảng kinh tế nghiêm trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The management must confirm if any conflicts of interest exist before approving the project.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý phải xác nhận xem có bất kỳ sự xung đột lợi ích nào tồn tại trước khi phê duyệt dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-ljspeech-7e89f247.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-cori-7e89f247.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exist-4bf8a0d0.webp', '[\"occur\", \"remain\", \"survive\"]', '[\"vanish\", \"disappear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"continue to exist\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tục tồn tại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cease to exist\", \"meaning\": \"ngừng tồn tại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exit\", \"note_vi\": \"exist là tồn tại, còn exit là lối ra hoặc đi ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"existence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"existing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-cori-7e89f247.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-aru0-7e89f247.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-aru5-7e89f247.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-aru6-7e89f247.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-aru10-7e89f247.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-aru9-7e89f247.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-aru3-7e89f247.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-aru7-7e89f247.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exist-