('3e9b614a-f667-54f2-b255-6984f97b069b', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'height', '/haɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Kích thước từ đáy lên đỉnh của một vật hoặc người.', 'the measurement of how tall or high something is from the bottom to top.', 'The height of the new building will be over 100 meters.', 'Chiều cao của tòa nhà mới sẽ hơn 100 mét.', '{\"en\": \"The architect checked the height of the ceiling before installing the new lighting system.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã kiểm tra chiều cao của trần nhà trước khi lắp đặt hệ thống chiếu sáng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-ljspeech-73e7e545.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-cori-73e7e545.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/height-ababd0fe.webp', '[\"stature\", \"altitude\"]', '[\"depth\", \"width\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"at a height of\", \"meaning\": \"ở độ cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maximum height\", \"meaning\": \"chiều cao tối đa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"high\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"heighten\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-cori-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-aru0-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-aru5-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-aru6-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-aru10-73e7e545.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-aru9-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-aru3-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-aru7-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-aru8-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-aru2-73e7e545.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-ljspeech-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-lt408-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-lt138-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-lt624-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-lt396-73e7e545.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-lt498-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-lt132-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-lt288-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-lt42-73e7e545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/height-lt90-73e7e545.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý cách phát âm đuôi -ght thường là âm câm.', 'housing', 2, 24),
('88f77226-99a9-55bb-a84a-ffe738e8d4b4', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'progress', '/ˈprəʊɡres/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự phát triển hoặc cải thiện theo thời gian.', 'the process of improving or developing over a period of time towards a better state.', 'The research team reported steady progress in developing the new medical treatment.', 'Đội ngũ nghiên cứu đã báo cáo tiến độ đều đặn trong việc phát triển phương pháp điều trị y tế mới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked for a weekly report to check our progress on the construction project.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý yêu cầu báo cáo hàng tuần để kiểm tra tiến độ của chúng ta trong dự án xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-ljspeech-5aaf8905.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-cori-5aaf8905.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/progress-94f151e4.webp', '[\"advancement\", \"development\", \"improvement\"]', '[\"decline\", \"regression\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make progress\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra sự tiến bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"significant progress\", \"meaning\": \"tiến bộ đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work in progress\", \"meaning\": \"công việc đang tiến hành\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"process\", \"note_vi\": \"\'process\' là quá trình, \'progress\' là sự tiến bộ hoặc tiến độ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"progress\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"progressive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-cori-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru0-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru5-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru6-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru10-5aaf8905.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru9-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru3-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru7-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru8-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru2-5aaf8905.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-ljspeech-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-lt408-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-lt138-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-lt624-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-lt396-5aaf8905.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-lt498-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-lt132-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-lt288-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-lt42-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-lt90-5aaf8905.mp3\"]}}', 'Là danh từ không đếm được, không dùng \'a progress\' hay \'progresses\'.', 'business', 2, 25)
