('f85962c6-aeb0-5704-8af2-e9b1bc13359e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'fiction', '/ˈfɪkʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thể loại văn học hoặc câu chuyện không có thật, do trí tưởng tượng tạo ra.', 'literature in the form of prose, especially novels, that describes imaginary events and people.', 'The talented author gained widespread recognition after publishing her latest science fiction novel.', 'Tác giả tài năng đã đạt được sự công nhận rộng rãi sau khi xuất bản cuốn tiểu thuyết khoa học viễn tưởng mới nhất của cô.', '{\"en\": \"The bookstore has a large section dedicated to science fiction and business management.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sách có một khu vực lớn dành riêng cho truyện khoa học viễn tưởng và quản trị kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-ljspeech-9e8eb67d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-cori-9e8eb67d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fiction-ee6be968.webp', '[\"fantasy\", \"storytelling\", \"myth\"]', '[\"non-fiction\", \"fact\", \"truth\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"science fiction\", \"meaning\": \"khoa học viễn tưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work of fiction\", \"meaning\": \"tác phẩm hư cấu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"faction\", \"note_vi\": \"bè phái, phe cánh; viết gần giống fiction\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fictional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-cori-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-aru0-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-aru5-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-aru6-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-aru10-9e8eb67d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-aru9-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-aru3-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-aru7-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-aru8-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-aru2-9e8eb67d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-ljspeech-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-lt408-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-lt138-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-lt624-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-lt396-9e8eb67d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-lt498-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-lt132-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-lt288-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-lt42-9e8eb67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiction-lt90-9e8eb67d.mp3\"]}}', 'Fiction là thể loại văn học hư cấu, phân biệt với non-fiction (phi hư cấu).', 'media', 2, 26),
('6b97297f-20a8-55d1-93c5-732c6b9ef6ab', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3412bdd0-99ff-5585-b6b7-c8cfc88f2824', 'c090219c-765f-5eb7-8ff9-c7f6e36d471e', 'finger', '/ˈfɪŋɡə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một trong năm phần nhô ra ở cuối bàn tay.', 'one of the five parts at the end of a hand.', 'He accidentally cut his finger while slicing vegetables for dinner yesterday.', 'Anh ấy vô tình bị cắt vào ngón tay khi đang thái rau cho bữa tối hôm qua.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist typed with one finger on the old keyboard.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên lễ tân đã gõ bằng một ngón tay trên bàn phím cũ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-ljspeech-ec654d9c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-cori-ec654d9c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/finger-be337757.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"index finger\", \"meaning\": \"ngón trỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"finger nail\", \"meaning\": \"móng tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"point a finger\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ tay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fig\", \"note_vi\": \"fig là quả sung, không phải ngón tay\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-cori-ec654d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-aru0-ec654d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-aru5-ec654d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-aru6-ec654d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-aru10-ec654d9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-aru9-ec654d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-aru3-ec654d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-aru7-ec654d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-aru8-ec654d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-aru2-ec654d9c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finger-ljspeech-ec654d9c.mp3\", \"/s