('dc673a0d-93a5-519f-8794-5a9d121ad92f', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '39333668-61de-537c-898b-6f3fa68a6e32', '5a2b4d6b-ee23-5d39-b4dc-704f261557e0', 'enormous', '/ɪˈnɔːməs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cực kỳ lớn về kích thước hoặc số lượng.', 'extremely large in size, amount, degree, or extent of something.', 'The company made an enormous profit last quarter due to increased sales.', 'Công ty đã đạt được lợi nhuận khổng lồ trong quý trước nhờ doanh số tăng.', '{\"en\": \"The expansion project brought an enormous profit to the international shipping firm this year.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án mở rộng đã mang lại lợi nhuận khổng lồ cho công ty vận tải quốc tế trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-ljspeech-b3d6a9b7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-cori-b3d6a9b7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enormous-ff055793.webp', '[\"huge\", \"immense\", \"massive\"]', '[\"tiny\", \"small\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enormous amount\", \"meaning\": \"số lượng khổng lồ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enormous impact\", \"meaning\": \"tác động to lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"enormously\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enormity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-cori-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru0-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru5-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru6-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru10-b3d6a9b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru9-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru3-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru7-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru8-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru2-b3d6a9b7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-ljspeech-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-lt408-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-lt138-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-lt624-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-lt396-b3d6a9b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-lt498-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-lt132-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-lt288-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-lt42-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-lt90-b3d6a9b7.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để nhấn mạnh quy mô cực kỳ lớn, đồng nghĩa với \'huge\' hay \'giant\'.', 'business', 2, 22),
('90b72b8c-d356-551e-a01c-2d5e1fc931f1', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '39333668-61de-537c-898b-6f3fa68a6e32', '5a2b4d6b-ee23-5d39-b4dc-704f261557e0', 'couple', '/ˈkʌpl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hai người hoặc hai vật đi cùng nhau, hoặc một cặp vợ chồng/tình nhân.', 'two people or things that are together or linked.', 'The young couple held hands as they walked through the park.', 'Cặp đôi trẻ nắm tay nhau đi dạo trong công viên.', '{\"en\": \"A couple of clients visited our office for the contract signing.\", \"vi\": \"Một cặp khách hàng đã đến văn phòng chúng tôi để ký hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-ljspeech-33fc2d93.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-cori-33fc2d93.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/couple-2935b3e3.webp', '[\"pair\", \"duo\", \"twosome\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a couple of\", \"meaning\": \"một vài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"young couple\", \"meaning\": \"cặp trẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"married couple\", \"meaning\": \"cặp vợ chồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"double\", \"note_vi\": \"double nghĩa là gấp đôi, couple là hai.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"couple\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-cori-33fc2d93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-aru0-33fc2d93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-aru5-33fc2d93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-aru6-33fc2d93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-aru10-33fc2d93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-aru9-33fc2d93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-aru3-33fc2d93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-aru7-33fc2d93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-aru8-33fc2d93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/couple-aru2-33fc2d93.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st