('3049cb3d-d764-5ff6-99fe-f95e6528da7e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3b68733e-8e37-548d-8a0a-66fdc219770e', '7d2e9f60-6185-556d-8ac9-c44e52b25482', 'ship', '/ʃɪp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một phương tiện lớn đi trên biển để chở người hoặc hàng hóa.', 'a large boat used for transporting people or goods across the sea or ocean.', 'Our logistics manager arranged to ship the urgent order by express air freight.', 'Quản lý logistics của chúng tôi đã sắp xếp vận chuyển đơn hàng gấp bằng đường hàng không hỏa tốc.', '{\"en\": \"The cargo ship will arrive at the port tomorrow to unload the imported electronic goods.\", \"vi\": \"Tàu chở hàng sẽ đến cảng vào ngày mai để dỡ các mặt hàng điện tử.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-ljspeech-ed43a8a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-cori-ed43a8a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ship-a00ed7af.webp', '[\"vessel\", \"boat\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cargo ship\", \"meaning\": \"tàu chở hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cruise ship\", \"meaning\": \"tàu du lịch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sheep\", \"note_vi\": \"sheep là con cừu, ship là con tàu. Phát âm khác nhau.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shipment\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shipping\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-cori-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-aru0-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-aru5-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-aru6-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-aru10-ed43a8a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-aru9-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-aru3-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-aru7-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-aru8-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-aru2-ed43a8a0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-ljspeech-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-lt408-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-lt138-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-lt624-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-lt396-ed43a8a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-lt498-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-lt132-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-lt288-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-lt42-ed43a8a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ship-lt90-ed43a8a0.mp3\"]}}', 'Ship vừa là danh từ (tàu), vừa là động từ (vận chuyển).', 'business', 2, 2),
('82a70e80-4806-5e25-be93-bc3ae3afaae9', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3b68733e-8e37-548d-8a0a-66fdc219770e', '7d2e9f60-6185-556d-8ac9-c44e52b25482', 'scared', '/skeəd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy sợ hãi hoặc lo lắng về điều gì đó.', 'feeling fearful or anxious about something dangerous, painful, or unknown.', 'The little girl was scared of the dark and always slept with a nightlight.', 'Cô bé sợ bóng tối và luôn ngủ với đèn ngủ.', '{\"en\": \"Investors were scared that the unexpected market changes would lower their overall profits.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà đầu tư sợ rằng những thay đổi bất ngờ trên thị trường sẽ làm giảm tổng lợi nhuận của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-ljspeech-34305c61.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-cori-34305c61.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scared-6b077fc8.webp', '[\"afraid\", \"frightened\", \"fearful\"]', '[\"brave\", \"confident\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scared of\", \"meaning\": \"sợ hãi về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scared to death\", \"meaning\": \"sợ chết khiếp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sacred\", \"note_vi\": \"khác thứ tự chữ cái, sacred nghĩa là linh thiêng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"scare\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-cori-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-aru0-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-aru5-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-aru6-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-aru10-34305c61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-aru9-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-aru3-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-aru7-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-aru8-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-aru2-34305c61.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-ljspeech-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-lt408-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-lt138-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-lt624-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-lt396-34305c61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-lt498-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-lt132-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-lt288-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-lt42-34305c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scared-lt90-34305c61.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt scared (sợ hãi) với sacred (linh thiêng) dễ viết nhầm.', 'business', 2, 3),
('b414723c-936a-5718-9961-9dafbceaa7d1', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '3b68733e-8e37-548d-8a0a-66fdc219770e', '7d2e9f60-6185-556d-8ac9-c44e52b25482', 'such', '/sʌtʃ/', 'B1', 'determiner', 'Như thế, như vậy, dùng để nhấn mạnh hoặc chỉ một loại nào đó.', 'used to emphasize the degree of something or to refer to something already mentioned before.', 'It was such a beautiful day that we decided to go for a walk.', 'Đó là một ngày đẹp trời đến nỗi chúng tôi quyết định đi dạo.', '{\"en\": \"It was such a busy morning that we did not have time for a break.\", \"vi\": \"Đó là một buổi sáng bận rộn đến mức chúng tôi không có thời gian nghỉ ngơi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-ljspeech-47080e9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-cori-47080e9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/such-a1512ba6.webp', '[\"so\", \"like that\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"such as\", \"meaning\": \"như là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"such a\", \"meaning\": \"một... như vậy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"much\", \"note_vi\": \"much là nhiều, such là như vậy.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-cori-47080e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-aru0-47080e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-aru5-47080e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-aru6-47080e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-aru10-47080e9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-aru9-47080e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-aru3-47080e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-aru7-47080e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-aru8-47080e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-aru2-47080e9f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/such-ljspeech-47080e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec