('911a25d2-9eda-5661-8872-cac62f56790f', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '4335ca0d-f5e6-5639-8b75-9d01ee5197a5', '8fadb5a7-c236-5e83-abd3-0c38a96c293c', 'network', '/ˈnetwɜːk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hệ thống các đường dây hoặc kết nối với nhau.', 'a large system of connected parts, people, or computers that work together to share information.', 'Attending trade fairs allows companies to expand their business network rapidly.', 'Tham dự các hội chợ thương mại cho phép các công ty mở rộng mạng lưới kinh doanh nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"You should expand your professional network by attending industry conferences and meeting new business partners.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn nên mở rộng mạng lưới chuyên môn bằng cách tham dự các hội nghị ngành và gặp gỡ đối tác kinh doanh mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-ljspeech-c112e881.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-cori-c112e881.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/network-c219b406.webp', '[\"system\", \"connection\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"social network\", \"meaning\": \"mạng xã hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"computer network\", \"meaning\": \"mạng máy tính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"networking\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-cori-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-aru0-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-aru5-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-aru6-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-aru10-c112e881.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-aru9-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-aru3-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-aru7-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-aru8-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-aru2-c112e881.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-ljspeech-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-lt408-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-lt138-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-lt624-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-lt396-c112e881.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-lt498-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-lt132-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-lt288-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-lt42-c112e881.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/network-lt90-c112e881.mp3\"]}}', '\'Networking\' là kỹ năng quan trọng để tìm kiếm cơ hội việc làm.', 'technology', 2, 4),
('2e590e69-b229-556e-9e56-0c9d5c47ca3a', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '4335ca0d-f5e6-5639-8b75-9d01ee5197a5', '8fadb5a7-c236-5e83-abd3-0c38a96c293c', 'society', '/səˈsaɪəti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'xã hội, cộng đồng', 'people in general living together in a community with shared laws and traditions.', 'Education plays a crucial role in shaping a modern society.', 'Giáo dục đóng vai trò quan trọng trong việc định hình một xã hội hiện đại.', '{\"en\": \"The corporation announced a new charity project to support underprivileged families in local society.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn đã công bố một dự án từ thiện mới nhằm hỗ trợ các gia đình khó khăn trong xã hội địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/society-ljspeech-4abdad28.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/society-cori-4abdad28.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/society-ad7f354c.webp', '[\"community\", \"public\", \"civilization\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"civil society\", \"meaning\": \"xã hội dân sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"modern society\", \"meaning\": \"xã hội hiện đại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high society\", \"meaning\": \"tầng lớp thượng lưu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"social\", \"note_vi\": \"Social là tính từ (thuộc xã hội), còn society là danh từ (xã hội).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"social\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"socially\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"socialize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/society-cori-4abdad28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/society-aru0-4abdad28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/society-aru5-4abdad28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/society-aru6-4abdad28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/society-aru10-4abdad28.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/society-aru9-4abdad28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/society-aru3-4a