('bc1670cd-fe9a-5655-ac53-cd91bac758bc', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '4335ca0d-f5e6-5639-8b75-9d01ee5197a5', '8fadb5a7-c236-5e83-abd3-0c38a96c293c', 'owner', '/ˈəʊnə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người có quyền sở hữu hợp pháp đối với một vật gì đó.', 'a person who legally possesses and has the right to use something.', 'The owner of the restaurant greeted us warmly at the entrance.', 'Chủ sở hữu nhà hàng đã chào đón chúng tôi nồng nhiệt ở lối vào.', '{\"en\": \"The business owner decided to expand the shop after a successful year.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ doanh nghiệp đã quyết định mở rộng cửa hàng sau một năm thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-ljspeech-579233b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-cori-579233b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/owner-86f13fd7.webp', '[\"proprietor\", \"holder\", \"possessor\"]', '[\"tenant\", \"renter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"business owner\", \"meaning\": \"chủ doanh nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"property owner\", \"meaning\": \"chủ sở hữu tài sản\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"own\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ownership\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-cori-579233b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-aru0-579233b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-aru5-579233b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-aru6-579233b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-aru10-579233b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-aru9-579233b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-aru3-579233b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-aru7-579233b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-aru8-579233b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owner-aru2-579233b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/publi