('8e317a99-9f93-59d0-ac41-83975381a265', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '4335ca0d-f5e6-5639-8b75-9d01ee5197a5', '8fadb5a7-c236-5e83-abd3-0c38a96c293c', 'corner', '/ˈkɔːnə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Điểm gặp nhau của hai đường, hai mặt hoặc hai bức tường.', 'the point where two lines or surfaces meet to form an angle.', 'A new coffee shop recently opened on the corner of the main street.', 'Một quán cà phê mới vừa mở ở góc phố chính.', '{\"en\": \"The new office is located on the corner of the busy main street downtown.\", \"vi\": \"Văn phòng mới nằm ở góc đường chính sầm uất trong trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-ljspeech-eb542d91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-cori-eb542d91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/corner-32ed8c0b.webp', '[\"angle\", \"intersection\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"turn the corner\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua giai đoạn khó khăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cut corners\", \"meaning\": \"làm tắt, làm ẩu để tiết kiệm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-cori-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-aru0-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-aru5-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-aru6-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-aru10-eb542d91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-aru9-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-aru3-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-aru7-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-aru8-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-aru2-eb542d91.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-ljspeech-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-lt408-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-lt138-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-lt624-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-lt396-eb542d91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-lt498-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-lt132-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-lt288-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-lt42-eb542d91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corner-lt90-eb542d91.mp3\"]}}', 'Corner còn có nghĩa là dồn vào thế bí (verb).', 'daily', 2, 21),
('78cd1e9c-6c23-5c7d-a7dd-cdff0d015e4f', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '4335ca0d-f5e6-5639-8b75-9d01ee5197a5', '8fadb5a7-c236-5e83-abd3-0c38a96c293c', 'sir', '/sɜː(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cách xưng hô lịch sự với đàn ông, đặc biệt là người lạ hoặc cấp trên.', 'a formal and polite way to address a man, especially in a professional service setting.', '\"Excuse me, sir, could you tell me the way to the station?\"', '\"Xin lỗi, thưa ông, ông có thể chỉ cho tôi đường đến nhà ga được không?\"', '{\"en\": \"Excuse me, sir, could you please sign these documents before you leave the meeting room?\", \"vi\": \"Xin lỗi ông, ông có thể vui lòng ký vào các tài liệu này trước khi rời phòng họp không?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-ljspeech-e5f37c1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-cori-e5f37c1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sir-1d05cf43.webp', '[\"gentleman\", \"mister\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dear sir\", \"meaning\": \"kính gửi ông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"yes, sir\", \"meaning\": \"vâng, thưa ông\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-cori-e5f37c1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-aru0-e5f37c1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-aru5-e5f37c1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-aru6-e5f37c1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-aru10-e5f37c1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-aru9-e5f37c1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-aru3-e5f37c1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-aru7-e5f37c1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-aru8-e5f37c1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-aru2-e5f37c1b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sir-ljspeech-e5f37c1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v