('b240f718-cd7c-5e69-914e-110bb3e312bd', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '50a74e42-c9e1-5dad-8abe-9c25d0196621', '4bd0ecc1-9fb3-5238-a076-13bd0c06a81d', 'figure', '/ˈfɪɡə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một con số hoặc số liệu.', 'a symbol representing a number or an official amount recorded in business.', 'Government reports show that unemployment figures have dropped significantly this quarter.', 'Báo cáo của chính phủ cho thấy các con số về thất nghiệp đã giảm đáng kể trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"The financial manager reviewed the sales figure before submitting the quarterly report.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tài chính đã xem xét con số doanh số trước khi trình báo cáo quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-ljspeech-f85bdc67.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-cori-f85bdc67.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/figure-df9aeef7.webp', '[\"number\", \"digit\", \"amount\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sales figure\", \"meaning\": \"con số doanh số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exact figure\", \"meaning\": \"con số chính xác\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"figure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-cori-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-aru0-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-aru5-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-aru6-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-aru10-f85bdc67.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-aru9-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-aru3-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-aru7-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-aru8-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-aru2-f85bdc67.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-ljspeech-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-lt408-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-lt138-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-lt624-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-lt396-f85bdc67.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-lt498-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-lt132-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-lt288-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-lt42-f85bdc67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-lt90-f85bdc67.mp3\"]}}', 'Figure có nhiều nghĩa: con số, nhân vật, dáng người; trong TOEIC thường là con số tài chính.', 'finance', 2, 6),
('adc5b97c-be6b-5fd2-804d-fe29efa313cb', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '50a74e42-c9e1-5dad-8abe-9c25d0196621', '4bd0ecc1-9fb3-5238-a076-13bd0c06a81d', 'blank', '/blæŋk/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Không có chữ viết, hình ảnh, hoặc nội dung gì.', 'having nothing written or printed on a surface or in a space.', 'Applicants must not leave any blank fields when submitting their online job application.', 'Ứng viên không được để trống bất kỳ trường nào khi nộp đơn xin việc trực tuyến.', '{\"en\": \"Please return the contract with any blank sections completed by tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng trả lại hợp đồng với các phần trống được điền vào trước ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-ljspeech-6184d684.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-cori-6184d684.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blank-6640753d.webp', '[\"empty\", \"vacant\", \"unfilled\"]', '[\"filled\", \"marked\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"blank form\", \"meaning\": \"mẫu trống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blank space\", \"meaning\": \"khoảng trống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blank cheque\", \"meaning\": \"séc trắng (ủy quyền toàn quyền)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"blink\", \"note_vi\": \"blank là trống, blink là chớp mắt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"blankly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"blankness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-cori-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-aru0-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-aru5-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-aru6-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-aru10-6184d684.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-aru9-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-aru3-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-aru7-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-aru8-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-aru2-6184d684.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-ljspeech-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-lt408-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-lt138-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-lt624-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-lt396-6184d684.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-lt498-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-lt132-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-lt288-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-lt42-6184d684.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-lt90-6184d684.mp3\"]}}', 'Blank trống, đừng nhầm với blink (chớp mắt).', 'office', 2, 7),
('206a2569-c9c4-5230-b6b0-d97d05c884a8', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '50a74e42-c9e1-5dad-8abe-9c25d0196621', '4bd0ecc1-9fb3-5238-a076-13bd0c06a81d', 'control', '/kənˈtrəʊl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Quyền lực hoặc khả năng điều khiển, chi phối một cái gì đó.', 'the power to make decisions about how something is managed or operated.', 'Strict financial measures were implemented to regain control of the company\'s rising budget.', 'Các biện pháp tài chính nghiêm ngặt đã được thực thi nhằm giành lại sự kiểm soát đối với ngân sách đang tăng của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The manager kept strict control over the budget to avoid unnecessary expenses.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý kiểm soát chặt chẽ ngân sách để tránh các chi phí không cần thiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-ljspeech-2aeede80.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-cori-2aeede80.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/control-e6abe67a.webp', '[\"management\", \"authority\", \"command\"]', '[\"chaos\", \"disorder\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"quality control\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm soát chất lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under control\", \"meaning\": \"trong tầm kiểm soát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take control\", \"meaning\": \"nắm quyền kiểm soát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monitor\", \"note_vi\": \"monitor là theo dõi/giám sát; control là kiểm soát và có quyền can thiệp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"control\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"controller\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"controllable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"uncontrollable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-cori-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-aru0-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-aru5-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-aru6-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-aru10-2aeede80.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-aru9-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-aru3-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-aru7-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-aru8-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-aru2-2aeede80.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-ljspeech-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-lt408-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-lt138-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-lt624-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-lt396-2aeede80.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-lt498-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-lt132-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-lt288-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-lt42-2aeede80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/control-lt90-2aeede80.mp3\"]}}', '\'Quality control\' (QC) là cụm từ rất hay gặp trong đề TOEIC về sản xuất và quản lý.', 'office', 2, 8),
('3b696762-ecb9-5e0b-b10b-fb79c7372ec4', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '50a74e42-c9e1-5dad-8abe-9c25d0196621', '4bd0ecc1-9fb3-5238-a076-13bd0c06a81d', 'carpet', '/ˈkɑːpɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tấm vải dày dùng để trải sàn nhà.', 'a thick woven fabric material used for covering floors in buildings.', 'She bought a beautiful new carpet for her living room.', 'Cô ấy đã mua một tấm thảm mới rất đẹp cho phòng khách của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The facility manager scheduled a professional cleaning company to wash the office carpet.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cơ sở vật chất đã lên lịch cho công ty vệ sinh chuyên nghiệp giặt thảm văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-ljspeech-be207b77.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-cori-be207b77.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carpet-0968d49e.webp', '[\"rug\", \"mat\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fitted carpet\", \"meaning\": \"thảm trải kín sàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"red carpet\", \"meaning\": \"thảm đỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carpet cleaning\", \"meaning\": \"việc giặt thảm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rug\", \"note_vi\": \"carpet trải phủ kín toàn bộ sàn, rug chỉ là tấm thảm nhỏ rời.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"carpet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-cori-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru0-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru5-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru6-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru10-be207b77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru9-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru3-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru7-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru8-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru2-be207b77.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-ljspeech-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-lt408-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-lt138-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-lt624-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-lt396-be207b77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-lt498-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-lt132-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-lt288-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-lt42-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-lt90-be207b77.mp3\"]}}', 'Carpet thường chỉ thảm dệt phủ kín sàn nhà, khác với rug (thảm nhỏ rời).', 'housing', 2, 9),
('13772b2b-8fe2-565c-b07c-13d6d30a7ae2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '50a74e42-c9e1-5dad-8abe-9c25d0196621', '4bd0ecc1-9fb3-5238-a076-13bd0c06a81d', 'vehicle', '/ˈviːəkl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Phương tiện di chuyển, thường có bánh xe.', 'a machine used for transporting people or goods, such as a car, truck, or bus.', 'Bicycles are a great vehicle for short trips around the city.', 'Xe đạp là một phương tiện tuyệt vời cho những chuyến đi ngắn quanh thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"All company vehicles must be inspected by the maintenance team before the end of the month.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả xe cộ của công ty phải được đội bảo trì kiểm tra trước cuối tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-ljspeech-0b059106.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-cori-0b059106.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vehicle-3cb6d976.webp', '[\"transport\", \"conveyance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"company vehicle\", \"meaning\": \"xe công ty\"}, {\"phrase\": \"motor vehicle\", \"meaning\": \"xe cơ giới\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-cori-0b059106.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-aru0-0b059106.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-aru5-0b059106.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-aru6-0b059106.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-aru10-0b059106.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-aru9-0b059106.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-aru3-0b059106.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-aru7-0b059106.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-aru8-0b059106.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-aru2-0b059106.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vehicle-ljspeech-0b059106.mp3\", \"/storage/v1