('d489556f-7844-5abf-accb-edd1adb142eb', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '50a74e42-c9e1-5dad-8abe-9c25d0196621', '4bd0ecc1-9fb3-5238-a076-13bd0c06a81d', 'weight', '/weɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Độ nặng của một vật thể, được đo bằng đơn vị khối lượng.', 'The physical quantity expressing how heavy a particular item or body is.', 'The doctor asked me to check my weight regularly.', 'Bác sĩ yêu cầu tôi kiểm tra cân nặng thường xuyên.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping cost depends on the weight of the cargo.\", \"vi\": \"Chi phí vận chuyển phụ thuộc vào trọng lượng của hàng hóa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-ljspeech-afe04441.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-cori-afe04441.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weight-c50754cf.webp', '[\"heaviness\", \"mass\"]', '[\"lightness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lose weight\", \"meaning\": \"giảm cân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"body weight\", \"meaning\": \"cân nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weight limit\", \"meaning\": \"giới hạn trọng lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wait\", \"note_vi\": \"wait là chờ, weight là trọng lượng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weigh\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"weighty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-cori-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru0-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru5-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru6-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru10-afe04441.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru9-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru3-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru7-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru8-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru2-a