('36296d98-3f41-52fc-810f-2de5b0c180e7', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '518f1783-4de0-5475-ac2e-bd5eace06290', '8618bad3-c8f1-5fae-88a9-188ccc8784d1', 'deep', '/diːp/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có khoảng cách lớn từ bề mặt xuống đáy.', 'extending far down from the top or surface, or having a large distance between sides.', 'The ocean in this area is very deep, reaching several kilometers down.', 'Đại dương ở khu vực này rất sâu, xuống tới vài kilomet.', '{\"en\": \"The company needs to make a deep analysis of market trends before launching the product.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cần thực hiện một phân tích sâu về xu hướng thị trường trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-ljspeech-3dde59ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-cori-3dde59ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deep-7113bbdf.webp', '[\"profound\", \"bottomless\"]', '[\"shallow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deep analysis\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích sâu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deep understanding\", \"meaning\": \"sự hiểu biết sâu sắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"deepen\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"depth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-cori-3dde59ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-aru0-3dde59ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-aru5-3dde59ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-aru6-3dde59ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-aru10-3dde59ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-aru9-3dde59ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-aru3-3dde59ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-aru7-3dde59ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-aru8-3dde59ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deep-aru2-3dde59ff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/