('c01f7979-30ca-547e-ae62-8be39cb3880e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '518f1783-4de0-5475-ac2e-bd5eace06290', '8618bad3-c8f1-5fae-88a9-188ccc8784d1', 'weak', '/wiːk/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Không có sức mạnh, không khỏe.', 'not strong or having little power, energy, or ability to resist force.', 'The wireless internet signal in the basement office was too weak to send emails.', 'Tín hiệu internet không dây trong văn phòng tầng hầm quá yếu để gửi email.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s weak sales performance in the third quarter required immediate action from management.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số bán hàng yếu kém của công ty trong quý ba đòi hỏi ban quản lý phải hành động ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-ljspeech-1ded3053.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-cori-1ded3053.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weak-28c4d220.webp', '[\"fragile\", \"feeble\"]', '[\"strong\", \"powerful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"weak demand\", \"meaning\": \"nhu cầu yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weak performance\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu suất kém\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"week\", \"note_vi\": \"đồng âm, \'week\' nghĩa là tuần lễ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weaken\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weakness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"weakly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-cori-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru0-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru5-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru6-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru10-1ded3053.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru9-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru3-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru7-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat