('e20ed392-3fd4-5214-9adc-a69f7b34dafe', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '518f1783-4de0-5475-ac2e-bd5eace06290', '8618bad3-c8f1-5fae-88a9-188ccc8784d1', 'strange', '/streɪndʒ/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Khác thường, không quen thuộc, gây ngạc nhiên.', 'not expected or usual, often causing surprise or confusion because it is different.', 'I heard a strange noise coming from the attic last night.', 'Tối qua tôi nghe thấy một tiếng động lạ phát ra từ gác mái.', '{\"en\": \"It is strange that the manager did not attend the important quarterly budget meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Thật kỳ lạ khi người quản lý không tham dự cuộc họp ngân sách quý quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-ljspeech-1468ebe4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-cori-1468ebe4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/strange-4c292951.webp', '[\"odd\", \"unusual\"]', '[\"normal\", \"familiar\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strange behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi kỳ lạ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strange coincidence\", \"meaning\": \"sự trùng hợp kỳ lạ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"strangely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-cori-1468ebe4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-aru0-1468ebe4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-aru5-1468ebe4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-aru6-1468ebe4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-aru10-1468ebe4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-aru9-1468ebe4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-aru3-1468ebe4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-aru7-1468ebe4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-aru8-1468ebe4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strange-aru2-1468ebe4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pub