('c3aabf77-bbf8-534d-b350-44eb87064f3a', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '51eb4f4d-d432-5f33-9d6e-f57228471286', '328b3852-5be3-55ce-9d78-90564566b312', 'wind', '/wɪnd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Luồng không khí chuyển động tự nhiên trong khí quyển.', 'a current of air that moves across the surface of the earth.', 'A gentle wind blew through the open window during our morning meeting.', 'Một làn gió nhẹ thổi qua cửa sổ đang mở trong cuộc họp buổi sáng của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The strong wind caused a delay in the delivery of our shipment today.\", \"vi\": \"Cơn gió mạnh đã gây ra sự chậm trễ trong việc giao hàng của chúng tôi hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-ljspeech-e70091e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-cori-e70091e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wind-b0361a43.webp', '[\"breeze\", \"gust\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"strong wind\", \"meaning\": \"gió mạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wind power\", \"meaning\": \"năng lượng gió\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wind\", \"note_vi\": \"động từ: lên dây cót, phát âm khác /waɪnd/.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"windy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-cori-e70091e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-aru0-e70091e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-aru5-e70091e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-aru6-e70091e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-aru10-e70091e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-aru9-e70091e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-aru3-e70091e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-aru7-e70091e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-aru8-e70091e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-aru2-e70091e7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati