('0a6ce52e-219b-5b3d-b0e0-f912b66a20b2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '51eb4f4d-d432-5f33-9d6e-f57228471286', '328b3852-5be3-55ce-9d78-90564566b312', 'advertisement', '/ədˈvɜːtɪsmənt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thông báo công khai nhằm giới thiệu sản phẩm, dịch vụ.', 'a picture, short film, or text that tries to persuade people to buy a product or service.', 'The company posted a job advertisement on their website to recruit managers.', 'Công ty đã đăng một quảng cáo tuyển dụng trên trang web để chiêu mộ quản lý.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department placed a full-page advertisement in the local newspaper to promote the sale.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận tiếp thị đã đặt một quảng cáo nguyên trang trên tờ báo địa phương để thúc đẩy đợt giảm giá.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-ljspeech-f264e6fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-cori-f264e6fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/advertisement-4793de67.webp', '[\"commercial\", \"ad\", \"announcement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"job advertisement\", \"meaning\": \"quảng cáo tuyển dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"place an advertisement\", \"meaning\": \"đăng quảng cáo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commercial\", \"note_vi\": \"commercial thường chỉ quảng cáo trên TV/radio, advertisement bao quát hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"advertise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"advertiser\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-cori-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru0-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru5-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru6-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru10-f264e6fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advertisement-aru9-f264e6fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi