('9605be98-7fd9-5f32-a154-de74c02cd0fb', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '6c965487-9672-5c93-91d9-6a518b81a343', 'e10e6150-10ee-59cf-8f80-39a6f45d35ff', 'lawyer', '/ˈlɔɪə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'luật sư (người hành nghề luật pháp)', 'a qualified legal professional who provides counsel to clients and conducts litigation during court proceedings.', 'The corporation hired an experienced lawyer to handle the complex intellectual property dispute.', 'Tập đoàn đã thuê một luật sư giàu kinh nghiệm để xử lý tranh chấp trí tuệ phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"Our company lawyer will review the contract before we sign the final agreement next week.\", \"vi\": \"Luật sư của công ty chúng tôi sẽ xem xét hợp đồng trước khi chúng ta ký thỏa thuận cuối cùng vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-ljspeech-3a16417e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-cori-3a16417e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lawyer-2570d321.webp', '[\"attorney\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hire a lawyer\", \"meaning\": \"thuê luật sư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"corporate lawyer\", \"meaning\": \"luật sư doanh nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"law\", \"note_vi\": \"Luật sư tư vấn pháp lý, không phải thẩm phán (judge).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"law\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-cori-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-aru0-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-aru5-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-aru6-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-aru10-3a16417e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-aru9-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-aru3-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-aru7-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-aru8-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-aru2-3a16417e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-ljspeech-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-lt408-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-lt138-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-lt624-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-lt396-3a16417e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-lt498-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-lt132-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-lt288-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-lt42-3a16417e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lawyer-lt90-3a16417e.mp3\"]}}', 'Luật sư tư vấn pháp lý, không phải thẩm phán (judge).', 'law', 2, 10),
('352f743a-99d8-5449-bee6-59a33fd6f477', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '6c965487-9672-5c93-91d9-6a518b81a343', 'e10e6150-10ee-59cf-8f80-39a6f45d35ff', 'double', '/ˈdʌbl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Gấp đôi về số lượng, kích thước hoặc cường độ.', 'consisting of two parts or intended for two people to use at the same time.', 'I\'d like a double scoop of ice cream, please.', 'Làm ơn cho tôi hai muỗng kem.', '{\"en\": \"We reserved a double room for the business trip to ensure enough space for everyone.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã đặt một phòng đôi cho chuyến công tác để đảm bảo đủ không gian cho mọi người.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-ljspeech-bdb36bb2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-cori-bdb36bb2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/double-8f5c4065.webp', '[\"dual\", \"twofold\"]', '[\"single\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"double room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng đôi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"double check\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra kỹ lại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"doubly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-cori-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru0-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru5-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru6-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru10-bdb36bb2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru9-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru3-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru7-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru8-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru2-bdb36bb2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-ljspeech-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci