('e5ebd471-ce86-54d2-9807-deec6c45f033', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '6c965487-9672-5c93-91d9-6a518b81a343', 'e10e6150-10ee-59cf-8f80-39a6f45d35ff', 'clear', '/klɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Dễ hiểu, không mơ hồ; trong suốt, không bị che khuất.', 'easy to see, hear, or understand without any doubt or confusion.', 'The instructions were very clear, so everyone understood what to do.', 'Các hướng dẫn rất rõ ràng nên mọi người đều hiểu phải làm gì.', '{\"en\": \"The manager provided clear instructions on how to operate the new office equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đưa ra những hướng dẫn rõ ràng về cách vận hành thiết bị văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-ljspeech-168cbb2e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cori-168cbb2e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clear-33f234c5.webp', '[\"obvious\", \"plain\", \"evident\"]', '[\"vague\", \"unclear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"clear instructions\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear evidence\", \"meaning\": \"bằng chứng rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"clean\", \"note_vi\": \"clean là sạch sẽ (không bẩn), clear là rõ ràng (dễ hiểu/thấy).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"clearly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"clarity\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"clear\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cori-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru0-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru5-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru6-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru10-168cbb2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru9-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru3-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru7-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru8-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru2-168cbb2e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-ljspeech-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-lt408-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-lt138-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-lt624-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-lt396-168cbb2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-lt498-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-lt132-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-lt288-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-lt42-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-lt90-168cbb2e.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'clean\'. Clear thường dùng cho sự hiểu biết hoặc tầm nhìn.', 'office', 2, 12),
('84977d45-6eb5-5dd8-a7a8-e2cfe5dd2880', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '6c965487-9672-5c93-91d9-6a518b81a343', 'e10e6150-10ee-59cf-8f80-39a6f45d35ff', 'media', '/ˈmiːdiə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Các phương tiện truyền tin tức và thông tin cho công chúng.', 'the main ways that large numbers of people receive information and news, like television.', 'The news media reported extensively on the election results.', 'Các phương tiện truyền thông đã đưa tin rộng rãi về kết quả bầu cử.', '{\"en\": \"The company invited the local media to cover the launch of their new eco-friendly product.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã mời truyền thông địa phương đến đưa tin về sự kiện ra mắt sản phẩm thân thiện với môi trường mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-ljspeech-bb362a46.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-cori-bb362a46.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/media-bbaa774c.webp', '[\"press\", \"journalism\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"social media\", \"meaning\": \"mạng xã hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"news media\", \"meaning\": \"truyền thông tin tức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"medium\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-cori-bb362a46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-aru0-bb362a46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-aru5-bb362a46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-aru6-bb362a46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-aru10-bb362a46.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-aru9-bb362a46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-aru3-bb362a46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-aru7-bb362a46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-aru8-bb362a46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/media-aru2-bb362a46.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/p