('05303dc0-0ba5-5dc9-8ffc-308712e5455e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8529a8ed-98e1-51b6-8e9c-7d3800c71010', '6a41e2e0-9d3a-5bbc-b38e-4d0e02d83464', 'sheet', '/ʃiːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tấm vải trải giường; một tờ giấy phẳng.', 'a large piece of thin cloth used on a bed for sleeping on or under.', 'Please change the bed sheets before the guests arrive.', 'Vui lòng thay ga trải giường trước khi khách đến.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel housekeeper changed the dirty sheet and blankets before the new guest arrived.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên dọn phòng khách sạn đã thay ga trải giường và chăn bẩn trước khi khách mới đến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-ljspeech-542ebc9c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-cori-542ebc9c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sheet-0a8397de.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bed sheet\", \"meaning\": \"ga trải giường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clean sheet\", \"meaning\": \"ga trải giường sạch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sheet\", \"note_vi\": \"cũng có nghĩa là tờ giấy, cần dựa vào ngữ cảnh để dịch\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-cori-542ebc9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-aru0-542ebc9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-aru5-542ebc9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-aru6-542ebc9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-aru10-542ebc9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-aru9-542ebc9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-aru3-542ebc9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-aru7-542ebc9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-aru8-542ebc9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-aru2-542ebc9c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sheet-ljspeech-542ebc9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o