('1c4a3a02-de4d-57af-9c82-109d1780bc7c', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8529a8ed-98e1-51b6-8e9c-7d3800c71010', '6a41e2e0-9d3a-5bbc-b38e-4d0e02d83464', 'heart', '/hɑːrt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Cơ quan bơm máu trong cơ thể, nằm trong lồng ngực.', 'the organ in the chest that pumps blood throughout the entire body.', 'The doctor listened carefully to the patient\'s heart.', 'Bác sĩ đã lắng nghe cẩn thận tim của bệnh nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The medical center will sponsor a free heart checkup for senior citizens next month.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm y tế sẽ tài trợ một đợt khám tim miễn phí cho người cao tuổi vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-ljspeech-ef8201e1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-cori-ef8201e1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heart-6d359e41.webp', '[\"core\", \"center\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"heart attack\", \"meaning\": \"cơn đau tim\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heart rate\", \"meaning\": \"nhịp tim\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at the heart of\", \"meaning\": \"ở trung tâm của\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hearty\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"heartless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-cori-ef8201e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-aru0-ef8201e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-aru5-ef8201e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-aru6-ef8201e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-aru10-ef8201e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-aru9-ef8201e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-aru3-ef8201e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-aru7-ef8201e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-aru8-ef8201e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heart-aru2-ef8201e1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storag