('c230cc6d-878f-5768-a795-9859dc968969', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'fear', '/fɪə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác lo lắng, sợ hãi trước nguy hiểm hoặc điều không hay.', 'a strong feeling of being worried or frightened because something bad might happen.', 'Her greatest fear was speaking in public.', 'Nỗi sợ lớn nhất của cô ấy là nói trước đám đông.', '{\"en\": \"The fear of losing market share prompted the company to launch a new advertising campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Nỗi sợ mất thị phần đã thúc đẩy công ty tung ra một chiến dịch quảng cáo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-ljspeech-865a3923.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-cori-865a3923.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fear-6b16e2c4.webp', '[\"anxiety\", \"dread\"]', '[\"courage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fear of\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi sợ về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"express fear\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ nỗi sợ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fearful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-cori-865a3923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-aru0-865a3923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-aru5-865a3923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-aru6-865a3923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-aru10-865a3923.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-aru9-865a3923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-aru3-865a3923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-aru7-865a3923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-aru8-865a3923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-aru2-865a3923.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fear-ljspeech-865a3923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v