('f1f37b7f-441d-5f7a-ba2e-fa26f3f18e69', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'according to', '/əˈkɔːdɪŋ tə/', 'A2', 'preposition', 'Dựa trên những gì ai đó nói hoặc một nguồn thông tin.', 'as stated or reported by someone or something.', 'According to the weather forecast, it will rain tomorrow.', 'Theo dự báo thời tiết, ngày mai trời sẽ mưa.', '{\"en\": \"According to the new policy, all employees must submit reports by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Theo chính sách mới, tất cả nhân viên phải nộp báo cáo trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-ljspeech-3afbcfb4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-cori-3afbcfb4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/according-to-6f62939c.webp', '[\"as per\", \"based on\", \"in line with\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"according to the report\", \"meaning\": \"theo báo cáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"according to the schedule\", \"meaning\": \"theo lịch trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"according to the contract\", \"meaning\": \"theo hợp đồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"in accordance with\", \"note_vi\": \"in accordance with mang tính trang trọng hơn, thường dùng trong văn bản pháp lý\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-cori-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru0-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru5-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru6-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru10-3afbcfb4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru9-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru3-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru7-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru8-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-aru2-3afbcfb4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-ljspeech-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt408-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt138-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt624-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt396-3afbcfb4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt498-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt132-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt288-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt42-3afbcfb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/according-to-lt90-3afbcfb4.mp3\"]}}', '\'According to\' không dùng với ý kiến cá nhân của chính mình; dùng \'in my opinion\' thay thế.', 'office', 2, 5),
('873fcc2b-24d6-5c49-8398-7f602262f335', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'credit', '/ˈkredɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự tin tưởng cho phép mua hàng trả sau; điểm danh dự hoặc sự công nhận.', 'a system that allows you to buy things now and pay for them later.', 'Many students use a student credit card to manage their expenses.', 'Nhiều sinh viên sử dụng thẻ tín dụng sinh viên để quản lý chi tiêu của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The company extended a line of credit to its long-term business partners last quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã cấp hạn mức tín dụng cho các đối tác kinh doanh lâu năm trong quý vừa rồi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-ljspeech-9cf5e7cd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-cori-9cf5e7cd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/credit-302e1372.webp', '[\"loan\", \"financing\"]', '[\"debit\", \"cash\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"credit card\", \"meaning\": \"thẻ tín dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"line of credit\", \"meaning\": \"hạn mức tín dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"credit score\", \"meaning\": \"điểm tín dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"debit\", \"note_vi\": \"\'debit\' là tiền trừ thẳng từ tài khoản; \'credit\' là vay trước trả sau\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"creditor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"creditable\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"credit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-cori-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru0-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru5-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru6-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru10-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru9-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru3-9cf5e