('70f34c9d-c000-5e04-bdb4-6a57e110aa63', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'herself', '/hɜːˈself/', 'A2', 'pronoun', 'Đại từ phản thân, chỉ chính người phụ nữ hoặc cô gái đó.', 'used as the object of a verb or preposition when the female subject does the action.', 'She taught herself how to play the guitar.', 'Cô ấy tự học cách chơi đàn guitar.', '{\"en\": \"The director herself delivered the opening speech at the annual business conference yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Chính bà giám đốc đã đọc bài phát biểu khai mạc tại hội nghị kinh doanh thường niên hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-ljspeech-03558a3d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-cori-03558a3d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/herself-2e43f5fc.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"by herself\", \"meaning\": \"một mình cô ấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"express herself\", \"meaning\": \"tự bày tỏ bản thân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"her\", \"note_vi\": \"her là tân ngữ thông thường, herself là đại từ phản thân.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-cori-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru0-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru5-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru6-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru10-03558a3d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru9-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru3-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru7-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru8-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-aru2-03558a3d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-ljspeech-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-lt408-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-lt138-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-lt624-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-lt396-03558a3d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-lt498-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-lt132-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-lt288-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-lt42-03558a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herself-lt90-03558a3d.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng herself khi chủ ngữ và tân ngữ cùng chỉ một người nữ, hoặc để nhấn mạnh.', 'office', 2, 7),
('073cf906-fac0-5eec-b1ec-dddda24baab7', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'surprise', '/səˈpraɪz/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một sự kiện hoặc điều gì đó không mong đợi, gây ngạc nhiên.', 'an unexpected event or piece of news that makes you feel amazed.', 'The manager\'s resignation announcement came as a huge surprise to the entire department.', 'Thông báo từ chức của người quản lý là một sự bất ngờ lớn đối với toàn bộ phòng ban.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden increase in quarterly profits was a pleasant surprise for all the investors.\", \"vi\": \"Sự gia tăng đột ngột trong lợi nhuận hàng quý là một bất ngờ thú vị cho tất cả các nhà đầu tư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-ljspeech-63e76d7b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-cori-63e76d7b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surprise-2c72b04e.webp', '[\"shock\", \"amazement\"]', '[\"expectation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pleasant surprise\", \"meaning\": \"bất ngờ thú vị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"big surprise\", \"meaning\": \"bất ngờ lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"surprise\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"surprising\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"surprised\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-cori-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-aru0-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-aru5-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-aru6-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-aru10-63e76d7b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-aru9-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-aru3-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-aru7-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-aru8-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-aru2-63e76d7b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-ljspeech-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-lt408-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-lt138-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-lt624-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-lt396-63e76d7b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-lt498-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-lt132-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-lt288-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-lt42-63e76d7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprise-lt90-63e76d7b.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phát âm có âm /r/ ở âm tiết đầu tiên: /səˈpraɪz/.', 'business', 2, 8),
('cc146256-df60-5c0a-a53e-73e4828dc68a', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'rest', '/rest/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thời gian thư giãn, ngừng làm việc hoặc ngủ.', 'a period of time when you stop working or doing activities to relax and recover.', 'After a long day of hiking, all I wanted was some rest.', 'Sau một ngày dài đi bộ đường dài, tất cả những gì tôi muốn là nghỉ ngơi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager suggested that the team take a short rest before finishing the final report.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đề nghị cả nhóm nên nghỉ ngơi một chút trước khi hoàn thành bản báo cáo cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-ljspeech-27ad1672.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-cori-27ad1672.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rest-9cd862b0.webp', '[\"break\", \"relaxation\"]', '[\"work\", \"activity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take a rest\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ ngơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"well-deserved rest\", \"meaning\": \"kỳ nghỉ xứng đáng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"restful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-cori-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru0-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru5-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru6-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru10-27ad1672.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru9-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru3-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru7-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru8-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru2-27ad1672.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-ljspeech-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-lt408-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-lt138-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-lt624-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-lt396-27ad1672.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-lt498-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-lt132-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-lt288-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-lt42-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-lt90-27ad1672.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng như danh từ (sự nghỉ ngơi) hoặc động từ (nghỉ ngơi).', 'daily', 2, 9),
('301bc3dd-bc09-56c0-aa5d-6cf0859c0e63', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'stupid', '/ˈstjuːpɪd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Thiếu thông minh hoặc hành động không khôn ngoan.', 'showing a lack of good sense or judgment; not intelligent.', 'It was stupid of him to leave his wallet on the table unattended.', 'Thật ngu ngốc khi anh ấy để ví trên bàn mà không trông coi.', '{\"en\": \"It was a stupid mistake to send the email to the wrong client.\", \"vi\": \"Đó là một sai lầm ngu ngốc khi gửi email cho nhầm khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-ljspeech-5514ae81.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-cori-5514ae81.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stupid-8c0260fd.webp', '[\"foolish\", \"silly\", \"dumb\"]', '[\"smart\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stupid mistake\", \"meaning\": \"sai lầm ngu ngốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stupid idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng ngớ ngẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel stupid\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy ngu ngốc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"student\", \"note_vi\": \"student là sinh viên, dễ nhầm khi đọc nhanh.\"}, {\"word\": \"sturdy\", \"note_vi\": \"sturdy là chắc chắn, khác nghĩa ngu ngốc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stupidity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"stupidly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-cori-5514ae81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-aru0-5514ae81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-aru5-5514ae81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-aru6-5514ae81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-aru10-5514ae81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-aru9-5514ae81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-aru3-5514ae81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stupid-aru7-55