('aba26371-8d2f-5d7d-b514-0dc551ec612f', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'last', '/lɑːst/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Tiếp tục tồn tại hoặc diễn ra trong một khoảng thời gian.', 'to remain functional, durable, or ongoing throughout a specified timeframe.', 'The training seminar is scheduled to last all afternoon.', 'Buổi thảo luận huấn luyện dự kiến sẽ kéo dài suốt cả buổi chiều.', '{\"en\": \"The training session will last for three hours, so please bring your own water bottle.\", \"vi\": \"Buổi đào tạo sẽ kéo dài trong ba tiếng, vì vậy hãy mang theo chai nước của bạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-ljspeech-213ed3ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-cori-213ed3ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/last-c66fbefc.webp', '[\"endure\", \"continue\"]', '[\"end\", \"stop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"last long\", \"meaning\": \"kéo dài lâu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"last forever\", \"meaning\": \"kéo dài mãi mãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lost\", \"note_vi\": \"lost là quá khứ của lose, last là kéo dài.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lasting\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"lastly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-cori-213ed3ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-aru0-213ed3ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-aru5-213ed3ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-aru6-213ed3ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-aru10-213ed3ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-aru9-213ed3ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-aru3-213ed3ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-aru7-213ed3ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-aru8-213ed3ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-