('e8d549da-227d-57b6-9cf5-b5acede7697a', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'welcome', '/ˈwelkəm/', 'A1', 'interjection', 'Lời chào thể hiện sự vui mừng khi ai đó đến.', 'a word used to greet someone in a polite and friendly way.', 'The manager gave a warm speech to welcome the new employees to the company.', 'Quản lý đã phát biểu một bài diễn văn ấm áp để chào mừng các nhân viên mới đến với công ty.', '{\"en\": \"Welcome to our annual conference, and thank you all for attending today.\", \"vi\": \"Chào mừng đến với hội nghị thường niên của chúng tôi, và cảm ơn tất cả các bạn đã tham dự hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-ljspeech-c0b137fe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-cori-c0b137fe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/welcome-c98ebea7.webp', '[\"greetings\", \"hello\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"welcome to\", \"meaning\": \"chào mừng đến với\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"welcome\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"welcome\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-cori-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-aru0-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-aru5-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-aru6-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-aru10-c0b137fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-aru9-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-aru3-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-aru7-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-aru8-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-aru2-c0b137fe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-ljspeech-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-lt408-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-lt138-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-lt624-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-lt396-c0b137fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-lt498-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-lt132-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-lt288-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-lt42-c0b137fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/welcome-lt90-c0b137fe.mp3\"]}}', 'Welcome vừa là thán từ, động từ, tính từ và danh từ.', 'office', 2, 13),
('a39a9e5c-19bd-524a-bc0a-6f4c9c5705fa', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'nature', '/ˈneɪtʃə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thế giới tự nhiên, bao gồm cây cối, động vật, sông núi.', 'the physical world including plants, animals, and landscapes that exists without human influence or control.', 'Spending time in nature can be very relaxing and refreshing.', 'Dành thời gian trong thiên nhiên có thể rất thư giãn và sảng khoái.', '{\"en\": \"Our company supports projects that protect nature while building new factories in rural areas today.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi hỗ trợ các dự án bảo vệ thiên nhiên trong khi xây dựng nhà máy mới tại vùng nông thôn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-ljspeech-a5197f10.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-cori-a5197f10.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nature-405d7882.webp', '[\"environment\", \"outdoors\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mother nature\", \"meaning\": \"mẹ thiên nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in nature\", \"meaning\": \"trong tự nhiên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"natural\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"naturally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-cori-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru0-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru5-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru6-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru10-a5197f10.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru9-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru3-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru7-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru8-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p