('6b1eb7d1-0e4a-5bf7-99e6-c77312424670', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'extreme', '/ɪkˈstriːm/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Ở mức độ cao nhất, rất lớn hoặc rất nghiêm trọng.', 'very great in degree, or much more than is usual or expected.', 'The climbers faced extreme weather conditions on the mountain.', 'Những người leo núi đã đối mặt với điều kiện thời tiết khắc nghiệt trên núi.', '{\"en\": \"The company took extreme measures to prevent any further data leaks.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thực hiện các biện pháp cực đoan để ngăn chặn rò rỉ dữ liệu thêm nữa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-ljspeech-6928e849.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-cori-6928e849.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extreme-bf5baf3c.webp', '[\"severe\", \"intense\", \"excessive\"]', '[\"mild\", \"moderate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extreme weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết khắc nghiệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extreme caution\", \"meaning\": \"sự vô cùng thận trọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"extremely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extremist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-cori-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru0-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru5-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru6-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru10-6928e849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru9-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru3-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru7-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru8-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru2-6928e849.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-ljspeech-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt408-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt138-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt624-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt396-6928e849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt498-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt132-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt288-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt42-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt90-6928e849.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để nhấn mạnh mức độ vượt trội, vượt qua giới hạn thông thường.', 'other', 2, 23),
('c51ab95e-7600-58a7-a978-3b41f378504e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'pull', '/pʊl/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Kéo, lôi một vật về phía mình hoặc theo một hướng nhất định.', 'to move something towards yourself by using your hands or arms.', 'Workers had to pull the heavy lever down to start the factory machinery.', 'Công nhân phải kéo cần gạt nặng xuống để khởi động máy móc trong nhà máy.', '{\"en\": \"You should pull the handle firmly to open the heavy glass door of the office.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn nên kéo tay cầm thật mạnh để mở cánh cửa kính nặng của văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-ljspeech-c872d556.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-cori-c872d556.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pull-5df2ff49.webp', '[\"drag\", \"draw\"]', '[\"push\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pull out\", \"meaning\": \"rút ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pull over\", \"meaning\": \"tấp xe vào lề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"push\", \"note_vi\": \"Push là đẩy, pull là kéo, hai hành động ngược nhau.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-cori-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-aru0-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-aru5-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-aru6-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-aru10-c872d556.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-aru9-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-aru3-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-aru7-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-aru8-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-aru2-c872d556.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-ljspeech-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-lt408-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-lt138-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-lt624-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-lt396-c872d556.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-lt498-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-lt132-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-lt288-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-lt42-c872d556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pull-lt90-c872d556.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường thấy trên các biển báo cửa ra vào: Push (đẩy) hoặc Pull (kéo).', 'office', 2, 24),
('b85f96a7-bc8c-5580-9e19-77c9a76684ed', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'tidy', '/ˈtaɪdi/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Sắp xếp ngăn nắp, sạch sẽ và có trật tự.', 'having everything in the right place and arranged in a neat and organized way.', 'Before leaving the office, make sure your workspace is clean and tidy.', 'Trước khi rời văn phòng, hãy đảm bảo không gian làm việc của bạn sạch sẽ và gọn gàng.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure your workstation is tidy before you leave the office for the weekend.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo khu vực làm việc của bạn gọn gàng trước khi rời văn phòng cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-ljspeech-a78fb138.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-cori-a78fb138.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tidy-62ee6175.webp', '[\"neat\", \"organized\"]', '[\"messy\", \"untidy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keep tidy\", \"meaning\": \"giữ gọn gàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tidy up\", \"meaning\": \"dọn dẹp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tiny\", \"note_vi\": \"tiny là nhỏ xíu, tidy là gọn gàng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tidiness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"tidily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-cori-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-aru0-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-aru5-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-aru6-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-aru10-a78fb138.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-aru9-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-aru3-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-aru7-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-aru8-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-aru2-a78fb138.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-ljspeech-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-lt408-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-lt138-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-lt624-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-lt396-a78fb138.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-lt498-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-lt132-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-lt288-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-lt42-a78fb138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tidy-lt90-a78fb138.mp3\"]}}', '\"Tidy up\" là cụm động từ rất phổ biến.', 'office', 2, 25),
('3488346e-41e6-5f50-96b0-bb252d6fbac7', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'reception', '/rɪˈsepʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'quầy lễ tân (ở khách sạn, văn phòng)', 'the area in a hotel or office where visitors are greeted and registered.', 'Please check in at the reception desk when you arrive.', 'Vui lòng làm thủ tục tại quầy lễ tân khi bạn đến.', '{\"en\": \"Upon arriving at the corporate office, visitors must check in at the front reception desk.\", \"vi\": \"Khi đến văn phòng công ty, khách tham quan phải làm thủ tục tại bàn lễ tân phía trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-ljspeech-44057e3f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-cori-44057e3f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reception-c093abb4.webp', '[\"front desk\", \"lobby\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reception desk\", \"meaning\": \"bàn lễ tân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reception area\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực lễ tân\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"receptionist\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"receive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-cori-44057e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-aru0-44057e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-aru5-44057e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-aru6-44057e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-aru10-44057e3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-aru9-44057e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-aru3-44057e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-aru7-44057e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-aru8-44057e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reception-aru2-44057e3f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storag