('05143e01-8ec6-527f-8f0d-a3dd8910207b', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'mineral', 'UK: /ˈmɪnərəl/ | US: /ˈmɪnərəl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'khoáng sản', 'a naturally occurring inorganic solid substance obtained from under the ground.', 'They are searching for new sources of valuable minerals.', 'Họ đang tìm kiếm các nguồn khoáng sản quý giá mới.', '{\"en\": \"The national economy relies heavily on the export of oil and other natural minerals.\", \"vi\": \"Nền kinh tế quốc gia phụ thuộc lớn vào việc xuất khẩu dầu mỏ và các khoáng sản tự nhiên khác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-ljspeech-558d9ebf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-cori-558d9ebf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mineral-6ecaf6f1.webp', '[\"ore\", \"resource\", \"element\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mineral resources\", \"meaning\": \"tài nguyên khoáng sản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mineral water\", \"meaning\": \"nước khoáng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mineral-rich\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-cori-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-aru0-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-aru5-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-aru6-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-aru10-558d9ebf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-aru9-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-aru3-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-aru7-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-aru8-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-aru2-558d9ebf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-ljspeech-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-lt408-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-lt138-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-lt624-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-lt396-558d9ebf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-lt498-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-lt132-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-lt288-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-lt42-558d9ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mineral-lt90-558d9ebf.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong bài đọc về tài nguyên thiên nhiên hoặc sản phẩm đồ uống \'mineral water\'.', 'industry', 1, 27),
('ef34bb8d-04c7-596e-840f-295de785e1c1', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '868e0ad7-8ba9-53eb-9252-8c0c7f155e86', 'c8fdd44d-f347-53fc-b512-c83e8a88568a', 'nut', '/nʌt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một loại quả khô có vỏ cứng, ăn được phần nhân bên trong.', 'a small hard fruit with a thick shell that contains an edible seed inside.', 'She likes to add chopped nuts to her morning oatmeal.', 'Cô ấy thích thêm hạt đã băm vào món cháo yến mạch buổi sáng của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Please inform the kitchen staff if you have any severe nut allergies.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng thông báo cho nhân viên bếp nếu bạn bị dị ứng hạt nghiêm trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-ljspeech-85ae1763.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-cori-85ae1763.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nut-86400254.webp', '[\"seed\", \"kernel\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"nut allergy\", \"meaning\": \"dị ứng hạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nuts and bolts\", \"meaning\": \"chi tiết cơ bản / chi tiết kỹ thuật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"node\", \"note_vi\": \"node là nút/giao điểm, nut là hạt hoặc đai ốc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"nutty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-cori-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru0-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru5-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru6-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru10-85ae1763.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru9-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru3-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru7-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru8-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru2-85ae1763.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati