('ccc8387d-bd2e-5af1-8b41-e12b1d0faa93', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8acaa00f-6881-53ff-b300-1e20e0fff5ac', '54e62094-871a-537d-afbd-3a26357dcbd6', 'worst', '/wɜːst/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Tồi tệ nhất, kém nhất về chất lượng hoặc mức độ.', 'most bad in quality, condition, or degree compared to all other things.', 'Heavy traffic caused the worst delay our delivery team had experienced this month.', 'Giao thông đông đúc đã gây ra sự chậm trễ tệ nhất mà đội giao hàng của chúng tôi gặp phải trong tháng này.', '{\"en\": \"This was the worst financial quarter the retail firm had experienced in ten years.\", \"vi\": \"Đây là quý tài chính tệ nhất mà công ty bán lẻ trải qua trong mười năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-ljspeech-c5ce11c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-cori-c5ce11c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/worst-cb314953.webp', '[\"poorest\", \"dreadful\"]', '[\"best\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"worst scenario\", \"meaning\": \"kịch bản tồi tệ nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"worst fears\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi sợ lớn nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"worse\", \"note_vi\": \"\'worse\' là so sánh hơn, \'worst\' là so sánh nhất.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-cori-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru0-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru5-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru6-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru10-c5ce11c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru9-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru3-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru7-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru8-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru2-c5ce11c7.