('7524aa49-6c55-5faf-8cbb-9f36a20cdf3b', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8acaa00f-6881-53ff-b300-1e20e0fff5ac', '54e62094-871a-537d-afbd-3a26357dcbd6', 'half', '/hɑːf/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một trong hai phần bằng nhau của một cái gì đó.', 'one of two equal parts into which a whole thing is divided.', 'She ate only half of her sandwich because she was full.', 'Cô ấy chỉ ăn một nửa chiếc bánh mì kẹp vì đã no.', '{\"en\": \"More than half of the employees attended the annual company seminar yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Hơn một nửa số nhân viên đã tham dự hội thảo thường niên của công ty ngày qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-ljspeech-6dbdd59a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-cori-6dbdd59a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/half-024299d9.webp', '[\"part\", \"portion\"]', '[\"whole\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"first half\", \"meaning\": \"nửa đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"second half\", \"meaning\": \"nửa sau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in half\", \"meaning\": \"thành hai nửa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"halve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-cori-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru0-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru5-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru6-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru10-6dbdd59a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru9-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru3-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru7-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru8-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-aru2-6dbdd59a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-ljspeech-6dbdd59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun