('2e58bffe-f15e-5175-8065-0fafd5120180', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8caeb67e-edf2-5e8a-ae61-195b88c50a78', '3dd3a3b6-3c1e-530e-b338-cd56dc24438e', 'rock', '/rɒk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Vật liệu khoáng rắn tự nhiên cấu tạo nên vỏ Trái Đất.', 'a hard natural substance that forms part of the earth\'s surface and mountains.', 'We saw many interesting rock formations along the coastline.', 'Chúng tôi đã thấy nhiều khối đá có hình thù thú vị dọc theo bờ biển.', '{\"en\": \"Workers cleared a large rock from the construction site to start building the foundation.\", \"vi\": \"Các công nhân đã dọn một hòn đá lớn khỏi công trường để bắt đầu xây nền móng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-ljspeech-38464bf0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-cori-38464bf0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rock-a8242686.webp', '[\"stone\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"solid rock\", \"meaning\": \"đá cứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rock formation\", \"meaning\": \"cấu tạo đá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lock\", \"note_vi\": \"Khác âm đầu r/l; lock nghĩa là khóa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rocky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-cori-38464bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-aru0-38464bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-aru5-38464bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-aru6-38464bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-aru10-38464bf0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-aru9-38464bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-aru3-38464bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-aru7-38464bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-aru8-38464bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rock-aru2-38464bf0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v