('c6fc2920-8cfe-56ff-a82c-984adecf7f2e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8caeb67e-edf2-5e8a-ae61-195b88c50a78', '3dd3a3b6-3c1e-530e-b338-cd56dc24438e', 'pleased', '/pliːzd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy hài lòng hoặc vui vẻ về điều gì đó.', 'feeling happy and satisfied about something that has happened or been done.', 'I was very pleased with the results of the exam.', 'Tôi rất hài lòng với kết quả của kỳ thi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was very pleased with the team\'s performance on the recent project.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý rất hài lòng với hiệu suất của nhóm trong dự án gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-ljspeech-b2820646.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-cori-b2820646.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pleased-cab6e444.webp', '[\"happy\", \"satisfied\", \"glad\"]', '[\"displeased\", \"unhappy\", \"dissatisfied\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pleased with\", \"meaning\": \"hài lòng với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pleased to meet you\", \"meaning\": \"rất vui được gặp bạn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pleasant\", \"note_vi\": \"pleasant là dễ chịu (thời tiết, tính cách), pleased là cảm thấy hài lòng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"please\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pleasure\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pleasant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-cori-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-aru0-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-aru5-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-aru6-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-aru10-b2820646.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-aru9-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-aru3-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-aru7-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-aru8-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-aru2-b2820646.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-ljspeech-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-lt408-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-lt138-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-lt624-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-lt396-b2820646.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-lt498-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-lt132-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-lt288-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-lt42-b2820646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleased-lt90-b2820646.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'with\' hoặc động từ nguyên mẫu.', 'hr', 2, 20),
('336e3f58-82cd-5325-a001-41729ec0bc7e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8caeb67e-edf2-5e8a-ae61-195b88c50a78', '3dd3a3b6-3c1e-530e-b338-cd56dc24438e', 'revise', 'UK: /rɪˈvaɪz/ | US: /rɪˈvaɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'xem lại, sửa đổi (thường để cải thiện)', 'to examine and alter a document or plan in order to improve or update it.', 'The team needs to revise the report before submission.', 'Nhóm cần xem lại báo cáo trước khi nộp.', '{\"en\": \"The legal team asked us to revise the proposal before submitting it to the client.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ pháp lý đã yêu cầu chúng tôi chỉnh sửa bản đề xuất trước khi gửi cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-ljspeech-a5062f56.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-cori-a5062f56.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/revise-7cd19cb7.webp', '[\"modify\", \"amend\", \"alter\", \"edit\"]', '[\"maintain\", \"preserve\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"revise a contract\", \"meaning\": \"chỉnh sửa hợp đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"revise a schedule\", \"meaning\": \"sửa đổi lịch trình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"review\", \"note_vi\": \"Review là xem xét, đánh giá; revise là tiến hành sửa đổi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"revision\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"revised\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-cori-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-aru0-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-aru5-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-aru6-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-aru10-a5062f56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-aru9-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-aru3-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-aru7-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-aru8-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-aru2-a5062f56.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-ljspeech-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-lt408-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-lt138-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-lt624-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-lt396-a5062f56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-lt498-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-lt132-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-lt288-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-lt42-a5062f56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revise-lt90-a5062f56.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'revise\' (chủ động sửa đổi nội dung) và \'review\' (đánh giá, xem lại).', 'office', 1, 21),
('5515c062-0964-5dcf-9550-0a4496b7aef2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8caeb67e-edf2-5e8a-ae61-195b88c50a78', '3dd3a3b6-3c1e-530e-b338-cd56dc24438e', 'able', '/ˈeɪbl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng làm gì đó.', 'having the capacity or skill to perform a task.', 'After practicing for months, she was finally able to play the song perfectly.', 'Sau nhiều tháng luyện tập, cuối cùng cô ấy đã có thể chơi bản nhạc một cách hoàn hảo.', '{\"en\": \"Our team was able to close the deal with the new client.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ của chúng tôi đã có thể chốt hợp đồng với khách hàng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-ljspeech-782e5ce8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-cori-782e5ce8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/able-10098f4a.webp', '[\"capable\", \"competent\"]', '[\"incapable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be able to\", \"meaning\": \"có thể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"able to help\", \"meaning\": \"có thể giúp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"able to attend\", \"meaning\": \"có thể tham gia\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"enable\", \"note_vi\": \"enable là động từ, able là tính từ cùng gốc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ability\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"enable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-cori-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-aru0-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-aru5-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-aru6-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-aru10-782e5ce8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-aru9-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-aru3-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-aru7-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-aru8-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-aru2-782e5ce8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-ljspeech-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-lt408-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-lt138-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-lt624-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-lt396-782e5ce8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-lt498-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-lt132-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-lt288-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-lt42-782e5ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/able-lt90-782e5ce8.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ able là tính từ, đi với to-infinitive: be able to do.', 'office', 2, 22),
('323bfee1-d860-5c49-bf1b-6f6d8a9ce0fb', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8caeb67e-edf2-5e8a-ae61-195b88c50a78', '3dd3a3b6-3c1e-530e-b338-cd56dc24438e', 'once', 'UK: /wʌns/ | US: /wʌns/', 'B1', 'conjunction', 'một khi, ngay khi', 'As soon as or from the moment that a specific event occurs.', 'Once you submit the form, you cannot edit it.', 'Một khi bạn gửi biểu mẫu, bạn không thể chỉnh sửa nó.', '{\"en\": \"Once the contract is signed by both parties, we can begin work on the project immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Một khi hợp đồng được ký bởi cả hai bên, chúng ta có thể bắt đầu làm dự án ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-ljspeech-18638356.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-cori-18638356.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/once-de04318e.webp', '[\"as soon as\", \"the moment\", \"when\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"once agreed\", \"meaning\": \"một khi đã thống nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"once completed\", \"meaning\": \"ngay khi hoàn thành\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"at once\", \"note_vi\": \"\'At once\' là trạng từ có nghĩa là ngay lập tức, trong khi liên từ \'once\' nghĩa là ngay khi/một khi.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-cori-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru0-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru5-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru6-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru10-18638356.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru9-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru3-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru7-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru8-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru2-18638356.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-ljspeech-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt408-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt138-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt624-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt396-18638356.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt498-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt132-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt288-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt42-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt90-18638356.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi làm liên từ, \'once\' nối hai mệnh đề (Once + S + V, S + V) mang nghĩa \'ngay khi/một khi...\'. Khi làm trạng từ, nó có nghĩa là \'một lần\'.', 'office', 1, 23),
('4f00de92-6b00-5fab-b247-cacf26b61a10', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8caeb67e-edf2-5e8a-ae61-195b88c50a78', '3dd3a3b6-3c1e-530e-b338-cd56dc24438e', 'after', '/ˈɑːftə(r)/', 'A1', 'preposition', 'theo sau về thời gian hoặc thứ tự', 'following in time, place, order, or importance.', 'The project manager scheduled a brief team briefing immediately after lunch.', 'Trưởng dự án đã lên lịch cho một cuộc họp ngắn của đội ngay sau giờ ăn trưa.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team will hold a brief meeting immediately after the lunch break today.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị sẽ tổ chức một cuộc họp ngắn ngay sau giờ nghỉ trưa hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-ljspeech-405906c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-cori-405906c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/after-a5e8f32d.webp', '[\"following\", \"behind\"]', '[\"before\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"day after day\", \"meaning\": \"ngày này qua ngày khác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"after work\", \"meaning\": \"sau giờ làm việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"later\", \"note_vi\": \"after đi với danh từ/mệnh đề, later đứng một mình\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"afterward\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-cori-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-aru0-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-aru5-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-aru6-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-aru10-405906c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-aru9-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-aru3-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-aru7-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-aru8-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-aru2-405906c9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-ljspeech-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-lt408-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-lt138-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-lt624-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-lt396-405906c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-lt498-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-lt132-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-lt288-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-lt42-405906c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after-lt90-405906c9.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn cách dùng giữa after (giới từ/liên từ) và afterward (trạng từ).', 'office', 2, 24),
('7d967f1b-bc98-50cb-99f1-17b3a9ef8479', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8caeb67e-edf2-5e8a-ae61-195b88c50a78', '3dd3a3b6-3c1e-530e-b338-cd56dc24438e', 'link', '/lɪŋk/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nối hoặc tạo mối quan hệ giữa hai hoặc nhiều thứ.', 'to join two or more things or ideas together in a clear way.', 'The new bridge will link the two parts of the city.', 'Cây cầu mới sẽ nối hai phần của thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The new bridge will link the industrial zone to the main highway for faster transport.\", \"vi\": \"Cây cầu mới sẽ kết nối khu công nghiệp với đường cao tốc chính để vận chuyển nhanh hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-ljspeech-4f0aa52d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-cori-4f0aa52d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/link-2417d0c1.webp', '[\"connect\", \"join\"]', '[\"separate\", \"disconnect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"link together\", \"meaning\": \"kết nối với nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"direct link\", \"meaning\": \"kết nối trực tiếp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"linkage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-cori-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-aru0-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-aru5-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-aru6-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-aru10-4f0aa52d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-aru9-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-aru3-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-aru7-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-aru8-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-aru2-4f0aa52d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-ljspeech-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-lt408-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-lt138-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-lt624-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-lt396-4f0aa52d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-lt498-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-lt132-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-lt288-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-lt42-4f0aa52d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/link-lt90-4f0aa52d.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng cả nghĩa đen (cầu đường) và nghĩa bóng (kết nối dữ liệu, ý tưởng).', 'technology', 2, 25),
('8da5df75-4e77-505c-a6a6-e5e65695a985', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8caeb67e-edf2-5e8a-ae61-195b88c50a78', '3dd3a3b6-3c1e-530e-b338-cd56dc24438e', 'affect', '/əˈfekt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Tác động hoặc gây ra sự thay đổi ở cái gì đó.', 'to cause a change in someone or something, or to have an impact on them.', 'The new policy will directly affect all employees.', 'Chính sách mới sẽ ảnh hưởng trực tiếp đến tất cả nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"Rising fuel costs will directly affect the shipping prices for all international orders.\", \"vi\": \"Chi phí nhiên liệu tăng cao sẽ ảnh hưởng trực tiếp đến giá vận chuyển cho tất cả các đơn hàng quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-ljspeech-5c1b9018.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-cori-5c1b9018.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/affect-3851fcac.webp', '[\"influence\", \"impact\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"negatively affect\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hưởng tiêu cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"directly affect\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hưởng trực tiếp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"effect\", \"note_vi\": \"Affect là động từ (ảnh hưởng), effect là danh từ (kết quả).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"effect\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-cori-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru0-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru5-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru6-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru10-5c1b9018.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru9-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru3-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru7-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru8-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affec