('94ab738d-8feb-5732-b8f0-70ef7b4553fe', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '8caeb67e-edf2-5e8a-ae61-195b88c50a78', '3dd3a3b6-3c1e-530e-b338-cd56dc24438e', 'resource', 'UK: /rɪˈzɔːs/ | US: /ˈriːsɔːrs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'tài nguyên', 'a useful supply of materials, money, or staff that an organization can use to function effectively.', 'Natural resources are essential for economic growth.', 'Tài nguyên thiên nhiên rất cần thiết cho tăng trưởng kinh tế.', '{\"en\": \"The project leader requested additional financial resources to meet the tight deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng dự án đã yêu cầu thêm nguồn lực tài chính để kịp thời hạn gấp gáp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-ljspeech-7a104738.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-cori-7a104738.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/resource-ba0a27cd.webp', '[\"assets\", \"supplies\", \"materials\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"human resources\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn nhân lực / phòng nhân sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"allocate resources\", \"meaning\": \"phân bổ nguồn lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"source\", \"note_vi\": \"source là nguồn gốc/xuất xứ của thông tin hay nguyên liệu, còn resource là tài nguyên sẵn có.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"resourceful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-cori-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-aru0-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-aru5-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-aru6-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-aru10-7a104738.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-aru9-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-aru3-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-aru7-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-aru8-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-aru2-7a104738.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-ljspeech-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-lt408-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-lt138-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-lt624-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-lt396-7a104738.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-lt498-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-lt132-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-lt288-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-lt42-7a104738.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resource-lt90-7a104738.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ này thường ở dạng số nhiều \'resources\'. Cụm \'Human Resources\' (HR) chỉ phòng Nhân sự.', 'office', 1, 29),
('ed522ee5-afd1-5cd1-adb6-0c7387ef6c95', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'election', 'UK: /ɪˈlɛkʃən/ | US: /ɪˈlɛkʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cuộc bầu cử', 'A formal process in which people vote to choose individuals for public or official positions.', 'The results of the city election will be announced today.', 'Kết quả cuộc bầu cử thành phố sẽ được công bố hôm nay.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors will hold an election next month to choose the new CEO.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị sẽ tổ chức một cuộc bầu cử vào tháng tới để chọn ra CEO mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-ljspeech-ed9c23ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-cori-ed9c23ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/election-3bfc0f0a.webp', '[\"vote\", \"ballot\", \"selection\", \"poll\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hold an election\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức một cuộc bầu cử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"election results\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả bầu cử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upcoming election\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc bầu cử sắp tới\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"elect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"elective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-cori-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru0-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru5-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru6-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru10-ed9c23ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru9-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru3-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru7-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru8-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"