('e6d2764e-d1db-5a78-9e67-e989b37a5639', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'soldier', '/ˈsəʊldʒə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người lính, chiến sĩ trong quân đội.', 'a person who serves in an army and performs tasks related to military defense.', 'The young soldier received a medal for courage during the rescue operation.', 'Người lính trẻ đã nhận được huy chương vì sự dũng cảm trong chiến dịch cứu hộ.', '{\"en\": \"The security company hired a former soldier to manage the facility\'s complex surveillance system.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty an ninh đã thuê một cựu quân nhân để quản lý hệ thống giám sát phức tạp của cơ sở.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-ljspeech-5a58d848.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-cori-5a58d848.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/soldier-ba99fa5b.webp', '[\"military personnel\", \"trooper\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"brave soldier\", \"meaning\": \"người lính dũng cảm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"serve as a soldier\", \"meaning\": \"phục vụ như một người lính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"soldiery\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-cori-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-aru0-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-aru5-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-aru6-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-aru10-5a58d848.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-aru9-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-aru3-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-aru7-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-aru8-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-aru2-5a58d848.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-ljspeech-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-lt408-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-lt138-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-lt624-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-lt396-5a58d848.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-lt498-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-lt132-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-lt288-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-lt42-5a58d848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soldier-lt90-5a58d848.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong các bài đọc về tuyển dụng hoặc tiểu sử nhân vật.', 'other', 2, 2),
('677765df-2714-5ac7-8133-e238802b22a5', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'although', '/ɔːlˈðəʊ/', 'A2', 'conjunction', 'Từ dùng để giới thiệu một mệnh đề tương phản.', 'used to introduce a statement that makes the main clause seem surprising.', 'Although it was raining, we still decided to go for a walk in the park.', 'Mặc dù trời đang mưa, chúng tôi vẫn quyết định đi dạo trong công viên.', '{\"en\": \"Although the budget was limited, the marketing team produced an impressive advertisement.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù ngân sách hạn chế, đội ngũ tiếp thị vẫn tạo ra một quảng cáo ấn tượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-ljspeech-dea713fc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-cori-dea713fc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/although-f9db9a1c.webp', '[\"though\", \"even though\"]', NULL, NULL, '[{\"word\": \"despite\", \"note_vi\": \"Although đi với mệnh đề (S+V), còn despite đi với danh từ hoặc V-ing.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-cori-dea713fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-aru0-dea713fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-aru5-dea713fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-aru6-dea713fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-aru10-dea713fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-aru9-dea713fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-aru3-dea713fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-aru7-dea713fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-aru8-dea713fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-aru2-dea713fc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/although-ljspeech-dea713fc.mp3\", \"/sto