('376924c2-c608-51e4-9e1c-1d53f82a27cd', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'designer', '/dɪˈzaɪnə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người sáng tạo ra mẫu mã, kiểu dáng cho sản phẩm, quần áo, công trình.', 'a person who creates plans or drawings for how something should be made or look.', 'Our graphic designer created a stunning layout for the annual report.', 'Nhà thiết kế đồ họa của chúng tôi đã tạo ra một bố cục tuyệt đẹp cho báo cáo thường niên.', '{\"en\": \"The lead graphic designer will present the new marketing layout to the board members tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế đồ họa chính sẽ trình bày bố cục tiếp thị mới cho các thành viên hội đồng vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-ljspeech-1ec1e366.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-cori-1ec1e366.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/designer-0493d0ac.webp', '[\"creator\", \"planner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fashion designer\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thiết kế thời trang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"graphic designer\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thiết kế đồ họa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"design\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"design\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-cori-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru0-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru5-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru6-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru10-1ec1e366.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru9-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru3-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru7-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru8-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-aru2-1ec1e366.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-ljspeech-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-lt408-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-lt138-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-lt624-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-lt396-1ec1e366.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-lt498-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-lt132-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-lt288-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-lt42-1ec1e366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designer-lt90-1ec1e366.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'sign\' (biển báo), từ này có gốc là \'design\' (thiết kế).', 'marketing', 2, 4),
('a0b4327f-d186-5f19-a27e-6313a012f30a', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'cycle', '/ˈsaɪkl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loạt các sự kiện lặp lại theo trình tự.', 'a series of events that happen in a particular order and are often repeated.', 'The water cycle is a continuous process that moves water around the Earth.', 'Chu trình nước là một quá trình liên tục di chuyển nước khắp Trái Đất.', '{\"en\": \"The billing cycle for all corporate accounts ends on the last day of the month.\", \"vi\": \"Chu kỳ thanh toán cho tất cả các tài khoản doanh nghiệp kết thúc vào ngày cuối cùng của tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-ljspeech-5d2432d4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-cori-5d2432d4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cycle-1838d38d.webp', '[\"phase\", \"pattern\", \"loop\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"billing cycle\", \"meaning\": \"chu kỳ thanh toán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business cycle\", \"meaning\": \"chu kỳ kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"circle\", \"note_vi\": \"circle là hình tròn, cycle là chu kỳ lặp lại theo thời gian.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cyclical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-cori-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-aru0-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-aru5-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-aru6-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-aru10-5d2432d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-aru9-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-aru3-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-aru7-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-aru8-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-aru2-5d2432d4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-ljspeech-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-lt408-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-lt138-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-lt624-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-lt396-5d2432d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-lt498-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-lt132-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-lt288-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-lt42-5d2432d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cycle-lt90-5d2432d4.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, từ này thường xuất hiện trong cụm \'billing cycle\' (chu kỳ thanh toán).', 'finance', 2, 5),
('42bf975a-0a44-53ac-a194-a5fa830fb4b2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'single', '/ˈsɪŋɡl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Chỉ một, duy nhất; chưa kết hôn.', 'only one, not double or multiple, consisting of just one part or item.', 'He ate every single piece of cake by himself.', 'Anh ấy đã ăn hết từng miếng bánh một mình.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a single room at a discounted rate for business travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp phòng đơn với mức giá ưu đãi cho khách đi công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-ljspeech-ce0b1612.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-cori-ce0b1612.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/single-4dd9952a.webp', '[\"sole\", \"individual\", \"lone\"]', '[\"double\", \"multiple\", \"several\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"single room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"single ticket\", \"meaning\": \"vé một chiều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"every single\", \"meaning\": \"mỗi một, từng cái một\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sole\", \"note_vi\": \"sole nhấn mạnh duy nhất không có ai/cái khác, single chỉ đơn giản là một\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"singly\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"single\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"singleton\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-cori-ce0b1612.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-aru0-ce0b1612.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-aru5-ce0b1612.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-aru6-ce0b1612.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-aru10-ce0b1612.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-aru9-ce0b1612.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-aru3-ce0b1612.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-aru7-ce0b1612.mp3\", \"/s