('d87c77d9-ba66-5730-8220-a35e61a25835', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'direction', '/dəˈrekʃn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hướng đi, phía nào đó; sự chỉ dẫn.', 'the position towards which someone or something moves or faces.', 'Can you give me directions to the nearest post office?', 'Bạn có thể chỉ cho tôi đường đến bưu điện gần nhất không?', '{\"en\": \"Please follow the signs in the correct direction to find the human resources department.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đi theo các biển báo đúng hướng để tìm phòng nhân sự.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-ljspeech-57077e98.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-cori-57077e98.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/direction-88903019.webp', '[\"way\", \"route\", \"path\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"in the right direction\", \"meaning\": \"đúng hướng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sense of direction\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng định hướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"instruction\", \"note_vi\": \"directions (số nhiều) thường là chỉ dẫn đường đi, instruction là hướng dẫn sử dụng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"direct\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"directly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"director\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-cori-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru0-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru5-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru6-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru10-57077e98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru9-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru3-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direction-aru7-57077e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec