('4d4ff96c-b08c-5ecf-875a-3b7cd78d8a16', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'intelligent', '/ɪnˈtelɪdʒənt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng học hỏi, hiểu và áp dụng kiến thức nhanh chóng.', 'showing a high level of mental ability to learn, understand, and think.', 'Engineers designed an intelligent system to monitor energy consumption in the building.', 'Các kỹ sư đã thiết kế một hệ thống thông minh để giám sát việc tiêu thụ năng lượng trong tòa nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The factory installed an intelligent system to monitor energy consumption automatically.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã lắp đặt một hệ thống thông minh để tự động theo dõi lượng tiêu thụ năng lượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-ljspeech-065e43c0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-cori-065e43c0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intelligent-8fca482d.webp', '[\"smart\", \"clever\", \"bright\"]', '[\"stupid\", \"foolish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intelligent design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế thông minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly intelligent\", \"meaning\": \"rất thông minh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intelligible\", \"note_vi\": \"dễ hiểu, rõ ràng (về ngôn ngữ, âm thanh)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intelligence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"intelligently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-cori-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-aru0-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-aru5-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-aru6-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-aru10-065e43c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-aru9-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-aru3-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-aru7-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-aru8-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-aru2-065e43c0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-ljspeech-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-lt408-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-lt138-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-lt624-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-lt396-065e43c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-lt498-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-lt132-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-lt288-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-lt42-065e43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intelligent-lt90-065e43c0.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với intelligible nghĩa là dễ hiểu, có thể hiểu được.', 'technology', 2, 24),
('4c7b8bc2-6c57-5107-82ba-a123d5b1d2f9', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'narrow', '/ˈnærəʊ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có chiều rộng nhỏ, hẹp.', 'having a small distance from one side to the other; not wide.', 'Delivery drivers found it difficult to maneuver large trucks through the narrow alleyway.', 'Các tài xế giao hàng thấy khó khăn khi điều khiển những chiếc xe tải lớn qua con hẻm hẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The narrow hallway in the office building made it difficult to move large equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Hành lang hẹp trong tòa nhà văn phòng khiến việc di chuyển thiết bị lớn trở nên khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-ljspeech-e1b335fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-cori-e1b335fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/narrow-0daa1c03.webp', '[\"slim\", \"tight\", \"confined\"]', '[\"wide\", \"broad\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"narrow road\", \"meaning\": \"con đường hẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"narrow margin\", \"meaning\": \"biên độ hẹp, chênh lệch nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"narrow down\", \"meaning\": \"thu hẹp lại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"slim\", \"note_vi\": \"\'slim\' thường tả người hoặc cơ hội; \'narrow\' tả không gian hoặc phạm vi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"narrow\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"narrowly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"narrowness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-cori-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru0-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru5-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru6-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru10-e1b335fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru9-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-ar