('432ac607-1078-5fc6-aeaf-d71dec66b83c', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'point', 'UK: /pɔɪnt/ | US: /pɔɪnt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'chỉ, trỏ', 'to indicate a direction or position using one\'s finger or an object.', 'He pointed to the correct answer on the board.', 'Anh ấy chỉ vào câu trả lời đúng trên bảng.', '{\"en\": \"During the presentation, the speaker pointed to the chart to highlight the recent sales growth.\", \"vi\": \"Trong suốt buổi thuyết trình, diễn giả đã chỉ vào biểu đồ để làm nổi bật sự tăng trưởng doanh số gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-ljspeech-71a7ca85.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-cori-71a7ca85.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/point-8e3a7834.webp', '[\"indicate\", \"direct\", \"gesture\", \"signal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"point out\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ ra, lưu ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"point to\", \"meaning\": \"hướng về, chỉ vào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"appoint\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Appoint\' có nghĩa là bổ nhiệm nhân sự, hoàn toàn khác với \'point\' (chỉ trỏ).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"point\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pointed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-cori-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-aru0-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-aru5-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-aru6-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-aru10-71a7ca85.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-aru9-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-aru3-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-aru7-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-aru8-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-aru2-71a7ca85.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-ljspeech-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-lt408-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-lt138-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-lt624-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-lt396-71a7ca85.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-lt498-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-lt132-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-lt288-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-lt42-71a7ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/point-lt90-71a7ca85.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'point out\' (chỉ ra/lưu ý) và \'point to\' (chỉ về hướng) cực kỳ hay xuất hiện trong bài thi TOEIC.', 'office', 1, 27),
('c04b5e8a-4699-522f-9520-9d9d499d3c11', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'lecture', '/ˈlektʃə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bài nói chuyện hoặc bài học dài về một chủ đề cụ thể.', 'a formal talk given to a group of people in order to teach them about a subject.', 'Students attended an informative lecture on environmental sustainability yesterday morning.', 'Các sinh viên đã tham dự một bài giảng bổ ích về sự phát triển bền vững của môi trường vào sáng qua.', '{\"en\": \"The guest speaker will deliver a lecture on modern marketing strategies in the main hall.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả khách mời sẽ trình bày một bài giảng về các chiến lược tiếp thị hiện đại tại sảnh chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-ljspeech-af09e2fc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-cori-af09e2fc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lecture-0387dee8.webp', '[\"speech\", \"presentation\", \"talk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"deliver a lecture\", \"meaning\": \"trình bày bài giảng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attend a lecture\", \"meaning\": \"tham dự bài giảng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"speech\", \"note_vi\": \"lecture mang tính học thuật/giảng dạy, speech là bài phát biểu chung.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lecturer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-cori-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-aru0-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-aru5-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-aru6-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-aru10-af09e2fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-aru9-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-aru3-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-aru7-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-aru8-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-aru2-af09e2fc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-ljspeech-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-lt408-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-lt138-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-lt624-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-lt396-af09e2fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-lt498-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-lt132-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-lt288-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-lt42-af09e2fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lecture-lt90-af09e2fc.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng động từ \'give\' hoặc \'deliver\' khi nói về việc trình bày bài giảng.', 'education', 2, 28),
('4add9cff-4551-57cc-8501-a10cffd5281e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', '903acbfa-1481-5e11-b687-ce0187b0cc90', 'd8175439-a858-5af0-b85c-b660e6942740', 'frog', '/frɒɡ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Động vật lưỡng cư nhỏ, có chân sau dài để nhảy, thường sống gần nước.', 'a small green or brown animal that lives near water and can jump well.', 'We heard a frog croaking loudly by the pond last night.', 'Tối qua chúng tôi nghe thấy một con ếch kêu ộp ộp rất to bên ao.', '{\"en\": \"The nature resort advertised frog-watching tours as part of its eco-tourism package.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng thiên nhiên quảng cáo các tour ngắm ếch như một phần của gói du lịch sinh thái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-ljspeech-b3e0f62f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-cori-b3e0f62f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/frog-87276890.webp', '[\"toad\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tree frog\", \"meaning\": \"ếch cây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"frog legs\", \"meaning\": \"đùi ếch (món ăn)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"frog pond\", \"meaning\": \"ao ếch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"toad\", \"note_vi\": \"toad (cóc) có da sần sùi, sống trên cạn; frog (ếch) da trơn, sống gần nước\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-cori-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru0-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru5-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru6-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru10-b3e0f62f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru9-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru3-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru7-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru8-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru2-b3e0f62f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-ljspeech-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-lt408-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-lt138-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-lt624-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-lt396-b3e0f62f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-lt498-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-lt132-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-lt288-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-lt42-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-lt90-b3e0f62f.mp3\"]}}', '\'A frog in one\'s throat\' là thành ngữ phổ biến chỉ giọng bị khàn — hay gặp trong bài nghe TOEIC.', 'nature', 2, 29),
('001747c4-f484-5692-b59c-ec745a281a7d', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'a658b505-c776-5fda-b44c-d133379050a6', 'c45e08f9-202c-5c47-9b17-fa1c7ad252e8', 'suggest', '/səˈdʒest/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Gợi ý, đề xuất một ý tưởng hoặc kế hoạch.', 'to mention an idea, possible plan, or action for other people to consider.', 'Can you suggest a good book for me to read during my vacation?', 'Bạn có thể gợi ý một cuốn sách hay để tôi đọc trong kỳ nghỉ không?', '{\"en\": \"The manager will suggest a new marketing strategy during the meeting tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý sẽ gợi ý một chiến lược tiếp thị mới trong cuộc họp sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-ljspeech-fd0a4950.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-cori-fd0a4950.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suggest-61491452.webp', '[\"propose\", \"recommend\", \"advise\"]', '[\"oppose\", \"forbid\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"suggest a solution\", \"meaning\": \"gợi ý giải pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly suggest\", \"meaning\": \"kịch liệt đề nghị\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"suggestion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"suggestive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-cori-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru0-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru5-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru6-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru10-fd0a4950.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru9-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru3-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru7-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru8-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru2-fd0a4950.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-ljspeech-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-lt408-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-lt138-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-lt624-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-lt396-fd0a4950.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-lt498-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-lt132-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-lt288-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-lt42-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-lt90-fd0a4950.mp3\"]}}', 'Theo sau suggest là V-ing hoặc mệnh đề (that) S + (should) + V nguyên thể.', 'office', 2, 0),
('b69c86f3-16b6-5b37-a2cf-8bbbeeb76fd2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'a658b505-c776-5fda-b44c-d133379050a6', 'c45e08f9-202c-5c47-9b17-fa1c7ad252e8', 'truck', '/trʌk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Xe cơ giới lớn dùng để chở hàng hóa.', 'a large road vehicle used for transporting heavy goods or materials.', 'A delivery truck arrived with our new refrigerator this morning.', 'Một chiếc xe tải giao hàng đã đến với tủ lạnh mới của chúng tôi sáng nay.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck arrived at the warehouse early this morning to unload the shipment.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng đã đến kho vào sáng sớm nay để dỡ lô hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-ljspeech-7a4d63b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-cori-7a4d63b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/truck-c2b47e6d.webp', '[\"lorry\", \"van\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"delivery truck\", \"meaning\": \"xe tải giao hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"truck driver\", \"meaning\": \"tài xế xe tải\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-cori-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru0-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru5-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru6-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru10-7a4d63b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru9-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru3-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru7-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru8-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru2-7a4d63b1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-ljspeech-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt408-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob