('69259ad3-7fa5-5c30-8db0-f58014f77ea6', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'a658b505-c776-5fda-b44c-d133379050a6', 'c45e08f9-202c-5c47-9b17-fa1c7ad252e8', 'heat', '/hiːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Năng lượng làm tăng nhiệt độ, cảm giác nóng.', 'the quality of being hot or the energy that makes something become warm.', 'The sun\'s heat can be intense in the summer.', 'Sức nóng của mặt trời có thể rất gay gắt vào mùa hè.', '{\"en\": \"The factory ventilation system failed, causing intense heat in the main production area.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống thông gió của nhà máy bị hỏng, gây ra sức nóng gay gắt trong khu vực sản xuất chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-ljspeech-853911dc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-cori-853911dc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heat-42a1a8e0.webp', '[\"warmth\", \"temperature\"]', '[\"cold\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intense heat\", \"meaning\": \"sức nóng gay gắt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heat wave\", \"meaning\": \"đợt nóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"heat\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"heated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-cori-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru0-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru5-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru6-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru10-853911dc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru9-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru3-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru7-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru8-853911dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-aru2-853911dc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-ljspeech-853911dc.mp3\", \"