('401f0479-e651-518a-a856-ab6bb37b54e2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'a658b505-c776-5fda-b44c-d133379050a6', 'c45e08f9-202c-5c47-9b17-fa1c7ad252e8', 'responsible', 'UK: /rɪˈspɒn.sə.bəl/ | US: /rɪˈspɑːn.sə.bəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'chịu trách nhiệm', 'having the duty of taking care of something so that you may be blamed if things go wrong.', 'She is responsible for managing the project budget.', 'Cô ấy chịu trách nhiệm quản lý ngân sách dự án.', '{\"en\": \"Ms. Davis is responsible for reviewing all incoming vendor contracts before final approval.\", \"vi\": \"Bà Davis chịu trách nhiệm xem xét tất cả hợp đồng nhà cung cấp gửi đến trước khi phê duyệt cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-ljspeech-37926bac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-cori-37926bac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/responsible-ad952bee.webp', '[\"accountable\", \"liable\", \"in charge of\"]', '[\"irresponsible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be responsible for\", \"meaning\": \"chịu trách nhiệm về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hold somebody responsible\", \"meaning\": \"quy trách nhiệm cho ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"responsive\", \"note_vi\": \"Responsible là chịu trách nhiệm, còn responsive là phản hồi nhanh chóng/nhiệt tình.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"responsibility\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"responsibly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-cori-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-aru0-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-aru5-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-aru6-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-aru10-37926bac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-aru9-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-aru3-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-aru7-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-aru8-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-aru2-37926bac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-ljspeech-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-lt408-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-lt138-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-lt624-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-lt396-37926bac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-lt498-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-lt132-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-lt288-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-lt42-37926bac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsible-lt90-37926bac.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với \'be responsible for + N/V-ing\'. Phân biệt với \'responsive\' (phản hồi nhanh).', 'personnel', 1, 20),
('ea59cd9b-173e-5c10-8a01-c2bd446fe168', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'a658b505-c776-5fda-b44c-d133379050a6', 'c45e08f9-202c-5c47-9b17-fa1c7ad252e8', 'aware', 'UK: /əˈweə/ | US: /əˈwɛr/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'nhận thức được', 'having conscious knowledge, understanding, or realization of a particular situation, fact, or condition', 'Are you aware of the new policy?', 'Bạn có nhận thức được chính sách mới không?', '{\"en\": \"All employees should be aware of the revised safety protocols before operating the machinery.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên nên nhận thức/nắm rõ các quy trình an toàn sửa đổi trước khi vận hành máy móc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-ljspeech-80f29f59.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-cori-80f29f59.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aware-8f146802.webp', '[\"conscious\", \"mindful\", \"informed\", \"cognizant\"]', '[\"unaware\", \"ignorant\", \"unconscious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be aware of\", \"meaning\": \"nhận thức/biết về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make someone aware\", \"meaning\": \"làm cho ai đó nhận ra/biết được\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"awareness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-cori-80f29f59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-aru0-80f29f59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-aru5-80f29f59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-aru6-80f29f59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-aru10-80f29f59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-aru9-80f29f59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-aru3-80f29f59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-aru7-80f29f59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-aru8-80f29f59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aware-aru2-80f29f59.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"