('258d7660-735d-51e4-932b-4f79757f7b21', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'a658b505-c776-5fda-b44c-d133379050a6', 'c45e08f9-202c-5c47-9b17-fa1c7ad252e8', 'castle', '/ˈkɑːsl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tòa nhà lớn, kiên cố thời xưa, thường có tường cao và tháp.', 'a very large and strong building from the past, often with thick walls and towers.', 'We visited an old castle in Scotland that had been standing for centuries.', 'Chúng tôi đã thăm một lâu đài cổ ở Scotland đã tồn tại hàng thế kỷ.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel is located in a historic castle that attracts many tourists from around the world.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn nằm trong một lâu đài lịch sử thu hút nhiều khách du lịch từ khắp nơi trên thế giới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-ljspeech-36e473c8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-cori-36e473c8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/castle-b50de802.webp', '[\"fortress\", \"palace\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"medieval castle\", \"meaning\": \"lâu đài thời trung cổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"visit a castle\", \"meaning\": \"thăm lâu đài\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-cori-36e473c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-aru0-36e473c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-aru5-36e473c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-aru6-36e473c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-aru10-36e473c8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-aru9-36e473c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-aru3-36e473c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-aru7-36e473c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-aru8-36e473c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-aru2-36e473c8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/castle-lj