('51ef1d2f-1162-5eac-95d4-779c8c0ac461', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'adb223f5-560b-5753-87cc-b6208d1ad5e3', 'b35cc101-07ac-5a98-8b4c-9eb3f164d155', 'rate', '/reɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tỷ lệ hoặc tốc độ xảy ra một việc gì đó.', 'a measure of how often something happens or its speed.', 'The unemployment rate in the city has decreased significantly this year.', 'Tỷ lệ thất nghiệp trong thành phố đã giảm đáng kể trong năm nay.', '{\"en\": \"The company reviewed the tax rate before finalizing its annual budget.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã xem xét tỷ lệ thuế trước khi chốt ngân sách hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-ljspeech-1e01d215.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-cori-1e01d215.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rate-8bcebe32.webp', '[\"ratio\", \"proportion\", \"percentage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"interest rate\", \"meaning\": \"lãi suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exchange rate\", \"meaning\": \"tỷ giá hối đoái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rate of growth\", \"meaning\": \"tỷ lệ tăng trưởng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rare\", \"note_vi\": \"rare nghĩa là hiếm, rate là tỷ lệ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rating\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-cori-1e01d215.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-aru0-1e01d215.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-aru5-1e01d215.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-aru6-1e01d215.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-aru10-1e01d215.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-aru9-1e01d215.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-aru3-1e01d215.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-aru7-1e01d215.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-aru8-1e01d215.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rate-a