('24543f0a-690c-5d27-9cd3-6c9961e436f0', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'adb223f5-560b-5753-87cc-b6208d1ad5e3', 'b35cc101-07ac-5a98-8b4c-9eb3f164d155', 'creative', '/kriˈeɪtɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng tạo ra ý tưởng mới hoặc độc đáo.', 'having the ability to produce new and original ideas or things in an artistic way.', 'She is a very creative designer with many original ideas.', 'Cô ấy là một nhà thiết kế rất sáng tạo với nhiều ý tưởng độc đáo.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team needs a creative approach to attract more customers to the new product line.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi cần một cách tiếp cận sáng tạo để thu hút thêm khách hàng cho dòng sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-ljspeech-df0b6c41.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-cori-df0b6c41.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/creative-375dcc10.webp', '[\"imaginative\", \"inventive\"]', '[\"unimaginative\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"creative thinking\", \"meaning\": \"tư duy sáng tạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"creative design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế sáng tạo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"create\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"creativity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-cori-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru0-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru5-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru6-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru10-df0b6c41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru9-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru3-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru7-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru8-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/