('576a9861-40f0-55d6-aefa-ef18847d9fb7', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'b6dc5d47-d30b-5b57-949d-4c3f6bf8ef9d', '92c88d9b-1111-5bcc-9f80-a13109ddcd47', 'sharp', 'UK: /ʃɑːp/ | US: /ʃɑːrp/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'đúng (thời gian)', 'Indicating that an action happens precisely at a specific designated hour or time.', 'The meeting will start at 9 AM sharp.', 'Cuộc họp sẽ bắt đầu đúng 9 giờ sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The department strategy meeting will begin at 8:00 a.m. sharp tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp chiến lược của phòng ban sẽ bắt đầu vào đúng 8 giờ sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-ljspeech-ca0b6293.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-cori-ca0b6293.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sharp-6647d5c0.webp', '[\"precisely\", \"exactly\", \"promptly\"]', '[\"roughly\", \"approximately\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"at 9:00 a.m. sharp\", \"meaning\": \"vào đúng 9 giờ sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"start sharp\", \"meaning\": \"bắt đầu đúng giờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sharply\", \"note_vi\": \"sharply là trạng từ chỉ sự gia tăng/giảm mạnh mẽ hoặc đột ngột, không dùng cho mốc giờ giấc chính xác.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sharp\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"sharply\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sharpen\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-cori-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru0-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru5-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru6-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru10-ca0b6293.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru9-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru3-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru7-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci