('bcde48ca-63f4-5262-bf78-4606917a6924', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bd272ae3-05d4-50da-9f25-222ba3150e47', 'a44790e5-3300-5ab7-a19a-e5d1b1f04cfd', 'apply', '/əˈplaɪ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Gửi đơn xin việc, xin học hoặc xin phép.', 'to make a formal request for a job, place, or permission.', 'You should apply for the scholarship before the deadline.', 'Bạn nên nộp đơn xin học bổng trước thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"Interested candidates should apply for the sales position before the end of this month.\", \"vi\": \"Các ứng viên quan tâm nên nộp đơn xin việc cho vị trí kinh doanh trước cuối tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-ljspeech-69f45da1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-cori-69f45da1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/apply-5aeb7437.webp', '[\"request\", \"submit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apply for a job\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn xin việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"apply online\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn trực tuyến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"supply\", \"note_vi\": \"supply là cung cấp, apply là nộp đơn hoặc áp dụng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"applicant\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"application\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"applicable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-cori-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-aru0-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-aru5-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-aru6-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-aru10-69f45da1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-aru9-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-aru3-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-aru7-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-aru8-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-aru2-69f45da1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-ljspeech-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-lt408-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-lt138-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-lt624-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-lt396-69f45da1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-lt498-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-lt132-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-lt288-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-lt42-69f45da1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apply-lt90-69f45da1.mp3\"]}}', 'Nộp đơn cho vị trí gì dùng apply for; nộp đơn tới ai/đâu dùng apply to.', 'hr', 2, 5),
('86d7a8a7-b27f-50c7-a2c1-2816c11913ed', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bd272ae3-05d4-50da-9f25-222ba3150e47', 'a44790e5-3300-5ab7-a19a-e5d1b1f04cfd', 'conclusion', 'UK: /kənˈkluːʒən/ | US: /kənˈkluʒən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'kết luận', 'A judgment or decision reached by reasoning after considering all available information.', 'The report presented several key conclusions.', 'Báo cáo trình bày một số kết luận chính.', '{\"en\": \"After analyzing the survey results, the committee reached the conclusion that product redesign was necessary.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi phân tích kết quả khảo sát, ủy ban đã đi đến kết luận rằng việc thiết kế lại sản phẩm là cần thiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclusion-ljspeech-6a38a38f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclusion-cori-6a38a38f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conclusion-a29a7c55.webp', '[\"decision\", \"deduction\", \"inference\", \"outcome\"]', '[\"beginning\", \"introduction\", \"start\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reach a conclusion\", \"meaning\": \"đi đến kết luận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in conclusion\", \"meaning\": \"tóm lại, kết luận lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"draw a conclusion\", \"meaning\": \"rút ra kết luận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inclusion\", \"note_vi\": \"Inclusion nghĩa là sự bao gồm, trái ngược nghĩa gốc tiền tố với conclusion (kết luận/kết thúc).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"conclude\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"conclusive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclusion-cori-6a38a38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclusion-aru0-6a38a38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclusion-aru5-6a38a38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclusion-aru6-6a38a38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclusion-aru10-6a38a38f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclusion-aru9-6a