('d41acfad-ae57-59bf-96c8-2213d882a4db', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bd272ae3-05d4-50da-9f25-222ba3150e47', 'a44790e5-3300-5ab7-a19a-e5d1b1f04cfd', 'inside', '/ˌɪnˈsaɪd/', 'A2', 'preposition', 'Ở phía trong của một vật hoặc không gian.', 'positioned within the inner part of a container, building, or space.', 'It started raining, so we decided to eat lunch inside the cafe.', 'Trời bắt đầu mưa, nên chúng tôi quyết định ăn trưa bên trong quán cà phê.', '{\"en\": \"Please place all confidential documents inside the locked cabinet before leaving.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đặt tất cả tài liệu bảo mật vào bên trong tủ đã khóa trước khi về.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-ljspeech-fcc53788.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-cori-fcc53788.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inside-2fd07481.webp', '[\"within\", \"into\"]', '[\"outside\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inside the building\", \"meaning\": \"bên trong tòa nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inside the envelope\", \"meaning\": \"bên trong phong bì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"indoor\", \"note_vi\": \"indoor là tính từ đứng trước danh từ; inside là giới từ/trạng từ/danh từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inside\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inside\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-cori-fcc53788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-aru0-fcc53788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-aru5-fcc53788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-aru6-fcc53788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-aru10-fcc53788.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-aru9-fcc53788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-aru3-fcc53788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-aru7-fcc53788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inside-aru8-f