('74790b7e-a2c0-5fb3-8a7c-e93381f52f5c', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bdb26425-e39b-559b-8d54-303aacf0920b', '86fc3c20-8a1e-5d1e-9d63-836c534f6984', 'clever', '/ˈklevə(r)/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Nhanh trí, có khả năng học hỏi và hiểu nhanh.', 'having the ability to learn or understand things quickly and easily.', 'She came up with a very clever solution to the problem.', 'Cô ấy đã đưa ra một giải pháp rất thông minh cho vấn đề.', '{\"en\": \"The clever marketing strategy helped the company increase its sales significantly in the last quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến lược tiếp thị thông minh đã giúp công ty tăng doanh số đáng kể trong quý vừa qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-ljspeech-a31a61e9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-cori-a31a61e9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clever-e108dc83.webp', '[\"smart\", \"intelligent\"]', '[\"stupid\", \"foolish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"clever idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng thông minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clever solution\", \"meaning\": \"giải pháp thông minh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"smart\", \"note_vi\": \"thông minh, sắc sảo; clever nhấn mạnh sự khéo léo, sáng tạo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cleverness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-cori-a31a61e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-aru0-a31a61e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-aru5-a31a61e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-aru6-a31a61e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-aru10-a31a61e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-aru9-a31a61e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-aru3-a31a61e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-aru7-a31a61e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clever-aru8-a31a61e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p