('c63cc2fd-df4c-52b0-8065-11a863c71365', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bdb26425-e39b-559b-8d54-303aacf0920b', '86fc3c20-8a1e-5d1e-9d63-836c534f6984', 'pack', '/pæk/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Sắp xếp đồ đạc vào túi hoặc hộp.', 'to put things into a bag, box, or suitcase for travel or storage.', 'Don\'t forget to pack a swimsuit for your vacation.', 'Đừng quên đóng gói đồ bơi cho kỳ nghỉ của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Workers must pack the fragile items carefully before loading them onto the delivery truck.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân phải đóng gói các mặt hàng dễ vỡ một cách cẩn thận trước khi xếp chúng lên xe tải giao hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-ljspeech-6acd6212.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-cori-6acd6212.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pack-9807a0d4.webp', '[\"wrap\", \"package\", \"fill\"]', '[\"unpack\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pack a suitcase\", \"meaning\": \"đóng gói vali\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pack items\", \"meaning\": \"đóng gói các mặt hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"package\", \"note_vi\": \"pack là động từ đóng gói, package là danh từ bưu kiện\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"package\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"packing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-cori-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-aru0-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-aru5-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-aru6-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-aru10-6acd6212.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-aru9-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-aru3-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-aru7-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-aru8-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-aru2-6acd6212.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-ljspeech-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt408-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt138-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt624-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt396-6acd6212.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt498-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt132-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt288-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt42-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt90-6acd6212.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm \'pack\' (đóng gói) với \'unpack\' (mở gói, dỡ đồ).', 'manufacturing', 2, 7),
('69af00c0-4c05-56e6-ac3c-4522a462c8cc', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bdb26425-e39b-559b-8d54-303aacf0920b', '86fc3c20-8a1e-5d1e-9d63-836c534f6984', 'brilliant', '/ˈbrɪliənt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất thông minh, tài giỏi hoặc cực kỳ ấn tượng, rực rỡ.', 'showing a very high level of intelligence or skill in a particular area of work.', 'Her idea for the new project was absolutely brilliant.', 'Ý tưởng của cô ấy cho dự án mới hoàn toàn xuất sắc.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team came up with a brilliant strategy to increase our sales this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã đưa ra một chiến lược xuất sắc để tăng doanh số của chúng ta quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-ljspeech-2f2aa30f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-cori-2f2aa30f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brilliant-b4b32e50.webp', '[\"excellent\", \"talented\"]', '[\"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"brilliant idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng xuất sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brilliant career\", \"meaning\": \"sự nghiệp rực rỡ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"brilliance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-cori-2f2aa30f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-aru0-2f2aa30f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-aru5-2f2aa30f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-aru6-2f2aa30f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-aru10-2f2aa30f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-aru9-2f2aa30f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-aru3-2f2aa30f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-aru7-2f2aa30f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-aru8-2f2aa30f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brilliant-aru2-2f2aa30f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [