('bf91f6ae-0df0-5a2e-90f3-dad79948f314', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bdb26425-e39b-559b-8d54-303aacf0920b', '86fc3c20-8a1e-5d1e-9d63-836c534f6984', 'normal', '/ˈnɔːml/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Phù hợp với điều thường lệ, không có gì bất thường.', 'following the usual standard or expected way of doing things without any special features.', 'Under normal circumstances, the office closes at six o\'clock every evening.', 'Trong điều kiện bình thường, văn phòng đóng cửa lúc sáu giờ mỗi tối.', '{\"en\": \"It is normal for the office to be busy during the end of the month.\", \"vi\": \"Việc văn phòng bận rộn vào cuối tháng là điều bình thường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-ljspeech-9c2a6e48.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-cori-9c2a6e48.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/normal-59934d37.webp', '[\"standard\", \"regular\"]', '[\"abnormal\", \"unusual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"normal practice\", \"meaning\": \"thông lệ bình thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"back to normal\", \"meaning\": \"trở lại bình thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"formal\", \"note_vi\": \"formal là trang trọng, normal là bình thường.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"normality\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"normally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-cori-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-aru0-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-aru5-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-aru6-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-aru10-9c2a6e48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-aru9-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-aru3-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-aru7-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-aru8-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-aru2-9c2a6e48.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-ljspeech-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-lt408-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-lt138-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-lt624-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-lt396-9c2a6e48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-lt498-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-lt132-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-lt288-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-lt42-9c2a6e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/normal-lt90-9c2a6e48.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm lẫn với \'formal\' (trang trọng).', 'office', 2, 9),
('79e0234a-8cf2-5ac3-861c-d402c321b442', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bdb26425-e39b-559b-8d54-303aacf0920b', '86fc3c20-8a1e-5d1e-9d63-836c534f6984', 'onto', '/ˈɒntə/', '', 'preposition', 'Lên trên một bề mặt hoặc vị trí.', 'moving to a position that is on the top surface of something.', 'Workers loaded heavy wooden crates onto the delivery truck before noon.', 'Các công nhân đã bốc những thùng gỗ nặng lên xe tải giao hàng trước giữa trưa.', '{\"en\": \"Please place the signed contract onto the manager\'s desk before you leave the office today.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đặt hợp đồng đã ký lên bàn của quản lý trước khi bạn rời văn phòng hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-ljspeech-9257ca85.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-cori-9257ca85.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/onto-eaa6e3a0.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-cori-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-aru0-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-aru5-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-aru6-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-aru10-9257ca85.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-aru9-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-aru3-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-aru7-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-aru8-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-aru2-9257ca85.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-ljspeech-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-lt408-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-lt138-9257ca85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onto-lt624-9257ca85.mp3\",