('7810395b-26e4-5120-9df1-16e60890cab2', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bdb26425-e39b-559b-8d54-303aacf0920b', '86fc3c20-8a1e-5d1e-9d63-836c534f6984', 'relax', 'UK: /rɪˈlæks/ | US: /rɪˈlæks/', 'A2', 'verb', 'thư giãn', 'to rest and become less anxious or tense after spending time working hard.', 'After work, I like to relax with a good book.', 'Sau giờ làm, tôi thích thư giãn bằng một cuốn sách hay.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to relax its dress code policy on Fridays to boost office morale.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã quyết định nới lỏng quy định về trang phục vào các ngày thứ Sáu để nâng cao tinh thần làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-ljspeech-63bb094c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-cori-63bb094c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relax-cc2aa74b.webp', '[\"unwind\", \"loosen\", \"ease\"]', '[\"stress\", \"tighten\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"relax regulations\", \"meaning\": \"nới lỏng các quy định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relax after work\", \"meaning\": \"thư giãn sau giờ làm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"relaxed\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"relaxation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-cori-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru0-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru5-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru6-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru10-63bb094c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru9-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru3-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru7-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru8-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru2-63bb094c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-ljspeech-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt408-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt138-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt624-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt396-63bb094c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt498-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt132-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt288-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt42-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt90-63bb094c.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa nghỉ ngơi thư giãn, trong TOEIC còn mang nghĩa \'nới lỏng\' (relax rules/restrictions).', 'office', 1, 11),
('ec4b1cef-0e24-5577-a55a-d5905759fd14', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'bdb26425-e39b-559b-8d54-303aacf0920b', '86fc3c20-8a1e-5d1e-9d63-836c534f6984', 'recommend', '/ˌrekəˈmend/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đề xuất hoặc gợi ý một cái gì đó là tốt hoặc phù hợp.', 'to advise someone to choose a specific person, thing, or course of action.', 'Our supervisor will recommend several experienced candidates for the vacant managerial position.', 'Người giám sát của chúng tôi sẽ đề xuất một số ứng viên có kinh nghiệm cho vị trí quản lý đang bỏ trống.', '{\"en\": \"I highly recommend this hotel to anyone visiting the city for business.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi thực sự khuyên dùng khách sạn này cho bất kỳ ai đến thăm thành phố vì công việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-ljspeech-1fe94581.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-cori-1fe94581.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recommend-9da98b39.webp', '[\"suggest\", \"advise\", \"advocate\"]', '[\"discourage\", \"warn\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly recommend\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ khuyên dùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recommend a product\", \"meaning\": \"giới thiệu một sản phẩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"suggest\", \"note_vi\": \"gợi ý chung, recommend mang tính tiến cử dựa trên kinh nghiệm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"recommendation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-cori-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru0-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru5-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru6-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru10-1fe94581.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru9-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru3-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati