('cac30e84-e2a8-503d-8555-a82107445828', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cbb21ab6-b3db-5bd1-9ba1-2c0db96c839a', 'd621bca7-b344-5e47-89db-ee89e75bd3d6', 'successful', '/səkˈsesfl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Đạt được kết quả tốt đẹp, có được sự thịnh vượng hoặc nổi tiếng.', 'achieving the results that you wanted or hoped for.', 'The new marketing campaign was very successful, boosting sales significantly.', 'Chiến dịch tiếp thị mới rất thành công, thúc đẩy doanh số bán hàng đáng kể.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing campaign was highly successful and boosted our sales by twenty percent.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị đã rất thành công và giúp tăng doanh số của chúng tôi thêm hai mươi phần trăm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-ljspeech-33375351.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-cori-33375351.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/successful-2af29fee.webp', '[\"prosperous\", \"triumphant\", \"effective\"]', '[\"unsuccessful\", \"failed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly successful\", \"meaning\": \"rất thành công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"successful career\", \"meaning\": \"sự nghiệp thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"successive\", \"note_vi\": \"liên tiếp, kế tiếp; không phải là thành công\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"succeed\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"success\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"successfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-cori-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru0-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru5-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru6-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru10-33375351.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru9-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru3-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru7-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru8-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru2-33375351.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-ljspeech-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt408-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt138-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt624-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt396-33375351.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt498-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt132-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt288-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt42-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt90-33375351.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn giữa successful (thành công) và successive (liên tiếp).', 'business', 2, 5),
('214c1eac-2e3e-5673-a728-8f80a41968c5', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cbb21ab6-b3db-5bd1-9ba1-2c0db96c839a', 'd621bca7-b344-5e47-89db-ee89e75bd3d6', 'thought', '/θɔːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một ý tưởng hoặc điều gì đó bạn đang nghĩ đến.', 'an idea, opinion, or belief produced by mental activity in the mind.', 'My first thought was to call her, but then I decided to wait.', 'Ý nghĩ đầu tiên của tôi là gọi cho cô ấy, nhưng sau đó tôi quyết định đợi.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant gave careful thought to the client\'s complex budget proposal before responding.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyên gia tư vấn đã suy nghĩ cẩn thận về đề xuất ngân sách phức tạp của khách hàng trước khi phản hồi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-ljspeech-af93b391.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-cori-af93b391.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thought-ca78f24a.webp', '[\"idea\", \"notion\", \"concept\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"give thought to\", \"meaning\": \"suy nghĩ về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deep thought\", \"meaning\": \"suy nghĩ sâu sắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"though\", \"note_vi\": \"though là liên từ/trạng từ (mặc dù), khác với thought.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"think\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"thoughtful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-cori-af93b391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-aru0-af93b391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-aru5-af93b391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-aru6-af93b391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-aru10-af93b391.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-aru9-af93b391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-aru3-af93b391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thought-aru7-af93b391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v