('28680ff7-a617-5750-a419-3692e97e946f', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cbb21ab6-b3db-5bd1-9ba1-2c0db96c839a', 'd621bca7-b344-5e47-89db-ee89e75bd3d6', 'officer', '/ˈɒfɪsə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người có cấp bậc trong quân đội, cảnh sát, hoặc một tổ chức.', 'a person who holds a position of authority in an organization or the military.', 'A police officer helped us find our way after we got lost.', 'Một sĩ quan cảnh sát đã giúp chúng tôi tìm đường sau khi chúng tôi bị lạc.', '{\"en\": \"The chief financial officer presented the annual budget report to the board.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tài chính đã trình bày báo cáo ngân sách hàng năm trước hội đồng quản trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-ljspeech-f90409b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-cori-f90409b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/officer-bdba9da7.webp', '[\"official\", \"executive\", \"administrator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chief executive officer\", \"meaning\": \"giám đốc điều hành (CEO)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"loan officer\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên tín dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"customs officer\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên hải quan\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"official\", \"note_vi\": \"official là tính từ (chính thức) hoặc danh từ chung; officer chỉ người giữ chức vụ cụ thể\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"office\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"official\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"officially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-cori-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-aru0-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-aru5-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-aru6-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-aru10-f90409b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-aru9-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-aru3-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-aru7-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-aru8-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-aru2-f90409b9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-ljspeech-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-lt408-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-lt138-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-lt624-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-lt396-f90409b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-lt498-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-lt132-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-lt288-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-lt42-f90409b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/officer-lt90-f90409b9.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, hay gặp các chức danh như CEO, CFO, HR officer – đều dùng \'officer\' hoặc \'executive\'.', 'hr', 2, 7),
('8498f7df-dc66-51c7-8b0f-f58a0d1d036a', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cbb21ab6-b3db-5bd1-9ba1-2c0db96c839a', 'd621bca7-b344-5e47-89db-ee89e75bd3d6', 'shout', '/ʃaʊt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nói to hoặc kêu lớn tiếng.', 'to speak in a very loud voice, often because of anger or to get attention.', 'He had to shout to be heard over the loud music.', 'Anh ấy phải hét lên để người khác nghe thấy giữa tiếng nhạc lớn.', '{\"en\": \"It is unprofessional to shout at your colleagues during a heated discussion in the office.\", \"vi\": \"Thật thiếu chuyên nghiệp khi hét vào mặt đồng nghiệp trong một cuộc thảo luận căng thẳng tại văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-ljspeech-d1c79aa3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-cori-d1c79aa3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shout-5d2a5302.webp', '[\"yell\", \"scream\"]', '[\"whisper\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"shout at someone\", \"meaning\": \"hét vào mặt ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shout loudly\", \"meaning\": \"hét lớn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-cori-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru0-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru5-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru6-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru10-d1c79aa3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru9-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru3-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru7-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru8-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru2-d1c79aa3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-ljspeech-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-lt408-d1c