('7f22acc9-9fc5-5b86-b731-9c6e973258a6', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cbb21ab6-b3db-5bd1-9ba1-2c0db96c839a', 'd621bca7-b344-5e47-89db-ee89e75bd3d6', 'film', '/fɪɫm/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một tác phẩm điện ảnh hoặc lớp mỏng.', 'a series of moving pictures shown on a screen with sound.', 'Our media team produced a promotional film showcasing the company\'s new technological achievements.', 'Đội ngũ truyền thông của chúng tôi đã sản xuất một bộ phim quảng cáo giới thiệu những thành tựu công nghệ mới của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The media department will produce a promotional film about our new software product.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận truyền thông sẽ sản xuất một bộ phim quảng cáo về sản phẩm phần mềm mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-ljspeech-ad363a93.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-cori-ad363a93.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/film-f53215a0.webp', '[\"movie\", \"picture\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"feature film\", \"meaning\": \"phim điện ảnh dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"documentary film\", \"meaning\": \"phim tài liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a film\", \"meaning\": \"làm một bộ phim\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"filming\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-cori-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-aru0-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-aru5-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-aru6-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-aru10-ad363a93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-aru9-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-aru3-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-aru7-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-aru8-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-aru2-ad363a93.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-ljspeech-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-lt408-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-lt138-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-lt624-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-lt396-ad363a93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-lt498-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-lt132-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-lt288-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-lt42-ad363a93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-lt90-ad363a93.mp3\"]}}', '', 'media', 2, 9),
('b8aaba38-d5d2-5ef4-a43e-6c4c418f7948', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cbb21ab6-b3db-5bd1-9ba1-2c0db96c839a', 'd621bca7-b344-5e47-89db-ee89e75bd3d6', 'wave', '/weɪv/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự chuyển động nhấp nhô của nước, âm thanh, ánh sáng.', 'a raised mass of water that moves across the surface of the sea or ocean.', 'The surfers waited patiently for the perfect wave to ride.', 'Những người lướt sóng kiên nhẫn chờ đợi con sóng hoàn hảo để lướt.', '{\"en\": \"The cruise ship was delayed because of the high wave conditions in the open sea.\", \"vi\": \"Tàu du lịch đã bị hoãn vì điều kiện sóng lớn ngoài khơi xa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-ljspeech-d7ce7446.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-cori-d7ce7446.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wave-84e2e656.webp', '[\"swell\", \"breaker\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tidal wave\", \"meaning\": \"sóng thần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heat wave\", \"meaning\": \"đợt nóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"wavy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-cori-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-aru0-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-aru5-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-aru6-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-aru10-d7ce7446.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-aru9-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-aru3-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-aru7-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-aru8-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-aru2-d7ce7446.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-ljspeech-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-lt408-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-lt138-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-lt624-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-lt396-d7ce7446.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-lt498-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-lt132-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-lt288-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-lt42-d7ce7446.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wave-lt90-d7ce7446.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, \'make waves\' nghĩa là gây xáo trộn.', 'travel', 2, 10),
('f25bf346-11e4-5dba-9840-d938c53000a8', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cbb21ab6-b3db-5bd1-9ba1-2c0db96c839a', 'd621bca7-b344-5e47-89db-ee89e75bd3d6', 'noise', '/nɔɪz/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Âm thanh lớn, khó chịu hoặc không mong muốn.', 'a sound, especially one that is loud, unpleasant, or disruptive.', 'The construction work made a lot of noise all day.', 'Công trường xây dựng gây ra rất nhiều tiếng ồn suốt cả ngày.', '{\"en\": \"Employees complained about the loud noise coming from the construction site next door.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên phàn nàn về tiếng ồn lớn phát ra từ công trường xây dựng bên cạnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-ljspeech-9424ac79.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-cori-9424ac79.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/noise-57d35b95.webp', '[\"sound\", \"din\", \"racket\"]', '[\"silence\", \"quiet\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make a noise\", \"meaning\": \"làm ồn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"background noise\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng ồn nền\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"noisy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"noisily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-cori-9424ac79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-aru0-9424ac79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-aru5-9424ac79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-aru6-9424ac79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-aru10-9424ac79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-aru9-9424ac79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-aru3-9424ac79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-aru7-9424ac79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-aru8-9424ac79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-aru2-9424ac79.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noise-