('a5d4129c-64e2-5219-9aaf-70c51a9a902a', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cbb21ab6-b3db-5bd1-9ba1-2c0db96c839a', 'd621bca7-b344-5e47-89db-ee89e75bd3d6', 'reason', 'UK: /ˈriːzn/ | US: /ˈriːzn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'lý do', 'a cause, explanation, or justification for an action, occurrence, belief, or event.', 'The manager asked for the reason behind the delay.', 'Người quản lý hỏi lý do đằng sau sự chậm trễ.', '{\"en\": \"The main reason for the delay was an unexpected technical glitch.\", \"vi\": \"Lý do chính cho sự chậm trễ là một sự cố kỹ thuật không mong muốn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-ljspeech-7947e92e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-cori-7947e92e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reason-a7a32ad7.webp', '[\"cause\", \"motive\", \"explanation\", \"justification\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reason for\", \"meaning\": \"lý do cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"for safety reasons\", \"meaning\": \"vì lý do an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"within reason\", \"meaning\": \"trong mức độ hợp lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cause\", \"note_vi\": \"\'cause\' là nguyên nhân trực tiếp sinh ra kết quả; \'reason\' là lý do/giải thích cho hành động hay sự việc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reasonable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"reasonably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-cori-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru0-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru5-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru6-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru10-7947e92e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru9-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru3-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru7-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru8-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-aru2-7947e92e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-ljspeech-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-lt408-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-lt138-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-lt624-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-lt396-7947e92e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-lt498-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-lt132-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-lt288-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-lt42-7947e92e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-lt90-7947e92e.mp3\"]}}', 'Giới từ theo sau: \'reason FOR something\' hoặc \'reason WHY + mệnh đề\'. Không dùng \'reason of\'.', 'office', 1, 24),
('7bec4166-3e86-56ab-b330-dc4a45e921b3', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cbb21ab6-b3db-5bd1-9ba1-2c0db96c839a', 'd621bca7-b344-5e47-89db-ee89e75bd3d6', 'shore', 'UK: /ʃɔː/ | US: /ʃɔːr/', 'B1', 'noun', 'bờ (sông, hồ, biển)', 'The land along the edge of a sea, lake, or other large body of water.', 'The small fishing boats are usually found near the shore.', 'Những chiếc thuyền đánh cá nhỏ thường được tìm thấy gần bờ.', '{\"en\": \"The resort is located along the southern shore of the island, offering scenic ocean views.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng nằm dọc theo bờ phía nam của hòn đảo, mang lại tầm nhìn hướng ra biển rất đẹp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-ljspeech-24dc6316.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-cori-24dc6316.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shore-4a5f6abb.webp', '[\"coast\", \"coastline\", \"seashore\", \"beach\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"offshore investment\", \"meaning\": \"đầu tư ra nước ngoài / hải ngoại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"along the shore\", \"meaning\": \"dọc theo bờ biển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bank\", \"note_vi\": \"Bank là bờ sông/bờ đê, còn shore là bờ biển hoặc bờ hồ lớn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"offshore\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"onshore\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-cori-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru0-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru5-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru6-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru10-24dc6316.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru9-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru3-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru7-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru8-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru2-24dc6316.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-ljspeech-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt408-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt138-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt624-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt396-24dc6316.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt498-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt132-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt288-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt42-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt90-24dc6316.mp3\"]}}', '\'Shore\' chỉ bờ biển hoặc bờ hồ lớn; đối với bờ sông nhỏ hoặc bờ kênh thì người ta hay dùng \'bank\'.', 'travel', 1, 25)
