('e21da07c-ff77-5db2-bd35-fc9e4cd6606b', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'cc2910f5-adf2-520b-b0e7-a60f9067a0ad', '9e2eb8f8-9564-5968-854b-46088848ab73', 'knee', '/niː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khớp nối phần đùi và cẳng chân.', 'The flexible anatomical articulation connecting the upper portion of the human leg to the lower part.', 'He fell and scraped his knee while playing soccer.', 'Anh ấy bị ngã và trầy đầu gối khi đang chơi bóng đá.', '{\"en\": \"The worker injured his knee while lifting heavy boxes in the warehouse yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Người công nhân đã bị thương ở đầu gối khi đang nâng những chiếc hộp nặng trong kho ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-ljspeech-d22dda44.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-cori-d22dda44.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/knee-430235b2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bend one\'s knees\", \"meaning\": \"gập đầu gối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"knee injury\", \"meaning\": \"chấn thương đầu gối\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"kneel\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-cori-d22dda44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-aru0-d22dda44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-aru5-d22dda44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-aru6-d22dda44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-aru10-d22dda44.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-aru9-d22dda44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-aru3-d22dda44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-aru7-d22dda44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-aru8-d22dda44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-aru2-d22dda44.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-ljspeech-d22dda44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knee-lt40