('8158c448-ed18-5edd-82c3-d2d5b5750bf8', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd4f0c4de-b4a8-5081-a6da-9acf26ae9945', '290d8e0f-12d5-5f19-85f4-b2e75104611c', 'care', '/keə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự quan tâm, chăm sóc hoặc sự cẩn thận.', 'the process of protecting someone or keeping something in good condition.', 'She takes great care of her elderly parents.', 'Cô ấy rất quan tâm chăm sóc cha mẹ già của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The technician handled the delicate computer equipment with great care during installation.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã xử lý thiết bị máy tính tinh vi với sự chăm sóc cẩn thận trong quá trình lắp đặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-ljspeech-ec1deb95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-cori-ec1deb95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/care-153362b4.webp', '[\"attention\", \"caution\", \"protection\"]', '[\"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take care of\", \"meaning\": \"chăm sóc, đảm nhận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"customer care\", \"meaning\": \"chăm sóc khách hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"medical care\", \"meaning\": \"chăm sóc y tế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cure\", \"note_vi\": \"Care là chăm sóc/chú ý, cure là chữa trị.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"care\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"careful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"carelessly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-cori-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru0-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru5-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru6-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru10-ec1deb95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru9-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru3-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru7-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storag