('4f43adee-c024-54c6-a980-7118e7b96558', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd4f0c4de-b4a8-5081-a6da-9acf26ae9945', '290d8e0f-12d5-5f19-85f4-b2e75104611c', 'lucky', '/ˈlʌki/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có được điều tốt đẹp một cách tình cờ, không mong đợi.', 'experiencing unexpected success or favorable events due to pure chance', 'You\'re so lucky to have won the lottery; I never win anything!', 'Bạn thật may mắn khi trúng số; tôi chẳng bao giờ thắng được gì cả!', '{\"en\": \"We were lucky to secure the last booth at the international trade fair.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã May mắn giành được gian hàng cuối cùng tại hội chợ thương mại quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-ljspeech-1ce14163.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-cori-1ce14163.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lucky-c64e9b7a.webp', '[\"fortunate\", \"blessed\"]', '[\"unlucky\", \"unfortunate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lucky charm\", \"meaning\": \"bùa may mắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lucky break\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội may mắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"luck\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"luckily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-cori-1ce14163.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-aru0-1ce14163.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-aru5-1ce14163.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-aru6-1ce14163.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-aru10-1ce14163.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-aru9-1ce14163.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-aru3-1ce14163.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-aru7-1ce14163.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-aru8-1ce14163.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lucky-aru2-1ce14163.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/publ