('2166195a-1c23-55f2-b125-715be3dce577', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd4f0c4de-b4a8-5081-a6da-9acf26ae9945', '290d8e0f-12d5-5f19-85f4-b2e75104611c', 'desert', '/ˈdezət/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Vùng đất khô cằn, ít mưa, thường có cát hoặc đá.', 'a large, dry area of land with very few plants and little rainfall.', 'The Sahara Desert is the largest hot desert in the world.', 'Sa mạc Sahara là sa mạc nóng lớn nhất thế giới.', '{\"en\": \"The new solar power plant will be built in the desert to maximize energy production.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy điện mặt trời mới sẽ được xây dựng trên sa mạc để tối đa hóa sản lượng năng lượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-ljspeech-2d5128d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-cori-2d5128d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/desert-a8a540d4.webp', '[\"wasteland\", \"wilderness\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"desert island\", \"meaning\": \"đảo hoang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vast desert\", \"meaning\": \"sa mạc rộng lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dessert\", \"note_vi\": \"món tráng miệng, có hai chữ \'s\' và trọng âm âm tiết hai\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"desert\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"deserted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-cori-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru0-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru5-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru6-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru10-2d5128d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru9-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru3-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru7-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru8-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru2-2d5128d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-ljspeech-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-lt408-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-lt138-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-lt624-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-lt396-2d5128d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-lt498-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-lt132-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-lt288-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-lt42-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-lt90-2d5128d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phát âm trọng âm rơi vào âm tiết thứ nhất, khác với động từ desert (bỏ rơi).', 'nature', 2, 16),
('a8b2eaae-d3cc-598b-b946-cd062b010e6e', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd4f0c4de-b4a8-5081-a6da-9acf26ae9945', '290d8e0f-12d5-5f19-85f4-b2e75104611c', 'expression', '/ɪkˈspreʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự thể hiện cảm xúc hoặc ý nghĩ qua nét mặt, lời nói.', 'a look on someone\'s face that shows what they are thinking or feeling.', 'Her happy expression showed how excited she was about the news.', 'Nét mặt vui vẻ của cô ấy cho thấy cô ấy phấn khích thế nào về tin tức đó.', '{\"en\": \"The manager maintained a professional expression during the entire salary negotiation process.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã giữ một biểu cảm chuyên nghiệp trong suốt quá trình đàm phán lương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-ljspeech-ec981439.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-cori-ec981439.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expression-28482437.webp', '[\"look\", \"countenance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"facial expression\", \"meaning\": \"biểu cảm khuôn mặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"puzzled expression\", \"meaning\": \"biểu cảm khó hiểu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"impression\", \"note_vi\": \"impression là ấn tượng, expression là biểu cảm hoặc từ ngữ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"express\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"expressive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-cori-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-aru0-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-aru5-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-aru6-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-aru10-ec981439.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-aru9-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-aru3-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-aru7-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-aru8-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-aru2-ec981439.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-ljspeech-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-lt408-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-lt138-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-lt624-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-lt396-ec981439.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-lt498-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-lt132-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-lt288-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-lt42-ec981439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expression-lt90-ec981439.mp3\"]}}', 'Expression vừa là nét mặt biểu cảm, vừa là cụm từ diễn đạt.', 'office', 2, 17),
('f9df0635-629b-5774-8d58-e992767c778b', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd4f0c4de-b4a8-5081-a6da-9acf26ae9945', '290d8e0f-12d5-5f19-85f4-b2e75104611c', 'thick', '/θɪk/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có độ dày lớn, không mỏng.', 'Relatively broad or deep in measure from one side or surface to another.', 'He wore a thick jacket to protect himself from the cold wind.', 'Anh ấy mặc một chiếc áo khoác dày để bảo vệ mình khỏi gió lạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The construction manager handed out thick user manuals to all new machine operators.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý xây dựng đã phát các cuốn sách hướng dẫn sử dụng dày cho tất cả thợ vận hành máy mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-ljspeech-8fb4cd18.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-cori-8fb4cd18.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thick-61bc929f.webp', '[\"dense\", \"heavy\"]', '[\"thin\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thick layer\", \"meaning\": \"lớp dày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thick report\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo dày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dense\", \"note_vi\": \"thick là dày (độ dày/sương dày); dense là dày đặc, đông đúc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thickness\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"thicken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-cori-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru0-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru5-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru6-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru10-8fb4cd18.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru9-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru3-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru7-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru8-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru2-