('1a558de3-4a39-58a0-bb0d-713c8020805a', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd4f0c4de-b4a8-5081-a6da-9acf26ae9945', '290d8e0f-12d5-5f19-85f4-b2e75104611c', 'accident', '/ˈæksɪdənt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự việc không mong muốn, thường gây thiệt hại hoặc thương tích.', 'a sudden event that causes damage or injury, often involving cars or other machines.', 'She had a minor accident on her bicycle but thankfully wasn\'t seriously hurt.', 'Cô ấy bị một tai nạn nhỏ với xe đạp nhưng may mắn là không bị thương nặng.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery driver was delayed because of a minor traffic accident on the main highway.\", \"vi\": \"Tài xế giao hàng đã bị trễ do một vụ tai nạn giao thông nhỏ trên đường cao tốc chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-ljspeech-f2b195dc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-cori-f2b195dc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accident-b9e387d9.webp', '[\"crash\", \"collision\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"traffic accident\", \"meaning\": \"tai nạn giao thông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"car accident\", \"meaning\": \"tai nạn xe hơi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accidental\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-cori-f2b195dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-aru0-f2b195dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-aru5-f2b195dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-aru6-f2b195dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-aru10-f2b195dc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-aru9-f2b195dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-aru3-f2b195dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-aru7-f2b195dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-aru8-f2b195dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accident-aru2-f2b195d