('3029044b-4ca5-5b01-a14e-bf9676484655', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'myself', '/maɪˈself/', 'A2', 'pronoun', 'Đại từ phản thân, dùng để chỉ chính bản thân người nói.', 'used to refer back to the speaker as the object or to add emphasis.', 'I taught myself how to play the guitar by watching online videos.', 'Tôi đã tự học chơi đàn guitar bằng cách xem các video trực tuyến.', '{\"en\": \"The director decided to handle the client presentation myself.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc quyết định tự mình xử lý buổi thuyết trình cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-ljspeech-e9ba3d3a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-cori-e9ba3d3a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/myself-8cba0a2e.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"by myself\", \"meaning\": \"một mình, tự làm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"do it myself\", \"meaning\": \"tự làm điều đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"I myself\", \"meaning\": \"chính bản thân tôi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"me\", \"note_vi\": \"myself dùng để nhấn mạnh hoặc phản thân, không thay thế me làm tân ngữ thông thường\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-cori-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-aru0-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-aru5-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-aru6-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-aru10-e9ba3d3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-aru9-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-aru3-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-aru7-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-aru8-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-aru2-e9ba3d3a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-ljspeech-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-lt408-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-lt138-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-lt624-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-lt396-e9ba3d3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-lt498-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-lt132-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-lt288-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-lt42-e9ba3d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myself-lt90-e9ba3d3a.mp3\"]}}', 'By myself = một mình; I myself = chính tôi — hai cách dùng khác nhau cần phân biệt.', 'daily', 2, 0),
('1dc82642-6ad9-5bfa-bbba-636842a09b14', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'tower', '/ˈtaʊə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Cấu trúc cao, thường hẹp hơn chiều cao, dùng làm đài quan sát hoặc trang trí.', 'a tall narrow structure that rises high into the air.', 'Construction of the forty-story office tower will be completed by the end of next year.', 'Việc xây dựng tòa tháp văn phòng bốn mươi tầng sẽ hoàn thành vào cuối năm sau.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel tower offers a beautiful view of the busy port.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa tháp khách sạn mang lại tầm nhìn đẹp ra cảng bận rộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-ljspeech-54efaa66.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-cori-54efaa66.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tower-c24e302d.webp', '[\"spire\", \"skyscraper\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clock tower\", \"meaning\": \"tháp đồng hồ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tower block\", \"meaning\": \"tòa nhà chung cư cao tầng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ivory tower\", \"meaning\": \"tháp ngà (xa rời thực tế)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lower\", \"note_vi\": \"lower là thấp hơn, trái nghĩa và dễ nhầm chính tả.\"}, {\"word\": \"towel\", \"note_vi\": \"towel là khăn tắm, phát âm gần tower.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tower\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"towering\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-cori-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-aru0-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-aru5-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-aru6-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-aru10-54efaa66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-aru9-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-aru3-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-aru7-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-aru8-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-aru2-54efaa66.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-ljspeech-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-lt408-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-lt138-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-lt624-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-lt396-54efaa66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-lt498-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-lt132-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-lt288-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-lt42-54efaa66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tower-lt90-54efaa66.mp3\"]}}', 'Tower là tòa tháp; nhớ không nhầm với towel (khăn) hay lower (thấp hơn).', 'travel', 2, 1),
('2364f6bb-1476-5088-84aa-67ae98db9b80', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'duty', 'UK: /ˈdjuːtiz/ | US: /ˈduːtiz/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nhiệm vụ, bổn phận', 'a moral or legal obligation, responsibility, or task required by one\'s role.', 'The manager\'s duties include overseeing the entire team.', 'Các nhiệm vụ của người quản lý bao gồm giám sát toàn bộ đội nhóm.', '{\"en\": \"One of your main duties as project manager is to review weekly status reports.\", \"vi\": \"Một trong những nhiệm vụ chính của bạn với tư cách là quản lý dự án là xem xét các báo cáo tiến độ hàng tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-ljspeech-d1f30ba1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-cori-d1f30ba1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/duty-b7f71bf8.webp', '[\"responsibility\", \"task\", \"obligation\", \"role\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on duty\", \"meaning\": \"đang trong giờ làm việc / lên ca\"}, {\"phrase\": \"job duties\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"duty-free\", \"meaning\": \"miễn thuế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dutiful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-cori-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru0-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru5-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru6-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru10-d1f30ba1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru9-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru3-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru7-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru8-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru2-d1f30ba1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-ljspeech-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt408-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt138-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt624-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt396-d1f30ba1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt498-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt132-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt288-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt42-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt90-d1f30ba1.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'job duties\' chỉ trách nhiệm công việc, còn \'on duty\' nghĩa là đang trong ca làm việc.', 'personnel', 1, 2),
('04e2eda8-f279-5042-aecf-9470438cbe1d', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'convince', 'UK: /kənˈvɪnsɪŋ/ | US: /kənˈvɪnsɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'thuyết phục', 'persuasive and capable of causing someone to believe that something is true.', 'The scientist presented convincing arguments for her new theory.', 'Nhà khoa học đã trình bày những lập luận thuyết phục cho lý thuyết mới của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The sales manager delivered a convincing presentation that persuaded the potential client.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng kinh doanh đã trình bày một bài phát biểu thuyết phục làm xiêu lòng khách hàng tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-ljspeech-485958db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-cori-485958db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/convince-dee7a1ad.webp', '[\"persuade\", \"reassure\", \"satisfy\"]', '[\"dissuade\", \"discourage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"convince someone of\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục ai tin vào điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"convince someone to do\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục ai làm việc gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"convey\", \"note_vi\": \"Truyền đạt thông tin/ý tưởng, không có nghĩa thuyết phục người khác tin vào điều gì.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"convince\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"convincing\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conviction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-cori-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-aru0-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-aru5-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-aru6-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-aru10-485958db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-aru9-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-aru3-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-aru7-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-aru8-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-aru2-485958db.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-ljspeech-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-lt408-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-lt138-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-lt624-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-lt396-485958db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-lt498-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-lt132-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-lt288-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-lt42-485958db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convince-lt90-485958db.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý cấu trúc convince sb of sth / convince sb to do sth (thuyết phục ai tin vào điều gì / làm việc gì).', 'sales', 1, 3),
('91321777-806f-5178-94ea-5b3932fa0714', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'advise', 'UK: /ədˈvaɪz/ | US: /ədˈvaɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'khuyên bảo, tư vấn', 'to give suggestions to someone about what they should do in a situation.', 'The manager will advise us on the next steps.', 'Quản lý sẽ tư vấn cho chúng ta về các bước tiếp theo.', '{\"en\": \"The legal team advised the CEO to review the terms of the contract carefully.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ pháp lý đã khuyên Giám đốc điều hành xem xét kỹ các điều khoản hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-ljspeech-1ce9e22b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-cori-1ce9e22b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/advise-4fd6f073.webp', '[\"counsel\", \"recommend\", \"suggest\"]', '[\"dissuade\", \"discourage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"advise somebody to do something\", \"meaning\": \"khuyên ai làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"advise on something\", \"meaning\": \"tư vấn về cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"advice\", \"note_vi\": \"Advise (động từ, phát âm /z/) khuyên bảo; Advice (danh từ, phát âm /s/) lời khuyên.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"advice\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"advisable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"adviser\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-cori-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru0-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru5-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru6-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru10-1ce9e22b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru9-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru3-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru7-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru8-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru2-1ce9e22b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-ljspeech-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt408-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt138-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt624-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt396-1ce9e22b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt498-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt132-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt288-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt42-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt90-1ce9e22b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: \'advise somebody to do something\' hoặc \'advise somebody on/about something\'. Đuôi \'-se\' phát âm là /z/.', 'legal', 1, 4),
('01a84966-f2da-51e2-ade3-97cfe5a01878', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'limit', 'UK: /ˈlɪmɪt/ | US: /ˈlɪmɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'hạn chế, giới hạn', 'to set a maximum boundary on the amount, number, or degree of something.', 'We must limit access to confidential documents to authorized personnel.', 'Chúng ta phải hạn chế quyền truy cập vào tài liệu mật cho những nhân viên được ủy quyền.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to limit expense reimbursements to $100 per day.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã quyết định giới hạn hoàn trả chi phí ở mức 100 đô la mỗi ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-ljspeech-e4d68c5a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-cori-e4d68c5a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/limit-a68a7e9c.webp', '[\"restrict\", \"cap\", \"bound\", \"curb\"]', '[\"expand\", \"extend\", \"increase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"limit expenditure\", \"meaning\": \"giới hạn chi tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"limit to\", \"meaning\": \"giới hạn ở mức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"limit\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"limitation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"limited\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-cori-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-aru0-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-aru5-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-aru6-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-aru10-e4d68c5a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-aru9-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-aru3-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-aru7-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-aru8-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-aru2-e4d68c5a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-ljspeech-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-lt408-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-lt138-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-lt624-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-lt396-e4d68c5a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-lt498-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-lt132-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-lt288-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-lt42-e4d68c5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/limit-lt90-e4d68c5a.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ \'limit\' thường đi với giới từ \'to\' (limit something to something: giới hạn cái gì ở mức nào).', 'finance', 1, 5),
('9dfd7a28-fdc1-5fbb-93af-c6875c0f0cc3', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'pleasure', 'UK: /ˈpleʒər/ | US: /ˈpleʒər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'niềm vui, sự thích thú', 'a feeling of happy satisfaction and enjoyment derived from an experience.', 'The concert provided pleasure to all attendees.', 'Buổi hòa nhạc đã mang lại niềm vui cho tất cả những người tham dự.', '{\"en\": \"It was an absolute pleasure collaborating with your design team on this project.\", \"vi\": \"Quả là một niềm hân hạnh tuyệt vời khi được hợp tác với đội ngũ thiết kế của bạn trong dự án này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-ljspeech-59ea4ada.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-cori-59ea4ada.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pleasure-5d0cb5ba.webp', '[\"delight\", \"enjoyment\", \"satisfaction\", \"happiness\"]', '[\"displeasure\", \"pain\", \"sorrow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"my pleasure\", \"meaning\": \"niềm hân hạnh của tôi (dùng đáp lại lời cảm ơn)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take pleasure in\", \"meaning\": \"tìm thấy niềm vui trong việc gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pressure\", \"note_vi\": \"Pressure nghĩa là áp lực công việc/cuộc sống (/ˈpreʃ.ər/ khác với pleasure /ˈpleʒ.ər/).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"please\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pleasant\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pleased\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-cori-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru0-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru5-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru6-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru10-59ea4ada.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru9-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu