('b7515f9a-7dd9-5ffa-9b69-a478796f77bb', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'journalist', '/ˈdʒɜːnəlɪst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nhà báo, phóng viên', 'a person whose job is to collect news and write about it for newspapers, magazines, or television.', 'A good journalist always checks their sources carefully.', 'Một nhà báo giỏi luôn kiểm tra kỹ các nguồn tin của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The local journalist interviewed our chief executive officer about the new marketing strategy.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà báo địa phương đã phỏng vấn giám đốc điều hành của chúng tôi về chiến lược tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-ljspeech-4c7c6120.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-cori-4c7c6120.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/journalist-1b3f034a.webp', '[\"reporter\", \"correspondent\", \"writer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"investigative journalist\", \"meaning\": \"nhà báo điều tra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"freelance journalist\", \"meaning\": \"nhà báo tự do\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reporter\", \"note_vi\": \"reporter thường đưa tin trực tiếp, journalist viết bài sâu sắc hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"journalism\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"journalistic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-cori-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-aru0-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-aru5-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-aru6-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-aru10-4c7c6120.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-aru9-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-aru3-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-aru7-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-aru8-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-aru2-4c7c6120.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-ljspeech-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-lt408-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-lt138-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-lt624-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-lt396-4c7c6120.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-lt498-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-lt132-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-lt288-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-lt42-4c7c6120.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/journalist-lt90-4c7c6120.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -ist chỉ người làm nghề nghiệp, phân biệt với journal là tờ báo.', 'media', 2, 8),
('e6d4bf3c-d7a5-5ec3-8ca6-b174a4624af7', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'wish', '/wɪʃ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'mong muốn, ước ao điều gì đó', 'to want something to happen or to want to have something very much.', 'I wish I could travel around the world next year.', 'Tôi ước mình có thể đi du lịch vòng quanh thế giới vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"Please let us know if you wish to change your flight booking time.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng cho chúng tôi biết nếu bạn mong muốn thay đổi thời gian đặt vé máy bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-ljspeech-7b2577c4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-cori-7b2577c4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wish-8a8bae66.webp', '[\"desire\", \"want\", \"hope\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wish to do something\", \"meaning\": \"mong muốn làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"best wishes\", \"meaning\": \"lời chúc tốt đẹp nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hope\", \"note_vi\": \"hope dùng cho khả năng có thể xảy ra, wish thường cho giả định trái thực tế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"wishful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-cori-7b2577c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-aru0-7b2577c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-aru5-7b2577c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-aru6-7b2577c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-aru10-7b2577c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-aru9-7b2577c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-aru3-7b2577c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-aru7-7b2577c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-aru8-7b2577c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wish-aru2-7b2577c4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/publi