('62fc0cd3-31f6-54d2-b24d-75013ee4d494', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'signal', 'UK: /ˈsɪɡnəl/ | US: /ˈsɪɡnəl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'tín hiệu', 'a sound, light, or gesture used to give information, instructions, or a warning.', 'The warning light gave a signal that the engine needed maintenance.', 'Đèn cảnh báo đã phát tín hiệu rằng động cơ cần được bảo trì.', '{\"en\": \"A weak Wi-Fi signal in the conference room interrupted the virtual presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Tín hiệu Wi-Fi yếu trong phòng họp đã làm gián đoạn buổi thuyết trình trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-ljspeech-36ab4aaa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-cori-36ab4aaa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/signal-d0a22d37.webp', '[\"sign\", \"indication\", \"cue\", \"gesture\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"weak signal\", \"meaning\": \"tín hiệu yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear signal\", \"meaning\": \"tín hiệu rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"traffic signal\", \"meaning\": \"tín hiệu giao thông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sign\", \"note_vi\": \"sign là biển báo hoặc chữ ký (khi là động từ), còn signal là tín hiệu sóng hoặc đèn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"signal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-cori-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-aru0-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-aru5-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-aru6-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-aru10-36ab4aaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-aru9-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-aru3-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-aru7-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-aru8-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-aru2-36ab4aaa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-ljspeech-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-lt408-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-lt138-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-lt624-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-lt396-36ab4aaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-lt498-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-lt132-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-lt288-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-lt42-36ab4aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/signal-lt90-36ab4aaa.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'signal\' (tín hiệu sóng, đèn, cử chỉ) với \'sign\' (biển báo hoặc dấu hiệu chung).', 'technology', 1, 17),
('b88e64e9-a7ae-5fbc-890d-512056aef4ea', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'd51e2eb9-fee4-5673-a698-c2fbf6216306', '9cf6adeb-d085-5c46-8a26-c88e36ca1ece', 'appear', '/əˈpɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Trở nên nhìn thấy được hoặc hiện diện.', 'to start to be seen or to become visible in a particular place or situation.', 'A small boat appeared on the horizon.', 'Một chiếc thuyền nhỏ xuất hiện ở đường chân trời.', '{\"en\": \"The new software update will appear on your screen automatically after you restart the computer.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm mới sẽ tự động xuất hiện trên màn hình sau khi bạn khởi động lại máy tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-ljspeech-910f17dc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-cori-910f17dc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appear-e7d5a587.webp', '[\"emerge\", \"arrive\"]', '[\"disappear\", \"vanish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"appear to be\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ như\"}, {\"phrase\": \"suddenly appear\", \"meaning\": \"xuất hiện đột ngột\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"appeal\", \"note_vi\": \"appeal là thu hút/kháng cáo, appear là xuất hiện.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"appearance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"apparent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-cori-910f17dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-aru0-910f17dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-aru5-910f17dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-aru6-910f17dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-aru10-910f17dc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-aru9-910f17dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-aru3-910f17dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-aru7-910f17dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appear-aru8-910f17dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/