('b1d6bae2-1112-59f0-ad86-aa83e03e531b', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'e85a4f9d-cc85-5052-b792-a0f120d7fbd1', '143573d0-fa40-5023-8dcb-7db752f735ee', 'catch', '/kætʃ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Tóm lấy hoặc giữ một vật đang chuyển động.', 'to stop and hold something that is moving through the air or falling.', 'He had to run quickly to catch the early morning train to work.', 'Anh ấy phải chạy nhanh để kịp chuyến tàu buổi sáng sớm đi làm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager tried to catch the mistake in the report before sending it to the client.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã cố gắng phát hiện lỗi sai trong báo cáo trước khi gửi nó cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-ljspeech-9ebad64e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-cori-9ebad64e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/catch-f423d9d3.webp', '[\"grab\", \"capture\"]', '[\"drop\", \"miss\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"catch a mistake\", \"meaning\": \"phát hiện lỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"catch a flight\", \"meaning\": \"bắt chuyến bay\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"catcher\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-cori-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru0-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru5-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru6-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru10-9ebad64e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru9-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru3-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru7-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru8-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru2-9ebad64e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-ljspeech-9ebad64e.mp3\", \