('ec4efc0f-a515-51fc-b539-15e340537bda', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'f40dd9ed-cb9c-5c6a-a96d-4561ff050ee9', '8d167174-52fb-5f28-8eb8-5e330cbe8321', 'environment', '/ɪnˈvaɪrənmənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Điều kiện tự nhiên và xã hội xung quanh chúng ta.', 'the natural world in which people, animals, and plants live together.', 'We all have a responsibility to protect the natural environment.', 'Tất cả chúng ta đều có trách nhiệm bảo vệ môi trường tự nhiên.', '{\"en\": \"Our company is committed to creating a sustainable environment by reducing plastic waste.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi cam kết tạo ra một môi trường bền vững bằng cách giảm thiểu rác thải nhựa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-ljspeech-c6e454d9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-cori-c6e454d9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/environment-2a3056e5.webp', '[\"surroundings\", \"habitat\", \"setting\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"working environment\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"protect the environment\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ môi trường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"environmental\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"environmentalist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-cori-c6e454d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-aru0-c6e454d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-aru5-c6e454d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-aru6-c6e454d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-aru10-c6e454d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-aru9-c6e454d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-aru3-c6e454d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment-aru7-c6e454d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/environment