('e041fdb7-cabf-59fa-931f-6ca479a9e088', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'f40dd9ed-cb9c-5c6a-a96d-4561ff050ee9', '8d167174-52fb-5f28-8eb8-5e330cbe8321', 'option', '/ˈɒpʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một sự lựa chọn hoặc khả năng có thể được chọn.', 'a choice that you can make between two or more different things or possibilities.', 'We have several options for dinner tonight, including pizza or pasta.', 'Chúng ta có vài lựa chọn cho bữa tối nay, bao gồm pizza hoặc mì ống.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department offers employees the option to work remotely two days per week.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự cung cấp cho nhân viên lựa chọn làm việc từ xa hai ngày mỗi tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-ljspeech-14eb14ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-cori-14eb14ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/option-b50169ee.webp', '[\"choice\", \"alternative\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have the option\", \"meaning\": \"có lựa chọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"best option\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn tốt nhất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"optional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-cori-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru0-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru5-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru6-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru10-14eb14ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru9-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru3-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru7-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru8-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru2-14eb14ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-ljspeech-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt408-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt138-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt624-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt396-14eb14ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt498-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt132-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt288-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt42-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt90-14eb14ec.mp3\"]}}', '\'Optional\' là tính từ nghĩa là \'không bắt buộc\', rất hay gặp trong TOEIC.', 'hr', 2, 22),
('35220b85-dc4c-5cb3-b6a4-3b61d2753836', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'f40dd9ed-cb9c-5c6a-a96d-4561ff050ee9', '8d167174-52fb-5f28-8eb8-5e330cbe8321', 'general', '/ˈdʒenrəl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến nhiều người, nhiều thứ, không cụ thể.', 'involving or relating to most people, things, or situations, rather than being specific.', 'In general, people are becoming more aware of environmental issues.', 'Nói chung, mọi người đang ngày càng nhận thức rõ hơn về các vấn đề môi trường.', '{\"en\": \"The general manager will announce the new company policies to all staff members tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng giám đốc sẽ thông báo các chính sách mới của công ty cho toàn thể nhân viên vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-ljspeech-dfe2db74.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-cori-dfe2db74.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/general-85cccd60.webp', '[\"broad\", \"overall\", \"common\"]', '[\"specific\", \"particular\", \"detailed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"general manager\", \"meaning\": \"tổng giám đốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"general public\", \"meaning\": \"công chúng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"general idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng chung\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"generally\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"generalize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-cori-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-aru0-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-aru5-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-aru6-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-aru10-dfe2db74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-aru9-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-aru3-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-aru7-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-aru8-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-aru2-dfe2db74.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-ljspeech-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-lt408-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-lt138-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-lt624-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-lt396-dfe2db74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-lt498-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-lt132-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-lt288-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-lt42-dfe2db74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-lt90-dfe2db74.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các chức danh như General Manager (Tổng giám đốc).', 'business', 2, 23),
('ab599aaf-e86c-591d-9395-6cd5fb38309c', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'f40dd9ed-cb9c-5c6a-a96d-4561ff050ee9', '8d167174-52fb-5f28-8eb8-5e330cbe8321', 'grill', 'UK: /ɡrɪl/ | US: /ɡrɪl/', 'B1', 'verb', 'nướng', 'to cook food over intense direct heat on a metal frame above an open fire or gas flame', 'We will grill the fish for dinner.', 'Chúng ta sẽ nướng cá cho bữa tối.', '{\"en\": \"The cafeteria staff will grill fresh salmon for today\'s special lunch menu.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên nhà ăn sẽ nướng cá hồi tươi cho thực đơn bữa trưa đặc biệt hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-ljspeech-e1545f8f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-cori-e1545f8f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grill-8f30c147.webp', '[\"barbecue\", \"broil\", \"roast\"]', '[\"boil\", \"steam\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"grill steaks\", \"meaning\": \"nướng bít tết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outdoor grill\", \"meaning\": \"vỉ nướng ngoài trời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grille\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ chỉ tấm khung kim loại / tấm lưới tản nhiệt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"grill\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"grilled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-cori-e1545f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-aru0-e1545f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-aru5-e1545f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-aru6-e1545f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-aru10-e1545f8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-aru9-e1545f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-aru3-e1545f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-aru7-e1545f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-aru8-e1545f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grill-aru2-e1545f8f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st