('61d59fe9-f17c-5de6-a7ca-aa10a2384fdf', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'f7ae17aa-ea5a-546e-bab1-a9f4b4a4ad58', '5c539c8b-0b27-5925-a090-b88c96f9d500', 'secret', '/ˈsiːkrət/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Được giữ kín, không cho người khác biết.', 'something that is kept hidden from other people and not known by them.', 'She kept her travel plans a secret until the last minute.', 'Cô ấy giữ kín kế hoạch du lịch của mình cho đến phút cuối.', '{\"en\": \"The manager shared a secret plan for the upcoming merger with the senior board members.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã chia sẻ một kế hoạch bí mật về vụ sáp nhập sắp tới với các thành viên hội đồng quản trị cấp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-ljspeech-e5e9fa1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-cori-e5e9fa1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/secret-ac8948cd.webp', '[\"confidential\", \"private\"]', '[\"public\", \"known\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keep a secret\", \"meaning\": \"giữ bí mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"top secret\", \"meaning\": \"tuyệt mật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sacred\", \"note_vi\": \"thiêng liêng, khác nghĩa hoàn toàn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"secrecy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"secretly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-cori-e5e9fa1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-aru0-e5e9fa1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-aru5-e5e9fa1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-aru6-e5e9fa1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-aru10-e5e9fa1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-aru9-e5e9fa1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-aru3-e5e9fa1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-aru7-e5e9fa1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secret-aru8-e5e9fa1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v