('53b4ccb0-b5c7-5a96-955b-6d7401794e98', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'f7ae17aa-ea5a-546e-bab1-a9f4b4a4ad58', '5c539c8b-0b27-5925-a090-b88c96f9d500', 'free', '/friː/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Không bị kiểm soát, ràng buộc hay hạn chế.', 'not costing any money to use or obtain for a specific service or item.', 'After finishing all her exams, she felt completely free to pursue her hobbies.', 'Sau khi hoàn thành tất cả các kỳ thi, cô ấy cảm thấy hoàn toàn tự do theo đuổi sở thích của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a free shuttle service to the airport for all registered business guests.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp dịch vụ xe đưa đón miễn phí đến sân bay cho tất cả khách công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-ljspeech-4ff88aad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-cori-4ff88aad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/free-a4afd28e.webp', '[\"complimentary\", \"gratis\"]', '[\"expensive\", \"paid\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"free of charge\", \"meaning\": \"miễn phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"free trial\", \"meaning\": \"dùng thử miễn phí\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"freedom\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-cori-4ff88aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-aru0-4ff88aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-aru5-4ff88aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-aru6-4ff88aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-aru10-4ff88aad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-aru9-4ff88aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-aru3-4ff88aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-aru7-4ff88aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-aru8-4ff88aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-aru2-4ff88aad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/