('8badd353-7b0f-5eda-9416-3b8289e7325c', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'fd624eab-dfed-5e52-af0e-3d93e7d73550', 'd5bacc1d-2b23-5c61-85da-7a8f2494905e', 'printer', '/ˈprɪntə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị dùng để in tài liệu từ máy tính.', 'An electronic output device that reproduces text and images from computers onto physical paper.', 'My old printer is very slow, so I\'m thinking of buying a new one.', 'Máy in cũ của tôi rất chậm, nên tôi đang nghĩ đến việc mua một cái mới.', '{\"en\": \"Please check the office printer because it is out of paper and needs maintenance.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra máy in văn phòng vì nó đã hết giấy và cần bảo trì.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-ljspeech-3d3221b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-cori-3d3221b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/printer-64603864.webp', '[\"copier\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"laser printer\", \"meaning\": \"máy in laser\"}, {\"phrase\": \"printer ink\", \"meaning\": \"mực in\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"print\", \"note_vi\": \"Đừng nhầm với \'print\' (động từ: in ấn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"print\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-cori-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru0-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru5-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru6-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru10-3d3221b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru9-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru3-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru7-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru8-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru2-3d3221b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu