('f60fddac-b8b9-5795-8196-239e5a851d42', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'fd624eab-dfed-5e52-af0e-3d93e7d73550', 'd5bacc1d-2b23-5c61-85da-7a8f2494905e', 'pollution', '/pəˈluːʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự ô nhiễm môi trường.', 'the presence of harmful substances in the environment that cause damage to the natural world.', 'The local factory was fined heavily for releasing chemical pollution into the river.', 'Nhà máy địa phương đã bị phạt nặng vì xả chất ô nhiễm hóa học ra sông.', '{\"en\": \"The new factory must follow strict regulations to reduce air pollution in the surrounding area.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy mới phải tuân thủ các quy định nghiêm ngặt để giảm ô nhiễm không khí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-ljspeech-233471ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-cori-233471ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pollution-73c91909.webp', '[\"contamination\", \"waste\"]', '[\"purity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"air pollution\", \"meaning\": \"ô nhiễm không khí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"water pollution\", \"meaning\": \"ô nhiễm nguồn nước\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pollute\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pollutant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-cori-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru0-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru5-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru6-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru10-233471ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru9-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru3-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru7-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru8-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr