('c7880348-dbcb-50ee-b1e2-571c440261d3', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'fd624eab-dfed-5e52-af0e-3d93e7d73550', 'd5bacc1d-2b23-5c61-85da-7a8f2494905e', 'layer', 'UK: /ˈleɪə/ | US: /ˈleɪər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'lớp, tầng', 'a sheet, quantity, or thickness of material spread over a surface or between other items', 'The cake has a creamy layer of frosting.', 'Chiếc bánh có một lớp kem phủ béo ngậy.', '{\"en\": \"The protective coating adds an extra layer of durability to the building\'s exterior.\", \"vi\": \"Lớp phủ bảo vệ bổ sung thêm một lớp độ bền cho phần ngoại thất của tòa nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-ljspeech-d54c2aa2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-cori-d54c2aa2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/layer-56864e89.webp', '[\"tier\", \"coat\", \"sheet\", \"stratum\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"outer layer\", \"meaning\": \"lớp ngoài cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"multiple layers\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều lớp / nhiều tầng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"layer\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"lay\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-cori-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-aru0-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-aru5-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-aru6-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-aru10-d54c2aa2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-aru9-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-aru3-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-aru7-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-aru8-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-aru2-d54c2aa2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-ljspeech-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-lt408-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-lt138-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-lt624-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-lt396-d54c2aa2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-lt498-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-lt132-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-lt288-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-lt42-d54c2aa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layer-lt90-d54c2aa2.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng cho vật liệu (lớp sơn, lớp phủ bảo vệ) hoặc cấp bậc quản lý trong tổ chức (management layers).', 'construction', 1, 27),
('ae127f8f-4d72-5874-9fea-8c9d89c82fab', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'fd624eab-dfed-5e52-af0e-3d93e7d73550', 'd5bacc1d-2b23-5c61-85da-7a8f2494905e', 'downstairs', '/ˌdaʊnˈsteəz/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Ở tầng dưới hoặc đi xuống tầng dưới.', 'to or on a lower floor of a building, especially the ground floor.', 'Please head downstairs to the main lobby to welcome our new international clients.', 'Xin vui lòng đi xuống tầng dưới đến sảnh chính để đón tiếp các khách hàng quốc tế mới của chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"Please take the heavy boxes downstairs to the storage room before the meeting starts.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng mang những chiếc hộp nặng xuống tầng dưới đến phòng kho trước khi cuộc họp bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-ljspeech-83663496.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-cori-83663496.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/downstairs-5bd7f98d.webp', '[\"below\", \"lower level\"]', '[\"upstairs\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"go downstairs\", \"meaning\": \"đi xuống tầng dưới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"walk downstairs\", \"meaning\": \"đi bộ xuống tầng dưới\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-cori-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru0-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru5-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru6-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru10-83663496.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru9-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru3-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru7-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru8-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru2-83663496.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-ljspeech-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt408-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt138-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt624-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt396-83663496.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt498-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt132-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt288-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt42-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt90-83663496.mp3\"]}}', 'Không cần giới từ \'to\' trước downstairs.', 'daily', 2, 28),
('5cdcffc5-d3d4-5dba-bdf9-a06f84fdf6e4', 'f22c8c20-af01-5c36-b57d-2e84d1a5e7dd', 'fd624eab-dfed-5e52-af0e-3d93e7d73550', 'd5bacc1d-2b23-5c61-85da-7a8f2494905e', 'manner', '/ˈmænə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cách một người làm gì đó hoặc hành xử.', 'the way in which a person behaves towards other people.', 'He always speaks in a polite manner, which everyone appreciates.', 'Anh ấy luôn nói chuyện một cách lịch sự, điều mà mọi người đều đánh giá cao.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are expected to maintain a professional manner when dealing with difficult customer inquiries.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được kỳ vọng duy trì cách cư xử chuyên nghiệp khi giải quyết các thắc mắc của khách hàng khó tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-ljspeech-4ebd24df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-cori-4ebd24df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/manner-79cf026e.webp', '[\"behavior\", \"conduct\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"professional manner\", \"meaning\": \"cách cư xử chuyên nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in a ... manner\", \"meaning\": \"theo một cách...\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-cori-4ebd24df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-aru0-4ebd24df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-aru5-4ebd24df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-aru6-4ebd24df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-aru10-4ebd24df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-aru9-4ebd24df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-aru3-4ebd24df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-aru7-4ebd24df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-aru8-4ebd24df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-aru2-4ebd24df.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manner-ljspeech-4