('3f72b01d-9884-50b8-8e92-91d719ba6641', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '06a38396-1063-5155-b665-f0594ae2ae39', '21411bc9-f78c-5941-852b-1b34486bd977', 'excitement', '/ɪkˈsaɪtmənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác vui sướng, hào hứng mạnh mẽ.', 'a feeling of great joy and eager interest in something that is happening or going to happen.', 'The announcement of the new product generated great excitement among potential investors.', 'Thông báo về sản phẩm mới đã tạo ra sự phấn khích lớn cho các nhà đầu tư tiềm năng.', '{\"en\": \"The announcement of the annual bonus generated a lot of excitement among the office staff.\", \"vi\": \"Thông báo về tiền thưởng hàng năm đã tạo ra nhiều sự hào hứng trong số nhân viên văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-ljspeech-a66cd1a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-cori-a66cd1a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excitement-74f375ac.webp', '[\"enthusiasm\", \"thrill\", \"eagerness\"]', '[\"boredom\", \"apathy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"generate excitement\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra sự hào hứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a sense of excitement\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác hào hứng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"excite\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"exciting\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"excited\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-cori-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru0-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru5-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru6-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru10-a66cd1a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru9-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru3-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia