('2b9ec045-a649-5803-b0a1-da9a7ed57c9b', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '06a38396-1063-5155-b665-f0594ae2ae39', '21411bc9-f78c-5941-852b-1b34486bd977', 'conditioner', 'UK: /kənˈdɪʃənə/ | US: /kənˈdɪʃənər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'dầu xả', 'A liquid substance applied after washing to make hair softer and smoother.', 'After shampooing, apply conditioner to your hair.', 'Sau khi gội đầu, thoa dầu xả lên tóc.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance staff repaired the air conditioner in the main conference hall before the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã sửa máy điều hòa trong hội trường chính trước cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-ljspeech-f3d66855.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-cori-f3d66855.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conditioner-3ec7e6c0.webp', '[\"softener\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"air conditioner\", \"meaning\": \"máy điều hòa nhiệt độ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hair conditioner\", \"meaning\": \"dầu xả tóc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fabric conditioner\", \"meaning\": \"nước xả vải\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"condition\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"condition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-cori-f3d66855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-aru0-f3d66855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-aru5-f3d66855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-aru6-f3d66855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-aru10-f3d66855.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-aru9-f3d66855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-aru3-f3d66855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-aru7-f3d66855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conditioner-aru8-f3d66855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci