('5cb08e89-2e5e-5c37-af20-fecd8fc1bfc3', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '121cdfe2-2e91-54b4-a92a-fe13f7f8851a', 'a9af8609-149b-5352-a046-853ad0f3550e', 'branch', '/brɑːntʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cành cây; một bộ phận của tổ chức hoặc hệ thống.', 'a part of a tree growing out from the trunk, or a local office of a business.', 'Our company plans to open a regional branch in Singapore next spring.', 'Công ty chúng tôi dự định mở một chi nhánh khu vực tại Singapore vào mùa xuân tới.', '{\"en\": \"Our company plans to open a new local branch in downtown Chicago next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi dự định mở một chi nhánh mới ở trung tâm Chicago vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-ljspeech-10d735e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-cori-10d735e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/branch-8db42762.webp', '[\"division\", \"office\", \"arm\"]', '[\"headquarters\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"head office and branch\", \"meaning\": \"trụ sở chính và chi nhánh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"open a branch\", \"meaning\": \"mở chi nhánh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"brand\", \"note_vi\": \"brand là thương hiệu, branch là chi nhánh hoặc cành cây\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"branch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-cori-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru0-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru5-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru6-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru10-10d735e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru9-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru3-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru7-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru8-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru2-10d735e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-ljspeech-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt408-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt138-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt624-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt396-10d735e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt498-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt132-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt288-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt42-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt90-10d735e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, từ này thường mang nghĩa chi nhánh công ty hoặc ngân hàng.', 'business', 1, 3),
('5dbc57fb-d3fa-58cc-baf4-615c9b310621', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '121cdfe2-2e91-54b4-a92a-fe13f7f8851a', 'a9af8609-149b-5352-a046-853ad0f3550e', 'fair', 'UK: /feə/ | US: /fɛr/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'hợp lý, công bằng', 'Treating people equally without bias, or reasonable and acceptable in amount.', 'This is a fair price for the quality of work.', 'Đây là mức giá hợp lý cho chất lượng công việc.', '{\"en\": \"Both parties agreed that the proposed terms of the merger were fair.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai bên đều đồng ý rằng các điều khoản sáp nhập được đề xuất là hợp lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-ljspeech-187770cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-cori-187770cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fair-2419a4b8.webp', '[\"reasonable\", \"just\", \"impartial\", \"equitable\"]', '[\"unfair\", \"biased\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fair price\", \"meaning\": \"giá cả hợp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fair competition\", \"meaning\": \"cạnh tranh bình đẳng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fare\", \"note_vi\": \"Fare là tiền vé (xe, tàu, xe buýt), còn fair là hợp lý/công bằng hoặc hội chợ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fairly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fairness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-cori-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru0-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru5-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru6-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru10-187770cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru9-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru3-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru7-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru8-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation