('e3f0d5e0-3e92-5e10-9ac5-9dbbce44d174', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '121cdfe2-2e91-54b4-a92a-fe13f7f8851a', 'a9af8609-149b-5352-a046-853ad0f3550e', 'trend', '/trend/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Xu hướng, khuynh hướng phát triển.', 'a general direction in which something is changing or developing over a period of time.', 'The latest fashion trend is all about comfortable and oversized clothing.', 'Xu hướng thời trang mới nhất là về quần áo thoải mái và ngoại cỡ.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department analyzed the current market trend to improve our quarterly sales performance.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tiếp thị đã phân tích xu hướng thị trường hiện tại để cải thiện hiệu suất bán hàng hàng quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-ljspeech-48075864.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-cori-48075864.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trend-fda76423.webp', '[\"tendency\", \"movement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"market trend\", \"meaning\": \"xu hướng thị trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"follow a trend\", \"meaning\": \"theo một xu hướng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"trendy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-cori-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru0-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru5-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru6-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru10-48075864.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru9-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru3-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru7-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru8-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru2-48075864.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-ljspeech-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt408-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt138-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt624-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt396-48075864.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt498-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt132-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt288-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt42-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt90-48075864.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng với giới từ \'in\' (e.g., a trend in sales).', 'marketing', 1, 5),
('1d26e181-3f9e-5dd6-a739-45f9b65afc85', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '121cdfe2-2e91-54b4-a92a-fe13f7f8851a', 'a9af8609-149b-5352-a046-853ad0f3550e', 'air-condition', 'UK: /eə kənˈdɪʃənɪŋ/ | US: /ɛr kənˈdɪʃənɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'hệ thống điều hòa không khí', 'a system used to cool and control the humidity of indoor environments.', 'The air-conditioning unit needs to be repaired.', 'Thiết bị điều hòa cần được sửa chữa.', '{\"en\": \"The facilities manager called a technician to repair the office air-condition system.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cơ sở vật chất đã gọi kỹ thuật viên đến sửa hệ thống điều hòa không khí của văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-ljspeech-3c793711.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-cori-3c793711.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/air-condition-72ec4397.webp', '[\"air conditioning\", \"cooling system\", \"HVAC system\"]', '[\"heating system\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"air-condition system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống điều hòa không khí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"air-conditioned office\", \"meaning\": \"văn phòng có điều hòa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"air conditioner\", \"note_vi\": \"Air conditioner chỉ chiếc máy điều hòa cụ thể, air conditioning / air-condition chỉ hệ thống làm mát.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"air-conditioned\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"air conditioner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-cori-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-aru0-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-aru5-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-aru6-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-aru10-3c793711.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-aru9-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-aru3-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-aru7-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-aru8-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-aru2-3c793711.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-ljspeech-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-lt408-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-lt138-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-lt624-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-lt396-3c793711.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-lt498-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-lt132-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-lt288-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-lt42-3c793711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/air-condition-lt90-3c793711.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh văn phòng, danh từ thường dùng thực tế là \'air conditioning\' (hệ thống) hoặc \'air conditioner\' (máy điều hòa).', 'office', 1, 6),
('4e335755-242d-5762-baa1-d25814b2b114', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '121cdfe2-2e91-54b4-a92a-fe13f7f8851a', 'a9af8609-149b-5352-a046-853ad0f3550e', 'shine', '/ʃaɪn/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Phát ra ánh sáng hoặc phản chiếu ánh sáng.', 'to produce or reflect light, making something look bright, clear, or very clean and polished.', 'Her newly polished leather shoes began to shine under the bright hallway lights.', 'Đôi giày da mới đánh bóng của cô ấy bắt đầu tỏa sáng dưới ánh đèn hành lang sáng rực.', '{\"en\": \"The cleaning staff worked hard to make the office windows shine before the important client visit.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên vệ sinh đã làm việc chăm chỉ để làm cửa sổ văn phòng sáng bóng trước chuyến thăm của khách hàng quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-ljspeech-3da90bd3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-cori-3da90bd3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shine-40a40b28.webp', '[\"glow\", \"sparkle\", \"beam\"]', '[\"dull\", \"fade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"shine bright\", \"meaning\": \"tỏa sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make something shine\", \"meaning\": \"làm cho thứ gì đó sáng bóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shiny\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shining\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-cori-3da90bd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-aru0-3da90bd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-aru5-3da90bd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-aru6-3da90bd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-aru10-3da90bd3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-aru9-3da90bd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-aru3-3da90bd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-aru7-3da90bd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shine-aru8-3da90bd