('627a3f6e-52a8-5159-b0a8-a9078e41152a', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'direct', '/dəˈrekt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Thẳng thắn, không vòng vo; trực diện.', 'going straight from one place to another without stopping or changing the path taken.', 'He gave a direct answer to the question, without hesitation.', 'Anh ấy đã đưa ra câu trả lời trực tiếp cho câu hỏi, không hề do dự.', '{\"en\": \"We offer a direct flight from London to Tokyo for all our business travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi cung cấp chuyến bay thẳng từ London đến Tokyo cho tất cả khách hàng doanh nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-ljspeech-24a1733c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-cori-24a1733c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/direct-76629533.webp', '[\"straight\", \"straightforward\", \"immediate\"]', '[\"indirect\", \"circuitous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"direct contact\", \"meaning\": \"liên lạc trực tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"direct result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả trực tiếp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"direction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"directly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-cori-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru0-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru5-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru6-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru10-24a1733c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru9-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru3-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru7-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru8-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru2-24a1733c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-ljspeech-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt408-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt138-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt624-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt396-24a1733c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt498-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt132-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt288-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt42-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt90-24a1733c.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý nghĩa \"thẳng thắn\" (tính cách) và \"trực tiếp\" (hành động/đường đi).', 'travel', 1, 2),
('4c6530c3-8ca2-5613-8daf-4179fa128fc2', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'district', 'UK: /ˈdɪstrɪkt/ | US: /ˈdɪstrɪkt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'quận, khu vực', 'a specific area of a city or country that has a particular purpose.', 'The business district is very busy during weekdays.', 'Khu thương mại rất bận rộn vào các ngày trong tuần.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate headquarters will relocate to the city\'s central business district next summer.\", \"vi\": \"Trụ sở chính của tập đoàn sẽ chuyển đến khu vực thương mại trung tâm của thành phố vào mùa hè tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-ljspeech-dfbbe7ed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-cori-dfbbe7ed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/district-61805526.webp', '[\"region\", \"area\", \"zone\", \"sector\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business district\", \"meaning\": \"khu thương mại / khu kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"financial district\", \"meaning\": \"khu tài chính\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-cori-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-aru0-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-aru5-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-aru6-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-aru10-dfbbe7ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-aru9-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-aru3-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-aru7-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-aru8-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-aru2-dfbbe7ed.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-ljspeech-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-lt408-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-lt138-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-lt624-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-lt396-dfbbe7ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-lt498-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-lt132-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-lt288-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-lt42-dfbbe7ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/district-lt90-dfbbe7ed.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong đề thi TOEIC thường ghép với ngành nghề để chỉ vùng chuyên biệt: \'business district\' (khu thương mại), \'financial district\' (khu tài chính).', 'real estate', 1, 3),
('770c0f03-d3c3-5e5e-8646-044f928ccfe0', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'whatever', '/wɒtˈevə(r)/', 'B1', 'determiner', 'Bất cứ điều gì, không quan trọng là gì.', 'anything that May be chosen without limitation or condition.', 'Our department will accept whatever budget proposal the director approves tomorrow.', 'Bộ phận của chúng tôi sẽ chấp nhận bất kỳ đề xuất ngân sách nào mà giám đốc phê duyệt vào ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"Customers May return whatever product they bought within thirty days.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể trả lại bất cứ sản phẩm nào họ đã mua trong ba mươi ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-ljspeech-d869db7f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-cori-d869db7f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whatever-a74e3fd7.webp', '[\"any\", \"whichever\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"whatever reason\", \"meaning\": \"bất cứ lý do gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whatever happens\", \"meaning\": \"dù chuyện gì xảy ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whatever choice\", \"meaning\": \"bất cứ lựa chọn nào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"what\", \"note_vi\": \"what hỏi cái gì, whatever nghĩa bất cứ cái gì không hạn chế.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-cori-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-aru0-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-aru5-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-aru6-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-aru10-d869db7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-aru9-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-aru3-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-aru7-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-aru8-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-aru2-d869db7f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-ljspeech-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-lt408-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-lt138-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-lt624-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-lt396-d869db7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-lt498-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-lt132-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-lt288-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-lt42-d869db7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whatever-lt90-d869db7f.mp3\"]}}', 'Whatever đứng trước danh từ nghĩa là bất cứ danh từ nào, không hỏi.', 'shopping', 1, 4),
('0e3b2146-1e14-57da-97fa-fc4a71a2f9d1', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'backseat', 'UK: /ˈbæksiːt/ | US: /ˈbækˌsit/', 'B1', 'noun', 'ghế sau (ô tô)', 'the rear sitting row situated behind the driver inside a passenger vehicle or car', 'The client sat in the backseat of the car.', 'Khách hàng ngồi ở ghế sau xe.', '{\"en\": \"During the company trip, the executives sat in the backseat of the hired limousine.\", \"vi\": \"Trong chuyến đi của công ty, các giám đốc điều hành ngồi ở ghế sau của chiếc limousine được thuê.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-ljspeech-3857ab74.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-cori-3857ab74.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/backseat-1db8e948.webp', '[\"rear seat\"]', '[\"front seat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take a backseat\", \"meaning\": \"lùi về sau, nhận vai trò phụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"backseat driver\", \"meaning\": \"người ngồi sau chỉ tay 5 ngón / can thiệp việc lái xe\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-cori-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru0-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru5-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru6-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru10-3857ab74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru9-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru3-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru7-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru8-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru2-3857ab74.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-ljspeech-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt408-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt138-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt624-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt396-3857ab74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt498-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt132-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt288-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt42-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt90-3857ab74.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết liền \'backseat\'. Cụm \'take a backseat\' có nghĩa là lùi về sau, giữ vai trò ít quan trọng hơn.', 'travel', 1, 5),
('245d5999-70f7-5da6-bba3-986c7bcfdcd9', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'consequence', '/ˈkɒnsɪkwəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kết quả của một hành động hoặc sự việc nào đó.', 'the result or effect of an action or situation that often happens later.', 'He didn\'t think about the consequences of his actions.', 'Anh ấy đã không nghĩ về những hậu quả từ hành động của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager warned that missing the deadline would have serious consequences for the project team.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảnh báo rằng việc trễ thời hạn sẽ gây ra hậu quả nghiêm trọng cho nhóm dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-ljspeech-f4475dac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-cori-f4475dac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consequence-7e3ae889.webp', '[\"result\", \"outcome\", \"effect\"]', '[\"cause\", \"origin\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"face the consequences\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt với hậu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"serious consequence\", \"meaning\": \"hậu quả nghiêm trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sequence\", \"note_vi\": \"trình tự, thứ tự các sự việc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"consequent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"consequently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-cori-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru0-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru5-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru6-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru10-f4475dac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru9-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru3-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-