('b72c9ee7-30b2-5460-95d2-27983bcd2ea0', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'recommendation', '/ˌrekəmenˈdeɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Lời khuyên, sự giới thiệu hoặc đề xuất.', 'a suggestion that someone should do something or use a specific service.', 'The consultant wrote a formal letter of recommendation for her former colleague.', 'Người tư vấn đã viết một thư giới thiệu chính thức cho đồng nghiệp cũ của cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant provided a professional recommendation to improve our company\'s marketing strategy this year.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà tư vấn đã đưa ra một đề xuất chuyên nghiệp để cải thiện chiến lược tiếp thị của công ty chúng tôi năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-ljspeech-d0c18034.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-cori-d0c18034.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recommendation-f304279c.webp', '[\"suggestion\", \"proposal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"letter of recommendation\", \"meaning\": \"thư giới thiệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"follow a recommendation\", \"meaning\": \"làm theo đề xuất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"recommend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-cori-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-aru0-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-aru5-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-aru6-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-aru10-d0c18034.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-aru9-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-aru3-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-aru7-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-aru8-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-aru2-d0c18034.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-ljspeech-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-lt408-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-lt138-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-lt624-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-lt396-d0c18034.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-lt498-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-lt132-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-lt288-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-lt42-d0c18034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommendation-lt90-d0c18034.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong tuyển dụng (thư giới thiệu) hoặc tư vấn kinh doanh.', 'hr', 1, 9),
('f1b89309-0202-583f-adef-a0fcea467d75', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'place', '/pleɪs/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Đặt cái gì đó vào một vị trí cụ thể.', 'to put something in a particular position or location carefully.', 'Please place your books on the table when you finish reading.', 'Xin hãy đặt sách của bạn lên bàn khi đọc xong.', '{\"en\": \"Customers can place an order online and pick it up at the nearest store.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể đặt hàng trực tuyến và nhận hàng tại cửa hàng gần nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-ljspeech-9da8f1fa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-cori-9da8f1fa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/place-57fb1396.webp', '[\"put\", \"position\", \"locate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"place an order\", \"meaning\": \"đặt hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"place an advertisement\", \"meaning\": \"đăng quảng cáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"place emphasis on\", \"meaning\": \"nhấn mạnh vào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"replace\", \"note_vi\": \"replace là thay thế, place là đặt để\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"placement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-cori-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-aru0-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-aru5-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-aru6-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-aru10-9da8f1fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-aru9-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-aru3-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-aru7-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-aru8-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-aru2-9da8f1fa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-ljspeech-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-lt408-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-lt138-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-lt624-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-lt396-9da8f1fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-lt498-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-lt132-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-lt288-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-lt42-9da8f1fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/place-lt90-9da8f1fa.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, cụm từ place an order (đặt hàng) cực kỳ phổ biến.', 'shopping', 1, 10),
('1c4d091f-9989-5ce6-9b5a-aaa769b3774a', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'emotion', '/ɪˈməʊʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một phản ứng tâm lý mạnh mẽ như vui, buồn, giận, sợ hãi.', 'a strong feeling such as happiness, sadness, or anger that you experience in your life.', 'Her voice was full of emotion as she spoke about her childhood.', 'Giọng cô ấy tràn đầy cảm xúc khi nói về tuổi thơ.', '{\"en\": \"The speaker expressed great emotion when describing the success of the new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Người diễn thuyết đã bày tỏ cảm xúc mạnh mẽ khi mô tả sự thành công của chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-ljspeech-a1faba8b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-cori-a1faba8b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/emotion-5d52e94e.webp', '[\"feeling\", \"sentiment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"show emotion\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện cảm xúc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strong emotion\", \"meaning\": \"cảm xúc mạnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"motion\", \"note_vi\": \"Motion là sự chuyển động, emotion là cảm xúc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"emotional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-cori-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-aru0-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-aru5-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-aru6-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-aru10-a1faba8b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-aru9-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-aru3-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-aru7-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-aru8-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-aru2-a1faba8b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-ljspeech-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-lt408-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-lt138-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-lt624-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-lt396-a1faba8b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-lt498-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-lt132-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-lt288-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-lt42-a1faba8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotion-lt90-a1faba8b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'motion\' (chuyển động) do mặt chữ.', 'daily', 1, 11),
('bad5dc9e-1990-5465-bb21-9fdedb682b27', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'punishment', '/ˈpʌnɪʃmənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hình phạt, sự trừng trị.', 'a penalty given to someone because they have done something wrong.', 'The teacher gave him extra homework as a punishment for being late.', 'Giáo viên đã giao thêm bài tập về nhà cho cậu bé như một hình phạt vì đi học muộn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees who violate security regulations will face severe punishment from the management.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên vi phạm quy định bảo mật sẽ phải chịu hình phạt nặng từ ban quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-ljspeech-6285e5dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-cori-6285e5dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/punishment-65801a6d.webp', '[\"penalty\", \"sanction\", \"discipline\"]', '[\"reward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"severe punishment\", \"meaning\": \"hình phạt nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"capital punishment\", \"meaning\": \"án tử hình\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"punish\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"punishing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-cori-6285e5dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-aru0-6285e5dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-aru5-6285e5dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-aru6-6285e5dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-aru10-6285e5dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-aru9-6285e5dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-aru3-6285e5dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-aru7-6285e5dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/punishment-aru8-6285e5dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc