('01a4c6a3-fe71-56ab-89ce-dbf1cadef71c', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'reservation', '/ˌrezəˈveɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Việc đặt trước chỗ ở, vé hoặc dịch vụ.', 'an arrangement to keep a seat, room, or event space for future use.', 'The travel agent confirmed our hotel room reservation for three nights in Tokyo.', 'Đại lý du lịch đã xác nhận việc đặt phòng khách sạn của chúng tôi trong ba đêm ở Tokyo.', '{\"en\": \"Please call the hotel front desk to confirm your room reservation before arriving.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng gọi cho lễ tân khách sạn để xác nhận việc đặt phòng của bạn trước khi đến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-ljspeech-bcf112ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-cori-bcf112ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reservation-f0f78575.webp', '[\"booking\", \"engagement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a reservation\", \"meaning\": \"đặt chỗ trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cancel a reservation\", \"meaning\": \"hủy đặt chỗ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confirm a reservation\", \"meaning\": \"xác nhận việc đặt chỗ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"preservation\", \"note_vi\": \"preservation nghĩa là sự bảo tồn hoặc gìn giữ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reserve\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reserved\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-cori-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-aru0-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-aru5-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-aru6-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-aru10-bcf112ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-aru9-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-aru3-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-aru7-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-aru8-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-aru2-bcf112ef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-ljspeech-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-lt408-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-lt138-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-lt624-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-lt396-bcf112ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-lt498-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-lt132-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-lt288-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-lt42-bcf112ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reservation-lt90-bcf112ef.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn đi với động từ \'make\' trong cụm \'make a reservation\', không dùng \'do\'.', 'travel', 1, 21),
('34c28359-60b3-5bea-b86b-f5d3d30ae221', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '194d13c1-7347-5f37-95f2-0b19b81bd0ac', '6f88ef92-e892-58bd-9370-a11aeb139fdb', 'bite', '/baɪt/', 'A2', 'verb', 'dùng răng để cắn hoặc kẹp.', 'to use your teeth to cut into or hurt something or someone.', 'Be careful not to bite your tongue while eating.', 'Hãy cẩn thận đừng cắn vào lưỡi khi ăn.', '{\"en\": \"Customers complained that the small insects in the outdoor dining area would bite them.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng phàn nàn rằng những con côn trùng nhỏ ở khu vực ăn uống ngoài trời sẽ cắn họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-ljspeech-6a20d919.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-cori-6a20d919.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bite-6ca8535d.webp', '[\"chew\", \"nip\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bite your nails\", \"meaning\": \"cắn móng tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bite off\", \"meaning\": \"cắn đứt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"byte\", \"note_vi\": \"byte là đơn vị dữ liệu máy tính, phát âm giống hệt bite.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bite\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"biting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-cori-6a20d919.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-aru0-6a20d919.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-aru5-6a20d919.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-aru6-6a20d919.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-aru10-6a20d919.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-aru9-6a20d919.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-aru3-6a20d919.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-aru7-6a20d919.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-aru8-6a20d919.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-aru2-6a20d919.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bite-l