('47e6574c-3e2c-5f3c-9268-65f1e6634f0f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '1e92b505-331c-524d-9e73-fbe8394f2b8e', '5144b70f-3d40-5625-a73d-5939cf16eee8', 'weight', '/weɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Độ nặng của một vật thể, được đo bằng đơn vị khối lượng.', 'the measurement of how heavy a person or thing is in kilograms or pounds.', 'The maximum weight for this luggage is 20 kilograms.', 'Trọng lượng tối đa cho hành lý này là 20 kilôgam.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure your checked baggage does not exceed the weight limit of twenty kilograms.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo hành lý ký gửi của bạn không vượt quá giới hạn cân nặng hai mươi kg.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-ljspeech-afe04441.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-cori-afe04441.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weight-c50754cf.webp', '[\"heaviness\", \"mass\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"weight limit\", \"meaning\": \"giới hạn cân nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lose weight\", \"meaning\": \"giảm cân\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weigh\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-cori-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru0-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru5-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru6-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru10-afe04441.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru9-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru3-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru7-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru8-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-aru2-afe04441.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weight-ljspeech-afe04441.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec