('2f6259ae-7ae9-507c-a96c-d451dc03c34f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '1e92b505-331c-524d-9e73-fbe8394f2b8e', '5144b70f-3d40-5625-a73d-5939cf16eee8', 'analysis', '/əˈnæləsɪs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự phân tích, xem xét kỹ lưỡng.', 'the process of studying something in detail to understand its nature or determine its essential features.', 'The scientist conducted a detailed analysis of the soil samples.', 'Nhà khoa học đã thực hiện một phân tích chi tiết các mẫu đất.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team completed a thorough market analysis before launching the new product line today.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã hoàn thành bản phân tích thị trường kỹ lưỡng trước khi ra mắt dòng sản phẩm mới hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-ljspeech-36847a29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-cori-36847a29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/analysis-5c551158.webp', '[\"examination\", \"investigation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conduct an analysis\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện một cuộc phân tích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"detailed analysis\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích chi tiết\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"analyze\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"analytical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-cori-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru0-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru5-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru6-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru10-36847a29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru9-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru3-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru7-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru8-36847a29.