('65093a66-af84-5e16-ab71-7387129d5615', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '1e92b505-331c-524d-9e73-fbe8394f2b8e', '5144b70f-3d40-5625-a73d-5939cf16eee8', 'brake', 'UK: /breɪk/ | US: /breɪk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'phanh', 'A device fitted to a vehicle for slowing down or bringing it to a complete stop.', 'Always check the brake fluid levels regularly.', 'Luôn kiểm tra mức dầu phanh thường xuyên.', '{\"en\": \"The mechanic recommended replacing the front brake pads during the routine maintenance.\", \"vi\": \"Người thợ máy đã khuyên nên thay má phanh trước trong đợt bảo dưỡng định kỳ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-ljspeech-39cabc71.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-cori-39cabc71.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brake-632fc686.webp', '[\"restraint\", \"damper\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apply the brakes\", \"meaning\": \"đạp phanh / hãm phanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brake pedal\", \"meaning\": \"bàn đạp phanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"break\", \"note_vi\": \"break mang nghĩa làm vỡ hoặc giờ nghỉ, phát âm giống hệt brake.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"brake\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-cori-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru0-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru5-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru6-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru10-39cabc71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru9-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru3-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru7-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru8-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru2-39cabc71.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-ljspeech-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt408-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt138-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt624-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt396-39cabc71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt498-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt132-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt288-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt42-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt90-39cabc71.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt chính tả: \'brake\' (phanh xe) và \'break\' (làm vỡ / giờ nghỉ).', 'transportation', 1, 27),
('9f74c938-09ea-51e8-b621-01d3c5c90f1e', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '1e92b505-331c-524d-9e73-fbe8394f2b8e', '5144b70f-3d40-5625-a73d-5939cf16eee8', 'attitude', '/ˈætɪtjuːd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cách suy nghĩ, cảm nhận và hành xử của một người đối với điều gì đó.', 'a feeling or opinion about something, or a way of behaving towards someone.', 'Having a professional attitude is essential for career growth in any company.', 'Có một thái độ chuyên nghiệp là rất quan trọng cho sự phát triển nghề nghiệp trong bất kỳ công ty nào.', '{\"en\": \"Having a positive professional attitude is essential for career advancement in any firm.\", \"vi\": \"Thể hiện thái độ chuyên nghiệp tích cực là điều thiết yếu để thăng tiến sự nghiệp trong bất kỳ công ty nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-ljspeech-628912ee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-cori-628912ee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attitude-a50e750b.webp', '[\"mindset\", \"outlook\", \"stance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"positive attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ tích cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attitude towards work\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ đối với công việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"altitude\", \"note_vi\": \"attitude là thái độ, altitude là độ cao so với mặt nước biển\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"attitudinal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-cori-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-aru0-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-aru5-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-aru6-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-aru10-628912ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-aru9-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-aru3-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-aru7-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-aru8-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-aru2-628912ee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-ljspeech-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-lt408-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-lt138-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-lt624-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-lt396-628912ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-lt498-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-lt132-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-lt288-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-lt42-628912ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attitude-lt90-628912ee.mp3\"]}}', 'Người Việt dễ nhầm attitude (thái độ) với altitude (độ cao) và aptitude (năng khiếu).', 'hr', 1, 28),
('95d42b11-aa29-5d07-95b6-b0e1f349e9cf', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '1e92b505-331c-524d-9e73-fbe8394f2b8e', '5144b70f-3d40-5625-a73d-5939cf16eee8', 'surely', '/ˈʃʊəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Chắc chắn, hẳn là.', 'used to express that you are certain about something or expect agreement.', 'You surely don\'t believe everything he says, do you?', 'Hẳn là bạn không tin mọi điều anh ấy nói, phải không?', '{\"en\": \"If we lower our prices, we will surely attract more customers this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu chúng ta giảm giá, chúng ta chắc chắn sẽ thu hút được nhiều khách hàng hơn trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-ljspeech-e058f812.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-cori-e058f812.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surely-5419f5b7.webp', '[\"certainly\", \"definitely\", \"undoubtedly\"]', '[\"uncertainly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"slowly but surely\", \"meaning\": \"chậm mà chắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sure\", \"note_vi\": \"Sure là tính từ hoặc thán từ, surely là trạng từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-cori-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-aru0-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-aru5-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-aru6-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-aru10-e058f812.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-aru9-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-aru3-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-aru7-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-aru8-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-aru2-e058f812.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-ljspeech-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-lt408-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-lt138-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-lt624-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-lt396-e058f812.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-lt498-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-lt132-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-lt288-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-lt42-e058f812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surely-lt90-e058f812.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để diễn tả niềm tin mạnh mẽ hoặc mong muốn đối phương đồng ý.', 'business', 1, 29),
('daa4da4b-f729-5453-a730-e7b86c167891', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '2c8fb2ac-3215-57de-858b-a1522ce492c1', '7c72d5cc-a675-596c-b902-4064bf68f403', 'appointment', '/əˈpɔɪntmənt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một cuộc gặp đã được sắp xếp trước, đặc biệt là với chuyên gia.', 'a formal arrangement to meet or visit someone at a particular time.', 'The client scheduled an urgent appointment to discuss the revised contract terms.', 'Khách hàng đã lên lịch một cuộc hẹn khẩn cấp để thảo luận về các điều khoản hợp đồng sửa đổi.', '{\"en\": \"Please call the office to schedule an appointment with the marketing director.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng gọi cho văn phòng để lên lịch hẹn với giám đốc tiếp thị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-ljspeech-d93e8eec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-cori-d93e8eec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appointment-cebf9870.webp', '[\"meeting\", \"engagement\", \"date\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make an appointment\", \"meaning\": \"hẹn gặp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"schedule an appointment\", \"meaning\": \"lên lịch hẹn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cancel an appointment\", \"meaning\": \"hủy cuộc hẹn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"appoint\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-cori-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru0-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru5-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru6-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru10-d93e8eec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru9-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru3-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru7-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru8-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru2-d93e8eec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-ljspeech-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt408-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt138-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt624-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt396-d93e8eec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt498-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt132-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt288-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt42-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt90-d93e8eec.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'date\' (hẹn hò lãng mạn) hoặc \'meeting\' (cuộc họp nội bộ).', 'office', 1, 0),
('b4a37b9f-2be5-5d36-bbea-2e25b0464862', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '2c8fb2ac-3215-57de-858b-a1522ce492c1', '7c72d5cc-a675-596c-b902-4064bf68f403', 'disappointing', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Gây ra cảm giác thất vọng, không đạt được kỳ vọng.', 'not as good as expected, causing someone to feel unhappy or dissatisfied.', 'The quarterly sales figures were disappointing despite the extensive marketing campaign.', 'Con số doanh số hàng quý thật đáng thất vọng mặc dù có chiến dịch tiếp thị diện rộng.', '{\"en\": \"The quarterly sales figures were disappointing, failing to meet the target set by management.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số bán hàng quý vừa qua thật thất vọng, không đạt mục tiêu do ban quản lý đề ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-ljspeech-793ff57f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-cori-793ff57f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disappointing-6af8f8f1.webp', '[\"unsatisfactory\", \"frustrating\"]', '[\"satisfying\", \"encouraging\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disappointing result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả thất vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disappointing performance\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện thất vọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"disappointed\", \"note_vi\": \"disappointed miêu tả cảm xúc con người (bị thất vọng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disappoint\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disappointment\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disappointed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-cori-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-aru0-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-aru5-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-aru6-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-aru10-793ff57f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-aru9-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-aru3-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-aru7-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-aru8-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-aru2-793ff57f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-ljspeech-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-lt408-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-lt138-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-lt624-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-lt396-793ff57f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-lt498-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-lt132-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-lt288-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-lt42-793ff57f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointing-lt90-793ff57f.mp3\"]}}', 'Disappointing diễn tả bản chất sự việc, còn disappointed chỉ cảm xúc con người.', 'finance', 1, 1),
('b9c41349-e028-5ca0-b6d4-e1849464214b', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '2c8fb2ac-3215-57de-858b-a1522ce492c1', '7c72d5cc-a675-596c-b902-4064bf68f403', 'locate', '/ləʊˈkeɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Tìm thấy hoặc xác định vị trí của một thứ gì đó.', 'to find the exact position of somebody or something after searching carefully.', 'The search team managed to locate the missing document in the archived file cabinet.', 'Đội tìm kiếm đã tìm được tài liệu bị thất lạc trong tủ hồ sơ lưu trữ.', '{\"en\": \"The technician was able to locate the main problem in the server room quickly.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã có thể xác định vị trí sự cố chính trong phòng máy chủ một cách nhanh chóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-ljspeech-d108e833.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-cori-d108e833.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/locate-a06a0f9c.webp', '[\"find\", \"discover\", \"pinpoint\"]', '[\"lose\", \"misplace\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"locate a problem\", \"meaning\": \"xác định vị trí sự cố\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conveniently located\", \"meaning\": \"tọa lạc ở vị trí thuận tiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"allocate\", \"note_vi\": \"allocate nghĩa là phân bổ ngân sách hoặc nguồn lực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"location\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"located\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-cori-d108e833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-aru0-d108e833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-aru5-d108e833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-aru6-d108e833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-aru10-d108e833.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-aru9-d108e833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-aru3-d108e833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/locate-aru7-d108e833.m