('f74ad511-fca4-5333-9a4a-d21815460d32', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '2c8fb2ac-3215-57de-858b-a1522ce492c1', '7c72d5cc-a675-596c-b902-4064bf68f403', 'powerful', '/ˈpaʊəfl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có sức mạnh lớn, ảnh hưởng mạnh mẽ hoặc hiệu quả cao.', 'having a great deal of strength, influence, or the ability to produce a strong effect.', 'The new engine is much more powerful than the old one.', 'Động cơ mới mạnh mẽ hơn nhiều so với động cơ cũ.', '{\"en\": \"Our new marketing campaign is a powerful tool to increase sales in the international market.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị mới của chúng tôi là một công cụ mạnh mẽ để tăng doanh số trên thị trường quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-ljspeech-0e1ce4b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-cori-0e1ce4b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/powerful-25e49367.webp', '[\"strong\", \"influential\"]', '[\"weak\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"powerful engine\", \"meaning\": \"động cơ mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"powerful tool\", \"meaning\": \"công cụ hiệu quả\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"power\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"powerfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-cori-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru0-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru5-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru6-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru10-0e1ce4b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru9-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru3-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru7-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru8-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerf