('b358b18a-116a-5211-bb6c-c2b936ebe93e', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '2c8fb2ac-3215-57de-858b-a1522ce492c1', '7c72d5cc-a675-596c-b902-4064bf68f403', 'sight', '/saɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khả năng nhìn; cảnh tượng.', 'the ability to see or something that you can see.', 'The old lighthouse was a familiar sight for sailors.', 'Ngọn hải đăng cũ là một cảnh tượng quen thuộc đối với các thủy thủ.', '{\"en\": \"The new office building offers a beautiful sight of the city harbor from the windows.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng mới có tầm nhìn tuyệt đẹp ra bến cảng thành phố từ các cửa sổ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-ljspeech-89be8e39.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-cori-89be8e39.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sight-caef1e61.webp', '[\"vision\", \"view\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lose sight of\", \"meaning\": \"mất dấu/quên mất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at first sight\", \"meaning\": \"ngay từ cái nhìn đầu tiên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"site\", \"note_vi\": \"Site là địa điểm, công trường; sight là tầm nhìn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"see\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-cori-89be8e39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-aru0-89be8e39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-aru5-89be8e39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-aru6-89be8e39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-aru10-89be8e39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-aru9-89be8e39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-aru3-89be8e39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-aru7-89be8e39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-aru8-89be8e39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-aru2-89be8e39.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sight-