('3a67be00-5995-539b-930c-2bb0a784e5f4', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '2c8fb2ac-3215-57de-858b-a1522ce492c1', '7c72d5cc-a675-596c-b902-4064bf68f403', 'leaf', '/liːf/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bộ phận mỏng, phẳng và thường màu xanh của cây.', 'a flat, thin, and usually green part of a plant that grows on a stem.', 'In autumn, the leaves on the trees turn beautiful shades of red and gold.', 'Vào mùa thu, lá cây chuyển sang các màu đỏ và vàng tuyệt đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"We need to clear the fallen leaves from the office garden before the clients arrive today.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần dọn sạch lá rụng khỏi khu vườn văn phòng trước khi khách hàng đến hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-ljspeech-98798241.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-cori-98798241.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leaf-491d16cd.webp', '[\"foliage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fallen leaves\", \"meaning\": \"lá rụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"green leaf\", \"meaning\": \"lá xanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"leave\", \"note_vi\": \"động từ \'rời đi\', phát âm khác với leaf.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"leafy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-cori-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-aru0-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-aru5-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-aru6-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-aru10-98798241.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-aru9-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-aru3-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-aru7-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-aru8-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-aru2-98798241.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-ljspeech-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-lt408-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-lt138-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-lt624-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-lt396-98798241.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-lt498-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-lt132-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-lt288-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-lt42-98798241.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaf-lt90-98798241.mp3\"]}}', 'Số nhiều của leaf là leaves, không phải leafs.', 'nature', 1, 21),
('e53b3a59-7ecc-5730-96a9-2c2d115cb8c9', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '2c8fb2ac-3215-57de-858b-a1522ce492c1', '7c72d5cc-a675-596c-b902-4064bf68f403', 'daytime', 'UK: /ˈdeɪˌtaɪm/ | US: /ˈdeɪˌtaɪm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'ban ngày', 'The period of time between sunrise and sunset when light is naturally present outside.', 'The daytime temperatures are usually much warmer.', 'Nhiệt độ ban ngày thường ấm hơn nhiều.', '{\"en\": \"The facility is open for daytime visits, while security staff monitor it overnight.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ sở mở cửa cho các chuyến thăm ban ngày, trong khi nhân viên bảo vệ giám sát qua đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-ljspeech-fa484b08.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-cori-fa484b08.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/daytime-a468b6a1.webp', '[\"daylight hours\", \"day\"]', '[\"nighttime\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"daytime hours\", \"meaning\": \"giờ ban ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"daytime shift\", \"meaning\": \"ca làm việc ban ngày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"daily\", \"note_vi\": \"Daily nghĩa là hàng ngày (tần suất), trong khi daytime chỉ khoảng thời gian ban ngày (đối lập với ban đêm).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-cori-fa484b08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-aru0-fa484b08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-aru5-fa484b08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-aru6-fa484b08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-aru10-fa484b08.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-aru9-fa484b08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-aru3-fa484b08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-aru7-fa484b08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-aru8-fa484b08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daytime-aru2-fa484b08.