('a225bf0e-c042-5051-b408-5b13f4ec4ade', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'photographer', '/fəˈtɒɡrəfə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người chuyên chụp ảnh, đặc biệt là cho mục đích nghệ thuật hoặc báo chí.', 'a person who takes pictures as a job or for a creative project.', 'A professional photographer was hired to capture the event.', 'Một nhiếp ảnh gia chuyên nghiệp đã được thuê để chụp sự kiện.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department hired a professional photographer to take pictures for the new brochure.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tiếp thị đã thuê một nhiếp ảnh gia chuyên nghiệp để chụp ảnh cho tập quảng cáo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-ljspeech-9ce9b6ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-cori-9ce9b6ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/photographer-0f6549f6.webp', '[\"cameraman\", \"photojournalist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"professional photographer\", \"meaning\": \"nhiếp ảnh gia chuyên nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"freelance photographer\", \"meaning\": \"nhiếp ảnh gia tự do\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"photography\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"photograph\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-cori-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru0-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru5-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru6-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru10-9ce9b6ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru9-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru3-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru7-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun