('3331f7f8-f06f-573c-aad5-285d7e63239a', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'attendant', 'UK: /əˈtɛn.dənt/ | US: /əˈtɛn.dənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'người phục vụ, người hướng dẫn, người đi kèm', 'a person whose job is to serve, help, or assist visitors or customers.', 'An attendant will be available to assist visitors with inquiries.', 'Một nhân viên sẽ có mặt để hỗ trợ du khách với các câu hỏi.', '{\"en\": \"The parking attendant directed the conference guests to the reserved parking area behind the building.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên trông xe đã hướng dẫn khách tham dự hội nghị đến khu vực đậu xe dành riêng phía sau tòa nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-ljspeech-cca8bd9c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-cori-cca8bd9c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attendant-943d1ff9.webp', '[\"assistant\", \"helper\", \"steward\", \"guide\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"flight attendant\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp viên hàng không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"parking attendant\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên trông xe\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attendee\", \"note_vi\": \"Attendant là người phục vụ/nhân viên hỗ trợ, trong khi attendee là khách/người đến tham dự sự kiện.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"attend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attendance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-cori-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-aru0-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-aru5-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-aru6-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-aru10-cca8bd9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-aru9-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-aru3-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-aru7-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-aru8-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-aru2-cca8bd9c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-ljspeech-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-lt408-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-lt138-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-lt624-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-lt396-cca8bd9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-lt498-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-lt132-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-lt288-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-lt42-cca8bd9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendant-lt90-cca8bd9c.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chỉ người phục vụ hoặc nhân viên hỗ trợ. Thường đi kèm lĩnh vực: \'flight attendant\' (tiếp viên hàng không), \'parking attendant\' (nhân viên trông xe).', 'travel', 1, 10),
('fc1392ec-10fe-5c57-b837-8b437fe0daea', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'meanwhile', '/ˈmiːnwaɪl/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Trong cùng khoảng thời gian; đồng thời.', 'in the period of time between two events or at the same time.', 'The main course is cooking; meanwhile, we can enjoy the appetizers.', 'Món chính đang được nấu; trong khi đó, chúng ta có thể thưởng thức món khai vị.', '{\"en\": \"The manager is reviewing the contract; meanwhile, the assistant is preparing the meeting room.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đang xem xét hợp đồng; trong lúc đó, trợ lý đang chuẩn bị phòng họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-ljspeech-6c246f4b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-cori-6c246f4b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/meanwhile-017be516.webp', '[\"meantime\", \"simultaneously\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"meanwhile in the office\", \"meaning\": \"trong khi đó tại văn phòng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-cori-6c246f4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-aru0-6c246f4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-aru5-6c246f4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-aru6-6c246f4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-aru10-6c246f4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-aru9-6c246f4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-aru3-6c246f4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-aru7-6c246f4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-aru8-6c246f4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-aru2-6c246f4b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meanwhile-ljspeech-6c246f4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje