('0ec07018-001d-53a7-81cf-246f2e1bd1ef', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'separate', '/ˈseprət/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Tách rời, không dính liền hoặc chung với cái khác.', 'existing or kept apart from other things, not joined or shared with anything else.', 'The manager decided to separate the conflicting departments into different offices.', 'Quản lý đã quyết định tách các bộ phận xung đột vào các văn phòng khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"Please keep the financial records in a separate folder to ensure they are easy to find.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng giữ các hồ sơ tài chính trong một thư mục riêng để đảm bảo chúng dễ tìm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-ljspeech-afddd76f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-cori-afddd76f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/separate-f5ed3a3f.webp', '[\"distinct\", \"detached\"]', '[\"joined\", \"shared\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"separate room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng riêng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep separate\", \"meaning\": \"giữ tách biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"separable\", \"note_vi\": \"Separate là tính từ, separable là có thể tách rời được.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"separation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"separately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-cori-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-aru0-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-aru5-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-aru6-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-aru10-afddd76f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-aru9-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-aru3-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-aru7-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-aru8-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-aru2-afddd76f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-ljspeech-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-lt408-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-lt138-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-lt624-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-lt396-afddd76f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-lt498-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-lt132-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-lt288-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-lt42-afddd76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/separate-lt90-afddd76f.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm khác nhau giữa tính từ (kết thúc -it) và động từ (kết thúc -ate).', 'office', 1, 16),
('f6b323cd-f9e2-5e79-8da7-706636ce3b45', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'similarly', '/ˈsɪmələli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách tương tự, giống như vậy.', 'in a way that is almost the same as something or someone else.', 'The first experiment yielded positive results; similarly, the second one showed promise.', 'Thí nghiệm đầu tiên mang lại kết quả tích cực; tương tự, thí nghiệm thứ hai cũng cho thấy triển vọng.', '{\"en\": \"The sales in branch A increased; similarly, branch B recorded significant profit growth.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số ở chi nhánh A tăng lên; tương tự, chi nhánh B ghi nhận sự tăng trưởng lợi nhuận đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-ljspeech-1bc0846e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-cori-1bc0846e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/similarly-67efbd85.webp', '[\"likewise\", \"correspondingly\"]', '[\"differently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be similarly affected\", \"meaning\": \"bị ảnh hưởng tương tự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be structured similarly\", \"meaning\": \"được cấu trúc tương tự\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"familiarly\", \"note_vi\": \"familiarly là quen thuộc, dễ nhầm mặt chữ với similarly (tương tự).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"similar\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"similarity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-cori-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-aru0-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-aru5-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-aru6-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-aru10-1bc0846e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-aru9-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-aru3-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-aru7-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-aru8-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-aru2-1bc0846e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-ljspeech-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-lt408-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-lt138-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-lt624-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-lt396-1bc0846e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-lt498-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-lt132-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-lt288-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-lt42-1bc0846e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similarly-lt90-1bc0846e.mp3\"]}}', 'Similarly thường đứng đầu câu làm trạng từ liên kết, theo sau là dấu phẩy.', 'business', 1, 17),
('017456b7-0fad-5e74-a91f-542cc203fbae', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'album', '/ˈælbəm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tập hợp các bài hát, ảnh hoặc tem được sắp xếp lại với nhau.', 'a collection of songs, photos, or stamps stored together.', 'The studio announced that the artist will release a solo album soon.', 'Phòng thu thông báo rằng nghệ sĩ sẽ sớm phát hành một album đơn.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team produced a photo album for the annual company event.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ marketing đã làm một album ảnh cho sự kiện thường niên của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-ljspeech-0323809a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-cori-0323809a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/album-02b8db42.webp', '[\"collection\", \"compilation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"photo album\", \"meaning\": \"album ảnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"music album\", \"meaning\": \"album nhạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stamp album\", \"meaning\": \"album tem\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"almanac\", \"note_vi\": \"sách niên giám, khác album tập hợp ảnh\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-cori-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-aru0-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-aru5-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-aru6-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-aru10-0323809a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-aru9-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-aru3-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-aru7-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-aru8-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-aru2-0323809a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-ljspeech-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-lt408-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-lt138-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-lt624-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-lt396-0323809a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-lt498-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-lt132-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-lt288-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-lt42-0323809a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/album-lt90-0323809a.mp3\"]}}', 'Album có thể là tập nhạc hoặc tập ảnh, không phải sách niên giám.', 'media', 1, 18),
('268672be-9061-506d-965f-593560c66798', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'script', '/skrɪpt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Văn bản viết của một vở kịch, phim hoặc chương trình.', 'the written words for a movie, play, or broadcast that actors read and perform.', 'The presenter made a few last-minute edits to his speaking script before going onstage.', 'Người dẫn chương trình đã thực hiện một vài chỉnh sửa vào phút cuối cho kịch bản phát biểu của mình trước khi lên sân khấu.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team reviewed the video script to ensure the message aligns with our brand.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã xem xét kịch bản video để đảm bảo thông điệp phù hợp với thương hiệu của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-ljspeech-cb5346a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-cori-cb5346a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/script-50790d65.webp', '[\"text\", \"screenplay\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"follow a script\", \"meaning\": \"làm theo kịch bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"write a script\", \"meaning\": \"viết kịch bản\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"scriptwriter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-cori-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-aru0-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-aru5-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-aru6-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-aru10-cb5346a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-aru9-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-aru3-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-aru7-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-aru8-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-aru2-cb5346a0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-ljspeech-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-lt408-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-lt138-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-lt624-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-lt396-cb5346a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-lt498-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-lt132-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-lt288-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-lt42-cb5346a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/script-lt90-cb5346a0.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công sở, từ này còn dùng để chỉ các câu thoại mẫu cho nhân viên tổng đài.', 'media', 1, 19),
('cb891426-0229-58f1-9436-6936d2020d9d', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'authority', '/ɔːˈθɒrəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Quyền hạn, quyền lực để ra lệnh hoặc đưa ra quyết định.', 'the official power to make decisions, control people, or give orders to others.', 'The local government has the authority to approve new building projects.', 'Chính quyền địa phương có quyền phê duyệt các dự án xây dựng mới.', '{\"en\": \"Only the department manager has the authority to approve travel expenses for employees.\", \"vi\": \"Chỉ trưởng bộ phận mới có thẩm quyền phê duyệt chi phí đi lại cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-ljspeech-66f5c871.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-cori-66f5c871.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/authority-a2681537.webp', '[\"power\", \"control\", \"command\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have the authority to\", \"meaning\": \"có thẩm quyền làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"abuse of authority\", \"meaning\": \"lạm dụng quyền hạn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"authorization\", \"note_vi\": \"authority là quyền hạn/thẩm quyền; authorization là sự cho phép/cấp phép.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"authorize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"authoritative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-cori-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru0-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru5-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru6-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru10-66f5c871.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru9-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru3-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru7-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru8-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru2-66f5c871.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-ljspeech-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt408-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt138-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt624-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt396-66f5c871.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt498-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt132-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt288-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt42-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt90-66f5c871.mp3\"]}}', 'Authority ở dạng số nhiều (authorities) thường chỉ các nhà chức trách, chính quyền.', 'hr', 1, 20),
('a8568dbf-2260-5a52-9325-3c6ec86cbb91', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'diner', 'UK: /ˈdaɪnər/ | US: /ˈdaɪnər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'thực khách', 'a person who eats a meal, especially in a restaurant or public establishment.', 'The restaurant was full of happy diners.', 'Nhà hàng đầy những thực khách vui vẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The head chef personally greeted diners at their tables to ask about their experience.\", \"vi\": \"Bếp trưởng đã trực tiếp chào hỏi các thực khách tại bàn để hỏi thăm về trải nghiệm của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-ljspeech-322ffac5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-cori-322ffac5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diner-244f8ec8.webp', '[\"patron\", \"customer\", \"eater\", \"guest\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"satisfied diners\", \"meaning\": \"những thực khách hài lòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"frequent diner\", \"meaning\": \"khách ăn thường xuyên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dinner\", \"note_vi\": \"Dinner là bữa ăn tối (danh từ chỉ bữa ăn), còn diner là thực khách (người ăn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dine\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-cori-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru0-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru5-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru6-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru10-322ffac5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru9-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru3-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru7-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru8-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru2-322ffac5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-ljspeech-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt408-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt138-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt624-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt396-322ffac5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt498-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt132-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt288-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt42-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt90-322ffac5.mp3\"]}}', '\'Diner\' dùng để chỉ thực khách (người ăn), tránh nhầm với \'dinner\' (bữa ăn tối).', 'dining', 1, 21),
('798d215a-be54-548a-b65a-cb1b392a5aa3', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'aged', '/eɪdʒd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đã được ủ hoặc giữ trong thời gian dài để cải thiện chất lượng.', 'kept for a long time to allow the flavor to develop fully.', 'This restaurant is famous for serving premium aged beef grilled to perfection.', 'Nhà hàng này nổi tiếng với việc phục vụ thịt bò ủ lâu năm thượng hạng nướng hoàn hảo.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant is famous for serving premium aged beef to its corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng nổi tiếng với việc phục vụ thịt bò ủ lâu năm cao cấp cho các khách hàng doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-ljspeech-3fd8d44c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-cori-3fd8d44c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aged-8ec5cdcb.webp', '[\"matured\", \"ripened\"]', '[\"fresh\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"aged cheese\", \"meaning\": \"phô mai ủ lâu năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"aged beef\", \"meaning\": \"thịt bò ủ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ancient\", \"note_vi\": \"ancient là cổ xưa (lịch sử), aged là được ủ lâu năm hoặc lâu đời.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"age\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"age\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-cori-3fd8d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-aru0-3fd8d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-aru5-3fd8d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-aru6-3fd8d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-aru10-3fd8d44c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-aru9-3fd8d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-aru3-3fd8d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-aru7-3fd8d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aged-aru8-3fd8d44c.mp3\", \