('cc4c4c6d-d3fa-5eff-adf3-382a48bf6fac', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'factor', 'UK: /ˈfæktə/ | US: /ˈfæktər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'yếu tố', 'A circumstance or element that contributes to a particular result or outcome.', 'Cost is a major factor in purchasing decisions.', 'Chi phí là một yếu tố chính trong các quyết định mua hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Price is a key factor when clients choose a logistics supplier.\", \"vi\": \"Giá cả là một yếu tố then chốt khi khách hàng lựa chọn nhà cung cấp dịch vụ hậu cần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-ljspeech-7a7bc449.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-cori-7a7bc449.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/factor-3633658c.webp', '[\"element\", \"component\", \"consideration\", \"aspect\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"key factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố then chốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"contributing factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố đóng góp/gây ra\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-cori-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru0-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru5-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru6-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru10-7a7bc449.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru9-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru3-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru7-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru8-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru2-7a7bc449.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-ljspeech-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-lt408-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-lt138-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-lt624-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-lt396-7a7bc449.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-lt498-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-lt132-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-lt288-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-lt42-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-lt90-7a7bc449.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm động từ \'factor in sth\' nghĩa là tính đến/đưa yếu tố nào đó vào cân nhắc.', 'management', 1, 25),
('64580467-fe8b-51ae-89f8-e2216b73bb75', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '31faced9-706f-5b47-917b-05bfd0c8fc8a', '0f84046d-30fd-5814-bd64-a6070ff3069a', 'tend to', '/tend tə/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thường làm gì đó hoặc có khuynh hướng tự nhiên.', 'to be likely to behave in a particular way or have a certain characteristic.', 'People tend to eat more in cold weather.', 'Mọi người có xu hướng ăn nhiều hơn vào thời tiết lạnh.', '{\"en\": \"Customers tend to buy more products when we offer free shipping on large orders.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có xu hướng mua nhiều sản phẩm hơn khi chúng tôi cung cấp giao hàng miễn phí cho các đơn hàng lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-ljspeech-65434d2f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-cori-65434d2f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tend-to-46a0e8ab.webp', '[\"incline to\", \"be likely to\", \"lean towards\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tend to agree\", \"meaning\": \"có xu hướng đồng ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tend to forget\", \"meaning\": \"hay quên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intend to\", \"note_vi\": \"intend to là dự định làm gì, còn tend to là có xu hướng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tendency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-cori-65434d2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-aru0-65434d2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-aru5-65434d2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-aru6-65434d2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-aru10-65434d2f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-aru9-65434d2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-aru3-65434d2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-aru7-65434d2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tend-to-aru8-65434d2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc