('aab6d3eb-dbf9-5078-872b-0bf22fb81335', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '3260b349-c5de-5824-8360-a2f7fe7e2278', 'aa7a11f1-8a47-51c7-b876-1ea8043cdad2', 'escalator', 'UK: /ˈɛskəleɪtə/ | US: /ˈɛskəleɪtər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'thang cuốn', 'A moving staircase consisting of an endlessly circulating belt of steps driven by a motor.', 'Please use the escalator to go to the second floor.', 'Vui lòng sử dụng thang cuốn để lên tầng hai.', '{\"en\": \"Please take the escalator on your left to go up to the second floor.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đi thang cuốn bên trái bạn để lên tầng hai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-ljspeech-eaf83ca4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-cori-eaf83ca4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/escalator-1275522e.webp', '[\"moving staircase\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"moving escalator\", \"meaning\": \"thang cuốn đang di chuyển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take the escalator\", \"meaning\": \"đi thang cuốn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"elevator\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Elevator\' là thang máy nâng theo chiều thẳng đứng, còn \'escalator\' là thang cuốn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"escalate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-cori-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-aru0-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-aru5-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-aru6-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-aru10-eaf83ca4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-aru9-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-aru3-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-aru7-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-aru8-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-aru2-eaf83ca4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-ljspeech-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-lt408-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-lt138-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-lt624-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-lt396-eaf83ca4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-lt498-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-lt132-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-lt288-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-lt42-eaf83ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escalator-lt90-eaf83ca4.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt thang cuốn (escalator) với thang máy thùng kín (elevator / lift).', 'facility', 1, 19),
('b40cf51d-9094-54cf-baff-5c277df9707e', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '3260b349-c5de-5824-8360-a2f7fe7e2278', 'aa7a11f1-8a47-51c7-b876-1ea8043cdad2', 'figure out', 'UK: /ˈfɪɡər aʊt/ | US: /ˈfɪɡjər aʊt/', 'B1', 'v.phr', 'tìm ra, hiểu ra', 'to reach an understanding or find a solution to a problem through careful thought.', 'We need to figure out a solution to this problem.', 'Chúng ta cần tìm ra giải pháp cho vấn đề này.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department is trying to figure out the cause of the network outage.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng CNTT đang cố gắng tìm ra nguyên nhân gây ra sự cố mất mạng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-ljspeech-7c63de27.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-cori-7c63de27.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/figure-out-6b044a8b.webp', '[\"solve\", \"understand\", \"work out\", \"resolve\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"figure out a solution\", \"meaning\": \"tìm ra giải pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"figure out how to\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu cách làm thế nào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"find out\", \"note_vi\": \"Find out là nhận được thông tin/biết tin tức, còn figure out là dùng suy nghĩ để tự hiểu/giải quyết.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-cori-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-aru0-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-aru5-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-aru6-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-aru10-7c63de27.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-aru9-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-aru3-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-aru7-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-aru8-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-aru2-7c63de27.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-ljspeech-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-lt408-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-lt138-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-lt624-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-lt396-7c63de27.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-lt498-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-lt132-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-lt288-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-lt42-7c63de27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/figure-out-lt90-7c63de27.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm động từ rất phổ biến trong các đoạn hội thoại TOEIC Part 3. Đồng nghĩa với \'work out\' hoặc \'solve\'.', 'office', 1, 20),
('fcccc01a-ce0c-5914-ad35-669efa487629', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '3260b349-c5de-5824-8360-a2f7fe7e2278', 'aa7a11f1-8a47-51c7-b876-1ea8043cdad2', 'afford', '/əˈfɔːd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'có đủ tiền hoặc điều kiện để mua hay làm gì đó.', 'to have enough money or resources to be able to pay for or do something.', 'Our company cannot afford to lose major clients during this difficult economic period.', 'Công ty chúng tôi không thể gánh chịu việc mất các khách hàng lớn trong giai đoạn kinh tế khó khăn này.', '{\"en\": \"The small company cannot afford to upgrade all its computers this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty nhỏ không đủ khả năng nâng cấp tất cả máy tính trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-ljspeech-15cdad7a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-cori-15cdad7a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/afford-1430ec22.webp', '[\"manage\", \"sustain\", \"bear\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"afford to buy\", \"meaning\": \"đủ tiền để mua\"}, {\"phrase\": \"can\'t afford\", \"meaning\": \"không đủ khả năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"afford the cost\", \"meaning\": \"đủ khả năng chi trả chi phí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"affordable\", \"note_vi\": \"affordable là tính từ nghĩa là có giá cả phải chăng, dễ mua được\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"affordable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"affordability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-cori-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru0-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru5-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru6-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru10-15cdad7a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru9-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru3-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob