('b8dbafa3-206d-5819-a6a8-f2c4f2ce1c65', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'lie', '/laɪ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đặt mình xuống một bề mặt phẳng.', 'to be in or move into a flat position on a surface like a bed.', 'I like to lie on the grass and watch the clouds pass by.', 'Tôi thích nằm trên cỏ và ngắm mây trôi qua.', '{\"en\": \"The patient was asked to lie on the examination table while the doctor prepared the equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Bệnh nhân được yêu cầu nằm trên bàn khám trong khi bác sĩ chuẩn bị thiết bị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-ljspeech-54e2fcb9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-cori-54e2fcb9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lie-9e7fc261.webp', '[\"recline\", \"rest\"]', '[\"stand\", \"sit\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lie down\", \"meaning\": \"nằm xuống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lie flat\", \"meaning\": \"nằm phẳng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lay\", \"note_vi\": \"lay cần tân ngữ (đặt cái gì), lie không cần tân ngữ (tự nằm).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-cori-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru0-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru5-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru6-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru10-54e2fcb9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru9-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru3-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru7-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru8-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru2-54e2fcb9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-ljspeech-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt408-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt138-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt624-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt396-54e2fcb9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt498-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt132-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt288-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt42-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt90-54e2fcb9.mp3\"]}}', 'Quá khứ của lie (nằm) là lay, phân từ hai là lain. Rất dễ nhầm với lay (đặt, để).', 'health', 1, 2),
('4a4b63c8-2a74-599e-8e85-90b99279e2a2', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'discussion', 'UK: /dɪˈskʌʃn/ | US: /dɪˈskʌʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cuộc thảo luận', 'a conversation in which people talk about a particular topic to exchange ideas.', 'We had a productive discussion about the budget.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một cuộc thảo luận hiệu quả về ngân sách.', '{\"en\": \"After a lengthy discussion, the committee unanimously approved the new marketing plan.\", \"vi\": \"Sau cuộc thảo luận kéo dài, ủy ban đã nhất trí thông qua kế hoạch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-ljspeech-c255751d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-cori-c255751d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/discussion-b55476ad.webp', '[\"debate\", \"dialogue\", \"consultation\", \"conversation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"panel discussion\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tọa đàm/thảo luận chuyên gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"open for discussion\", \"meaning\": \"sẵn sàng để thảo luận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under discussion\", \"meaning\": \"đang được đưa ra thảo luận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"discuss\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-cori-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru0-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru5-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru6-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru10-c255751d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru9-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru3-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru7-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru8-c255751