('99fb628a-f306-5b98-b618-f7734f44ceb1', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'rugby', '/ˈrʌɡbi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao bóng bầu dục.', 'A competitive outdoor game involving two teams carrying an egg-shaped ball across a goal line.', 'Many people in New Zealand are passionate about playing and watching rugby.', 'Nhiều người ở New Zealand rất đam mê chơi và xem bóng bầu dục.', '{\"en\": \"Our company sponsored the local rugby tournament to improve our brand image in the community.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã tài trợ giải đấu bóng bầu dục địa phương để cải thiện hình ảnh thương hiệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-ljspeech-68208df6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-cori-68208df6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rugby-4a0c25b0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play rugby\", \"meaning\": \"chơi bóng bầu dục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rugby match\", \"meaning\": \"trận đấu bóng bầu dục\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-cori-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-aru0-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-aru5-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-aru6-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-aru10-68208df6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-aru9-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-aru3-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-aru7-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-aru8-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-aru2-68208df6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-ljspeech-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-lt408-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-lt138-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-lt624-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-lt396-68208df6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-lt498-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-lt132-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-lt288-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-lt42-68208df6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rugby-lt90-68208df6.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là môn thể thao phổ biến ở Anh, Úc, New Zealand và Nam Phi.', 'other', 1, 4),
('d98c89ea-c16c-57c0-a6f4-137c46c9854a', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'glove', '/ɡlʌv/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Đồ che tay, có các ngón riêng biệt hoặc không.', 'a covering worn on the hand with separate sections for each finger.', 'He put on his winter gloves before going out in the snow.', 'Anh ấy đã đeo găng tay mùa đông trước khi ra ngoài tuyết.', '{\"en\": \"Workers in the factory must wear protective gloves when handling chemical materials.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân trong nhà máy phải đeo găng tay bảo hộ khi xử lý vật liệu hóa chất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-ljspeech-070a6b22.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-cori-070a6b22.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/glove-62c9497c.webp', '[\"mitt\", \"mitten\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rubber gloves\", \"meaning\": \"găng tay cao su\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wear gloves\", \"meaning\": \"đeo găng tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"protective gloves\", \"meaning\": \"găng tay bảo hộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mitten\", \"note_vi\": \"mitten không có ngón riêng biệt, glove có ngón riêng cho từng ngón tay.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-cori-070a6b22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-aru0-070a6b22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-aru5-070a6b22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-aru6-070a6b22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-aru10-070a6b22.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-aru9-070a6b22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-aru3-070a6b22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-aru7-070a6b22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-aru8-070a6b22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glove-aru2-070a6b22.mp3\"]}, 