('8946e32b-b829-51e6-b2d4-12425613e9f1', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'muscle', '/ˈmʌsl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'mô trong cơ thể giúp di chuyển; cơ bắp.', 'a piece of tissue inside the body that connects bones and produces movement.', 'The athlete pulled a muscle during the warm-up session before the race.', 'Vận động viên này đã bị căng cơ trong buổi khởi động trước cuộc đua.', '{\"en\": \"The gym membership includes free advice on how to build muscle effectively.\", \"vi\": \"Thẻ hội viên phòng tập bao gồm tư vấn miễn phí về cách xây dựng cơ bắp hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-ljspeech-4b696327.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-cori-4b696327.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/muscle-88fd451f.webp', '[\"brawn\", \"strength\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"muscle pain\", \"meaning\": \"đau cơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"muscle strain\", \"meaning\": \"căng cơ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mussel\", \"note_vi\": \"muscle là cơ bắp, mussel là con trai (hải sản) - phát âm giống nhau\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"muscular\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-cori-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-aru0-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-aru5-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-aru6-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-aru10-4b696327.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-aru9-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-aru3-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-aru7-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-aru8-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-aru2-4b696327.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-ljspeech-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-lt408-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-lt138-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-lt624-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-lt396-4b696327.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-lt498-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-lt132-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-lt288-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-lt42-4b696327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-lt90-4b696327.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần chú ý từ đồng âm \'mussel\' (con trai vỏ đen) dễ nhầm khi nghe TOEIC.', 'health', 1, 9),
('91584187-87ce-5c81-a70f-b9d5b0f96866', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'nor', '/nɔː(r)/', 'B1', 'conjunction', 'Cũng không (dùng với \"neither\").', 'used to introduce a second negative idea, often following a previous negative statement or word.', 'He neither called nor sent a message after the incident.', 'Anh ấy không gọi điện cũng không gửi tin nhắn sau sự việc đó.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier did not provide the invoice, nor did they send the shipping confirmation.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp đã không cung cấp hóa đơn, họ cũng không gửi xác nhận vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-ljspeech-19d0495c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-cori-19d0495c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nor-8c5af9d3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"neither... nor...\", \"meaning\": \"không... cũng không...\"}, {\"phrase\": \"not... nor...\", \"meaning\": \"không... cũng không...\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-cori-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-aru0-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-aru5-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-aru6-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-aru10-19d0495c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-aru9-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-aru3-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-aru7-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-aru8-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-aru2-19d0495c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-ljspeech-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-lt408-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-lt138-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-lt624-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-lt396-19d0495c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-lt498-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-lt132-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-lt288-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-lt42-19d0495c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nor-lt90-19d0495c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc neither... nor... dùng để phủ định cả hai đối tượng.', 'business', 1, 10),
