('730bc195-22b8-5d67-965e-5589e3525041', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'brave', '/breɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Gan dạ, không sợ hãi khi đối mặt với nguy hiểm hoặc khó khăn.', 'ready to face danger or difficult situations without showing fear.', 'It was very brave of her to speak up against injustice.', 'Cô ấy thật dũng cảm khi lên tiếng chống lại sự bất công.', '{\"en\": \"The brave employee decided to report the safety violations to the chief management officer.\", \"vi\": \"Người nhân viên dũng cảm đã quyết định báo cáo các vi phạm an toàn cho giám đốc quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-ljspeech-9fc1aa64.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-cori-9fc1aa64.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brave-b07b474d.webp', '[\"courageous\", \"fearless\", \"bold\"]', '[\"cowardly\", \"fearful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"brave decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định dũng cảm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brave act\", \"meaning\": \"hành động dũng cảm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"bravely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bravery\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-cori-9fc1aa64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-aru0-9fc1aa64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-aru5-9fc1aa64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-aru6-9fc1aa64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-aru10-9fc1aa64.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-aru9-9fc1aa64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-aru3-9fc1aa64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-aru7-9fc1aa64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-aru8-9fc1aa64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brave-aru2-9fc1aa64.mp3\"]}, \"us\": 