('5075454f-95b1-5798-8f7a-0806579667d1', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'share', '/ʃeə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một phần của cái gì đó được chia sẻ hoặc phân bổ.', 'An allocated percentage or piece of a total resource distributed to an individual.', 'Everyone received an equal share of the cake at the party.', 'Mọi người đều nhận được một phần bánh bằng nhau tại bữa tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"Each employee will receive a fair share of the annual profits based on performance.\", \"vi\": \"Mỗi nhân viên sẽ nhận được một phần lợi nhuận hàng năm công bằng dựa trên hiệu suất làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-ljspeech-aab90dfe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-cori-aab90dfe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/share-c80e40da.webp', '[\"portion\", \"part\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"market share\", \"meaning\": \"thị phần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fair share\", \"meaning\": \"phần công bằng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sharing\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shared\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-cori-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-aru0-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-aru5-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-aru6-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-aru10-aab90dfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-aru9-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-aru3-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-aru7-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-aru8-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-aru2-aab90dfe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-ljspeech-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-lt408-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-lt138-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-lt624-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-lt396-aab90dfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-lt498-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-lt132-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-lt288-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-lt42-aab90dfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/share-lt90-aab90dfe.mp3\"]}}', 'rất phổ biến trong cụm \'market share\' (thị phần) trong kinh doanh.', 'business', 1, 18),
('5b36e849-ff5d-577d-80c0-8a56c26f788d', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'coach', '/kəʊtʃ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người hướng dẫn, đào tạo một đội thể thao hoặc cá nhân.', 'a person who trains a person or team in a sport or activity.', 'Our basketball coach always encourages us to do our best.', 'Huấn luyện viên bóng rổ của chúng tôi luôn khuyến khích chúng tôi cố gắng hết sức.', '{\"en\": \"The executive hired a corporate coach to improve leadership skills.\", \"vi\": \"Vị giám đốc đã thuê một người huấn luyện doanh nghiệp để cải thiện kỹ năng lãnh đạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-ljspeech-c63c8ec7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-cori-c63c8ec7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coach-4354a99d.webp', '[\"trainer\", \"instructor\", \"tutor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"head coach\", \"meaning\": \"huấn luyện viên trưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"certified coach\", \"meaning\": \"huấn luyện viên được cấp chứng chỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"couch\", \"note_vi\": \"Couch là ghế sofa dài, khác với coach là người huấn luyện hoặc xe khách.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coach\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coaching\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-cori-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru0-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru5-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru6-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru10-c63c8ec7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru9-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru3-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru7-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru8-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru2-c63c8ec7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-ljspeech-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-lt408-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-lt138-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-lt624-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-lt396-c63c8ec7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-lt498-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-lt132-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-lt288-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-lt42-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-lt90-c63c8ec7.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở, \'coach\' còn chỉ người khai vấn hay huấn luyện kỹ năng.', 'hr', 1, 19),
('adbfbba3-797e-57d2-bddf-e4a969ff85a9', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'ensure', 'UK: /ɪnˈʃɔː/ | US: /ɪnˈʃʊr/', 'B1', 'verb', 'đảm bảo', 'To make certain that something will happen or that a particular situation will exist.', 'Please ensure all data is accurate before submission.', 'Vui lòng đảm bảo tất cả dữ liệu là chính xác trước khi nộp.', '{\"en\": \"Please check the financial report carefully to ensure that all numbers are completely accurate.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra kỹ báo cáo tài chính để đảm bảo rằng tất cả con số đều hoàn toàn chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-ljspeech-03503cd8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-cori-03503cd8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ensure-8a53bf66.webp', '[\"guarantee\", \"secure\", \"confirm\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ensure compliance\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo sự tuân thủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ensure safety\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ensure success\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo sự thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assure\", \"note_vi\": \"Assure phải đi với tân ngữ chỉ người (assure someone that...), còn ensure đi thẳng với mệnh đề hoặc danh từ.\"}, {\"word\": \"insure\", \"note_vi\": \"Insure liên quan đến dịch vụ bảo hiểm bồi thường tiền bạc.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-cori-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru0-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru5-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru6-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru10-03503cd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru9-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru3-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru7-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru8-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru2-03503cd8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-ljspeech-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt408-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt138-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt624-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt396-03503cd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt498-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt132-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt288-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt42-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt90-03503cd8.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng \'ensure that + mệnh đề\' hoặc \'ensure + danh từ\'. Phân biệt với assure (trấn an người khác) và insure (mua bảo hiểm).', 'office', 1, 20),
('ce00de45-1a60-5562-bf74-9a7a6260a5d9', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'written', '/ˈrɪtn/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Đã được viết ra, ở dạng văn bản.', 'recorded or expressed using letters or words on paper or a screen.', 'She submitted a written report to her manager about the project\'s progress.', 'Cô ấy đã nộp một báo cáo bằng văn bản cho quản lý về tiến độ dự án.', '{\"en\": \"All complaints must be submitted in written form to the customer service department.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả khiếu nại phải được nộp dưới dạng văn bản đến bộ phận dịch vụ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-ljspeech-6180960e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-cori-6180960e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/written-c47a8afa.webp', '[\"documented\", \"recorded\", \"formal\"]', '[\"verbal\", \"spoken\", \"oral\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"written agreement\", \"meaning\": \"thỏa thuận bằng văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"written notice\", \"meaning\": \"thông báo bằng văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"written confirmation\", \"meaning\": \"xác nhận bằng văn bản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"verbal\", \"note_vi\": \"written là bằng văn bản, verbal là bằng lời nói; hay nhầm trong hợp đồng, thỏa thuận\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"write\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"writer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"writing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-cori-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-aru0-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-aru5-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-aru6-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-aru10-6180960e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-aru9-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-aru3-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-aru7-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-aru8-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-aru2-6180960e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-ljspeech-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-lt408-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-lt138-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-lt624-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-lt396-6180960e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-lt498-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-lt132-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-lt288-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-lt42-6180960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/written-lt90-6180960e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'written notice/agreement\' xuất hiện nhiều trong phần đọc hợp đồng và thư từ.', 'office', 1, 21),
('f00db2f1-be75-56ef-932a-236d0ca558d0', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'flour', '/ˈflaʊə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'bột mịn làm từ ngũ cốc, dùng để làm bánh.', 'a soft white or brown powder made by crushing grain, used for baking bread and cakes.', 'To bake a cake, you\'ll need butter, sugar, eggs, and a cup of flour.', 'Để nướng bánh, bạn sẽ cần bơ, đường, trứng và một cốc bột mì.', '{\"en\": \"The bakery ordered fifty bags of wheat flour to prepare for the holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Tiệm bánh đã đặt năm mươi bao bột mì để chuẩn bị cho mùa lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-ljspeech-3bcfa747.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-cori-3bcfa747.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flour-f2728305.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wheat flour\", \"meaning\": \"bột mì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sift flour\", \"meaning\": \"rây bột\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whole wheat flour\", \"meaning\": \"bột mì nguyên cám\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flower\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm giống hệt flour nhưng flower có nghĩa là bông hoa.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-cori-3bcfa747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-aru0-3bcfa747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-aru5-3bcfa747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-aru6-3bcfa747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-aru10-3bcfa747.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-aru9-3bcfa747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-aru3-3bcfa747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-aru7-3bcfa747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-aru8-3bcfa747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flour-aru2-3bcfa747.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/