('8131a040-b8cb-58b1-bf7c-e81c7336025b', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'location', '/ləʊˈkeɪʃn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nơi chốn hoặc địa điểm cụ thể.', 'A particular spot, site, or geographical area where a building or event exists.', 'The new restaurant has a great location near the park.', 'Nhà hàng mới có một vị trí tuyệt vời gần công viên.', '{\"en\": \"The store manager selected a convenient location near the subway station to open the new branch.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cửa hàng đã chọn một địa điểm thuận tiện gần ga tàu điện ngầm để mở chi nhánh mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-ljspeech-6469ac84.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-cori-6469ac84.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/location-15ed47c7.webp', '[\"site\", \"place\", \"spot\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prime location\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí đắc địa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"convenient location\", \"meaning\": \"địa điểm thuận tiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"locale\", \"note_vi\": \"Locale chỉ bối cảnh địa lý rộng, location là vị trí cụ thể.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"locate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"located\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-cori-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru0-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru5-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru6-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru10-6469ac84.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru9-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru3-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru7-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru8-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru2-6469ac84.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-ljspeech-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt408-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt138-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt624-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt396-6469ac84.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt498-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt132-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt288-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt42-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt90-6469ac84.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất thường gặp trong bài thi TOEIC chủ đề chọn mặt bằng kinh doanh.', 'business', 1, 28),
('8d7be4fc-9eba-52f0-98a7-af1380d1b425', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '34f96a94-348f-5e9c-9747-0b266a07a3ee', '712c806e-fd54-56ed-8a38-73f36c9d5785', 'fairly', '/ˈfeəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách công bằng, không thiên vị.', 'in a way that is right and treats everyone in the same manner.', 'The teacher always treats her students fairly, without showing favoritism.', 'Giáo viên luôn đối xử công bằng với học sinh của mình, không thiên vị.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to distribute the workload fairly among all team members this month.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã quyết định phân chia khối lượng công việc một cách công bằng giữa tất cả các thành viên trong nhóm tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-ljspeech-e94221b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-cori-e94221b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fairly-0cdb93fb.webp', '[\"impartially\", \"equitably\"]', '[\"unfairly\", \"partially\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"treat someone fairly\", \"meaning\": \"đối xử công bằng với ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fairly distributed\", \"meaning\": \"được phân chia công bằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fare\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ chỉ giá vé tàu xe, không phải trạng từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fair\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fairness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-cori-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru0-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru5-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru6-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru10-e94221b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru9-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru3-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru7-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru8-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru2-e94221b1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-ljspeech-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-lt408-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-lt138-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-lt624-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-lt396-e94221b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-lt498-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-lt132-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-lt288-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-lt42-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-lt90-e94221b1.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'fare\' (giá vé). \'Fairly\' còn có nghĩa là \'khá\' (tương đương quite).', 'office', 1, 29),
('6e489d34-9aa6-577a-8066-b4ef4d6445b8', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '38f3981d-06d8-5b71-a5f5-5a88ebc64812', '834035b5-8a12-5da4-982c-0b957c478cb0', 'checklist', 'UK: /ˈtʃɛklɪst/ | US: /ˈtʃɛklɪst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'danh sách kiểm tra', 'a detailed list of tasks or items requiring completion, verification, or attention.', 'Please refer to the checklist for all required tasks.', 'Vui lòng tham khảo danh sách kiểm tra cho tất cả các nhiệm vụ cần thiết.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager created a safety checklist for the construction site.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý dự án đã tạo một danh sách kiểm tra an toàn cho công trường xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-ljspeech-ff744cd0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-cori-ff744cd0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/checklist-d78d2c86.webp', '[\"inventory list\", \"task list\", \"to-do list\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"safety checklist\", \"meaning\": \"danh sách kiểm tra an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pre-event checklist\", \"meaning\": \"danh sách kiểm tra trước sự kiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"complete the checklist\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn thành danh sách kiểm tra\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-cori-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-aru0-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-aru5-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-aru6-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-aru10-ff744cd0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-aru9-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-aru3-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-aru7-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-aru8-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-aru2-ff744cd0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-ljspeech-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-lt408-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-lt138-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-lt624-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-lt396-ff744cd0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-lt498-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-lt132-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-lt288-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-lt42-ff744cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checklist-lt90-ff744cd0.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ ghép viết liền, dùng để chỉ danh sách công việc cần tích vào khi hoàn thành.', 'management', 1, 0),
('d474a878-4e3f-5d6b-a7a7-5d4d034b209d', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '38f3981d-06d8-5b71-a5f5-5a88ebc64812', '834035b5-8a12-5da4-982c-0b957c478cb0', 'spring', '/sprɪŋ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'mùa đầu tiên trong năm, sau mùa đông.', 'the season between winter and summer when plants begin to grow.', 'Many flowers bloom in the spring, making the garden look very colorful.', 'Nhiều loài hoa nở vào mùa xuân, khiến khu vườn trông rất rực rỡ.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department will launch the new clothing line early next spring.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận tiếp thị sẽ ra mắt dòng thời trang mới vào đầu mùa xuân tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-ljspeech-24890213.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-cori-24890213.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spring-f0da336c.webp', NULL, '[\"autumn\", \"fall\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spring season\", \"meaning\": \"mùa xuân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"early spring\", \"meaning\": \"đầu mùa xuân\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"spring\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-cori-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-aru0-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-aru5-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-aru6-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-aru10-24890213.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-aru9-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-aru3-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-aru7-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-aru8-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-aru2-24890213.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-ljspeech-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-lt408-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-lt138-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-lt624-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-lt396-24890213.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-lt498-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-lt132-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-lt288-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-lt42-24890213.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-lt90-24890213.mp3\"]}}', 'Spring ngoài nghĩa mùa xuân còn có nghĩa là lò xo, suối nước, hoặc hành động nhảy lên.', 'daily', 1, 1),
('8a6d6900-ab35-5eef-b26d-a99121f17dce', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '38f3981d-06d8-5b71-a5f5-5a88ebc64812', '834035b5-8a12-5da4-982c-0b957c478cb0', 'balance', '/ˈbæləns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Trạng thái ổn định, hài hòa giữa các yếu tố.', 'a state where different things are equal or in correct proportions.', 'It\'s important to find a good balance between work and personal life.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải tìm được sự cân bằng tốt giữa công việc và cuộc sống cá nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The company strives to maintain a healthy balance between quality and production cost.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cố gắng duy trì sự cân bằng lành mạnh giữa chất lượng và chi phí sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-ljspeech-8dfa30e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-cori-8dfa30e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/balance-e8662418.webp', '[\"equilibrium\", \"harmony\", \"stability\"]', '[\"imbalance\", \"instability\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strike a balance\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được sự cân bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work-life balance\", \"meaning\": \"cân bằng công việc và cuộc sống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep balance\", \"meaning\": \"giữ cân bằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ballot\", \"note_vi\": \"ballot là lá phiếu bầu, khác với balance là sự cân bằng hoặc số dư.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"balance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"balanced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-cori-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru0-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru5-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru6-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru10-8dfa30e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru9-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru3-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru7-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru8-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru2-8dfa30e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-ljspeech-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt408-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt138-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt624-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt396-8dfa30e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt498-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt132-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt288-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt42-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt90-8dfa30e0.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngân hàng/tài chính, balance còn có nghĩa là số dư tài khoản.', 'business', 1, 2),
('979c24b4-f93d-5404-bac5-99da97921911', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '38f3981d-06d8-5b71-a5f5-5a88ebc64812', '834035b5-8a12-5da4-982c-0b957c478cb0', 'mystery', '/ˈmɪstri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Điều gì đó khó hiểu, không giải thích được hoặc chưa được biết đến.', 'An event or phenomenon that remains unexplained or impossible to comprehend fully.', 'The sudden disappearance of the ancient artifact remains a complete mystery.', 'Sự biến mất đột ngột của cổ vật vẫn là một bí ẩn hoàn toàn.', '{\"en\": \"The cause of the unexpected server failure last night remains a complete mystery.\", \"vi\": \"Nguyên nhân gây ra sự cố máy chủ đột ngột tối qua vẫn là một ẩn số hoàn toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-ljspeech-4dc232a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-cori-4dc232a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mystery-eb700d67.webp', '[\"puzzle\", \"secret\", \"enigma\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"solve a mystery\", \"meaning\": \"giải mã một bí ẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain a mystery\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn còn là bí ẩn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mysterious\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"mysteriously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-cori-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru0-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru5-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru6-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru10-4dc232a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru9-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru3-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru7-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru8-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/m