('780cdc50-5a8e-5897-8495-f2a4a46298ca', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '38f3981d-06d8-5b71-a5f5-5a88ebc64812', '834035b5-8a12-5da4-982c-0b957c478cb0', 'buyer', 'UK: /ˈbaɪə/ | US: /ˈbaɪər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'người mua', 'a person or entity that purchases goods, property, or services for a financial cost', 'We are actively looking for a buyer for our old office building.', 'Chúng tôi đang tích cực tìm kiếm người mua cho tòa nhà văn phòng cũ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The potential buyer requested a thorough property inspection before submitting a final offer.\", \"vi\": \"Người mua tiềm năng đã yêu cầu kiểm tra kỹ lưỡng bất động sản trước khi đưa ra lời đề nghị cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-ljspeech-9b165e49.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-cori-9b165e49.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/buyer-3e393c3c.webp', '[\"purchaser\", \"client\", \"customer\"]', '[\"seller\", \"vendor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prospective buyer\", \"meaning\": \"người mua tiềm năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"buyer\'s market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường có lợi cho người mua\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"buy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-cori-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-aru0-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-aru5-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-aru6-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-aru10-9b165e49.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-aru9-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-aru3-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-aru7-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-aru8-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-aru2-9b165e49.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-ljspeech-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-lt408-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-lt138-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-lt624-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-lt396-9b165e49.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-lt498-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-lt132-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-lt288-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-lt42-9b165e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buyer-lt90-9b165e49.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong thương mại, \'buyer\' đối lập với \'seller\' hoặc \'vendor\'. Thường gặp \'prospective buyer\' (người mua tiềm năng).', 'business', 1, 4),
('12dfb525-77a6-5279-95e4-8252cf9ceaef', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '38f3981d-06d8-5b71-a5f5-5a88ebc64812', '834035b5-8a12-5da4-982c-0b957c478cb0', 'end up', 'UK: /ˌend ˈʌp/ | US: /ˌend ˈʌp/', 'B1', 'v.phr', 'kết thúc ở đâu đó, cuối cùng trở nên', 'To eventually arrive at a particular situation, outcome, or location without necessarily planning to.', 'We might end up working overtime tonight.', 'Chúng ta có thể phải làm thêm giờ tối nay.', '{\"en\": \"If we do not adjust our budget now, we might end up exceeding our project expenditure.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu chúng ta không điều chỉnh ngân sách ngay bây giờ, rốt cuộc chúng ta có thể sẽ chi vượt quá mức cho phép của dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-ljspeech-8ab18c8f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-cori-8ab18c8f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/end-up-9aa88776.webp', '[\"wind up\", \"turn out\", \"finish up\"]', '[\"start out\", \"begin\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"end up doing something\", \"meaning\": \"rốt cuộc lại làm điều gì đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"end up with\", \"meaning\": \"cuối cùng nhận được/mang lại kết quả gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wind up\", \"note_vi\": \"\'wind up\' cũng có nghĩa tương tự \'end up\', nhưng đôi khi mang sắc thái kết thúc một công việc kinh doanh hay cuộc họp.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-cori-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-aru0-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-aru5-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-aru6-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-aru10-8ab18c8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-aru9-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-aru3-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-aru7-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-aru8-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-aru2-8ab18c8f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-ljspeech-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-lt408-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-lt138-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-lt624-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-lt396-8ab18c8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-lt498-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-lt132-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-lt288-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-lt42-8ab18c8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-up-lt90-8ab18c8f.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc hay gặp trong TOEIC: \'end up + V-ing\' (rốt cuộc lại làm gì) hoặc \'end up + prep phrase\' (rốt cuộc rơi vào tình trạng nào).', 'finance', 1, 5),
('2fc3147b-8d93-599b-9f4c-b0ecc159464e', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '38f3981d-06d8-5b71-a5f5-5a88ebc64812', '834035b5-8a12-5da4-982c-0b957c478cb0', 'disappointed', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy buồn hoặc không hài lòng vì điều gì đó không như mong đợi.', 'saddened or dissatisfied because expectations, hopes, or promises were not fulfilled.', 'She was deeply disappointed when she didn\'t get the job.', 'Cô ấy vô cùng thất vọng khi không nhận được công việc đó.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was disappointed that the sales team failed to meet the quarterly target goals.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảm thấy thất vọng vì đội ngũ kinh doanh đã không đạt được các mục tiêu doanh số hàng quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-ljspeech-74699616.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-cori-74699616.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disappointed-dae90b3b.webp', '[\"upset\", \"dissatisfied\"]', '[\"satisfied\", \"pleased\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deeply disappointed\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng thất vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bitterly disappointed\", \"meaning\": \"thất vọng cay đắng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disappoint\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disappointment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-cori-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru0-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru5-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru6-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru10-74699616.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru9-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru3-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru7-74699616.mp3\", \"/st