('c25ad4f6-63f9-5bfc-b61e-4e9cc6414f7d', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '38f3981d-06d8-5b71-a5f5-5a88ebc64812', '834035b5-8a12-5da4-982c-0b957c478cb0', 'alternative', '/ɔːlˈtɜːnətɪv/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một sự lựa chọn hoặc phương án khác.', 'a thing that you can choose to do or have out of two or more possibilities.', 'If this plan doesn\'t work, we need to consider an alternative.', 'Nếu kế hoạch này không hiệu quả, chúng ta cần xem xét một phương án thay thế khác.', '{\"en\": \"We must find a cheaper alternative to our current shipping provider to cut costs.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta phải tìm một phương án thay thế rẻ hơn cho nhà cung cấp dịch vụ vận chuyển hiện tại để cắt giảm chi phí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-ljspeech-816d63e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-cori-816d63e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/alternative-097d3c15.webp', '[\"option\", \"choice\", \"substitute\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"viable alternative\", \"meaning\": \"phương án thay thế khả thi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find an alternative\", \"meaning\": \"tìm phương án thay thế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"alternate\", \"note_vi\": \"alternate là luân phiên, xen kẽ; alternative là thay thế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"alternate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"alternatively\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"alternative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-cori-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-aru0-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-aru5-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-aru6-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-aru10-816d63e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-aru9-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-aru3-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-aru7-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-aru8-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-aru2-816d63e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-ljspeech-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-lt408-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-lt138-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-lt624-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-lt396-816d63e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-lt498-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-lt132-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-lt288-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-lt42-816d63e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-lt90-816d63e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Alternative vừa là danh từ (phương án thay thế) vừa là tính từ (mang tính thay thế).', 'business', 1, 22),
('a1ef5226-a7e7-50f6-996c-3744c02942dd', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '38f3981d-06d8-5b71-a5f5-5a88ebc64812', '834035b5-8a12-5da4-982c-0b957c478cb0', 'frequently', '/ˈfriːkwəntli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Một cách thường xuyên, lặp đi lặp lại.', 'many times or at short intervals, happening often in a regular way.', 'Trains to the downtown business district depart frequently during morning peak hours.', 'Các chuyến tàu đến khu kinh doanh trung tâm thành phố khởi hành thường xuyên trong các giờ cao điểm buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"Our maintenance team frequently inspects the factory machines to prevent unexpected breakdowns.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì của chúng tôi thường xuyên kiểm tra máy móc nhà máy để ngăn ngừa sự cố bất ngờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequently-ljspeech-da2f4ce9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequently-cori-da2f4ce9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/frequently-52f28499.webp', '[\"often\", \"regularly\", \"repeatedly\"]', '[\"rarely\", \"seldom\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"frequently asked questions\", \"meaning\": \"các câu hỏi thường gặp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"occur frequently\", \"meaning\": \"xảy ra thường xuyên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fluent\", \"note_vi\": \"fluent có nghĩa là trôi chảy (ngôn ngữ).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"frequency\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"frequent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequently-cori-da2f4ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequently-aru0-da2f4ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequently-aru5-da2f4ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequently-aru6-da2f4ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequently-aru10-da2f4ce9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequently-aru9-da2f4ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequently-aru3-da2f4