('c7f8025b-3d13-58b4-9a16-f697a2cbffb8', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '3c4e79fe-b3c9-54cd-a99b-6ee0226165be', 'feae27b9-d1e3-5f49-97e8-4ce3ed2333eb', 'careless', '/ˈkeələs/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Thiếu cẩn thận, không chú ý đến những gì mình đang làm.', 'not taking enough care or attention when doing something.', 'Leaving confidential documents on the desk was a careless action by the clerk.', 'Để các tài liệu bảo mật trên bàn làm việc là một hành động bất cẩn của nhân viên văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager warned that careless mistakes in financial reports could damage our reputation.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng cảnh báo rằng những sai sót bất cẩn trong báo cáo tài chính có thể làm tổn hại đến uy tín của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-ljspeech-eeaae8b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-cori-eeaae8b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/careless-fbaafad3.webp', '[\"negligent\", \"thoughtless\", \"irresponsible\"]', '[\"careful\", \"cautious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"careless mistake\", \"meaning\": \"sai lầm bất cẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"careless driver\", \"meaning\": \"tài xế cẩu thả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"carefree\", \"note_vi\": \"carefree nghĩa là vô tư, không lo nghĩ, mang nghĩa tích cực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"care\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"carelessly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"carelessness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-cori-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru0-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru5-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru6-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru10-eeaae8b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru9-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru3-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru7-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru8-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru2-eeaae8b6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-ljspeech-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-lt408-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-lt138-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-lt624-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-lt396-eeaae8b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-lt498-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-lt132-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-lt288-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-lt42-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-lt90-eeaae8b6.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi \'-less\' mang nghĩa phủ định (không cẩn thận).', 'office', 1, 16),
('e0741ad3-2e80-593f-b12e-23caf831db0d', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '3c4e79fe-b3c9-54cd-a99b-6ee0226165be', 'feae27b9-d1e3-5f49-97e8-4ce3ed2333eb', 'necessarily', '/ˌnesəˈserəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'nhất định phải như vậy; không thể tránh khỏi.', 'used to say that something is not always true or does not happen in every case.', 'Just because something is expensive doesn\'t necessarily mean it\'s better quality.', 'Chỉ vì một thứ gì đó đắt tiền không nhất thiết có nghĩa là nó chất lượng hơn.', '{\"en\": \"A higher price does not necessarily guarantee that the product will meet our quality standards.\", \"vi\": \"Giá cao hơn không nhất thiết đảm bảo rằng sản phẩm sẽ đáp ứng các tiêu chuẩn chất lượng của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-ljspeech-d8e5f74e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-cori-d8e5f74e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/necessarily-0313683a.webp', '[\"inevitably\", \"certainly\"]', '[\"possibly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"not necessarily true\", \"meaning\": \"không nhất thiết là đúng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"not necessarily mean\", \"meaning\": \"không nhất thiết có nghĩa là\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"necessary\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"necessity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-cori-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru0-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru5-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru6-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru10-d8e5f74e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru9-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru3-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru7-d8e5f74e.mp3\"