('33091e93-5d2d-5696-b8f0-3744b5110489', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '3c4e79fe-b3c9-54cd-a99b-6ee0226165be', 'feae27b9-d1e3-5f49-97e8-4ce3ed2333eb', 'grain', '/ɡreɪn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hạt của cây ngũ cốc hoặc một lượng rất nhỏ.', 'a seed or seeds from a plant, especially a grass, that is used for food.', 'Farmers grow various types of grain, such as wheat and rice.', 'Nông dân trồng nhiều loại hạt ngũ cốc khác nhau, như lúa mì và gạo.', '{\"en\": \"The agricultural company plans to export a large amount of grain to international markets next year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty nông nghiệp dự kiến xuất khẩu một lượng lớn ngũ cốc ra thị trường quốc tế vào năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-ljspeech-ee4dddc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-cori-ee4dddc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grain-59a805cb.webp', '[\"cereal\", \"seed\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"whole grain\", \"meaning\": \"ngũ cốc nguyên hạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a grain of truth\", \"meaning\": \"một chút sự thật\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-cori-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-aru0-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-aru5-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-aru6-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-aru10-ee4dddc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-aru9-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-aru3-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-aru7-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-aru8-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-aru2-ee4dddc7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-ljspeech-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-lt408-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-lt138-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-lt624-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-lt396-ee4dddc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-lt498-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-lt132-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-lt288-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-lt42-ee4dddc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grain-lt90-ee4dddc7.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa ngũ cốc, \'a grain of\' còn dùng để chỉ một lượng rất nhỏ.', 'manufacturing', 1, 22),
('97474498-92de-5c1c-9bda-a1841c92c50e', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '3c4e79fe-b3c9-54cd-a99b-6ee0226165be', 'feae27b9-d1e3-5f49-97e8-4ce3ed2333eb', 'growth', '/ɡrəʊθ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự tăng trưởng, phát triển về kích thước, số lượng hoặc cường độ.', 'the process of increasing in size, number, value, or strength over a period of time.', 'The company has shown significant growth in sales over the last year.', 'Công ty đã cho thấy sự tăng trưởng đáng kể về doanh số trong năm qua.', '{\"en\": \"The company expects significant growth in annual revenue due to the launch of new products.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty kỳ vọng sự tăng trưởng đáng kể về doanh thu hàng năm nhờ việc ra mắt các sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-ljspeech-34a79622.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-cori-34a79622.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/growth-ac9eca8a.webp', '[\"increase\", \"expansion\"]', '[\"decline\", \"decrease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"economic growth\", \"meaning\": \"tăng trưởng kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rapid growth\", \"meaning\": \"tăng trưởng nhanh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"grow\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-cori-34a79622.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-aru0-34a79622.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-aru5-34a79622.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-aru6-34a79622.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-aru10-34a79622.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-aru9-34a79622.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-aru3-34a79622.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-aru7-34a79622.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-aru8-34a79622.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/growth-aru2-34a79622.mp3\"]}, \