('127dbe0c-2d33-54f9-8f39-96a790af523d', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '447ded16-011c-55a0-ba6a-e416e06f015f', 'f3fbaf4b-55eb-5303-9a41-4e17ea8b2dc9', 'spending', '/ˈspendɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Số tiền được chi ra.', 'the amount of money that a person, organization, or government uses for various purposes.', 'The government announced new measures to control public spending.', 'Chính phủ công bố các biện pháp mới để kiểm soát chi tiêu công.', '{\"en\": \"The manager reviewed the monthly spending report to identify ways to cut unnecessary costs.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã xem xét báo cáo chi tiêu hàng tháng để xác định cách cắt giảm chi phí không cần thiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-ljspeech-57bac4f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-cori-57bac4f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spending-79f5ab23.webp', '[\"expenditure\", \"outlay\"]', '[\"saving\", \"income\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"public spending\", \"meaning\": \"chi tiêu công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cut spending\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm chi tiêu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expense\", \"note_vi\": \"Expense là khoản chi phí, spending là hành động/tổng chi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"spend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-cori-57bac4f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-aru0-57bac4f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-aru5-57bac4f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-aru6-57bac4f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-aru10-57bac4f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-aru9-57bac4f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-aru3-57bac4f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-aru7-57bac4f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spending-aru8-57bac4f7.mp3\