('cb09bbdb-cd45-5509-a5d2-ac383c827689', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '447ded16-011c-55a0-ba6a-e416e06f015f', 'f3fbaf4b-55eb-5303-9a41-4e17ea8b2dc9', 'plot', '/plɒt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cốt truyện, diễn biến chính của một câu chuyện.', 'the series of events that form the main story of a book, film, or play.', 'The plot of the movie was so engaging that I couldn\'t stop watching.', 'Cốt truyện của bộ phim hấp dẫn đến nỗi tôi không thể ngừng xem.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team discussed the plot of their new advertisement campaign to attract more clients.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã thảo luận về cốt truyện của chiến dịch quảng cáo mới để thu hút thêm khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-ljspeech-0fee558e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-cori-0fee558e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plot-ca80181f.webp', '[\"storyline\", \"narrative\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"follow the plot\", \"meaning\": \"theo dõi cốt truyện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"complex plot\", \"meaning\": \"cốt truyện phức tạp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"plot\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-cori-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-aru0-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-aru5-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-aru6-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-aru10-0fee558e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-aru9-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-aru3-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-aru7-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-aru8-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-aru2-0fee558e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-ljspeech-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-lt408-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-lt138-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-lt624-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-lt396-0fee558e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-lt498-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-lt132-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-lt288-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-lt42-0fee558e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plot-lt90-0fee558e.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng ẩn dụ trong marketing để chỉ kịch bản của một chiến dịch quảng cáo.', 'marketing', 1, 23),
('e64e6a4a-5e38-55c3-9cc1-b7db5be520db', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '447ded16-011c-55a0-ba6a-e416e06f015f', 'f3fbaf4b-55eb-5303-9a41-4e17ea8b2dc9', 'click', '/klɪk/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Nhấn một nút trên chuột máy tính hoặc một biểu tượng điện tử.', 'to press a button on a computer device to select something on the screen.', 'To open the document, you just need to click on the file icon.', 'Để mở tài liệu, bạn chỉ cần nhấp vào biểu tượng tệp.', '{\"en\": \"Please click the submit button after you have finished filling out the online application.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nhấn nút gửi sau khi bạn đã điền xong đơn đăng ký trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-ljspeech-b93ec566.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-cori-b93ec566.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/click-e55916ab.webp', '[\"press\", \"select\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"click on\", \"meaning\": \"nhấn vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"double click\", \"meaning\": \"nhấn đúp\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-cori-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-aru0-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-aru5-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-aru6-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-aru10-b93ec566.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-aru9-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-aru3-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-aru7-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-aru8-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-aru2-b93ec566.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-ljspeech-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-lt408-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-lt138-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-lt624-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-lt396-b93ec566.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-lt498-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-lt132-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-lt288-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-lt42-b93ec566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/click-lt90-b93ec566.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng với giới từ \'on\' khi nói về việc chọn một liên kết.', 'technology', 1, 24),
('ee071233-3c81-5f5b-bb86-92b2e8f58587', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '447ded16-011c-55a0-ba6a-e416e06f015f', 'f3fbaf4b-55eb-5303-9a41-4e17ea8b2dc9', 'expedition', '/ˌekspəˈdɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một chuyến đi có tổ chức, thường là để khám phá hoặc nghiên cứu.', 'a long journey organized for a special purpose like exploring or studying a new place.', 'The scientific expedition to the Amazon rainforest discovered several new species.', 'Cuộc thám hiểm khoa học đến rừng nhiệt đới Amazon đã phát hiện ra một số loài mới.', '{\"en\": \"The research team is planning an expedition to study the impact of climate on agriculture.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đang lên kế hoạch cho một chuyến thám hiểm để nghiên cứu tác động của khí hậu lên nông nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-ljspeech-843e93f6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-cori-843e93f6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expedition-db69857e.webp', '[\"journey\", \"voyage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"scientific expedition\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến thám hiểm khoa học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lead an expedition\", \"meaning\": \"dẫn đầu đoàn thám hiểm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"excursion\", \"note_vi\": \"Excursion là chuyến đi ngắn, expedition là chuyến đi dài, quy mô.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"expedite\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-cori-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-aru0-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-aru5-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-aru6-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-aru10-843e93f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-aru9-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-aru3-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-aru7-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-aru8-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-aru2-843e93f6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-ljspeech-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-lt408-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-lt138-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-lt624-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-lt396-843e93f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-lt498-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-lt132-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-lt288-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-lt42-843e93f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedition-lt90-843e93f6.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'expedite\' (xúc tiến, làm nhanh).', 'academic', 1, 25),
('55f7d687-b054-54e3-a231-09aad84e9ba6', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '447ded16-011c-55a0-ba6a-e416e06f015f', 'f3fbaf4b-55eb-5303-9a41-4e17ea8b2dc9', 'seriously', '/ˈsɪəriəsli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách cẩn thận, không đùa cợt, hoặc ở mức độ cao.', 'in a bad or dangerous way, or in a way that shows you are not joking.', 'You should seriously consider his offer; it\'s a great opportunity.', 'Bạn nên nghiêm túc cân nhắc lời đề nghị của anh ấy; đó là một cơ hội tuyệt vời.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors is seriously considering opening a new branch in Tokyo next year.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đang nghiêm túc xem xét việc mở một chi nhánh mới tại Tokyo vào năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-ljspeech-4cd8c6ee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-cori-4cd8c6ee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seriously-8224db72.webp', '[\"gravely\", \"severely\", \"earnestly\"]', '[\"lightly\", \"casually\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take something seriously\", \"meaning\": \"coi trọng việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seriously injured\", \"meaning\": \"bị thương nặng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"serious\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"seriousness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-cori-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-aru0-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-aru5-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-aru6-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-aru10-4cd8c6ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-aru9-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-aru3-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-aru7-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-aru8-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-aru2-4cd8c6ee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-ljspeech-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-lt408-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-lt138-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-lt624-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-lt396-4cd8c6ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-lt498-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-lt132-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-lt288-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-lt42-4cd8c6ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seriously-lt90-4cd8c6ee.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để nhấn mạnh mức độ nghiêm trọng của vấn đề hoặc sự tập trung.', 'business', 1, 26),
('255c0cc4-487c-5191-9231-8581db676aa5', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '447ded16-011c-55a0-ba6a-e416e06f015f', 'f3fbaf4b-55eb-5303-9a41-4e17ea8b2dc9', 'bother', '/ˈbɒðə(r)/', 'B1', 'verb', 'làm phiền, quấy rầy ai đó; bận tâm.', 'to make someone feel worried, upset, or annoyed, or to spend time doing something.', 'Please don\'t bother me while I\'m working.', 'Xin đừng làm phiền tôi khi tôi đang làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"Please do not bother the manager while she is conducting the annual performance reviews.\", \"vi\": \"Xin vui lòng không làm phiền quản lý khi cô ấy đang tiến hành đánh giá hiệu suất hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-ljspeech-ddb1e7c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-cori-ddb1e7c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bother-c4de6cd3.webp', '[\"annoy\", \"disturb\", \"trouble\"]', '[\"soothe\", \"please\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bother to do something\", \"meaning\": \"bận tâm làm việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sorry to bother you\", \"meaning\": \"xin lỗi vì đã làm phiền bạn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"brother\", \"note_vi\": \"brother là anh em trai, chỉ khác nhau một chữ r.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bother\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bothersome\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-cori-ddb1e7c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-aru0-ddb1e7c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-aru5-ddb1e7c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-aru6-ddb1e7c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-aru10-ddb1e7c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-aru9-ddb1e7c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-aru3-ddb1e7c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-aru7-ddb1e7c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bother-aru8-ddb1e