('a69e115c-0efb-5cc9-a304-e1d2c7959820', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '45a1ac90-f2e0-5799-b1a8-6f39a9615e26', '29d0e3f9-da6e-5f4f-aae6-9091dd3cc074', 'coal', '/kəʊl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loại nhiên liệu hóa thạch rắn, màu đen, dùng để đốt.', 'A dark fossil fuel extracted from the earth, mainly utilized to generate thermal power.', 'Many power plants still rely on burning coal to generate electricity.', 'Nhiều nhà máy điện vẫn phụ thuộc vào việc đốt than để tạo ra điện.', '{\"en\": \"The manufacturing facility decided to reduce its reliance on burning coal for energy.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ sở sản xuất đã quyết định giảm sự phụ thuộc vào việc đốt than để lấy năng lượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-ljspeech-4a31e8e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-cori-4a31e8e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coal-e9f6e096.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coal mine\", \"meaning\": \"mỏ than\"}, {\"phrase\": \"burn coal\", \"meaning\": \"đốt than\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-cori-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-aru0-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-aru5-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-aru6-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-aru10-4a31e8e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-aru9-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-aru3-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-aru7-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-aru8-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-aru2-4a31e8e8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-ljspeech-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coal-lt408-4a31e8e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v