('3aacb89f-ae26-598b-9eb1-87b62011e980', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '45a1ac90-f2e0-5799-b1a8-6f39a9615e26', '29d0e3f9-da6e-5f4f-aae6-9091dd3cc074', 'security', '/sɪˈkjʊərəti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự an toàn, bảo vệ khỏi nguy hiểm hoặc mất mát.', 'protection of a person, building, or country against danger, damage, or crime.', 'The office building installed a new security system to prevent unauthorized visitors from entering.', 'Tòa nhà văn phòng đã lắp đặt hệ thống an ninh mới để ngăn chặn khách không có thẩm quyền truy cập.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a new security firm to monitor the office building at night.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một công ty bảo vệ mới để giám sát tòa nhà văn phòng vào ban đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/security-ljspeech-8eec7bc4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/security-cori-8eec7bc4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/security-454295b7.webp', '[\"safety\", \"protection\", \"defense\"]', '[\"danger\", \"insecurity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"security guard\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên bảo vệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"security system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống an ninh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"national security\", \"meaning\": \"an ninh quốc gia\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"secure\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"secure\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"securely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/security-cori-8eec7bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/security-aru0-8eec7bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/security-aru5-8eec7bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/security-aru6-8eec7bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/security-aru10-8eec7bc4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/security-aru9-8eec7bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/security-aru3-8eec7bc4.mp3\", \"/st