('b7d1f31c-9ec7-5214-b31c-6790528c0589', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '46623662-7712-5f0d-82c9-92b5751d989e', 'af10bcb0-1ce5-5cee-b152-4705b4421372', 'spicy', '/ˈspaɪsi/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có vị cay nồng, thường do ớt hoặc gia vị.', 'having a strong hot taste from pepper or spices.', 'Be careful, this curry is very spicy, so you might want to add less chili.', 'Hãy cẩn thận, món cà ri này rất cay, nên bạn có thể muốn cho ít ớt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant offers a spicy chicken dish that is popular with foreign guests.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng phục vụ món gà cay được khách nước ngoài ưa chuộng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-ljspeech-680c1e02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-cori-680c1e02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spicy-8efeb381.webp', '[\"hot\", \"fiery\"]', '[\"bland\", \"mild\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spicy food\", \"meaning\": \"đồ ăn cay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spicy sauce\", \"meaning\": \"nước sốt cay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spiky\", \"note_vi\": \"spiky nghĩa là nhọn, không phải cay\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spice\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spiciness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-cori-680c1e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-aru0-680c1e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-aru5-680c1e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-aru6-680c1e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-aru10-680c1e02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-aru9-680c1e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-aru3-680c1e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-aru7-680c1e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-aru8-680c1e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spicy-aru2-680c1e02.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/