('0d9ca3cc-c9e4-55f4-91bd-b68178745123', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '4949f93f-52d4-5176-ba7c-af70f377204c', 'af935662-d356-59d7-9198-3e6f19f5a668', 'economy', '/ɪˈkɒnəmi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hệ thống sản xuất, phân phối và tiêu thụ của một quốc gia.', 'the system of trade and industry by which wealth is created and used.', 'The government is working to boost the national economy.', 'Chính phủ đang nỗ lực thúc đẩy nền kinh tế quốc gia.', '{\"en\": \"The rapid growth of the local economy attracted many foreign investors.\", \"vi\": \"Sự tăng trưởng nhanh chóng của nền kinh tế địa phương đã thu hút nhiều nhà đầu tư nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-ljspeech-8ec4382b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-cori-8ec4382b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/economy-24b1536a.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"global economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế toàn cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"boost the economy\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy nền kinh tế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"economic\", \"note_vi\": \"Economic (thuộc kinh tế), economical (tiết kiệm).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"economic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"economical\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"economize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-cori-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru0-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru5-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru6-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru10-8ec4382b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru9-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru3-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru7-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru8-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru2-8ec4382b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-ljspeech-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt408-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt138-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt624-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt396-8ec4382b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt498-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt132-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt288-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt42-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt90-8ec4382b.mp3\"]}}', 'Học thêm tính từ từ word family: economic (thuộc kinh tế), economical (tiết kiệm).', 'finance', 1, 2),
('7ef4f7f0-ab0a-525f-8e4b-1b42214b78df', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '4949f93f-52d4-5176-ba7c-af70f377204c', 'af935662-d356-59d7-9198-3e6f19f5a668', 'pipe', '/paɪp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Ống dẫn chất lỏng hoặc khí.', 'a long tube through which liquid or gas can flow from one place to another.', 'The plumber fixed the leaky water pipe in the kitchen.', 'Người thợ sửa ống nước đã sửa chiếc ống nước bị rò rỉ trong bếp.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew replaced the damaged water pipe in the office basement yesterday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã thay thế ống nước bị hỏng dưới tầng hầm văn phòng vào sáng qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-ljspeech-aaa83eac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-cori-aaa83eac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pipe-8635e1ee.webp', '[\"tube\", \"conduit\", \"hose\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"water pipe\", \"meaning\": \"ống nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gas pipe\", \"meaning\": \"ống dẫn ga\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tube\", \"note_vi\": \"tube là ống nói chung, pipe thường là ống kim loại/nhựa cứng dẫn chất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"piping\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pipe\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-cori-aaa83eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-aru0-aaa83eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-aru5-aaa83eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-aru6-aaa83eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-aru10-aaa83eac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-aru9-aaa83eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-aru3-aaa83eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-aru7-aaa83eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-aru8-aaa83eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pipe-aru2-aaa83eac.mp3\"]}, \"us\"