('e28ff159-b0ab-5a38-8477-e3da5d7ae2c7', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '4949f93f-52d4-5176-ba7c-af70f377204c', 'af935662-d356-59d7-9198-3e6f19f5a668', 'care', 'UK: /keər/ | US: /kɛr/', 'B1', 'verb', 'quan tâm, để ý', 'to feel interest in or concern for someone or something', 'Do you care about the company\'s reputation?', 'Bạn có quan tâm đến danh tiếng của công ty không?', '{\"en\": \"Our customer support team cares deeply about resolving client inquiries in a timely manner.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ hỗ trợ khách hàng của chúng tôi rất quan tâm đến việc giải quyết các thắc mắc của khách hàng một cách kịp thời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-ljspeech-ec1deb95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-cori-ec1deb95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/care-153362b4.webp', '[\"mind\", \"worry\", \"attend\", \"regard\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"care about\", \"meaning\": \"quan tâm đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"care for\", \"meaning\": \"chăm sóc / muốn (dùng trong câu hỏi lịch sự)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cure\", \"note_vi\": \"Cure có nghĩa là chữa trị bệnh, khác với care là quan tâm/chăm sóc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"care\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"careful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"careless\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"carefully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-cori-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru0-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru5-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru6-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru10-ec1deb95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru9-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru3-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru7-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru8-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-aru2-ec1deb95.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-ljspeech-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-lt408-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-lt138-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-lt624-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-lt396-ec1deb95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-lt498-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-lt132-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-lt288-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-lt42-ec1deb95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/care-lt90-ec1deb95.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'care about\' (quan tâm, coi trọng điều gì) và \'care for\' (chăm sóc ai hoặc muốn dùng cái gì trong câu lịch sự).', 'customer service', 1, 17),
('68d00173-fd42-5d3d-858a-681eac020500', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '4949f93f-52d4-5176-ba7c-af70f377204c', 'af935662-d356-59d7-9198-3e6f19f5a668', 'elsewhere', 'UK: /ˈelsweər/ | US: /ˈelsweər/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'nơi khác', 'In, at, or to some other place or location besides the current one.', 'We looked for the book, but couldn\'t find it elsewhere.', 'Chúng tôi đã tìm cuốn sách, nhưng không thể tìm thấy nó ở nơi khác.', '{\"en\": \"If the required items are out of stock here, we can check if they are available elsewhere.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu các mặt hàng cần thiết hết hàng ở đây, chúng tôi có thể kiểm tra xem chúng có sẵn ở nơi khác không.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-ljspeech-8baf1a85.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-cori-8baf1a85.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elsewhere-1782586d.webp', '[\"somewhere else\", \"in another place\"]', '[\"here\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look elsewhere\", \"meaning\": \"tìm kiếm ở nơi khác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"available elsewhere\", \"meaning\": \"có sẵn ở nơi khác\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-cori-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru0-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru5-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru6-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru10-8baf1a85.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru9-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru3-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru7-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru8-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru2-8baf1a85.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-ljspeech-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt408-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt138-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt624-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt396-8baf1a85.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt498-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt132-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt288-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt42-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt90-8baf1a85.mp3\"]}}', 'Là trạng từ chỉ vị trí, thường đứng ở cuối câu hoặc sau động từ (look elsewhere, available elsewhere).', 'shopping', 1, 18),
('5628807e-49b9-587c-9ee5-9ddf329f0fe7', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '4949f93f-52d4-5176-ba7c-af70f377204c', 'af935662-d356-59d7-9198-3e6f19f5a668', 'claim', '/kleɪm/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Khẳng định một điều gì đó là sự thật, thường không có bằng chứng rõ ràng.', 'to say that something is true, although you cannot prove it.', 'She claims to have seen a UFO, but no one really believes her.', 'Cô ấy khẳng định đã nhìn thấy một UFO, nhưng không ai thực sự tin cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"Customers can claim a full refund if the product does not meet expectations.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể yêu cầu hoàn tiền đầy đủ nếu sản phẩm không đáp ứng mong đợi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-ljspeech-013872e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-cori-013872e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/claim-6061e0d8.webp', '[\"assert\", \"demand\", \"request\"]', '[\"deny\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"claim a refund\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu hoàn tiền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"claim compensation\", \"meaning\": \"đòi bồi thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exclaim\", \"note_vi\": \"thốt lên, la lên vì ngạc nhiên\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"claim\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"claimant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-cori-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru0-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru5-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru6-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru10-013872e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru9-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru3-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru7-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru8-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr