('59104ff8-c524-5185-a2ab-4b63a5621cf9', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '4949f93f-52d4-5176-ba7c-af70f377204c', 'af935662-d356-59d7-9198-3e6f19f5a668', 'horror', '/ˈhɒrə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác sợ hãi tột độ, sự kinh hoàng.', 'a strong feeling of shock and fear that makes you feel very upset.', 'The news of the accident filled everyone with horror.', 'Tin tức về vụ tai nạn khiến mọi người kinh hoàng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager expressed his horror at the sudden drop in our quarterly sales figures.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý bày tỏ sự kinh hoàng trước sự sụt giảm đột ngột trong doanh số bán hàng hàng quý của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-ljspeech-bf7b06aa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-cori-bf7b06aa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/horror-5048c400.webp', '[\"terror\", \"fear\", \"panic\"]', '[\"delight\", \"joy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in horror\", \"meaning\": \"trong sự kinh hoàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"horror movie\", \"meaning\": \"phim kinh dị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"terror\", \"note_vi\": \"terror thường chỉ sự khiếp sợ do bạo lực, horror nghiêng về cảm giác ghê rợn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"horrify\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"horrible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-cori-bf7b06aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-aru0-bf7b06aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-aru5-bf7b06aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-aru6-bf7b06aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-aru10-bf7b06aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-aru9-bf7b06aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-aru3-bf7b06aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-aru7-bf7b06aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horror-aru8-bf7b