('eab4bc39-65fa-5dcf-972a-a0b397beb6d6', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '55787b4f-732a-50ea-9427-0a64d4080f05', '1323f490-cf13-543b-a8cf-e92fe1f09e93', 'shell', '/ʃel/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Lớp vỏ cứng bên ngoài bảo vệ động vật hoặc hạt.', 'the hard outer covering that protects certain animals, seeds, or eggs.', 'Children collected colorful sea shells along the shore yesterday morning.', 'Trẻ em đã thu gom những vỏ sò đầy màu sắc dọc theo bờ biển sáng qua.', '{\"en\": \"The seafood restaurant serves fresh oysters in their original hard shell.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng hải sản phục vụ hàu tươi nguyên trong lớp vỏ cứng ban đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-ljspeech-ec122f54.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-cori-ec122f54.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shell-b17fcc15.webp', '[\"casing\", \"cover\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hard shell\", \"meaning\": \"lớp vỏ cứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sea shell\", \"meaning\": \"vỏ sò\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shelled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-cori-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru0-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru5-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru6-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru10-ec122f54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru9-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru3-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru7-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru8-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru2-ec122f54.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-ljspeech-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/she