('699d38f0-9529-5e5d-a3da-80587ea63c96', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '86dc5653-86a5-5ecb-80b4-ed6613e9ad02', 'd182e556-dd81-5805-b2ea-7f18f6059c83', 'since', '/sɪns/', 'A2', 'conjunction', 'Từ khi, kể từ lúc nào đó.', 'from a particular time in the past until a later time or now.', 'I haven\'t seen her since she moved to another city.', 'Tôi chưa gặp cô ấy kể từ khi cô ấy chuyển đến thành phố khác.', '{\"en\": \"Sales have increased significantly since the company launched its online marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số đã tăng đáng kể kể từ khi công ty ra mắt chiến dịch tiếp thị trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-ljspeech-2eb888e9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-cori-2eb888e9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/since-32e32a91.webp', '[\"because\", \"as\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ever since\", \"meaning\": \"kể từ đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"since then\", \"meaning\": \"từ lúc đó đến nay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"for\", \"note_vi\": \"Since đi với mốc thời gian, còn for đi với khoảng thời gian.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-cori-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru0-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru5-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru6-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru10-2eb888e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru9-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru3-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru7-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru8-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru2-2eb888e9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-ljspeech-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/stor