('383a2067-e0a1-5651-9997-b88630c571fb', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c0a9a80-25bb-5840-86e3-c82290eacf5d', '4dd37aac-0457-5bc2-8bd9-7111dd8903cc', 'reaction', '/riˈækʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc cảm xúc đáp lại một sự kiện hoặc tin tức.', 'a behavior or feeling that happens as a result of something that has occurred.', 'The public reaction to the corporate rebranding strategy was overwhelmingly positive.', 'Phản ứng của công chúng đối với chiến lược tái định vị thương hiệu của công ty là cực kỳ tích cực.', '{\"en\": \"The market reaction to the new product launch was very positive according to the report.\", \"vi\": \"Phản ứng của thị trường đối với việc ra mắt sản phẩm mới rất tích cực theo báo cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-ljspeech-a9043ffe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-cori-a9043ffe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reaction-3086f68c.webp', '[\"response\", \"reply\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chain reaction\", \"meaning\": \"phản ứng dây chuyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immediate reaction\", \"meaning\": \"phản ứng tức thì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"react\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reactive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-cori-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru0-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru5-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru6-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru10-a9043ffe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru9-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru3-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru7-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru8-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-aru2-a9043ffe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-ljspeech-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt408-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt138-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt624-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt396-a9043ffe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt498-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt132-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt288-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt42-a9043ffe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reaction-lt90-a9043ffe.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng trong bối cảnh phân tích thị trường hoặc phản hồi khách hàng.', 'marketing', 1, 15),
('a64a104a-9f4c-5e28-89b4-36fff6ffb085', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c0a9a80-25bb-5840-86e3-c82290eacf5d', '4dd37aac-0457-5bc2-8bd9-7111dd8903cc', 'closely', 'UK: /ˈkləʊsli/ | US: /ˈkloʊsli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'một cách chặt chẽ, sát sao', 'in a manner that involves direct contact, intense care, or careful attention to detail.', 'Our team works closely with clients to achieve goals.', 'Nhóm của chúng tôi làm việc chặt chẽ với khách hàng để đạt được mục tiêu.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team works closely with the design department to launch new campaigns.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi làm việc chặt chẽ với bộ phận thiết kế để khởi động các chiến dịch mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-ljspeech-be102793.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-cori-be102793.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/closely-59b4cde3.webp', '[\"tightly\", \"intimately\", \"carefully\", \"attentively\"]', '[\"loosely\", \"distantly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"work closely with\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc chặt chẽ với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"monitor closely\", \"meaning\": \"theo dõi sát sao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"resemble closely\", \"meaning\": \"rất giống với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"close\", \"note_vi\": \"close là tính từ (gần) hoặc động từ (đóng), còn closely chỉ đóng vai trò trạng từ (chặt chẽ, sát sao).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"close\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"closeness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-cori-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-aru0-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-aru5-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-aru6-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-aru10-be102793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-aru9-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-aru3-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-aru7-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-aru8-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-aru2-be102793.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-ljspeech-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-lt408-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-lt138-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-lt624-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-lt396-be102793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-lt498-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-lt132-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-lt288-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-lt42-be102793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closely-lt90-be102793.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm các động từ làm việc hoặc giám sát như \'work closely with\' (hợp tác chặt chẽ với) hoặc \'monitor closely\' (theo dõi sát sao).', 'office', 1, 16)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('fb49f341-d508-5853-a582-a680657ebbfe', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c0a9a80-25bb-5840-86e3-c82290eacf5d', '4dd37aac-0457-5bc2-8bd9-7111dd8903cc', 'address', 'UK: /əˈdres/ | US: /əˈdres/', 'B1', 'verb', 'diễn thuyết, nói chuyện trước công chúng', 'to speak formal words to a group of people assembled together', 'The CEO will address the employees at the annual meeting.', 'CEO sẽ phát biểu trước nhân viên tại cuộc họp thường niên.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker will address the audience at the start of tomorrow\'s session.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính sẽ phát biểu trước khán giả vào đầu phiên họp ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-ljspeech-c6621802.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-cori-c6621802.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/address-ac7693c9.webp', '[\"speak to\", \"lecture\", \"talk to\", \"greet\"]', '[\"ignore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"address an audience\", \"meaning\": \"diễn thuyết trước khán giả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"address a conference\", \"meaning\": \"phát biểu tại một hội nghị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"redress\", \"note_vi\": \"đền bù, uốn nắn, sửa sai\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"address\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"addressee\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-cori-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru0-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru5-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru6-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru10-c6621802.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru9-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru3-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru7-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru8-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru2-c6621802.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-ljspeech-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt408-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt138-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt624-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt396-c6621802.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt498-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt132-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt288-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt42-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt90-c6621802.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong bài thi TOEIC, \'address\' vừa có nghĩa là phát biểu/diễn thuyết, vừa có nghĩa là giải quyết (address a problem/issue).', 'office', 1, 17),
('7e17ca7a-4039-5c47-b10d-13b94af293ed', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c0a9a80-25bb-5840-86e3-c82290eacf5d', '4dd37aac-0457-5bc2-8bd9-7111dd8903cc', 'deliver', '/dɪˈlɪvə(r)/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Giao hàng, chuyển phát.', 'to take goods, letters, or packages to a specific person or place as requested.', 'The postman delivers letters and packages to our house every morning.', 'Người đưa thư giao thư và bưu kiện đến nhà chúng tôi mỗi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The courier company will deliver the urgent documents to our office by tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chuyển phát nhanh sẽ giao các tài liệu khẩn cấp đến văn phòng chúng ta vào sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-ljspeech-c3a71b15.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-cori-c3a71b15.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deliver-7b063808.webp', '[\"transport\", \"ship\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"deliver goods\", \"meaning\": \"giao hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deliver a speech\", \"meaning\": \"phát biểu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"delivery\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"deliverable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-cori-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-aru0-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-aru5-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-aru6-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-aru10-c3a71b15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-aru9-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-aru3-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-aru7-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-aru8-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-aru2-c3a71b15.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-ljspeech-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-lt408-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-lt138-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-lt624-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-lt396-c3a71b15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-lt498-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-lt132-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-lt288-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-lt42-c3a71b15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliver-lt90-c3a71b15.mp3\"]}}', 'Deliver a speech có nghĩa là phát biểu, không phải giao hàng.', 'business', 1, 18),
('f524d4ec-fcac-5278-9c71-ae6b017bbf5f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c0a9a80-25bb-5840-86e3-c82290eacf5d', '4dd37aac-0457-5bc2-8bd9-7111dd8903cc', 'escape', '/ɪˈskeɪp/', 'B1', 'verb', 'thoát khỏi một nơi hoặc tình huống nguy hiểm.', 'to get away from a dangerous, difficult, or unpleasant place or situation.', 'The prisoners tried to escape from the high-security jail last night.', 'Các tù nhân đã cố gắng trốn thoát khỏi nhà tù an ninh cao vào đêm qua.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must use the fire stairs to escape the building during an emergency.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải sử dụng cầu thang chữa cháy để thoát khỏi tòa nhà trong trường hợp khẩn cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-ljspeech-cdecabe1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-cori-cdecabe1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/escape-e1ec8474.webp', '[\"flee\", \"evade\", \"avoid\"]', '[\"capture\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"escape from\", \"meaning\": \"trốn thoát khỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"narrowly escape\", \"meaning\": \"suýt soát thoát khỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"escape injury\", \"meaning\": \"tránh bị thương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"avoid\", \"note_vi\": \"avoid là né tránh điều gì đó xảy ra, escape là thoát khỏi tình huống đang đối mặt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"escape\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"escapism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-cori-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-aru0-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-aru5-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-aru6-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-aru10-cdecabe1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-aru9-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-aru3-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-aru7-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-aru8-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-aru2-cdecabe1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-ljspeech-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-lt408-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-lt138-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-lt624-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-lt396-cdecabe1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-lt498-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-lt132-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-lt288-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-lt42-cdecabe1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/escape-lt90-cdecabe1.mp3\"]}}', 'Escape đi với giới từ \'from\' khi thoát khỏi một nơi chốn cụ thể.', 'office', 1, 19),
('eb31ad76-685c-52a2-ae8d-a72a8d939ca4', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c0a9a80-25bb-5840-86e3-c82290eacf5d', '4dd37aac-0457-5bc2-8bd9-7111dd8903cc', 'press', '/pres/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Dùng lực ấn xuống hoặc đè lên.', 'to push something firmly with your finger or hand to make it work or move.', 'You need to press the green key to activate the office printing machine.', 'Bạn cần nhấn phím màu xanh lá cây để kích hoạt máy in văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"Please press the green button on the printer to start copying the documents.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng ấn nút màu xanh trên máy in để bắt đầu sao chụp tài liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-ljspeech-cd09e18a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-cori-cd09e18a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/press-74080bd6.webp', '[\"push\", \"squeeze\"]', '[\"pull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"press a button\", \"meaning\": \"ấn nút\"}, {\"phrase\": \"press firmly\", \"meaning\": \"ấn mạnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compress\", \"note_vi\": \"ép hoặc nén nhỏ lại thay vì chỉ dùng tay ấn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pressure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-cori-cd09e18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-aru0-cd09e18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-aru5-cd09e18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-aru6-cd09e18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-aru10-cd09e18a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-aru9-cd09e18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-aru3-cd09e18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-aru7-cd09e18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-aru8-cd09e18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/press-aru2-cd09e18a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/