('3c44b7f0-cf99-583c-bb88-b0a42499eb35', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c7492b3-50bd-5a2e-9ad5-fefba637d495', '3e0c328a-72d7-57ff-9fb9-2f5fb5e4c96d', 'treatment', '/ˈtriːtmənt/', '', 'noun', 'Cách thức chữa bệnh hoặc đối xử với ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'the way of behaving towards someone or the process of providing medical care.', 'Patients who receive immediate treatment after an injury usually recover much faster.', 'Bệnh nhân nhận được sự điều trị ngay lập tức sau chấn thương thường hồi phục nhanh hơn nhiều.', '{\"en\": \"The company provides excellent medical treatment coverage as part of the employee benefits package.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp chế độ bảo hiểm y tế tuyệt vời như một phần của gói phúc lợi nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-ljspeech-532735d1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-cori-532735d1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/treatment-55eab34a.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-cori-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-aru0-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-aru5-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-aru6-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-aru10-532735d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-aru9-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-aru3-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-aru7-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-aru8-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-aru2-532735d1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-ljspeech-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-lt408-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-lt138-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-lt624-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-lt396-532735d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-lt498-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-lt132-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-lt288-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-lt42-532735d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/treatment-lt90-532735d1.mp3\"]}}', '', 'other', 1, 1),
('2acf341c-39ce-50a5-97d8-957c2956bd31', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c7492b3-50bd-5a2e-9ad5-fefba637d495', '3e0c328a-72d7-57ff-9fb9-2f5fb5e4c96d', 'qualification', '/ˌkwɒlɪfɪˈkeɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Bằng cấp, chứng chỉ hoặc kỹ năng cần thiết cho công việc.', 'an official record showing that you have finished a training course or have necessary skills.', 'Do you have the necessary qualifications for this management position?', 'Bạn có đủ các bằng cấp cần thiết cho vị trí quản lý này không?', '{\"en\": \"Please send your resume along with copies of your professional qualifications to the manager.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng gửi sơ yếu lý lịch cùng với bản sao các bằng cấp chuyên môn của bạn cho người quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-ljspeech-006442b3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-cori-006442b3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/qualification-1fd0e6f1.webp', '[\"credential\", \"certificate\", \"ability\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"academic qualifications\", \"meaning\": \"bằng cấp học thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"meet the qualifications\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng các tiêu chuẩn/yêu cầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"quality\", \"note_vi\": \"quality là chất lượng, qualification là bằng cấp hoặc năng lực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"qualify\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"qualified\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-cori-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru0-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru5-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru6-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru10-006442b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru9-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru3-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru7-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru8-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru2-006442b3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-ljspeech-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt408-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt138-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt624-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt396-006442b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt498-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt132-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt288-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt42-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt90-006442b3.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với quality (chất lượng). Qualification thường dùng ở số nhiều khi nói về hồ sơ xin việc.', 'hr', 1, 2),
('2c9f889a-64fa-54de-9cb4-a58aafea4ec7', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c7492b3-50bd-5a2e-9ad5-fefba637d495', '3e0c328a-72d7-57ff-9fb9-2f5fb5e4c96d', 'live', '/lɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Được phát sóng hoặc diễn ra ngay tại thời điểm hiện tại.', 'happening now and broadcast or performed for an audience at the same time.', 'The keynote speech will be streamed live across all major social media platforms.', 'Bài phát biểu chủ đề sẽ được phát trực tiếp trên tất cả các nền tảng mạng xã hội lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The company held a live webinar to demonstrate the new software features to global clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tổ chức một buổi hội thảo trực tuyến trực tiếp để trình diễn các tính năng phần mềm mới cho khách hàng toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-ljspeech-98aadb37.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-cori-98aadb37.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/live-1f222c26.webp', '[\"real-time\", \"current\"]', '[\"recorded\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"live broadcast\", \"meaning\": \"phát sóng trực tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"live performance\", \"meaning\": \"biểu diễn trực tiếp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"live\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-cori-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru0-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru5-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru6-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru10-98aadb37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru9-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru3-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru7-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru8-98aadb37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/live-aru2-98aadb37.mp3\"]