('661d684b-6c2b-57af-962e-4d958fb9837b', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c7492b3-50bd-5a2e-9ad5-fefba637d495', '3e0c328a-72d7-57ff-9fb9-2f5fb5e4c96d', 'sand', '/sænd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hạt khoáng nhỏ, mịn, thường thấy ở bãi biển hoặc sa mạc.', 'a substance consisting of very small grains of rock, found on beaches and deserts.', 'We built a big sandcastle on the beach during our vacation.', 'Chúng tôi đã xây một lâu đài cát lớn trên bãi biển trong kỳ nghỉ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The resort imported high-quality white sand to improve the appearance of its private beach.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng đã nhập khẩu cát trắng chất lượng cao để cải thiện diện mạo của bãi biển riêng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-ljspeech-42625bfe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-cori-42625bfe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sand-484efc99.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fine sand\", \"meaning\": \"cát mịn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grain of sand\", \"meaning\": \"hạt cát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sound\", \"note_vi\": \"sound là âm thanh, khác sand là cát.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sandy\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sand\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-cori-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-aru0-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-aru5-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-aru6-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-aru10-42625bfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-aru9-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-aru3-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-aru7-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-aru8-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-aru2-42625bfe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-ljspeech-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-lt408-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-lt138-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-lt624-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-lt396-42625bfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-lt498-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-lt132-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-lt288-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-lt42-42625bfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sand-lt90-42625bfe.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \'sound\' (âm thanh) hoặc \'send\' (gửi).', 'nature', 1, 4),
('823c9b08-dc46-50f8-9b43-d0d802667ce8', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c7492b3-50bd-5a2e-9ad5-fefba637d495', '3e0c328a-72d7-57ff-9fb9-2f5fb5e4c96d', 'rare', '/reə(r)/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không thường xuyên xảy ra hoặc không dễ tìm thấy.', 'not common or frequent, and therefore sometimes valuable or interesting.', 'Finding such dedicated employees with specialized skills is quite rare nowadays.', 'Tìm được những nhân viên tận tâm có kỹ năng chuyên môn như vậy là khá hiếm thời nay.', '{\"en\": \"It is rare for the company to offer such a large discount on new products.\", \"vi\": \"Rất hiếm khi công ty đưa ra mức giảm giá lớn như vậy cho các sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-ljspeech-d5e62fc1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-cori-d5e62fc1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rare-ed083847.webp', '[\"scarce\", \"uncommon\", \"unusual\"]', '[\"common\", \"frequent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rare opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội hiếm có\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rare species\", \"meaning\": \"loài quý hiếm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scarce\", \"note_vi\": \"scarce chỉ sự khan hiếm tạm thời do thiếu nguồn cung.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"rarely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rarity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-cori-d5e62fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-aru0-d5e62fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-aru5-d5e62fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-aru6-d5e62fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-aru10-d5e62fc1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-aru9-d5e62fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-aru3-d5e62fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-aru7-d5e62fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rare-aru8-d5e62fc1.