('56076e79-1ee6-5a84-ae47-77d5085cfa36', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c7492b3-50bd-5a2e-9ad5-fefba637d495', '3e0c328a-72d7-57ff-9fb9-2f5fb5e4c96d', 'communication', '/kəˌmjuːnɪˈkeɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự giao tiếp, trao đổi thông tin.', 'the process of sharing information with other people by speaking, writing, or using signals.', 'Good communication is essential for a healthy relationship.', 'Giao tiếp tốt là điều cần thiết cho một mối quan hệ lành mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"Effective communication between departments is essential for the successful completion of this marketing project.\", \"vi\": \"Giao tiếp hiệu quả giữa các phòng ban là điều cần thiết để hoàn thành thành công dự án tiếp thị này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-ljspeech-60c58ad2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-cori-60c58ad2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/communication-e7e8a5fc.webp', '[\"interaction\", \"contact\", \"connection\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"effective communication\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"communication skills\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ năng giao tiếp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"communicate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"communicative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-cori-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-aru0-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-aru5-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-aru6-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-aru10-60c58ad2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-aru9-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-aru3-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-aru7-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-aru8-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-aru2-60c58ad2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-ljspeech-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-lt408-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-lt138-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-lt624-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-lt396-60c58ad2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-lt498-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-lt132-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-lt288-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-lt42-60c58ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communication-lt90-60c58ad2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với tính từ \'effective\' (hiệu quả) trong môi trường công sở.', 'office', 1, 21),
('7e5aba48-d686-5295-bd71-1198a49f107b', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c7492b3-50bd-5a2e-9ad5-fefba637d495', '3e0c328a-72d7-57ff-9fb9-2f5fb5e4c96d', 'central', '/ˈsentrəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Ở giữa hoặc quan trọng nhất, đóng vai trò cốt lõi.', 'located in the middle or being the most important part of something.', 'The central market is usually the busiest part of the city.', 'Chợ trung tâm thường là nơi nhộn nhịp nhất của thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Improving customer service is a central goal for our department this year.\", \"vi\": \"Cải thiện dịch vụ khách hàng là mục tiêu cốt lõi của bộ phận chúng tôi trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/central-ljspeech-233ec5bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/central-cori-233ec5bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/central-93ce71ed.webp', '[\"core\", \"pivotal\", \"key\"]', '[\"peripheral\", \"marginal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"central location\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí trung tâm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"central role\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò cốt lõi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"central theme\", \"meaning\": \"chủ đề trung tâm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"centered\", \"note_vi\": \"centered là được đặt ở giữa, central là thuộc trung tâm/cốt lõi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"center\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"center\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"centrally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/central-cori-233ec5bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/central-aru0-233ec5bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/central-aru5-233ec5bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/central-aru6-233ec5bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/central-aru10-233ec5bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/central-aru9-233ec5bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/central-aru3-233ec5bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v