('15e7cc0f-4b74-507e-8981-50ceb3e3cc5f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '8c7492b3-50bd-5a2e-9ad5-fefba637d495', '3e0c328a-72d7-57ff-9fb9-2f5fb5e4c96d', 'exchange', '/ɪksˈtʃeɪndʒ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự trao đổi qua lại giữa hai hoặc nhiều thứ.', 'the act of giving something to someone and receiving something different in return from them.', 'We had a brief exchange of ideas about the new project.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một cuộc trao đổi ý kiến ngắn gọn về dự án mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company arranged an exchange of documents between the two international partners during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã sắp xếp việc trao đổi tài liệu giữa hai đối tác quốc tế trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-ljspeech-a3497f3e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-cori-a3497f3e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exchange-f3365d35.webp', '[\"swap\", \"trade\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"in exchange for\", \"meaning\": \"để đổi lấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cultural exchange\", \"meaning\": \"trao đổi văn hóa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"change\", \"note_vi\": \"change là thay đổi, exchange là đổi cái này lấy cái kia.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exchange\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-cori-a3497f3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-aru0-a3497f3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-aru5-a3497f3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-aru6-a3497f3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-aru10-a3497f3e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-aru9-a3497f3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-aru3-a3497f3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-aru7-a3497f3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exchange-aru8-a3497f3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v