('c2855f19-002f-536b-9da2-60c86eba3d94', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'spot', '/spɒt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một vết nhỏ, tròn hoặc một vị trí cụ thể.', 'a particular place or a small round area on a surface of something.', 'I noticed a small red spot on my shirt after painting.', 'Tôi nhận thấy một đốm đỏ nhỏ trên áo sơ mi của mình sau khi sơn.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance worker marked the exact spot where the water pipe was leaking.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã đánh dấu đúng vị trí nơi ống nước bị rò rỉ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-ljspeech-9f4b5271.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-cori-9f4b5271.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spot-4892ae7b.webp', '[\"location\", \"place\", \"mark\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"parking spot\", \"meaning\": \"chỗ đậu xe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on the spot\", \"meaning\": \"ngay tại chỗ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"spotted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-cori-9f4b5271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-aru0-9f4b5271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-aru5-9f4b5271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-aru6-9f4b5271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-aru10-9f4b5271.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-aru9-9f4b5271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-aru3-9f4b5271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-aru7-9f4b5271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-aru8-9f4b5271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-aru2-9f4b5271.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-ljspeech-9f4b5271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spot-lt408-9f4b5271.mp3\"