('5b941493-038d-5028-9c16-de9e80220a16', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'application', '/ˌæplɪˈkeɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một văn bản chính thức để yêu cầu một công việc, vị trí, hoặc dịch vụ.', 'an official written request for something, such as a job or admission.', 'Her application for the scholarship was accepted, which made her very happy.', 'Đơn xin học bổng của cô ấy đã được chấp nhận, điều đó làm cô ấy rất vui.', '{\"en\": \"Please submit your job application to the human resources department by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nộp đơn xin việc của bạn cho phòng nhân sự trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-ljspeech-d2005cc2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-cori-d2005cc2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/application-c1cab2a9.webp', '[\"request\", \"petition\", \"appeal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"submit an application\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn xin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"job application\", \"meaning\": \"đơn xin việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"application form\", \"meaning\": \"mẫu đơn đăng ký\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"apply\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"applicant\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"applicable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-cori-d2005cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-aru0-d2005cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-aru5-d2005cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-aru6-d2005cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-aru10-d2005cc2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-aru9-d2005cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-aru3-d2005cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appli