('e5124d3c-4222-5d1f-be57-5f68a30758a4', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'rope', '/rəʊp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sợi dây dày, chắc dùng để buộc, kéo hoặc leo trèo.', 'a strong, thick cord made by twisting smaller threads together.', 'We used a strong rope to tie the boat to the dock.', 'Chúng tôi đã dùng một sợi dây thừng chắc chắn để buộc thuyền vào bến.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping department needs a strong rope to secure the heavy cargo on the truck.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận vận chuyển cần một sợi dây thừng chắc chắn để cố định hàng hóa nặng trên xe tải.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-ljspeech-03976920.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-cori-03976920.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rope-79de3e34.webp', '[\"cord\", \"cable\", \"string\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tie a rope\", \"meaning\": \"buộc dây thừng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jump rope\", \"meaning\": \"nhảy dây\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"robe\", \"note_vi\": \"Robe là áo choàng tắm/lễ phục, phát âm kết thúc bằng âm /b/.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rope\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-cori-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru0-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru5-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru6-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru10-03976920.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru9-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru3-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru7-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru8-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru2-03976920.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-ljspeech-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt408-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt138-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt624-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt396-03976920.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt498-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt132-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt288-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt42-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt90-03976920.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt rope (dây thừng) với robe (áo choàng).', 'manufacturing', 1, 11),
('ed6201d4-c4d7-5eb5-bd61-a63bf109258f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'underwear', '/ˈʌndəweə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'quần áo mặc bên trong, đồ lót.', 'garments worn beneath outer clothing, usually next to the skin, for hygiene or warmth.', 'You should change your underwear daily for hygiene.', 'Bạn nên thay đồ lót hàng ngày để đảm bảo vệ sinh.', '{\"en\": \"The laundry service at the hotel will wash your personal items, including shirts and underwear.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ giặt ủi tại khách sạn sẽ giặt các vật dụng cá nhân của bạn, bao gồm áo sơ mi và đồ lót.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-ljspeech-101a7cf3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-cori-101a7cf3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/underwear-1a74c967.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clean underwear\", \"meaning\": \"đồ lót sạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"change underwear\", \"meaning\": \"thay đồ lót\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-cori-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-aru0-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-aru5-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-aru6-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-aru10-101a7cf3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-aru9-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-aru3-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-aru7-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-aru8-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-aru2-101a7cf3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-ljspeech-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-lt408-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-lt138-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-lt624-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-lt396-101a7cf3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-lt498-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-lt132-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-lt288-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-lt42-101a7cf3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underwear-lt90-101a7cf3.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'undergarment\', từ này thông dụng hơn trong đời sống hàng ngày.', 'daily', 1, 12),
('b2f22615-c719-5085-b929-2ee1f2878c8e', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'respect', '/rɪˈspekt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác ngưỡng mộ hoặc đánh giá cao ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'a feeling of deep admiration for someone or something because of their good qualities.', 'Employees earned the manager\'s respect through hard work and consistent professional behavior.', 'Các nhân viên đã giành được sự tôn trọng của người quản lý thông qua sự chăm chỉ và hành vi chuyên nghiệp đồng nhất.', '{\"en\": \"The new director has earned the respect of her team through her excellent leadership skills.\", \"vi\": \"Nữ giám đốc mới đã giành được sự tôn trọng của nhóm nhờ kỹ năng lãnh đạo xuất sắc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-ljspeech-14012cd1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-cori-14012cd1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/respect-7165bb72.webp', '[\"admiration\", \"esteem\", \"regard\"]', '[\"disrespect\", \"contempt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"earn respect\", \"meaning\": \"giành được sự tôn trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mutual respect\", \"meaning\": \"sự tôn trọng lẫn nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"respective\", \"note_vi\": \"respective mang nghĩa \'tương ứng\', không liên quan đến sự tôn trọng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"respect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"respectful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"respectable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-cori-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru0-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru5-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru6-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru10-14012cd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru9-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru3-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru7-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru8-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru2-14012cd1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-ljspeech-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt408-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt138-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt624-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt396-14012cd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt498-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt132-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt288-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt42-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt90-14012cd1.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'respectful\' (lễ phép, tôn trọng) và \'respectable\' (đáng kính).', 'hr', 1, 13),
('4ccc8747-a27a-5588-bc9c-470b696946df', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'theory', '/ˈθɪəri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một ý tưởng hoặc tập hợp các ý tưởng dùng để giải thích điều gì đó.', 'a formal set of ideas that is intended to explain why something happens or exists.', 'His theory about the origin of the universe is quite complex.', 'Lý thuyết của anh ấy về nguồn gốc vũ trụ khá phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant presented a new management theory to help the company improve employee productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyên gia tư vấn đã trình bày một lý thuyết quản lý mới để giúp công ty cải thiện năng suất nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-ljspeech-6477d7f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-cori-6477d7f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/theory-d5f41c4a.webp', '[\"hypothesis\", \"concept\", \"principle\"]', '[\"practice\", \"fact\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in theory\", \"meaning\": \"về mặt lý thuyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"develop a theory\", \"meaning\": \"phát triển một lý thuyết\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"theoretical\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"theorist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-cori-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-aru0-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-aru5-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-aru6-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-aru10-6477d7f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-aru9-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-aru3-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-aru7-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-aru8-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-aru2-6477d7f1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-ljspeech-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-lt408-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-lt138-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-lt624-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-lt396-6477d7f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-lt498-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-lt132-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-lt288-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-lt42-6477d7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theory-lt90-6477d7f1.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'in theory\' (trên lý thuyết) thường được dùng để đối lập với \'in practice\' (trong thực tế).', 'academic', 1, 14),
('89556605-bbb0-5693-b653-717d61b33ead', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'immigrant', '/ˈɪmɪɡrənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người rời bỏ đất nước mình để sống vĩnh viễn ở một quốc gia khác.', 'an individual who relocates permanently to a foreign nation to reside there.', 'Many immigrants work hard to build a new life for their families.', 'Nhiều người nhập cư làm việc chăm chỉ để xây dựng cuộc sống mới cho gia đình họ.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired an immigrant who had strong technical skills.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một người nhập cư có kỹ năng kỹ thuật mạnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrant-ljspeech-54486e71.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrant-cori-54486e71.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/immigrant-0e4af150.webp', '[\"settler\", \"newcomer\", \"migrant\"]', '[\"native\", \"emigrant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"illegal immigrant\", \"meaning\": \"người nhập cư trái phép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immigrant worker\", \"meaning\": \"công nhân nhập cư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immigrant community\", \"meaning\": \"cộng đồng người nhập cư\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"emigrant\", \"note_vi\": \"emigrant rời đi, immigrant đến nước mới định cư.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"immigrate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"immigration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrant-cori-54486e71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrant-aru0-54486e71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrant-aru5-54486e71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrant-aru6-54486e71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrant-aru10-54486e71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrant-aru9-54486e71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrant-aru3-54486e71.mp3\", \"/s