('349a7be0-aa14-5d7f-a253-70d4222c067f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'obvious', '/ˈɒbviəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Dễ thấy, dễ hiểu hoặc hiển nhiên, không cần giải thích.', 'easy to see, recognize, or understand without needing any explanation.', 'It was obvious from her expression that she was upset.', 'Rõ ràng là qua biểu cảm của cô ấy, cô ấy đang buồn.', '{\"en\": \"It is obvious that the new marketing campaign has increased our online sales significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Rõ ràng là chiến dịch tiếp thị mới đã làm tăng đáng kể doanh số bán hàng trực tuyến của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-ljspeech-e3ff2d9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-cori-e3ff2d9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obvious-aab00613.webp', '[\"clear\", \"evident\", \"apparent\"]', '[\"unclear\", \"hidden\", \"obscure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"obvious choice\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn rõ ràng/hiển nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obvious reason\", \"meaning\": \"lý do rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"become obvious\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên rõ ràng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"obviously\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obviousness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-cori-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru0-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru5-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru6-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru10-e3ff2d9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru9-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru3-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru7-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc