('bf2dfca1-fb5e-5405-b561-7381fb4d6135', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'peaceful', '/ˈpiːsfl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Thanh bình, không có chiến tranh, xung đột hay tiếng ồn.', 'calm and quiet, without violence, conflict, or disturbing noise.', 'We spent a peaceful weekend by the lake, far from the city noise.', 'Chúng tôi đã trải qua một cuối tuần yên bình bên hồ, cách xa tiếng ồn thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The resort offers a peaceful environment ideal for corporate retreats and team meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng cung cấp môi trường thanh bình lý tưởng cho các buổi nghỉ dưỡng doanh nghiệp và họp nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-ljspeech-bab4c3db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-cori-bab4c3db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/peaceful-a37c867e.webp', '[\"calm\", \"tranquil\", \"serene\"]', '[\"noisy\", \"chaotic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"peaceful environment\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường yên bình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"peaceful resolution\", \"meaning\": \"giải pháp hòa bình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"peaceful atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí thanh bình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"placid\", \"note_vi\": \"placid thường tả tính cách người điềm tĩnh, peaceful tả không gian yên bình\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"peace\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"peacefully\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"peacefulness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-cori-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-aru0-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-aru5-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-aru6-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-aru10-bab4c3db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-aru9-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-aru3-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-aru7-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-aru8-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-aru2-bab4c3db.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-ljspeech-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-lt408-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-lt138-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-lt624-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-lt396-bab4c3db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-lt498-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-lt132-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-lt288-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-lt42-bab4c3db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peaceful-lt90-bab4c3db.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm peaceful (yên bình) với pleased (hài lòng); hai từ khác nghĩa hoàn toàn.', 'travel', 1, 28),
('e331f112-7c7f-57e6-aeff-f14296b91119', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '929e2c7d-a4f3-52a8-9351-3859123a820f', '6afa9c47-dcaf-5478-ba04-a80c39feade6', 'smart', '/smɑːt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng học hỏi, suy nghĩ nhanh nhạy và đưa ra quyết định tốt.', 'having a quick mind and the ability to learn or understand things very easily.', 'She made a smart decision by investing in renewable energy.', 'Cô ấy đã đưa ra một quyết định thông minh khi đầu tư vào năng lượng tái tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The manager made a smart move by hiring an assistant with strong organizational skills.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã có một nước đi khôn ngoan khi thuê một trợ lý có kỹ năng tổ chức tốt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-ljspeech-15563556.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-cori-15563556.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/smart-339fb95f.webp', '[\"intelligent\", \"clever\"]', '[\"stupid\", \"foolish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"smart choice\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn thông minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"smart move\", \"meaning\": \"nước đi khôn ngoan\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"smartly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-cori-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-aru0-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-aru5-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-aru6-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-aru10-15563556.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-aru9-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-aru3-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-aru7-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-aru8-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-aru2-15563556.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-ljspeech-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-lt408-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-lt138-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-lt624-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-lt396-15563556.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-lt498-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-lt132-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-lt288-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-lt42-15563556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smart-lt90-15563556.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công sở, \'smart\' còn có nghĩa là lịch sự, chỉn chu (smart clothes).', 'office', 1, 29),
('e796cae3-8d97-5c6d-9462-7765ee0ac0dc', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '99d7a475-3ac4-5c23-8a97-88aeae5fe023', 'ca0919bb-48f5-5727-9433-2e89b03c63b3', 'risk', '/rɪsk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nguy cơ, khả năng xảy ra điều không mong muốn hoặc tổn thất.', 'the possibility of something bad or dangerous happening in the future.', 'Investing in the stock market always involves some level of risk.', 'Đầu tư vào thị trường chứng khoán luôn tiềm ẩn một mức độ rủi ro nhất định.', '{\"en\": \"Starting a new business always involves a high level of financial risk.\", \"vi\": \"Khởi nghiệp một doanh nghiệp mới luôn đi kèm với mức độ rủi ro tài chính cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-ljspeech-11a110bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-cori-11a110bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/risk-8f478e8e.webp', '[\"danger\", \"hazard\", \"threat\"]', '[\"safety\", \"security\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take a risk\", \"meaning\": \"chấp nhận rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"risk management\", \"meaning\": \"quản trị rủi ro\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"danger\", \"note_vi\": \"danger là mối nguy hiểm nói chung, risk là khả năng xảy ra rủi ro.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"risk\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"risky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-cori-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru0-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru5-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru6-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru10-11a110bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru9-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru3-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru7-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru8-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/