('5e4b95ac-26cb-5d69-9139-bd9712896a09', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '99d7a475-3ac4-5c23-8a97-88aeae5fe023', 'ca0919bb-48f5-5727-9433-2e89b03c63b3', 'deal', '/diːl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'sự thỏa thuận hoặc giao dịch.', 'an agreement between two or more parties to do business or exchange something of value.', 'They finally reached a deal after weeks of negotiation.', 'Cuối cùng họ đã đạt được một thỏa thuận sau nhiều tuần đàm phán.', '{\"en\": \"We secured a great deal on the new office furniture during the summer clearance sale.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã có được một thỏa thuận tốt về nội thất văn phòng mới trong đợt giảm giá mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-ljspeech-60f59e2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-cori-60f59e2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deal-e8719ccc.webp', '[\"agreement\", \"contract\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"close a deal\", \"meaning\": \"chốt giao dịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a deal\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện thỏa thuận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dealer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-cori-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-aru0-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-aru5-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-aru6-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-aru10-60f59e2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-aru9-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-aru3-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-aru7-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-aru8-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-aru2-60f59e2b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-ljspeech-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-lt408-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-lt138-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-lt624-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-lt396-60f59e2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-lt498-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-lt132-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-lt288-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-lt42-60f59e2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deal-lt90-60f59e2b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh đàm phán thương mại.', 'business', 1, 1),
('69d50b0e-f011-5cb5-890c-da421159be90', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', '99d7a475-3ac4-5c23-8a97-88aeae5fe023', 'ca0919bb-48f5-5727-9433-2e89b03c63b3', 'experiment', '/ɪkˈsperɪmənt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thực hiện một thí nghiệm hoặc thử nghiệm để kiểm tra giả thuyết.', 'to try new methods or substances to see what happens.', 'Scientists often experiment with new chemicals to find better solutions.', 'Các nhà khoa học thường thử nghiệm với các hóa chất mới để tìm ra giải pháp tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The factory will experiment with automated robots to improve production speed.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy sẽ thử nghiệm với robot tự động để cải thiện tốc độ sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experiment-ljspeech-f45f2bc8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experiment-cori-f45f2bc8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/experiment-8af3a6ef.webp', '[\"test\", \"try\", \"probe\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"experiment with\", \"meaning\": \"thử nghiệm với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conduct experiment\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành thí nghiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scientific experiment\", \"meaning\": \"thí nghiệm khoa học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"experience\", \"note_vi\": \"experience là trải nghiệm, experiment là thử nghiệm\"}, {\"word\": \"examine\", \"note_vi\": \"examine là kiểm tra kỹ, không phải thử\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"experiment\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"experimental\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experiment-cori-f45f2bc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experiment-aru0-f45f2bc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experiment-aru5-f45f2bc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experiment-aru6-f45f2bc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experiment-aru10-f45f2bc8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experiment-aru9-f45f2bc8.mp3\", \"/