('0565b442-2f46-5298-ac37-a8c03f2b5d04', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'a4dd6a66-9b37-50ee-b0a4-6bcba96aa151', '100dab08-885e-51ee-9ab5-b17b6611ad13', 'passion', '/ˈpæʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Niềm say mê, hứng thú mạnh mẽ đối với điều gì đó.', 'a very strong feeling of love or interest for a particular activity or subject.', 'She pursued her passion for painting by attending art school.', 'Cô ấy theo đuổi niềm đam mê hội họa bằng cách theo học trường nghệ thuật.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing director has a real passion for developing creative advertising campaigns.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tiếp thị mới có một niềm say mê thực sự với việc phát triển các chiến dịch quảng cáo sáng tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-ljspeech-eabc12ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-cori-eabc12ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/passion-2811e230.webp', '[\"enthusiasm\", \"eagerness\", \"devotion\"]', '[\"apathy\", \"indifference\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have a passion for\", \"meaning\": \"có niềm đam mê với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a lifelong passion\", \"meaning\": \"đam mê cả đời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"patience\", \"note_vi\": \"patience là sự kiên nhẫn, passion là đam mê\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"passionate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"passionately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-cori-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-aru0-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-aru5-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-aru6-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-aru10-eabc12ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-aru9-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-aru3-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-aru7-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-aru8-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-aru2-eabc12ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-ljspeech-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-lt408-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-lt138-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-lt624-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-lt396-eabc12ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-lt498-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-lt132-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-lt288-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-lt42-eabc12ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-lt90-eabc12ab.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'for\' (passion for something).', 'hr', 1, 26),
('33b7e8ea-6670-5618-a629-88edd7922318', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'a4dd6a66-9b37-50ee-b0a4-6bcba96aa151', '100dab08-885e-51ee-9ab5-b17b6611ad13', 'duty', '/ˈdjuːti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Trách nhiệm đạo đức hoặc pháp lý, hoặc một công việc phải làm.', 'something that you have to do because it is part of your job or because you think it is right.', 'It is our duty to protect the environment for future generations.', 'Bảo vệ môi trường cho các thế hệ tương lai là nhiệm vụ của chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard\'s primary duty is to monitor the building entrances during the night shift.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiệm vụ chính của nhân viên bảo vệ là giám sát các lối vào tòa nhà trong ca đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-ljspeech-d1f30ba1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-cori-d1f30ba1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/duty-b7f71bf8.webp', '[\"responsibility\", \"obligation\", \"task\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"do one\'s duty\", \"meaning\": \"làm nhiệm vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heavy duty\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ nặng nề hoặc siêu bền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"off duty\", \"meaning\": \"hết ca làm việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"responsibility\", \"note_vi\": \"duty thường thiên về nghĩa vụ bắt buộc, responsibility là trách nhiệm chung\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dutiful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-cori-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru0-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru5-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru6-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru10-d1f30ba1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru9-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru3-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru7-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru8-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-aru2-d1f30ba1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-ljspeech-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt408-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt138-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt624-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt396-d1f30ba1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt498-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt132-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt288-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt42-d1f30ba1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duty-lt90-d1f30ba1.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'on duty\' nghĩa là đang trong ca làm việc, \'off duty\' là hết ca.', 'hr', 1, 27),
('03bd58b0-6f73-5205-8970-6c92e9e98a80', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'a4dd6a66-9b37-50ee-b0a4-6bcba96aa151', '100dab08-885e-51ee-9ab5-b17b6611ad13', 'sex', '/seks/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một trong hai nhóm chính (nam hoặc nữ) mà sinh vật được chia thành.', 'the state of being male or female, especially regarding biological difference.', 'The application form asks for your name, age, and sex.', 'Đơn đăng ký yêu cầu điền tên, tuổi và giới tính của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The survey asked respondents to state their age, sex, and current occupation.\", \"vi\": \"Khảo sát yêu cầu người tham gia nêu rõ tuổi, giới tính và nghề nghiệp hiện tại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-ljspeech-68bb04bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-cori-68bb04bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sex-613e5029.webp', '[\"gender\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"same sex\", \"meaning\": \"cùng giới tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"opposite sex\", \"meaning\": \"khác giới tính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gender\", \"note_vi\": \"Sex thiên về sinh học (nam/nữ), gender thiên về giới tính xã hội.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sexual\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"sexually\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-cori-68bb04bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-aru0-68bb04bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-aru5-68bb04bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-aru6-68bb04bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-aru10-68bb04bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-aru9-68bb04bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-aru3-68bb04bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-aru7-68bb04bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-aru8-68bb04bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sex-aru2-68bb04bd.mp3\"]}, \"