('103ccafd-3c29-57d0-a1a5-9c4a4b80a4c8', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'delay', 'UK: /dɪˈleɪ/ | US: /dɪˈleɪ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'trì hoãn', 'To cause something to happen at a later time than originally planned.', 'The flight was delayed due to bad weather conditions.', 'Chuyến bay bị hoãn do điều kiện thời tiết xấu.', '{\"en\": \"Adverse weather conditions forced the airline to delay several departing international flights.\", \"vi\": \"Điều kiện thời tiết bất lợi đã buộc hãng hàng không phải hoãn một số chuyến bay quốc tế khởi hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-ljspeech-ab464f02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-cori-ab464f02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delay-0928fcd7.webp', '[\"postpone\", \"defer\", \"put off\", \"reschedule\"]', '[\"advance\", \"expedite\", \"accelerate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"delay publication\", \"meaning\": \"hoãn việc xuất bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delay shipment\", \"meaning\": \"trì hoãn giao hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"delay\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-cori-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru0-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru5-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru6-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru10-ab464f02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru9-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru3-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru7-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru8-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru2-ab464f02.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-ljspeech-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-lt408-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-lt138-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-lt624-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-lt396-ab464f02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-lt498-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-lt132-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-lt288-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-lt42-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-lt90-ab464f02.mp3\"]}}', 'Sau động từ \'delay\' sử dụng dạng V-ing (\'delay sending the report\'). \'Delay\' cũng thường đóng vai trò là danh từ.', 'travel', 1, 5),
('4322fce2-f7dd-5ce1-ad08-ad3f47d4ab4e', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'display', 'UK: /dɪˈspleɪ/ | US: /dɪˈspleɪ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'màn hình, sự trưng bày', 'an arrangement of items placed somewhere so that people can view them easily.', 'The new product display attracted many curious customers.', 'Màn hình trưng bày sản phẩm mới đã thu hút nhiều khách hàng tò mò.', '{\"en\": \"The new promotional posters are currently on display in the main entrance lobby.\", \"vi\": \"Các áp phích quảng cáo mới hiện đang được trưng bày tại sảnh lối vào chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-ljspeech-59b18907.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-cori-59b18907.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/display-41f9b083.webp', '[\"exhibition\", \"showcase\", \"presentation\", \"exhibit\"]', '[\"concealment\", \"hiding\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"on display\", \"meaning\": \"đang được trưng bày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"window display\", \"meaning\": \"tủ kính trưng bày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"digital display\", \"meaning\": \"màn hình hiển thị kỹ thuật số\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"demonstration\", \"note_vi\": \"sự trình diễn/hướng dẫn sử dụng sản phẩm, khác với sự trưng bày (display)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"display\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-cori-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-aru0-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-aru5-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-aru6-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-aru10-59b18907.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-aru9-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-aru3-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-aru7-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-aru8-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-aru2-59b18907.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-ljspeech-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-lt408-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-lt138-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-lt624-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-lt396-59b18907.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-lt498-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-lt132-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-lt288-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-lt42-59b18907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/display-lt90-59b18907.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC có cụm từ rất phổ biến \'on display\' (đang được trưng bày) và \'window display\' (tủ trưng bày sản phẩm).', 'shopping', 1, 6),
('32c32c13-7e3d-5175-a99b-4a64c2047a60', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'unfair', '/ˌʌnˈfeə(r)/', '', 'adjective', 'Không công bằng hoặc không chính đáng.', 'not treating people in an equal way or not following the rules of justice.', 'It\'s unfair to judge someone without knowing their full story.', 'Thật bất công khi đánh giá ai đó mà không biết toàn bộ câu chuyện của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The employees felt it was unfair to change the shift schedule without any prior notice.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên cảm thấy không công bằng khi thay đổi lịch làm việc mà không báo trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-ljspeech-ee50a54d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-cori-ee50a54d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unfair-e44f8543.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-cori-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-aru0-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-aru5-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-aru6-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-aru10-ee50a54d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-aru9-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-aru3-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-aru7-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-aru8-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-aru2-ee50a54d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-ljspeech-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-lt408-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-lt138-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-lt624-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-lt396-ee50a54d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-lt498-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-lt132-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-lt288-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-lt42-ee50a54d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfair-lt90-ee50a54d.mp3\"]}}', '', 'other', 1, 7),
('a3ace879-0578-55cb-a2bc-a2f76402fb4d', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'neither', '/ˈnaɪðə(r)/', 'A2', 'pronoun', 'Không phải cái này cũng không phải cái kia.', 'not the one nor the other of two people or things.', 'Neither of the two options seemed appealing to me.', 'Không có lựa chọn nào trong hai cái đó có vẻ hấp dẫn đối với tôi.', '{\"en\": \"We interviewed two candidates, but unfortunately, neither had the required experience.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã phỏng vấn hai ứng viên, nhưng không May là không ai có kinh nghiệm yêu cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-ljspeech-f1078caa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-cori-f1078caa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/neither-cc950834.webp', NULL, '[\"both\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"neither of them\", \"meaning\": \"không ai/cái nào trong hai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"neither here nor there\", \"meaning\": \"không quan trọng, không liên quan\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"either\", \"note_vi\": \"either dùng cho một trong hai, neither dùng cho phủ định cả hai.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-cori-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-aru0-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-aru5-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-aru6-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-aru10-f1078caa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-aru9-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-aru3-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-aru7-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-aru8-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-aru2-f1078caa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-ljspeech-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-lt408-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-lt138-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-lt624-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-lt396-f1078caa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-lt498-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-lt132-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-lt288-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-lt42-f1078caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neither-lt90-f1078caa.mp3\"]}}', 'Neither đi với động từ số ít khi làm chủ ngữ trực tiếp.', 'hr', 1, 8),
('7b7ac6bb-da98-5aa3-8519-8642110a5820', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'campaign', '/kæmˈpeɪn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một chuỗi hoạt động có tổ chức nhằm đạt được một mục tiêu cụ thể, thường là chính trị hoặc xã hội.', 'a series of planned activities that are intended to achieve a particular social or business goal.', 'The environmental group launched a campaign to raise awareness about plastic pollution.', 'Nhóm môi trường đã phát động một chiến dịch để nâng cao nhận thức về ô nhiễm nhựa.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department launched a new advertising campaign to promote the organic products.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận tiếp thị đã khởi động một chiến dịch quảng cáo mới để quảng bá các sản phẩm hữu cơ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-ljspeech-23f43ae9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-cori-23f43ae9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/campaign-2ee5cd42.webp', '[\"drive\", \"crusade\", \"strategy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"marketing campaign\", \"meaning\": \"chiến dịch tiếp thị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"launch a campaign\", \"meaning\": \"khởi động một chiến dịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"advertising campaign\", \"meaning\": \"chiến dịch quảng cáo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"campaign\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"campaigner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-cori-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-aru0-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-aru5-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-aru6-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-aru10-23f43ae9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-aru9-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-aru3-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-aru7-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-aru8-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-aru2-23f43ae9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-ljspeech-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-lt408-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-lt138-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-lt624-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-lt396-23f43ae9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-lt498-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-lt132-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-lt288-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-lt42-23f43ae9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campaign-lt90-23f43ae9.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với động từ launch (khởi động) hoặc run (chạy chiến dịch).', 'marketing', 1, 9),
('ca21e604-bad4-5b63-bf0f-0367c44331d9', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'narrative', '/ˈnærətɪv/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Câu chuyện, sự thuật lại một chuỗi sự kiện.', 'a spoken or written account of connected events.', 'The documentary provides a fascinating narrative of how the company expanded globally.', 'Bộ phim tài liệu cung cấp một câu chuyện lôi cuốn về cách công ty mở rộng ra toàn cầu.', '{\"en\": \"The manager shared a narrative of the project\'s success at the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý chia sẻ một câu chuyện về thành công của dự án trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-ljspeech-4c501dfa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-cori-4c501dfa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/narrative-62df1f46.webp', '[\"story\", \"account\", \"tale\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"personal narrative\", \"meaning\": \"câu chuyện cá nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"narrative structure\", \"meaning\": \"cấu trúc tự sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compelling narrative\", \"meaning\": \"câu chuyện hấp dẫn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"natural\", \"note_vi\": \"narrative là tự sự, natural là tự nhiên.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"narrate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"narrator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-cori-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-aru0-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-aru5-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-aru6-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-aru10-4c501dfa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-aru9-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-aru3-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-aru7-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-aru8-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-aru2-4c501dfa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-ljspeech-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-lt408-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-lt138-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-lt624-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-lt396-4c501dfa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-lt498-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-lt132-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-lt288-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-lt42-4c501dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrative-lt90-4c501dfa.mp3\"]}}', 'Narrative thường là văn xuôi thuật lại, khác với natural (tự nhiên).', 'office', 1, 10),
('063b29a6-3b46-5875-84ae-267706140933', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'coin', '/kɔɪn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Đồng tiền kim loại.', 'a small, flat, round piece of metal used as money in a country.', 'I found a rare old coin while digging in the garden.', 'Tôi tìm thấy một đồng tiền xu cổ quý hiếm khi đang đào vườn.', '{\"en\": \"The vending machine in the break room does not accept any coin smaller than ten cents.\", \"vi\": \"Máy bán hàng tự động trong phòng nghỉ không chấp nhận bất kỳ đồng xu nào nhỏ hơn mười xu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-ljspeech-3478fe69.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-cori-3478fe69.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coin-e283060c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gold coin\", \"meaning\": \"đồng tiền vàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"silver coin\", \"meaning\": \"đồng tiền bạc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coinage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-cori-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru0-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru5-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru6-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru10-3478fe69.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru9-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru3-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru7-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru8-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru2-3478fe69.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-ljspeech-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt408-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu