('686c2f10-c44e-5ce2-9d27-115132e94e20', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'double', '/ˈdʌbl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một lượng hoặc số lượng gấp hai lần.', 'an amount or number that is twice as much as another.', 'We ordered a double portion of fries because we were very hungry.', 'Chúng tôi đã gọi một suất khoai tây chiên gấp đôi vì chúng tôi rất đói.', '{\"en\": \"The new factory production target is a double of last year\'s total output.\", \"vi\": \"Mục tiêu sản lượng mới của nhà máy gấp đôi tổng sản lượng năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-ljspeech-bdb36bb2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-cori-bdb36bb2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/double-8f5c4065.webp', '[\"duplicate\", \"twin\"]', '[\"half\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"at the double\", \"meaning\": \"rất nhanh chóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a double of\", \"meaning\": \"lượng gấp đôi của\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"doubt\", \"note_vi\": \"doubt là sự nghi ngờ, phát âm khác double.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"double\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"double\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"doubly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-cori-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru0-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru5-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru6-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru10-bdb36bb2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru9-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru3-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru7-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru8-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-aru2-bdb36bb2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-ljspeech-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-lt408-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-lt138-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-lt624-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-lt396-bdb36bb2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-lt498-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-lt132-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-lt288-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-lt42-bdb36bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/double-lt90-bdb36bb2.mp3\"]}}', 'Double vừa là danh từ, động từ, tính từ và trạng từ.', 'business', 1, 18),
('39379207-9bd1-5a4a-acc1-3d08c7805871', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'cookware', 'UK: /ˈkʊkˌwɛə/ | US: /ˈkʊkˌwɛr/', 'B1', 'noun', 'dụng cụ nấu ăn', 'pots, pans, and other equipment used for preparing food in a kitchen.', 'The store offers a wide selection of cookware.', 'Cửa hàng có nhiều lựa chọn dụng cụ nấu ăn.', '{\"en\": \"The home appliance store offers a 20% discount on all stainless steel cookware this week.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng đồ gia dụng giảm giá 20% cho tất cả dụng cụ nấu ăn bằng thép không gỉ trong tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-ljspeech-a9018a1e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-cori-a9018a1e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cookware-e84a73ed.webp', '[\"kitchenware\", \"cooking utensils\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stainless steel cookware\", \"meaning\": \"dụng cụ nấu ăn bằng thép không gỉ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"non-stick cookware\", \"meaning\": \"dụng cụ nấu ăn chống dính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tableware\", \"note_vi\": \"Bộ dụng cụ phục vụ ăn uống trên bàn (bát, đĩa, thố), khác với cookware là đồ dùng trực tiếp nấu ăn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cook\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cooker\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-cori-a9018a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-aru0-a9018a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-aru5-a9018a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-aru6-a9018a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-aru10-a9018a1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-aru9-a9018a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-aru3-a9018a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cookware-aru7-a9018a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/