('1662fcdb-9d1b-5e3a-bafb-49b4742a9215', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'ac09ba7c-ef8c-556a-8ca6-e044064a6a19', 'b9588537-dac3-52d3-94fd-b10fc6e1b708', 'safety', '/ˈseɪfti/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng không có nguy hiểm hoặc rủi ro.', 'the state of being protected from danger, harm, or risk.', 'Always prioritize your safety when working with electrical equipment.', 'Luôn ưu tiên sự an toàn của bạn khi làm việc với thiết bị điện.', '{\"en\": \"All factory workers must attend the annual safety training session next week.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả công nhân nhà máy phải tham gia buổi huấn luyện an toàn hàng năm vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-ljspeech-be6c324c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-cori-be6c324c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/safety-7a0dfc2e.webp', '[\"security\", \"protection\"]', '[\"danger\", \"hazard\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"safety regulations\", \"meaning\": \"quy định an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"safety inspection\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra an toàn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"security\", \"note_vi\": \"safety là an toàn tránh tai nạn; security là an ninh tránh kẻ xấu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"safe\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"safely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-cori-be6c324c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-aru0-be6c324c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-aru5-be6c324c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-aru6-be6c324c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-aru10-be6c324c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-aru9-be6c324c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-aru3-be6c324c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-aru7-be6c324c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safety-aru8-be6c324c.m