('fa95b29d-20f2-5cea-80d2-8432b83d5646', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b01c6723-adc0-588b-ac93-0bfb21c23a39', '14172ddf-5892-5e3e-b518-597d7d0f7585', 'comparison', '/kəmˈpærɪsn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc quá trình xem xét sự tương đồng và khác biệt giữa hai hoặc nhiều thứ.', 'the act of looking at two or more things to see how they are different.', 'In comparison to last year, our sales have increased significantly.', 'So với năm ngoái, doanh số của chúng tôi đã tăng đáng kể.', '{\"en\": \"A detailed comparison of the two software packages helped the IT manager make a decision.\", \"vi\": \"Việc so sánh chi tiết giữa hai gói phần mềm đã giúp quản lý IT đưa ra quyết định.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-ljspeech-4d04521b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-cori-4d04521b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/comparison-76283eb5.webp', '[\"contrast\", \"analysis\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a comparison\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện so sánh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in comparison with\", \"meaning\": \"khi so sánh với\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compare\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"comparative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-cori-4d04521b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-aru0-4d04521b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-aru5-4d04521b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-aru6-4d04521b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-aru10-4d04521b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-aru9-4d04521b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-aru3-4d04521b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-aru7-4d04521b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparison-aru8-4d04521b.mp3\", \"/stora