('a84fd00c-c0b3-5d20-966d-de25e030324c', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b01c6723-adc0-588b-ac93-0bfb21c23a39', '14172ddf-5892-5e3e-b518-597d7d0f7585', 'whether', '/ˈweðə(r)/', 'A2', 'conjunction', 'Liệu rằng, có hay không.', 'used to express a choice between two or more possibilities.', 'I\'m not sure whether I should take the bus or walk.', 'Tôi không chắc liệu mình nên đi xe buýt hay đi bộ.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor asked whether the report was ready for the client.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát đã hỏi liệu báo cáo đã sẵn sàng cho khách hàng chưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-ljspeech-3b959693.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-cori-3b959693.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whether-e093a032.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"whether or not\", \"meaning\": \"có hay không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whether to\", \"meaning\": \"liệu có nên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ask whether\", \"meaning\": \"hỏi liệu rằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"weather\", \"note_vi\": \"whether là liên từ, weather là thời tiết.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-cori-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-aru0-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-aru5-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-aru6-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-aru10-3b959693.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-aru9-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-aru3-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-aru7-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-aru8-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-aru2-3b959693.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-ljspeech-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-lt408-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-lt138-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-lt624-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-lt396-3b959693.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-lt498-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-lt132-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-lt288-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-lt42-3b959693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whether-lt90-3b959693.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt whether (liệu) và weather (thời tiết) khi viết.', 'office', 1, 6),
('7faeafcb-2936-54a3-bfc8-a997c0f209c7', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b01c6723-adc0-588b-ac93-0bfb21c23a39', '14172ddf-5892-5e3e-b518-597d7d0f7585', 'cattle', 'UK: /ˈkætəl/ | US: /ˈkæt̬əl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'gia súc', 'large domesticated animals such as cows and bulls raised on farms for milk or meat', 'Farmers raise cattle for meat and milk production.', 'Nông dân nuôi gia súc để sản xuất thịt và sữa.', '{\"en\": \"The agricultural company exports high-quality beef raised from healthy cattle on modern ranches.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty nông nghiệp xuất khẩu thịt bò chất lượng cao được nuôi từ gia súc khỏe mạnh tại các trang trại hiện đại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-ljspeech-7ba71fae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-cori-7ba71fae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cattle-6999916f.webp', '[\"livestock\", \"cows\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"raise cattle\", \"meaning\": \"chăn nuôi gia súc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cattle farm\", \"meaning\": \"trang trại gia súc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"kettle\", \"note_vi\": \"kettle là ấm đun nước, có phát âm gần giống cattle (gia súc).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-cori-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru0-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru5-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru6-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru10-7ba71fae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru9-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru3-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru7-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru8-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru2-7ba71fae.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v