('8f6191a1-0085-562e-8dc0-2a082c1ea001', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b01c6723-adc0-588b-ac93-0bfb21c23a39', '14172ddf-5892-5e3e-b518-597d7d0f7585', 'fuel', '/ˈfjuːəl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Chất liệu được đốt cháy để tạo ra năng lượng hoặc nhiệt.', 'a substance that is burned to provide heat or power for machines or vehicles.', 'Rising prices of fuel have significantly increased transportation costs for local businesses.', 'Giá nhiên liệu tăng đã làm tăng đáng kể chi phí vận tải cho các doanh nghiệp địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery company is looking for ways to reduce fuel costs for their transport fleet.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty vận chuyển đang tìm cách giảm chi phí nhiên liệu cho đội xe vận tải của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-ljspeech-43505540.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-cori-43505540.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fuel-c94e1c03.webp', '[\"gas\", \"petrol\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fuel consumption\", \"meaning\": \"mức tiêu thụ nhiên liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fossil fuel\", \"meaning\": \"nhiên liệu hóa thạch\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fueling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-cori-43505540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-aru0-43505540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-aru5-43505540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-aru6-43505540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-aru10-43505540.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-aru9-43505540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-aru3-43505540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-aru7-43505540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-aru8-43505540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuel-aru2-43505540.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/objec