('a5b255a2-da3d-547e-8063-47798bda4d49', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b0dae735-9246-5f7b-89f6-3bed8d8ecbef', 'b3b32698-749d-511b-940e-3ef3dc0c1893', 'total', '/ˈtəʊtl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Toàn bộ, tổng cộng, không thiếu phần nào.', 'including everything, with no part left out or missing.', 'The total cost of the trip was more than we expected.', 'Tổng chi phí của chuyến đi cao hơn chúng tôi mong đợi.', '{\"en\": \"The total budget for the new office renovation is fifty thousand dollars.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng ngân sách cho việc cải tạo văn phòng mới là năm mươi nghìn đô la.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total-ljspeech-5a537e20.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total-cori-5a537e20.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/total-bb18d30c.webp', '[\"entire\", \"complete\", \"overall\"]', '[\"partial\", \"incomplete\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"total cost\", \"meaning\": \"tổng chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"total amount\", \"meaning\": \"tổng số tiền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grand total\", \"meaning\": \"tổng cộng toàn bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"whole\", \"note_vi\": \"whole nhấn mạnh tính nguyên vẹn, total nhấn mạnh phép cộng tổng số.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"total\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"total\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"totally\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"totality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total-cori-5a537e20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total-aru0-5a537e20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total-aru5-5a537e20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total-aru6-5a537e20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total-aru10-5a537e20.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total-aru9-5a537e20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total-aru3-5a537e20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/total