('7fdb6db5-5bc3-50c2-9843-f723a1634d29', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b0dae735-9246-5f7b-89f6-3bed8d8ecbef', 'b3b32698-749d-511b-940e-3ef3dc0c1893', 'intend', '/ɪnˈtend/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Có ý định, có kế hoạch làm gì.', 'to have a plan or purpose in your mind to do something in the future.', 'The directors intend to launch the new product line early next year.', 'Các giám đốc dự định ra mắt dòng sản phẩm mới vào đầu năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager does not intend to hire more temporary staff for the busy summer season.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý không có ý định thuê thêm nhân viên thời vụ cho mùa hè bận rộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-ljspeech-f72c7b77.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-cori-f72c7b77.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intend-9164d01a.webp', '[\"plan\", \"aim\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fully intend\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn có ý định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intend to do\", \"meaning\": \"có ý định làm gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intention\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"intentional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-cori-f72c7b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-aru0-f72c7b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-aru5-f72c7b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-aru6-f72c7b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-aru10-f72c7b77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-aru9-f72c7b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-aru3-f72c7b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-aru7-f72c7b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-aru8-f72c7b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intend-aru2-f72c7b77.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2