('3b8f1eff-52ba-5ead-92b6-94f310588978', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'database', 'UK: /ˈdeɪ.tə.beɪs/ | US: /ˈdeɪ.t̬ə.beɪs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cơ sở dữ liệu', 'A structured set of computerized information that can be easily accessed, managed, and updated.', 'The customer database stores important information.', 'Cơ sở dữ liệu khách hàng lưu trữ thông tin quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Employees can access the company database to retrieve client record history.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên có thể truy cập cơ sở dữ liệu của công ty để lấy lịch sử hồ sơ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-ljspeech-6d613a1e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-cori-6d613a1e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/database-64bf5857.webp', '[\"databank\", \"repository\", \"archive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"access a database\", \"meaning\": \"truy cập cơ sở dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"update the database\", \"meaning\": \"cập nhật cơ sở dữ liệu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-cori-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru0-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru5-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru6-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru10-6d613a1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru9-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru3-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru7-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru8-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru2-6d613a1e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-ljspeech-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt408-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt138-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt624-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt396-6d613a1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt498-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt132-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt288-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt42-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt90-6d613a1e.mp3\"]}}', '\'Database\' viết liền thành một từ. Thường đi với các động từ \'access\' (truy cập), \'update\' (cập nhật), \'maintain\' (bảo trì).', 'technology', 1, 7),
('d9b67943-c585-592b-84d2-43660dafcaaa', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'fire', 'UK: /faɪər ʌp/ | US: /faɪər ʌp/', 'B1', 'v.phr', 'đốt, nhóm lửa', 'to start operating a machine or engine, or to ignite something to produce flames.', 'The crew will fire up the machine to start the process.', 'Nhóm sẽ đốt lửa cho máy để bắt đầu quy trình.', '{\"en\": \"The technician had to fire up the backup generator when the main power system failed.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã phải khởi động máy phát điện dự phòng khi hệ thống điện chính bị lỗi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-ljspeech-1da84024.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-cori-1da84024.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fire-3836ed7f.webp', '[\"ignite\", \"activate\", \"launch\"]', '[\"extinguish\", \"deactivate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fire up\", \"meaning\": \"khởi động (máy móc/động cơ)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fire an employee\", \"meaning\": \"sa thải một nhân viên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hire\", \"note_vi\": \"Hire là tuyển dụng (trái nghĩa với fire là sa thải nhân viên).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fire\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-cori-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru0-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru5-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru6-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru10-1da84024.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru9-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru3-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru7-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru8-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru2-1da84024.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-ljspeech-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt408-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt138-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt624-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt396-1da84024.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt498-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt132-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt288-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt42-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt90-1da84024.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh kĩ thuật/vận hành, \'fire up\' có nghĩa là khởi động máy móc/động cơ; trong ngữ cảnh nhân sự, \'fire\' có nghĩa là sa thải.', 'technical support', 1, 8),
('a8e751ac-c193-5120-9055-9d4f145fcfec', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'clue', '/kluː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'một gợi ý hoặc thông tin giúp giải quyết một bí ẩn hoặc vấn đề.', 'a sign or some information that helps you find the answer to a problem.', 'The detective found a crucial clue that helped solve the case.', 'Thám tử đã tìm thấy một manh mối quan trọng giúp phá án.', '{\"en\": \"The technician found a helpful clue that explained why the server crashed yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã tìm thấy một manh mối hữu ích giải thích tại sao máy chủ bị sập hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-ljspeech-452d2582.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-cori-452d2582.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clue-d024163f.webp', '[\"hint\", \"sign\", \"indication\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"give a clue\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra gợi ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vital clue\", \"meaning\": \"manh mối quan trọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"clueless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-cori-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-aru0-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-aru5-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-aru6-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-aru10-452d2582.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-aru9-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-aru3-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-aru7-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-aru8-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-aru2-452d2582.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-ljspeech-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-lt408-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-lt138-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-lt624-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-lt396-452d2582.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-lt498-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-lt132-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-lt288-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-lt42-452d2582.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clue-lt90-452d2582.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'to\' hoặc \'about\' (clue to/about something).', 'technology', 1, 9),
('cd06606e-d66c-56c8-8ef9-3e20e3887dbf', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'clear', '/klɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Loại bỏ, dọn sạch mọi thứ không cần thiết.', 'to remove things that are not wanted from a place.', 'Workers were hired to clear the fallen branches from the main road after the storm.', 'Các công nhân đã được thuê để dọn các cành cây đổ khỏi con đường chính sau trận bão.', '{\"en\": \"Staff members must clear their desks before leaving the office for the weekend.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải dọn sạch bàn làm việc của họ trước khi rời văn phòng vào cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-ljspeech-168cbb2e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cori-168cbb2e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clear-33f234c5.webp', '[\"empty\", \"clean\", \"remove\"]', '[\"fill\", \"clutter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"clear the table\", \"meaning\": \"dọn bàn ăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear customs\", \"meaning\": \"thông quan, làm thủ tục hải quan\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"clean\", \"note_vi\": \"clean là làm sạch bụi bẩn, clear là dọn dẹp chướng ngại vật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"clear\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"clearly\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"clarify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cori-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru0-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru5-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru6-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru10-168cbb2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru9-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru3-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-aru7-168cbb2e.mp3\", \"/stor