('7f332181-02ec-516c-bf86-e850e39e10d5', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'poem', '/ˈpəʊɪm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một tác phẩm văn học được viết bằng ngôn ngữ có vần điệu hoặc nhịp điệu đặc biệt.', 'a piece of creative writing that uses rhythm and imagery to convey deep emotions.', 'She recited a beautiful poem at the school\'s annual talent show.', 'Cô ấy đã đọc một bài thơ tuyệt đẹp tại buổi biểu diễn tài năng thường niên của trường.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing manager wrote a short poem to inspire the staff during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng tiếp thị đã viết một bài thơ ngắn để truyền cảm hứng cho nhân viên trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-ljspeech-69d27e80.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-cori-69d27e80.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/poem-6bade63b.webp', '[\"verse\", \"stanza\", \"composition\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"write a poem\", \"meaning\": \"viết một bài thơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"read a poem\", \"meaning\": \"đọc một bài thơ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"poet\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"poetry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-cori-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-aru0-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-aru5-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-aru6-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-aru10-69d27e80.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-aru9-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-aru3-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-aru7-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-aru8-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-aru2-69d27e80.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-ljspeech-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-lt408-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-lt138-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-lt624-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-lt396-69d27e80.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-lt498-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-lt132-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-lt288-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-lt42-69d27e80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poem-lt90-69d27e80.mp3\"]}}', '\"Poem\" là danh từ đếm được, dùng để chỉ một tác phẩm cụ thể.', 'media', 1, 17),
('6cd4532b-d9f5-5bb8-bed3-ae602e4a44b5', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'political', '/pəˈlɪtɪkl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến chính phủ, nhà nước hoặc các vấn đề chính trị.', 'relating to the government or the public affairs of a country and its leaders.', 'The new policy has caused a lot of political debate.', 'Chính sách mới đã gây ra nhiều tranh luận chính trị.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to avoid any political discussion during the annual shareholder meeting today.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty quyết định tránh mọi cuộc thảo luận chính trị trong cuộc họp cổ đông thường niên hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-ljspeech-0574d7ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-cori-0574d7ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/political-7f103b87.webp', '[\"governmental\", \"civic\", \"public\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"political party\", \"meaning\": \"đảng phái chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"political system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống chính trị\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"politics\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"politician\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-cori-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-aru0-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-aru5-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-aru6-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-aru10-0574d7ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-aru9-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-aru3-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-aru7-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-aru8-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-aru2-0574d7ef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-ljspeech-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-lt408-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-lt138-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-lt624-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-lt396-0574d7ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-lt498-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-lt132-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-lt288-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-lt42-0574d7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/political-lt90-0574d7ef.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận không nhầm với \"policy\" (chính sách) dù cùng gốc từ.', 'law', 1, 18),
('e64c7e9f-cc2b-5877-8b1d-d36fc870cc69', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'secondary', '/ˈsekəndri/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không phải là quan trọng nhất; đứng thứ hai.', 'not the most important thing but coming after the main or first thing.', 'While profit is important, customer satisfaction should be our primary, not secondary, goal.', 'Mặc dù lợi nhuận quan trọng, sự hài lòng của khách hàng nên là mục tiêu chính, không phải thứ yếu của chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"The committee decided that office decoration is a secondary concern compared to the budget deficit.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban quyết định rằng việc trang trí văn phòng là mối quan tâm thứ yếu so với thâm hụt ngân sách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-ljspeech-e059fc69.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-cori-e059fc69.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/secondary-3601cd29.webp', '[\"minor\", \"subordinate\"]', '[\"primary\", \"main\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"secondary school\", \"meaning\": \"trường trung học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"secondary market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường thứ cấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"primary\", \"note_vi\": \"primary là quan trọng nhất, secondary là kém quan trọng hơn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-cori-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-aru0-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-aru5-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-aru6-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-aru10-e059fc69.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-aru9-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-aru3-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-aru7-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-aru8-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-aru2-e059fc69.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-ljspeech-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-lt408-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-lt138-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-lt624-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-lt396-e059fc69.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-lt498-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-lt132-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-lt288-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-lt42-e059fc69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secondary-lt90-e059fc69.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ những việc phụ, không ưu tiên.', 'business', 1, 19),
('e63e0d0f-1932-573a-bd7a-1df0ca67309f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'extend', 'UK: /ɪkˈstɛnd/ | US: /ɪkˈstɛnd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'gia hạn', 'to cause something to last longer or increase in duration, area, or reach.', 'We need to extend the deadline for submissions.', 'Chúng ta cần gia hạn thời gian nộp bài.', '{\"en\": \"The manager agreed to extend the deadline for the project proposal by two days.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đồng ý gia hạn thời hạn nộp đề xuất dự án thêm hai ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-ljspeech-de93ba2d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-cori-de93ba2d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extend-ec97377f.webp', '[\"prolong\", \"lengthen\", \"expand\", \"stretch\"]', '[\"shorten\", \"reduce\", \"curtail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extend a deadline\", \"meaning\": \"gia hạn thời hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extend an offer\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra lời đề nghị/mời công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extend gratitude\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ lòng biết ơn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expand\", \"note_vi\": \"expand là mở rộng về quy mô/kích thước, còn extend thiên về thời gian, chiều dài hoặc vươn xa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extension\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"extensive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"extensively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-cori-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru0-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru5-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru6-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru10-de93ba2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru9-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru3-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru7-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru8-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru2-de93ba2d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-ljspeech-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt408-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt138-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt624-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt396-de93ba2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt498-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt132-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt288-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt42-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt90-de93ba2d.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'extend\' rất hay đi với \'deadline\' (gia hạn thời hạn) hoặc \'offer\' (đưa ra lời đề nghị/mời làm việc).', 'office', 1, 20),
('e831cbad-e048-582e-a0c2-e930210a6837', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'confusing', 'UK: /kənˈfjuːzɪŋ/ | US: /kənˈfjuːzɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'gây khó hiểu, gây nhầm lẫn', 'Difficult to understand or think about clearly because of being complicated or unclear.', 'The instructions for assembling the new desk were very confusing.', 'Hướng dẫn lắp ráp chiếc bàn mới rất khó hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The instructions on the new expense reimbursement form were extremely confusing to employees.\", \"vi\": \"Các hướng dẫn trên mẫu hoàn trả chi phí mới cực kỳ gây khó hiểu đối với nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-ljspeech-5bccaca1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-cori-5bccaca1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confusing-149175b4.webp', '[\"puzzling\", \"perplexing\", \"unclear\", \"baffling\"]', '[\"clear\", \"straightforward\", \"understandable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"confusing instructions\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn gây khó hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confusing message\", \"meaning\": \"thông điệp gây bối rối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confused\", \"note_vi\": \"bị bối rối/hiểu nhầm (diễn tả cảm xúc của con người)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"confuse\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"confusion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confused\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-cori-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru0-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru5-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru6-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru10-5bccaca1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru9-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia