('2ac75fa8-4931-5393-9721-ffb0c9eb7fbe', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'slightly', '/ˈslaɪtli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một chút, không nhiều.', 'to a small degree or extent, but not very much.', 'The soup tastes slightly salty, maybe add a little more water.', 'Món súp hơi mặn một chút, có lẽ nên thêm ít nước.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery cost for international shipments increased slightly due to rising fuel prices.\", \"vi\": \"Chi phí giao hàng cho các lô hàng quốc tế đã tăng nhẹ do giá nhiên liệu tăng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-ljspeech-c28dd595.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-cori-c28dd595.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/slightly-f569db08.webp', '[\"marginally\", \"somewhat\", \"faintly\"]', '[\"significantly\", \"substantially\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"slightly higher\", \"meaning\": \"cao hơn một chút\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slightly different\", \"meaning\": \"khác biệt một chút\"}, {\"phrase\": \"increase slightly\", \"meaning\": \"tăng nhẹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shortly\", \"note_vi\": \"shortly nghĩa là sớm hoặc sắp sửa, khác với slightly là một chút hoặc nhẹ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"slight\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-cori-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru0-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru5-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru6-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru10-c28dd595.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru9-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru3-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru7-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru8-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru2-c28dd595.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-ljspeech-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt408-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt138-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt624-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt396-c28dd595.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt498-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt132-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt288-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt42-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt90-c28dd595.mp3\"]}}', 'Slightly thường dùng để bổ nghĩa cho tính từ hoặc động từ chỉ sự thay đổi.', 'business', 1, 24),
('9c37242b-b02a-5f3c-b655-865dd8ac83ff', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'b64be806-d317-509e-bf07-7a7fd386ccf9', 'bc3ba965-2dbf-593c-afe8-46d5e4bf364e', 'cultural', '/ˈkʌltʃərəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về văn hóa.', 'relating to the habits, traditions, and beliefs of a particular group of people or society.', 'Language is a key aspect of cultural identity.', 'Ngôn ngữ là một khía cạnh quan trọng của bản sắc văn hóa.', '{\"en\": \"The company organized a cultural exchange event to improve teamwork among international employees.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tổ chức một sự kiện trao đổi văn hóa để cải thiện tinh thần làm việc nhóm giữa các nhân viên quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-ljspeech-5f583551.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-cori-5f583551.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cultural-fa26bfa4.webp', '[\"societal\", \"traditional\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cultural background\", \"meaning\": \"nền tảng văn hóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cultural heritage\", \"meaning\": \"di sản văn hóa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"culture\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"culturally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-cori-5f583551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-aru0-5f583551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-aru5-5f583551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-aru6-5f583551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-aru10-5f583551.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-aru9-5f583551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-aru3-5f583551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-aru7-5f583551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-aru8-5f583551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cultural-aru2-