('ba4716ec-6e94-54bf-a017-88e2d1560abf', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'cd72a252-4c03-5fc0-9877-f627892fc586', '21c95768-a99d-53cc-8bef-8e3509f446c8', 'approximately', '/əˈprɒksɪmətli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'gần đúng, không chính xác hoàn toàn.', 'close to a particular number or amount, but not completely accurate.', 'The modern office building cost approximately five million dollars to complete.', 'Tòa nhà văn phòng hiện đại tốn khoảng năm triệu đô la để hoàn thành.', '{\"en\": \"The renovation of the main office will take approximately three weeks to complete.\", \"vi\": \"Việc cải tạo văn phòng chính sẽ mất khoảng ba tuần để hoàn thành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-ljspeech-3802a68d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-cori-3802a68d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/approximately-aacba2b0.webp', '[\"roughly\", \"about\", \"nearly\"]', '[\"exactly\", \"precisely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"approximately equal\", \"meaning\": \"xấp xỉ bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cost approximately\", \"meaning\": \"tốn khoảng chừng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"approximate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"approximation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-cori-3802a68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-aru0-3802a68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-aru5-3802a68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-aru6-3802a68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-aru10-3802a68d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-aru9-3802a68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-aru3-3802a68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately-aru7-3802a68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approximately