('5a723d93-10e9-53dd-8608-a360004c69e0', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'cd72a252-4c03-5fc0-9877-f627892fc586', '21c95768-a99d-53cc-8bef-8e3509f446c8', 'toe', '/təʊ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một trong năm ngón ở bàn chân.', 'one of the five small parts that stick out from your foot.', 'The athlete injured his big toe during the marathon competition last weekend.', 'Vận động viên đã bị thương ở ngón chân cái trong cuộc thi marathon cuối tuần trước.', '{\"en\": \"The safety inspector noticed that the worker was not wearing steel-toe boots.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra an toàn nhận thấy người công nhân không đi giày bảo hộ mũi thép.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-ljspeech-d756976b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-cori-d756976b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/toe-83045327.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"big toe\", \"meaning\": \"ngón chân cái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"from head to toe\", \"meaning\": \"từ đầu đến chân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tow\", \"note_vi\": \"tow là kéo, cẩu xe, phát âm giống toe\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-cori-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru0-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru5-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru6-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru10-d756976b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru9-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru3-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru7-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru8-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru2-d756976b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-ljspeech-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-lt408