('e09c8b5b-1a9f-5673-9903-429fd8babc65', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'cd72a252-4c03-5fc0-9877-f627892fc586', '21c95768-a99d-53cc-8bef-8e3509f446c8', 'beauty', '/ˈbjuːti/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Đặc điểm làm cho ai đó hoặc vật gì đó hấp dẫn, dễ chịu.', 'the quality of being pleasing to the senses or to the mind.', 'The beauty of the sunset over the ocean was breathtaking.', 'Vẻ đẹp của hoàng hôn trên biển thật ngoạn mục.', '{\"en\": \"The new hotel design combines modern beauty with traditional local architecture.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế khách sạn mới kết hợp vẻ đẹp hiện đại với kiến trúc truyền thống địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-ljspeech-874f5e37.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-cori-874f5e37.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beauty-17a44c8b.webp', '[\"attractiveness\", \"loveliness\", \"gorgeousness\"]', '[\"ugliness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"natural beauty\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ đẹp tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"beauty salon\", \"meaning\": \"thẩm mỹ viện\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"beautiful\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"beautify\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"beautifully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-cori-874f5e37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-aru0-874f5e37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-aru5-874f5e37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-aru6-874f5e37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-aru10-874f5e37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-aru9-874f5e37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-aru3-874f5e37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-aru7-874f5e37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-aru8-874f5e37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-aru2-