('099b6511-9a57-5262-afea-0366d69d3c75', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'cd72a252-4c03-5fc0-9877-f627892fc586', '21c95768-a99d-53cc-8bef-8e3509f446c8', 'politics', '/ˈpɒlətɪks/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động liên quan đến việc điều hành một quốc gia hoặc khu vực.', 'activities linked to making decisions and getting power in government or organizations.', 'Many people find politics to be a complex and often frustrating subject.', 'Nhiều người thấy chính trị là một chủ đề phức tạp và thường gây khó chịu.', '{\"en\": \"The news agency hired a senior analyst to cover international politics.\", \"vi\": \"Hãng tin đã thuê một chuyên gia phân tích cao cấp để đưa tin về chính trị quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-ljspeech-4c5fd84e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-cori-4c5fd84e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/politics-5c055a03.webp', '[\"government\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local politics\", \"meaning\": \"chính trị địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"office politics\", \"meaning\": \"chính trị văn phòng / mâu thuẫn nội bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"policy\", \"note_vi\": \"policy là chính sách quy định; politics là chính trị\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"political\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"politician\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"politically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-cori-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-aru0-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-aru5-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-aru6-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-aru10-4c5fd84e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-aru9-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-aru3-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-aru7-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-aru8-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-aru2-4c5fd84e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-ljspeech-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-lt408-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-lt138-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-lt624-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-lt396-4c5fd84e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-lt498-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-lt132-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-lt288-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-lt42-4c5fd84e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politics-lt90-4c5fd84e.mp3\"]}}', 'Politics kết thúc bằng \'s\' nhưng thường đi với động từ số ít.', 'media', 1, 16),
('9070d508-6316-5bbe-bade-1a31c80b3a4d', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'cd72a252-4c03-5fc0-9877-f627892fc586', '21c95768-a99d-53cc-8bef-8e3509f446c8', 'obviously', '/ˈɒbviəsli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách rõ ràng, dễ thấy hoặc dễ hiểu.', 'in a way that is easy to see, understand, or clear to everyone.', 'He was obviously upset by the news, though he tried to hide it.', 'Rõ ràng là anh ấy đã buồn vì tin tức đó, mặc dù anh ấy cố che giấu.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing campaign was obviously successful because online sales increased dramatically this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị rõ ràng đã thành công vì doanh số bán hàng trực tuyến tăng vọt trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-ljspeech-9fe5e197.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-cori-9fe5e197.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obviously-35153653.webp', '[\"clearly\", \"evidently\", \"plainly\"]', '[\"obscurely\", \"unclearly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"obviously clear\", \"meaning\": \"rõ ràng một cách hiển nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obviously wrong\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn sai lầm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"apparent\", \"note_vi\": \"Apparent có thể có nghĩa là dường như, còn obviously mang tính khẳng định chắc chắn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"obvious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-cori-9fe5e197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-aru0-9fe5e197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-aru5-9fe5e197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-aru6-9fe5e197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-aru10-9fe5e197.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-aru9-9fe5e197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-aru3-9fe5e197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obviously-aru7-