('fa5ac617-c192-503e-84bc-a2fff51de388', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'cd72a252-4c03-5fc0-9877-f627892fc586', '21c95768-a99d-53cc-8bef-8e3509f446c8', 'magic', '/ˈmædʒɪk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nghệ thuật hoặc sức mạnh siêu nhiên tạo ra những điều kỳ diệu.', 'a special power or art that makes impossible or wonderful things seem to happen.', 'Children were captivated by the magic show at the birthday party.', 'Trẻ em bị cuốn hút bởi màn trình diễn ma thuật tại bữa tiệc sinh nhật.', '{\"en\": \"The team leader used the magic of positive feedback to boost employee morale significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng nhóm đã dùng sức mạnh kỳ diệu của phản hồi tích cực để nâng cao tinh thần nhân viên đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-ljspeech-b40981aa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-cori-b40981aa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/magic-489d87bc.webp', '[\"sorcery\", \"enchantment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"magic trick\", \"meaning\": \"trò ảo thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work like magic\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu quả như phép màu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"magic formula\", \"meaning\": \"công thức kỳ diệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"magical\", \"note_vi\": \"magical là tính từ (kỳ diệu), magic dùng làm danh từ hoặc tính từ trước danh từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"magical\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"magically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"magician\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-cori-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-aru0-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-aru5-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-aru6-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-aru10-b40981aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-aru9-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-aru3-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-aru7-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-aru8-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-aru2-b40981aa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-ljspeech-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-lt408-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-lt138-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-lt624-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-lt396-b40981aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-lt498-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-lt132-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-lt288-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-lt42-b40981aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magic-lt90-b40981aa.mp3\"]}}', 'Magic dùng nghĩa bóng trong văn phòng như \'magic solution\' (giải pháp thần kỳ) khá phổ biến.', 'other', 1, 18),
('d1297b91-67a0-573d-a10f-66300de25ac0', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'cd72a252-4c03-5fc0-9877-f627892fc586', '21c95768-a99d-53cc-8bef-8e3509f446c8', 'break room', 'UK: /ˈbreɪk ruːm/ | US: /ˈbreɪk ruːm/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'phòng nghỉ', 'A designated space in a workplace where employees can relax, eat, or socialize during rest periods.', 'The break room has a new coffee machine.', 'Phòng nghỉ có một máy pha cà phê mới.', '{\"en\": \"Complimentary tea and coffee are available in the employee break room.\", \"vi\": \"Trà và cà phê miễn phí có sẵn trong phòng nghỉ của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-ljspeech-9a195688.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-cori-9a195688.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/break-room-63776340.webp', '[\"lunchroom\", \"lounge\", \"staff room\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"employee break room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng nghỉ dành cho nhân viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clean the break room\", \"meaning\": \"dọn dẹp phòng nghỉ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-cori-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru0-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru5-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru6-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru10-9a195688.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru9-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru3-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru7-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru8-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru2-9a195688.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-ljspeech-9a195688.mp3