('8b6b9530-eebb-5ab9-b8ed-3db4499a73fa', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'cd72a252-4c03-5fc0-9877-f627892fc586', '21c95768-a99d-53cc-8bef-8e3509f446c8', 'friendship', '/ˈfrendʃɪp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Mối quan hệ thân thiết, yêu mến giữa những người bạn.', 'a close relationship between people who like each other.', 'Their friendship has lasted for over twenty years.', 'Tình bạn của họ đã kéo dài hơn hai mươi năm.', '{\"en\": \"The team building event helped strengthen friendship among the new employees.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện xây dựng đội nhóm giúp củng cố tình bạn giữa các nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-ljspeech-850b4d7a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-cori-850b4d7a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/friendship-357bcc43.webp', '[\"bond\", \"companionship\"]', '[\"enmity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"close friendship\", \"meaning\": \"tình bạn thân thiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"friendship with\", \"meaning\": \"tình bạn với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"relationship\", \"note_vi\": \"relationship là quan hệ rộng, không chỉ bạn bè\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"friend\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"friendly\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"befriend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-cori-850b4d7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-aru0-850b4d7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-aru5-850b4d7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-aru6-850b4d7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-aru10-850b4d7a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-aru9-850b4d7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-aru3-850b4d7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/friendship-aru7-850b4d7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2