('a9d7fd42-d82a-5d0d-b4cd-702a86b7b715', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'd5bb2d85-9ac2-5bbf-afeb-106115dfd37d', 'd75a2cf9-8cf0-55d0-a761-ce77e096b570', 'tin', '/tɪn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hộp kim loại kín dùng để đựng thực phẩm hoặc đồ uống.', 'a metal container in which food or drink is kept closed to stay fresh.', 'She opened a tin of tuna for her lunch.', 'Cô ấy mở một hộp cá ngừ để ăn trưa.', '{\"en\": \"The supermarket clerk arranged the tins of soup neatly on the bottom shelf.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên siêu thị đã sắp xếp các lon súp một cách gọn gàng trên kệ dưới cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-ljspeech-f2691976.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-cori-f2691976.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tin-551118c5.webp', '[\"can\", \"container\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tin opener\", \"meaning\": \"dụng cụ mở đồ hộp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"baking tin\", \"meaning\": \"khuôn nướng bánh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"can\", \"note_vi\": \"can thường dùng trong tiếng Anh-Mỹ; tin phổ biến hơn trong tiếng Anh-Anh.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-cori-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-aru0-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-aru5-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-aru6-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-aru10-f2691976.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-aru9-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-aru3-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-aru7-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-aru8-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-aru2-f2691976.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-ljspeech-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-lt408-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-lt138-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-lt624-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-lt396-f2691976.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-lt498-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-lt132-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-lt288-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-lt42-f2691976.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tin-lt90-f2691976.mp3\"]}}', 'Tin vừa là kim loại thiếc, vừa là hộp thiếc đựng đồ ăn (giống như can).', 'shopping', 1, 18),
('c6ee6777-5555-5e15-8d49-26499a5a5ca3', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'd5bb2d85-9ac2-5bbf-afeb-106115dfd37d', 'd75a2cf9-8cf0-55d0-a761-ce77e096b570', 'conveniently', 'UK: /kənˈviː.ni.ənt.li/ | US: /kənˈviː.njənt.li/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'một cách tiện lợi', 'in a way that is easy, useful, or suitable for a particular situation.', 'The office is conveniently located near the train station.', 'Văn phòng được đặt ở vị trí thuận tiện gần ga tàu.', '{\"en\": \"Our conference facility is conveniently located near the central train station.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm hội nghị của chúng tôi nằm ở vị trí thuận tiện ngay gần ga tàu trung tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-ljspeech-363802f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-cori-363802f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conveniently-4feef1d3.webp', '[\"handily\", \"suitably\", \"easily\"]', '[\"inconveniently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conveniently located\", \"meaning\": \"tọa lạc ở vị trí thuận tiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conveniently placed\", \"meaning\": \"được đặt ở chỗ tiện dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conventionally\", \"note_vi\": \"Một cách thông thường/theo quy ước, khác với conveniently (một cách thuận tiện).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"convenience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"convenient\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-cori-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru0-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru5-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru6-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru10-363802f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru9-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru3-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru7-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru8-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru2-363802f7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-ljspeech-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt408-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt138-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt624-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt396-363802f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt498-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt132-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt288-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt42-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt90-363802f7.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ rất hay đi cùng phân từ hai \'located\' thành cụm \'conveniently located\' (nằm ở vị trí thuận tiện).', 'real estate', 1, 19),
('680ce29f-838f-5406-9936-677676fce62f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'd5bb2d85-9ac2-5bbf-afeb-106115dfd37d', 'd75a2cf9-8cf0-55d0-a761-ce77e096b570', 'trade', '/treɪd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động mua bán hàng hóa, dịch vụ giữa các quốc gia hoặc cá nhân.', 'the activity of buying, selling, or exchanging goods and services between people or countries.', 'International trade plays a crucial role in the global economy.', 'Thương mại quốc tế đóng vai trò quan trọng trong nền kinh tế toàn cầu.', '{\"en\": \"New government regulations have significantly impacted the volume of international trade this year.\", \"vi\": \"Các quy định mới của chính phủ đã ảnh hưởng đáng kể đến khối lượng thương mại quốc tế năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-ljspeech-6f3eb703.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-cori-6f3eb703.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trade-9b9e0d94.webp', '[\"commerce\", \"exchange\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"international trade\", \"meaning\": \"thương mại quốc tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"free trade\", \"meaning\": \"thương mại tự do\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trader\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"trade\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-cori-6f3eb703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-aru0-6f3eb703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-aru5-6f3eb703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-aru6-6f3eb703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-aru10-6f3eb703.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-aru9-6f3eb703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-aru3-6f3eb703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-aru7-6f3eb703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-aru8-6f3eb703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-aru2-