('353e84a9-5cd9-521f-8a61-8e20149d5e7b', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f2f3fc64-8811-5580-a904-da744732bee2', '04ac1242-676c-597f-adff-ecae9de374d9', 'leather', '/ˈleðə(r)/', '', 'noun', 'Chất liệu bền làm từ da động vật, thường dùng cho quần áo, túi xách.', 'a strong material made from the skin of an animal, used for making various goods.', 'The executive purchased an expensive leather briefcase for his upcoming business trip.', 'Vị quản lý đã mua một chiếc cặp táp bằng da đắt tiền cho chuyến công tác sắp tới.', '{\"en\": \"The luxury store specializes in high-quality leather bags and professional briefcases for business travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng sang trọng chuyên về túi da chất lượng cao và cặp tài liệu chuyên nghiệp cho doanh nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-ljspeech-79acf534.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-cori-79acf534.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leather-a0bb19cb.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-cori-79acf534.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-aru0-79acf534.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-aru5-79acf534.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-aru6-79acf534.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-aru10-79acf534.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-aru9-79acf534.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-aru3-79acf534.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-aru7-79acf534.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-aru8-79acf534.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-aru2-79acf534.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-ljspeech-79acf534.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leather-lt408-79acf534.mp