('e8d8bb59-c975-546e-b609-5c10658bd7fb', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f2f3fc64-8811-5580-a904-da744732bee2', '04ac1242-676c-597f-adff-ecae9de374d9', 'push', '/pʊʃ/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Dùng lực tác động để di chuyển cái gì ra xa.', 'to use physical force to move an object away from you or to a new place.', 'The worker had to push a heavy cart across the warehouse floor.', 'Người công nhân đã phải đẩy một chiếc xe kéo nặng qua sàn nhà kho.', '{\"en\": \"Please push the green button on the side to start the photocopier machine this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nhấn nút màu xanh ở bên cạnh để khởi động máy photocopy sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-ljspeech-dc867c03.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-cori-dc867c03.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/push-d180176f.webp', '[\"press\", \"shove\"]', '[\"pull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"push a button\", \"meaning\": \"nhấn nút\"}, {\"phrase\": \"push for something\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pull\", \"note_vi\": \"Push là đẩy ra xa, pull là kéo lại gần.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pusher\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-cori-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru0-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru5-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru6-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru10-dc867c03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru9-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru3-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru7-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru8-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru2-dc867c03.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-ljspeech-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt408-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt138-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt624-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt396-dc867c03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt498-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt132-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt288-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt42-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt90-dc867c03.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ quy tắc \'Push\' (đẩy) và \'Pull\' (kéo) trên cửa kính.', 'office', 1, 12),
('e1e32774-1c5b-5eb9-892c-b0005535ce95', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f2f3fc64-8811-5580-a904-da744732bee2', '04ac1242-676c-597f-adff-ecae9de374d9', 'needle', '/ˈniːdl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một vật nhọn nhỏ dùng để may vá, tiêm thuốc hoặc chỉ hướng.', 'a small, thin, sharp-pointed tool used for sewing, giving injections, or showing direction.', 'She threaded the needle with a piece of red string to mend her shirt.', 'Cô ấy xỏ chỉ đỏ vào kim để vá áo sơ mi của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The nurse used a fresh needle to take a blood sample from the patient during the health check.\", \"vi\": \"Y tá dùng kim mới để lấy mẫu máu từ bệnh nhân trong buổi kiểm tra sức khỏe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-ljspeech-b65840c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-cori-b65840c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/needle-42e40605.webp', '[\"pin\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sewing needle\", \"meaning\": \"kim khâu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"needle and thread\", \"meaning\": \"kim và chỉ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"injection needle\", \"meaning\": \"kim tiêm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pin\", \"note_vi\": \"pin thường không có lỗ xâu chỉ và dùng để ghim, needle dùng để khâu hoặc tiêm\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-cori-b65840c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-aru0-b65840c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-aru5-b65840c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-aru6-b65840c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-aru10-b65840c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-aru9-b65840c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-aru3-b65840c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-aru7-b65840c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/needle-aru8-b65840c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pron