('27c60fb4-83ff-584a-8b71-75ae0d825ea9', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f2f3fc64-8811-5580-a904-da744732bee2', '04ac1242-676c-597f-adff-ecae9de374d9', 'personally', '/ˈpɜːsənəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Về mặt cá nhân; tự mình.', 'in a way that relates to your own opinion or your own specific situation.', 'I personally believe that honesty is the best policy.', 'Cá nhân tôi tin rằng trung thực là chính sách tốt nhất.', '{\"en\": \"I personally recommend that we review the budget before signing the final contract with them.\", \"vi\": \"Cá nhân tôi đề nghị chúng ta xem xét lại ngân sách trước khi ký hợp đồng cuối cùng với họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-ljspeech-396be4c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-cori-396be4c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/personally-2d6a7355.webp', '[\"individually\", \"privately\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"personal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"personality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-cori-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru0-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru5-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru6-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru10-396be4c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru9-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru3-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru7-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru8-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-aru2-396be4c7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-ljspeech-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt408-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt138-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt624-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt396-396be4c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt498-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt132-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt288-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt42-396be4c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/personally-lt90-396be4c7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đặt ở đầu câu để nhấn mạnh quan điểm cá nhân.', 'office', 1, 15),
('ef1c77fd-6232-558c-9295-5927e618c29b', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f2f3fc64-8811-5580-a904-da744732bee2', '04ac1242-676c-597f-adff-ecae9de374d9', 'promote', '/prəˈməʊt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Giúp phát triển, tăng cường, hoặc quảng bá một điều gì đó.', 'to encourage people to buy, use, or support something special.', 'The marketing director designed an impressive campaign to promote the brand.', 'Giám đốc tiếp thị đã thiết kế một chiến dịch ấn tượng nhằm quảng bá thương hiệu.', '{\"en\": \"Our team will launch a campaign to promote the new line of eco-friendly products.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm chúng tôi sẽ khởi động một chiến dịch để quảng bá dòng sản phẩm thân thiện với môi trường mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-ljspeech-aa87dc4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-cori-aa87dc4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/promote-2ba39c0b.webp', '[\"encourage\", \"advocate\", \"boost\"]', '[\"hinder\", \"demote\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"promote a product\", \"meaning\": \"quảng bá sản phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"promote growth\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy sự phát triển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be promoted to\", \"meaning\": \"được thăng chức lên vị trí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"provide\", \"note_vi\": \"provide có nghĩa là cung cấp, khác với promote là quảng bá hoặc thăng chức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"promotion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"promotional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-cori-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru0-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru5-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru6-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru10-aa87dc4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru9-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru3-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru7-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru8-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru2-aa87dc4e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-ljspeech-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt408-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt138-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt624-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt396-aa87dc4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt498-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt132-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt288-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt42-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt90-aa87dc4e.mp3\"]}}', 'Promote vừa có nghĩa là quảng bá sản phẩm, vừa có nghĩa là thăng chức cho ai đó.', 'marketing', 1, 16),
('5c01ea72-d37c-5de2-adcb-09daecde92b5', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f2f3fc64-8811-5580-a904-da744732bee2', '04ac1242-676c-597f-adff-ecae9de374d9', 'effort', '/ˈefət/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự cố gắng, sức lực bỏ ra để hoàn thành một việc gì đó.', 'the physical or mental energy that you need to do something that is difficult to achieve.', 'She put a lot of effort into preparing for the presentation.', 'Cô ấy đã bỏ rất nhiều nỗ lực vào việc chuẩn bị cho buổi thuyết trình.', '{\"en\": \"It requires a significant effort from the entire team to complete this project by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Cần một sự nỗ lực đáng kể từ toàn bộ đội ngũ để hoàn thành dự án này trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-ljspeech-3f1e7273.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-cori-3f1e7273.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/effort-2b08578c.webp', '[\"attempt\", \"exertion\"]', '[\"laziness\", \"ease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make an effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"joint effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực chung\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"effortless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-cori-3f1e7273.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-aru0-3f1e7273.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-aru5-3f1e7273.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-aru6-3f1e7273.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-aru10-3f1e7273.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-aru9-3f1e7273.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-aru3-3f1e7273.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-aru7-3f1e7273.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-aru8-3f1e7273.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effort-aru2-3f1e7273.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pu