('6d6c0a27-bed9-5cda-8755-fc6968d957a5', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f3e698b3-2e2d-56b7-a924-b84df77f2042', '83781804-cfcf-5eff-9dd6-f772bf3f3c12', 'remote', '/rɪˈməʊt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Xa xôi, hẻo lánh; điều khiển từ xa.', 'far away from places where other people live or from main towns.', 'Many employees now prefer working in a remote environment rather than commuting daily.', 'Nhiều nhân viên hiện nay thích làm việc trong một môi trường từ xa hơn là đi lại hàng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"Many companies now allow employees to work from remote locations to save costs.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều công ty hiện cho phép nhân viên làm việc từ các địa điểm xa để tiết kiệm chi phí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-ljspeech-41ffe545.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-cori-41ffe545.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/remote-a8fbaa1e.webp', '[\"distant\", \"isolated\", \"faraway\"]', '[\"close\", \"near\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"remote area\", \"meaning\": \"vùng sâu vùng xa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remote control\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị điều khiển từ xa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remote work\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc từ xa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"remotely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"remoteness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-cori-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-aru0-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-aru5-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-aru6-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-aru10-41ffe545.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-aru9-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-aru3-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-aru7-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-aru8-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-aru2-41ffe545.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-ljspeech-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-lt408-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-lt138-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-lt624-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-lt396-41ffe545.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-lt498-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-lt132-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-lt288-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-lt42-41ffe545.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remote-lt90-41ffe545.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công sở hiện đại, \'remote work\' nghĩa là làm việc từ xa.', 'office', 1, 3),
('2f97bc00-0a15-54d7-a913-febd3d03eb36', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f3e698b3-2e2d-56b7-a924-b84df77f2042', '83781804-cfcf-5eff-9dd6-f772bf3f3c12', 'strongly', '/ˈstrɒŋli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Với sức mạnh lớn, một cách kiên quyết hoặc có ảnh hưởng lớn.', 'in a powerful way that shows clear opinions, feelings, or physical force.', 'The government strongly condemned the recent acts of violence.', 'Chính phủ đã mạnh mẽ lên án các hành vi bạo lực gần đây.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors strongly recommends that we upgrade our security software immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đề xuất một cách kiên quyết rằng chúng ta nâng cấp phần mềm bảo mật ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strongly-ljspeech-6e77d135.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strongly-cori-6e77d135.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/strongly-1308ae9c.webp', '[\"firmly\", \"vigorously\", \"powerfully\"]', '[\"weakly\", \"mildly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strongly recommend\", \"meaning\": \"khuyến nghị mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly disagree\", \"meaning\": \"phản đối kịch liệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly support\", \"meaning\": \"ủng hộ nhiệt tình\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"strong\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"strength\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"strengthen\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strongly-cori-6e77d135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strongly-aru0-6e77d135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strongly-aru5-6e77d135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strongly-aru6-6e77d135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strongly-aru10-6e77d135.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strongly-aru9-6e77d135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strongly-aru3-6e77d135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia