('4e5c3846-9005-5371-bdf7-6f501734624f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f3e698b3-2e2d-56b7-a924-b84df77f2042', '83781804-cfcf-5eff-9dd6-f772bf3f3c12', 'occasion', '/əˈkeɪʒn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một thời điểm hoặc sự kiện cụ thể, thường là đặc biệt.', 'a particular time when something happens, or a special event or celebration.', 'We only wear formal clothes on special occasions like weddings.', 'Chúng tôi chỉ mặc trang phục trang trọng vào những dịp đặc biệt như đám cưới.', '{\"en\": \"The grand opening of the new branch was a memorable occasion for all staff.\", \"vi\": \"Lễ khai trương chi nhánh mới là một sự kiện đáng nhớ đối với toàn thể nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-ljspeech-84eeb849.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-cori-84eeb849.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/occasion-486cc96b.webp', '[\"event\", \"time\", \"opportunity\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"special occasion\", \"meaning\": \"dịp đặc biệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on the occasion of\", \"meaning\": \"nhân dịp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rise to the occasion\", \"meaning\": \"tỏ ra có khả năng đối phó với tình thế khó khăn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"occasional\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"occasionally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-cori-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-aru0-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-aru5-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-aru6-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-aru10-84eeb849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-aru9-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-aru3-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-aru7-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-aru8-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-aru2-84eeb849.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-ljspeech-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-lt408-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-lt138-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-lt624-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-lt396-84eeb849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-lt498-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-lt132-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-lt288-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-lt42-84eeb849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasion-lt90-84eeb849.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý cách viết: hai chữ \'c\' và một chữ \'s\' (occasion).', 'business', 1, 23),
('023a5936-48f8-5d32-aaad-62d3939af903', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f3e698b3-2e2d-56b7-a924-b84df77f2042', '83781804-cfcf-5eff-9dd6-f772bf3f3c12', 'campfire', 'UK: /ˈkæmpˌfaɪə/ | US: /ˈkæmpˌfaɪr/', 'B1', 'noun', 'lửa trại', 'an outdoor open flame lit by people spending time outdoors for heat, cooking, or entertainment', 'We gathered around the campfire to tell stories.', 'Chúng tôi quây quần bên lửa trại để kể chuyện.', '{\"en\": \"During the annual corporate retreat, employees gathered around the campfire to share stories and strengthen team bonds.\", \"vi\": \"Trong kỳ nghỉ dưỡng hàng năm của công ty, các nhân viên đã tập hợp quanh lửa trại để chia sẻ câu chuyện và thắt chặt tình đoàn kết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-ljspeech-4bed1c4f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-cori-4bed1c4f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/campfire-2a5986cc.webp', '[\"bonfire\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sit around a campfire\", \"meaning\": \"ngồi quanh lửa trại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"light a campfire\", \"meaning\": \"đốt lửa trại\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-cori-4bed1c4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-aru0-4bed1c4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-aru5-4bed1c4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-aru6-4bed1c4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-aru10-4bed1c4f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-aru9-4bed1c4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-aru3-4bed1c4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-aru7-4bed1c4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-aru8-4bed1c4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campfire-aru2-4bed1c4f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/