('9a186ecc-4cf6-5298-921b-b27cad678ba4', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f3e698b3-2e2d-56b7-a924-b84df77f2042', '83781804-cfcf-5eff-9dd6-f772bf3f3c12', 'fancy', '/ˈfænsi/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Muốn hoặc thích làm điều gì đó.', 'To feel a strong inclination or desire toward having or undertaking something.', 'Do you fancy going out for dinner tonight?', 'Bạn có muốn đi ăn tối nay không?', '{\"en\": \"Do you fancy joining our sales department for coffee after the staff meeting?\", \"vi\": \"Bạn có muốn đi uống cà phê cùng phòng kinh doanh sau cuộc họp nhân viên không?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-ljspeech-2fe634d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-cori-2fe634d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fancy-47239355.webp', '[\"desire\", \"wish\", \"want\"]', '[\"dislike\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fancy doing something\", \"meaning\": \"thích/muốn làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fancy a drink\", \"meaning\": \"muốn uống nước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fancy\", \"note_vi\": \"Ngoài động từ (thích), fancy còn là tính từ nghĩa là sang trọng, xa xỉ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-cori-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-aru0-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-aru5-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-aru6-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-aru10-2fe634d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-aru9-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-aru3-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-aru7-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-aru8-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-aru2-2fe634d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-ljspeech-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-lt408-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-lt138-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-lt624-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-lt396-2fe634d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-lt498-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-lt132-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-lt288-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-lt42-2fe634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fancy-lt90-2fe634d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ fancy theo sau là V-ing (fancy doing something), không dùng to-V.', 'office', 1, 26),
('c7101456-fe95-5299-a44e-0896f001a57d', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f3e698b3-2e2d-56b7-a924-b84df77f2042', '83781804-cfcf-5eff-9dd6-f772bf3f3c12', 'issue', '/ˈɪʃuː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một vấn đề cần được thảo luận hoặc giải quyết.', 'a topic or problem that people need to talk about or find a solution for.', 'We need to address the issue of climate change urgently.', 'Chúng ta cần khẩn cấp giải quyết vấn đề biến đổi khí hậu.', '{\"en\": \"The manager called a meeting to resolve the issue with delayed shipments.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã triệu tập cuộc họp để giải quyết vấn đề về các lô hàng bị chậm trễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-ljspeech-00819c0e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-cori-00819c0e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/issue-79cb68a0.webp', '[\"problem\", \"matter\", \"concern\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"address an issue\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết/đề cập đến vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"raise an issue\", \"meaning\": \"nêu lên một vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"key issue\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề then chốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"problem\", \"note_vi\": \"issue trung lập hơn problem; issue thường dùng trong văn phong trang trọng, công sở\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"issue\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-cori-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-aru0-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-aru5-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-aru6-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-aru10-00819c0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-aru9-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-aru3-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-aru7-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-aru8-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-aru2-00819c0e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-ljspeech-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-lt408-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-lt138-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-lt624-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-lt396-00819c0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-lt498-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-lt132-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-lt288-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-lt42-00819c0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/issue-lt90-00819c0e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, issue rất phổ biến; \'address/resolve an issue\' là cụm cần nhớ.', 'office', 1, 27),
('cba92532-eefc-5792-a6e6-cb84ff2bc48f', 'fa0ef8f0-6a34-5cb5-b8c8-5551c70b5086', 'f3e698b3-2e2d-56b7-a924-b84df77f2042', '83781804-cfcf-5eff-9dd6-f772bf3f3c12', 'invest', '/ɪnˈvest/', 'B1', 'verb', 'bỏ tiền hoặc công sức vào cái gì đó để thu lợi.', 'to put money, effort, or time into something to gain a profit.', 'Many people choose to invest in real estate as a long-term strategy.', 'Nhiều người chọn đầu tư vào bất động sản như một chiến lược dài hạn.', '{\"en\": \"The company plans to invest two million dollars in renewable energy research next year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có kế hoạch đầu tư hai triệu đô la vào nghiên cứu năng lượng tái tạo trong năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-ljspeech-72527848.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-cori-72527848.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/invest-e77262df.webp', '[\"fund\", \"finance\", \"venture\"]', '[\"divest\", \"spend\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"invest in\", \"meaning\": \"đầu tư vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"invest heavily\", \"meaning\": \"đầu tư mạnh tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"invest capital\", \"meaning\": \"đầu tư vốn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"investment\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"investor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-cori-72527848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-aru0-72527848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-aru5-72527848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-aru6-72527848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-aru10-72527848.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-aru9-72527848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-aru3-72527848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-aru7-72527848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invest-aru8-72527848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/